window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":6101,"title":"Chapter 6101: Backhand","paragraphs":["Chapter 6101: Backhand","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Qishen Temple, Grave God Mountain.","Within the cave mansion originally belonging to Jian Wushuang, a black mist gathered.","A black figure emerged from the cave mansion.","The appearance was identical to Jian Wushuang.","Only the hair had turned black.","The key difference was the aura; there was none of Jian Wushuang’s aura.","This was the second Nascent Soul from before.","Jian Wushuang had thought it self-destructed and would never have imagined that it had been secretly controlled by Mie Sheng.","“Whoosh!”","This figure exhaled lightly.","Then, it headed straight to the foot of Tomb God Mountain.","There was no obstruction along the way.","No one dared to obstruct him.","Because he had the same face as Jian Wushuang.","Soon, he entered the first prison of Qishen Temple.","Gazing at the chains below, he smirked, grabbed a chain with one hand, and yanked it fiercely, pulling out the first prison of Qishen Temple with ease.","At this moment, only Gu Jun remained in the first prison.","Sensing the external aura, Gu Jun suddenly opened his eyes.","The first thing he saw was the black Jian Wushuang who looked exactly like Jian Wushuang.","“You...”","Before Gu Jun could speak, the black Jian Wushuang lifted him like a chick and walked away.","Because the Zhen Ling outside had already noticed something amiss.","The first prison was broken.","Zhen Ling was the first to return to Qishen Temple.","But before he could see clearly who the culprit was, everything went black.","He almost fainted.","When he regained his senses, that aura had already disappeared.","Despite all precautions, they had still failed.","He had long known that Gu Jun was useful to Mie Sheng, so he had kept him hidden.","He originally thought there would be no problem.","Otherwise, Mie Sheng would have taken Gu Jun long ago.","Unexpectedly, Gu Jun was taken away at this moment.","Swish!","Returning to the outside of Qishen Temple.","Zhen Ling’s face was dark.","“What happened?”","Everyone gathered around Zhen Ling, seeing his serious expression.","To calm the troops, Zhen Ling said, “Nothing, just checking.”","That sentence did more harm than good, causing more anxiety.","That disappearing aura had now reached the Temple of World Annihilation.","Mountain Lord, Demon Lord, and Gu Jun were now gathered together.","Mie Sheng and the black Jian Wushuang stood before the three.","“Let’s begin!” Mie Sheng said calmly, “Fortunately, I left a backup plan back then!”","The last sentence was directed at the black Jian Wushuang.","This was one of his clones, and once used, it naturally returned to the main body.","Mie Sheng was preparing for the final means, while the complete Broly had already broken free from his cage, and his goal now was to destroy everything.","Outside World.","Broly appeared!","His eyes turned waxy white again.","This indicated that he had completely lost consciousness and had become a beast.","Even Jian Wushuang felt a bit fearful when he saw Broly’s appearance.","Although Broly’s divine power remained at 20 million, his aura and oppressive presence made it hard for Jian Wushuang to breathe.","The others, just by seeing Broly, felt a heavy pressure on their chests, and their scalps almost exploded when they sensed his aura.","Great fear!","Even the Universe Masters in the Six Tribulation Realm didn’t dare to keep their eyes on Broly.","They even wanted to enter Qishen Temple and watch the battle through the sky screen.","They couldn’t handle experiencing that aura so closely.","It was too oppressive, so oppressive that it left them without the will to fight and even thoughts of ending their own lives.","This was the most terrifying aspect.","Zhen Ling glanced at the crowd and waved his hand, indicating, “All Universe Masters below the Seventh Tribulation, enter Qishen Temple, so Jian Wushuang isn’t distracted!”","Hearing Zhen Ling’s command gave them face, and they swiftly entered Qishen Temple.","Only eight Divine Lords, Shang, and Luo remained.","“Luo, you should go in too!” Shang turned to his partner, feeling it was too dangerous to stay outside.","Both of them had divine power of only around 3 million.","The others had a minimum of 5 million or more.","They were much stronger than the two.","They could still look directly at Broly.","Shang and Luo were somewhat weaker.","Luo looked up at Shang with a determined gaze, “If you don’t retreat, I won’t retreat!”","“What are you talking about!” Shang’s face sank, and he sternly said, “I am the heir of Qishen Temple, don’t compare yourself to me!”","“But the others...” Luo wanted to argue but swallowed her words halfway!","However, her eyes said it all.","She would stay.","At this moment, everyone was marveling at Broly’s terrifying aura, not paying attention to Shang and Luo’s conversation.","Seeing Broly revive, Jian Wushuang was too impatient to wait for Realm King’s plan and was about to make a move.","But the North Realm King, lost in thought, called out to him.","“Wait!!!”","Jian Wushuang stopped and looked at the North Realm King in confusion, urgently saying, “There’s no time, we must deal with Broly before Mie Sheng makes a move!”","“Jian Wushuang, take this token!”","Realm King, after much hesitation, threw out a blue token with a large “Ming” character on it!","The handwriting was similar to the God King’s token Jian Wushuang had received!","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. Upon holding it, he sensed the entire Northern Spacetime’s power contained within.","It was different from the token left by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Actually, his confidence stemmed from the trump card given by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi didn’t hope he could defeat Mie Sheng, hence the token.","“Jian Wushuang, this token carries all the divine power of Northern Spacetime. This battle can’t be borne by you alone. I think everyone should contribute. If you’re overpowered, crush the token to mobilize the power of the entire Northern Spacetime for the final battle!”","After saying this, Realm King took a deep breath.","This might be the Great Realm King’s reminder!","At a critical moment, one must go all out, because he had trusted people to back him up.","And that person was Jian Wushuang.","Holding the token, Jian Wushuang felt touched, carrying the burden of Northern Spacetime’s battle.","The pressure was nothing compared to the danger of this action.","If he lost, the entire Northern Spacetime would be buried with him.","Mie Sheng wouldn’t even need to act.","Actually, he had a better option, like using the token left by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Though he was reluctant, if faced with a mortal crisis, he would still use it.","Having that token gave him confidence.","This was the token’s greatest use.","Someone always had his back.","He had felt this way before.","But after entering the Great Si Region, that feeling was gone.","He had walked this path through sheer effort.","Every time, he fought desperately.","He had never truly enjoyed a real battle.","Now there was an opportunity before him, and he had to consider if it might be his only chance.","He had to use his strength and go all out.","“I want to try!”","Realm King was stunned, “What do you want to try?”","“Try my limits!” Jian Wushuang finished speaking and flashed beside Broly.","The two faced each other again.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists and shouted, “Ha!”","A deep blue aura enveloped his body, and blue lightning arcs flickered.","“Broly, let’s see how strong you are!”","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword appeared.","This time, it was still the strongest secret technique!","No holding back.","Even though Broly had reached his complete form, he still struggled to face the Spacetime Reincarnation Sword, barely able to defend.","The sword shadows shuttled through spacetime, graceful as a startled swan, and elegant as a wandering dragon!","Freely traversing spacetime, reincarnating everything.","Unconsciously, his Spacetime Reincarnation Sword had reached the Great Perfection realm.","This was the essence of battle.","The beauty of battle.","Surpassing one’s limits in battle, perfecting secret techniques.","Growing stronger with each fight.","He even gained the upper hand.","Using the sword to counter Broly’s fierce energy.","“Haha, is this all you’ve got?” Jian Wushuang unleashed countless swords, creating a sword spacetime, suppressing Broly within it. He turned and smiled at Realm King. “He’s not as fearsome as you think. Give me an hour, and I’ll take his head!”","Realm King was also stunned.","If he hadn’t witnessed the fight firsthand, he wouldn’t believe it was fought by a Universe Master in the Seven Tribulation Realm.","Anyone else would think it was two Nine Tribulation Realm masters fighting.","Though not at the Nine Tribulation Realm, they had the unique aura of the Nine Tribulation Realm.","An incredibly terrifying aura.","“Good! Good! Good!” Zhen Ling couldn’t understand the intricacies but could see Jian Wushuang had the upper hand and cheered to boost morale.","The others also showed joy after the shock.","They were shocked that Jian Wushuang, who appeared harmless, could fight Broly to this extent.","And he even suppressed Broly.","If it were them, they wouldn’t even have the desire to fight.","They would be sent to their deaths.","Only Hu Qing could compare.","At this moment, everyone thought Jian Wushuang was stronger than Hu Qing’s future self.","“Hmph!” Realm King coldly snorted, pouring cold water on them, “Don’t be foolish, can’t you see Broly’s aura is rising faster than Jian Wushuang’s?”","Only he and Hu Qing noticed this.","Even Jian Wushuang, in the midst of battle, didn’t realize that Broly’s aura was growing stronger with each fight, faster than his own.","Defeat Broly in an hour?","In Realm King’s view, it would be good if Jian Wushuang could hold on for a quarter of an hour.","Boom!","Sure enough.","As soon as Realm King finished speaking, Broly, trapped in the sword spacetime, broke through it, shattering the spacetime Jian Wushuang had constructed.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang hesitated and tried to suppress Broly again.","But he found Broly’s aura had surpassed his own.","This growth rate made his eyes flash with worry.","He hadn’t even used his divine domain yet, and he was growing so fast.","What would happen if he used his divine domain?","Could his hidden divine power surpass Broly’s?","Suddenly, he wanted to try.","“Spacetime!”","“Reincarnation!”","He launched his strongest sword again, only for Broly to easily block it.","His strongest sword had no effect.","His aura was suppressed.","This time it was his turn to be at a disadvantage, and his growth had reached its limit.","There was no hope for a comeback.","“Haha!” Broly let out a strange laugh and charged with his fist.","Boom!","A punch was thrown.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t dodge in time and was sent flying thousands of miles away.","His divine power dropped significantly.","“I don’t believe it!” He gritted his teeth, moved his mind, and the surrounding spacetime began to change.","Divine domain!"]},{"number":6102,"title":"Chapter 6102: Unlimited Growth","paragraphs":["Chapter 6102: Unlimited Growth","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Silently, it descended!","“Broly, today I’ll show you my true divine power!” Jian Wushuang emerged from the magma, glanced at the Temple of World Annihilation, and roared, “Mie Sheng!”","“Aaaargh!!!”","He bent slightly, clenched his fists, and began to unleash his divine power within the Divine Realm.","20 million!","That was his limit in the Northern Spacetime.","Currently, his base divine power was 8 million, and with the Tribulation Armor, it equaled 10 million base divine power.","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he amplified it a hundredfold.","In terms of divine power, that was a full 20 million.","However, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could no longer amplify his current divine power as much.","In the end, it only increased it by 15 million.","This was already after he had grown; otherwise, it would have been even lower.","Adding the base divine power.","It totaled 25 million divine power.","This scene left Mie Sheng and Zhen Ling dumbfounded.","As for the powerful figures of Qishen Temple, they were completely stunned.","They didn’t know the limit of divine power.","But just by seeing Jian Wushuang through the sky screen, it was as if they had seen the end of divine power.","25 million divine power.","“Incredible, to be this powerful!” Shang and Luo spoke in unison, both shocked by Jian Wushuang.","Wu Zuo, knowing the matters of the Divine Realm, reminded, “Don’t rush, Brother Wushuang hasn’t used the Origin Source Dao Arena yet! Broly has no Origin Source Dao Arena, no matter how fast he grows, how strong can he get?”","“Stop talking nonsense and watch carefully!” Zhen Ling cut off Wu Zuo’s boasting.","He knew Broly had no Origin Source?","The key was that Broly also concealed a massive amount of divine power.","At least 10 million.","Which meant, in the Divine Domain, he could unleash 30 million divine power.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, without any restrictions, directly exploded to 25 million.","He wanted to catch his breath, staring at Broly, “What, without suppression, shouldn’t you be more frenzied?”","“Huh?” Broly stared at Jian Wushuang, finding that his divine power suppressed him, but he only increased his aura.","He had no idea about the Divine Domain.","In simple terms, the other was a battle genius, but his mind was foolish, lacking awareness.","“Broly!” Mie Sheng couldn’t help but remind at this moment, “You idiot, unleash your divine power now!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang reacted.","In an instant, he charged at Broly.","He wanted to take advantage of this short time to finish him off.","Now, Broly didn’t know how to unleash his divine power; he could completely, with absolute divine power, slay him.","At the moment of his attack, his Origin Source Dojo also descended.","It was a starry sky yet to be illuminated.","Within it, seven Origin Source Universes shone brightly!","His divine power also rose from 25 million to 38 million.","This was his limit.","Through the amplification of the Origin Source Dojo, he directly rivaled a demigod.","Even Mie Sheng was stunned.","The most shocking was Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Dao Arena, which turned out to be the starry sky.","No wonder Jian Wushuang’s amplified divine power was so much.","With such powerful divine power, no matter how much Broly concealed, he had to die.","Boom!","A punch directly struck Broly’s chest.","Jian Wushuang’s entire arm pierced through Broly’s body.","Both the divine body and the flesh were penetrated.","A divine body of 20 million was like thin paper to him now.","This sudden increase in power made it harder for him to control it.","It also came with strong side effects.","This increase in divine power was a significant burden on him.","However, maintaining the fight was still not a problem.","Broly, who had his chest pierced, looked down at Jian Wushuang’s arm, his eyes filled with bloodlust.","He roared and tried to pull out the arm.","But Jian Wushuang threw him away forcefully.","Jian Wushuang didn’t give him any chance to catch his breath and charged forward again, relentlessly pummeling Broly.","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t take it lightly. Last time, his carelessness almost led to a reversal, so he decided to finish it with one decisive strike!","“Stop yelling!” Jian Wushuang rose from the magma and said, “Today is your death day!”","Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed, arriving beside Broly. He swung his sword, cutting Broly in half. Before Broly could recover, he struck several more times, shattering Broly’s divine body completely.","However, he knew that as long as the Temple of World Annihilation existed, Broly would revive again.","So his main target this time was the Temple of World Annihilation.","“Not good!”","Mie Sheng inside the temple sensed the problem and hurried to stop Jian Wushuang, but it was too late.","In the Divine Domain, Jian Wushuang’s speed was extremely fast. In an instant, he was above the Temple of World Annihilation, holding his divine sword tightly.","“Let’s see if you can reincarnate after I destroy you!”","“Break for me!”","Jian Wushuang roared and slashed his sword down.","Boom!","The entire Temple of World Annihilation was instantly shattered!","What seemed impossible before was now easily achieved.","The Temple of World Annihilation was completely destroyed.","A figure emerged from the ruins.","“Mie Sheng!”","“Jian Wu... Shuang!!!”","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang frowned upon seeing Mie Sheng.","He noticed that Mie Sheng had changed.","He now had two faces!","“Do you know Zamasu?” Realm King couldn’t help but exclaim, “Where did you get that jade slip?”","Mie Sheng snorted coldly, “You don’t have the right to know.”","“Zamasu?” Jian Wushuang finally recalled this supreme existence on the Realm God Continent. His gaze towards Mie Sheng turned murderous as he coldly said, “Did Zamasu collude with you, or did you join forces with Zamasu?”","Hearing the name Zamasu, Realm King couldn’t remain still.","Why would the successor of a Realm King God hold such a grudge against him?","He was merely a Realm King of a subsidiary spacetime.","On the Realm God Continent, he was a minor figure.","He didn’t even dare offend some demigods.","Why did Zamasu target him?","Realm King was in anguish!","An endless rage burned within him.","If one day he could get his hands on Zamas, he would make him regret it.","Hatred aside, he didn’t forget the immediate threat. He quickly reminded Jian Wushuang through a voice transmission, “Jian Wushuang, don’t be careless anymore. This time your opponent is Mie Sheng!”","“Mie Sheng?” Jian Wushuang looked at him playfully, causing Mie Sheng to feel uneasy.","“Did you absorb Shan Jun?”","Mie Sheng was momentarily unresponsive, unsure if Jian Wushuang was genuinely ignorant or pretending to be.","“Enough talk, let’s fight!”","The merged Mie Sheng was far more powerful than Broly.","The Realm King reminded from the side, “Jian Wushuang, don’t hesitate, crush the token!”","“I have my own strategy!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t crush the token immediately but chose to test the waters.","However, after exchanging blows, he realized he was no match.","Mie Sheng’s current state was far more terrifying than Broly, especially with his endless tricks, much more formidable than a madman.","Poof!","After being punched back, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was severely damaged.","“It seems I have to risk everything!”","Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated and directly crushed the Northern Spacetime token given by the Realm King.","Buzz!","The moment he crushed the token, the entire Northern Spacetime trembled.","Infinite power converged above Jian Wushuang’s head instantly.","The powerful force poured down, and Jian Wushuang’s divine power instantly exceeded fifty million.","The key was that he wouldn’t be suppressed by the Northern Spacetime.","However, his divine body couldn’t withstand this divine power!","He didn’t need Mie Sheng to attack; he could barely hold on himself.","“No, I must endure!”","Jian Wushuang roared inwardly, continuously channeling power into his Origin Source, allowing his Origin Source starry sky to absorb it, making the absorbed power his own.","The surge in divine power startled Mie Sheng.","“You, you madman, are you gambling with the entire Northern Spacetime’s cultivators?”","Mie Sheng, who had seen much, understood instantly.","He was furious. The Northern Spacetime was about to fall into his hands and couldn’t be destroyed like this. He immediately prepared to stop Jian Wushuang.","“Mie Sheng, you have to go through me first!”","Swish!","Hu Qing’s figure blocked Mie Sheng.","“Courting death!”","Mie Sheng had no time for Hu Qing, attacking with full force.","Hu Qing couldn’t resist, continuously being pummeled by Mie Sheng, his divine body shattered, and he fell into a deep sleep.","But it bought Jian Wushuang time.","“Huff!”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, looking at Mie Sheng.","His divine power was now fully absorbed.","Though it was still a bit strained, he could finally use it.","“Now it’s my turn!”"]},{"number":6103,"title":"Chapter 6103: The Final Duel","paragraphs":["Chapter 6103: The Final Duel","Jian Wushuang drew his Wanjie Sword and descended swiftly.","His aura swept around, suffocating Mie Sheng.","Feeling the oppressive force from the entire Northern Spacetime, Mie Sheng’s eyes widened, his divine body trembling!","With just one punch, Jian Wushuang sent Mie Sheng flying backward. Leveraging his","incredible speed, he caught up again, continuously pummeling Mie Sheng.","Crack!","“Mie Sheng, why is your divine authority not working?” Jian Wushuang slowly descended, staring disdainfully at the changing Mie Sheng.","At that moment, he felt that gods were nothing special, not at all impressive.","“Gods are inviolable!”","Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned. Before he could react, a black spear flashed before his eyes.","Buzz!","The spear pierced through his divine body.","The speed at that instant seemed eternal.","It was only after it pierced through that Jian Wushuang realized what had happened.","The moment Mie Sheng drew the spear, his battle power surged to its limit.","He instantly surpassed Jian Wushuang.","With Mie Sheng’s memories and consciousness, and his extensive experience, Mie Sheng gripped the spear and said calmly, “Now it’s my turn!”","The spear pierced through spacetime, continuously attacking Jian Wushuang.","Thud! Thud!","Jian Wushuang could only block with his hands. Although he had been somewhat careless just now and was pierced through, he appeared extremely excited, exclaiming, “Not bad, your divine power has indeed increased a lot. It seems you’ve completely merged with Shan Jun!”","The battle, initially one-sided, now became evenly matched.","The fight continued.","The desolate land in the downstream spacetime was completely devastated by the two. Many tributaries rejoined.","It seemed they were about to merge into a main stream again.","Fortunately, the Origin Source here was sparse, and there were few cultivators.","Even life was rare, allowing the two to fight without restraint.","They fought from the void into the chaotic flow of spacetime and then from the chaotic flow into the depths of desolation.","All the way toward the downstream.","Qishen Temple dared not approach, only following from a distance.","Realm King clenched his fists, sweating for Jian Wushuang.","“Hurry, the Northern Spacetime can’t hold much longer!”","Although the divine domain covered the downstream spacetime, it was ultimately just a treasure, not the Origin Source.","Jian Wushuang and Mie Sheng’s battle consumed the Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime.","This battle had consumed more than half of the Northern Spacetime’s foundation.","If they continued fighting, the Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime would be exhausted.","Consuming half of the foundation would take several cycles to recover.","The concept of time was quite vague for true supreme powerhouses.","An instant!","A breath!","A moment!","An hour, a day, a month, a year, an era.","Above eras was the cycle of reincarnation.","The time of reincarnation was the most vague and not fixed.","Usually, one cycle of reincarnation was about a trillion eras.","Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation rarely lived through an entire era.","In the Northern Spacetime, besides the Realm King and the gods, the longest surviving were the three Eternal Beings.","Among them, the Elder Tian Cang had lived for 12 cycles.","That meant the entire Northern Spacetime had gone through 12 cycles.","Each cycle made the Northern Spacetime stronger.","Now, the intense consumption of its foundation might all be for naught.","It would take several cycles to accumulate again.","Already behind the other three subsidiary spacetimes, if it fell further behind, it couldn’t even hope to catch up, let alone surpass.","Realm King had his difficulties too.","He needed to cultivate powerful cultivators; otherwise, he was failing in his duty.","“Lord Realm King, they won’t fight to the downstream, will they?” Wu Zuo watched the two massive energy masses clashing repeatedly, heading toward the downstream.","The situation didn’t seem quite right!","Realm King remained silent.","It would be best if they ended up at the lower reaches.","That place wasn’t under his control.","Both the lower reaches and the mouth of spacetime were ultimate locations.","Indeed, they weren’t under his control.","Moreover, the spacetime there was far stronger than here.","The starting point of the upper reaches had continuously gathered spacetime, accumulating","over countless years.","With so many years of accumulation, not to mention Jian Wushuang and Mie Sheng, even the superpowerful beings among the universe gods couldn’t destroy it. It was more stable than the spacetime of the Realm God Continent.","“Who would have thought that the return battle would end up like this!”","Even the well-traveled Wu Zuo found this return battle not only beyond his capability but","also beyond his understanding.","He could only watch helplessly.","Boom!","Amid countless spheres of energy, Jian Wushuang ignored everything, his figure turning into","a stream of light, shuttling through spacetime.","Behind him, Mie Sheng pursued relentlessly, shouting angrily, “Jian Wushuang, you have no","way out!”","Yet Jian Wushuang seemed unaffected.","Turning his head to glance at Mie Sheng behind him, he sneered, “Your speed is too slow!”","He had been dodging because he had just received a message from the Realm King.","He wanted to change the battlefield.","He couldn’t destroy the entire lower reaches spacetime just to defeat Mie Sheng.","This was their territory.","The loss would be his own.","Fortunately, in the lower reaches spacetime, all the tributaries nurturing life had been gathered together, leaving ninety-nine percent of the territory desolate.","He intended to head deep into this desolate land for the final showdown with Mie Sheng.","After such a long and fierce battle, it was time to determine the winner.","Whoosh!","A black beam of light shot out from Mie Sheng’s hand.","Sensing the power of the attack, Jian Wushuang quickly dodged.","This wasn’t a simple energy wave; if he took it head-on, he would be injured.","But just as he turned to evade, Mie Sheng appeared behind him, a spear already pointed at his","face.","“Die!” Mie Sheng roared, seizing the opportunity he had been waiting for.","The previous attacks had all been feints.","Having lived for so many years, he had honed his combat skills to perfection.","The black spear, crackling with arcs of electricity, pierced Jian Wushuang’s head.","Then he followed up with a kick.","Having been ambushed, Jian Wushuang lost his ability to resist. The kick sent him flying","millions of miles away.","His body, out of control, fell, slid, and broke through the entire other shore!","He finally stopped at the end of a very narrow tributary.","Jian Wushuang, lying slantwise on the ground, staggered to his feet, his divine power","beginning to shatter.","He raised his hand to grasp the spear in his head and pulled it out forcefully, extracting even","his thick divine power.","After pulling out the spear, his body weakened.","He turned to look at the nearby spacetime river, and he laughed!","“So, this is the lower reaches?”","His vision expanded.","Looking up.","At the end of the spacetime river, there was a massive abyss.","It was even larger than the abyss in the midstream spacetime.","According to the Realm King, even the Realm King himself couldn’t refine this abyss; it was","placed here by a super entity from the Starry Sky.","This abyss didn’t belong to the Northern Spacetime.","It was the convergence point of all subsidiary spacetimes.","Just like the spectacular waterfall in the upper level or upstream spacetimes.","It was the ultimate place of spacetime.","After his physical body healed, Jian Wushuang mustered his strength, his figure continuously rising, a confident smile forming on his lips. At this moment, he revealed unprecedented","confidence.","“Mie Sheng!”","“Hmm?” Sensing the drop in Jian Wushuang’s divine power, Mie Sheng hadn’t spoken yet but","saw his opponent’s confident expression and asked curiously, “What, did you lose your","mind?”","“Watch carefully, this might be your last look at the world!” Jian Wushuang pointed at everything around them and said calmly, “Perhaps, it might also be the last bit of reality in","this world!”","Because the upcoming battle could very well destroy the surrounding desolate land, leaving only that abyss."]},{"number":6104,"title":"Chapter 6104: Stunning","paragraphs":["Chapter 6104: Stunning","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Ha ha ha!” Mie Sheng laughed maniacally. “Jian Wushuang, no one can save you now. Stop dreaming and prepare to die!”","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, and his aura began to change.","His originally black short hair faintly turned blue.","This was Jian Wushuang’s Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Terrifying divine power directly forced Mie Sheng back thousands of miles.","Staring at Jian Wushuang in disbelief, Mie Sheng was too shocked to utter a word.","The massive commotion was clearly felt even upstream.","“This time, we will win for sure!” The Realm King gazed excitedly at Jian Wushuang.","So powerful, it felt like facing a Universe Master.","Now, he no longer believed Mie Sheng had any hope of turning the tables.","“Jian Wushuang, kill me!” Mie Sheng, with a tone like a Shan Jun’s, seemed to be pleading, tilting his head, devoid of any will to fight.","All he wanted now was for Jian Wushuang to end his life.","Buzz!","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang gathered a force of life and injected it into Mie Sheng.","“This is my repayment to you!”","Mie Sheng smiled bitterly, “Why bother?”","He knew what Jian Wushuang intended to do.","After repaying the favor, they would owe each other nothing.","“Do you have any last words?” Jian Wushuang asked his final question. He restored Mie Sheng’s divine power as a repayment for Shan Jun’s past kindness.","With his divine power restored, Mie Sheng was placed on the ground by Jian Wushuang.","He looked up at Jian Wushuang, thinking of the once naive boy, and said with a faint smile, “Tell Zhu Qi she had chosen the wrong man. Also, tell the Zhen Ling of Qishen Temple that the one from Moro Spacetime regrets it and was wrong.”","Wrong!","How heavy those words were.","But they came from Shan Jun’s mouth.","It was now clear that the Qishen had not abandoned the path of devouring but had become the path of devouring.","Swayed by Mie Sheng, he sought to advance further.","At that time, Qishen could have successfully passed the Tribulation.","If successful, he would now be a peak Eight Tribulations Realm powerhouse.","“I will,” Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","The gentle look in his eyes disappeared in an instant.","Mie Sheng attacked first.","It was as if the terrifying Mie Sheng had returned.","“Jian Wushuang!!!”","Mie Sheng roared in anger, unleashing endless Death power. A long spear instantly formed in his hand, and his body grew to 10,000 feet.","Seeing the frenzied Mie Sheng before him, Jian Wushuang knew this was his request for him to act.","He had to fulfill it.","Clang!","He drew the Wanjie Sword.","The sword hummed.","As soon as the Wanjie Sword was unsheathed, it couldn’t help but tremble.","For a moment, the sixth sword of the Starry Sky Chronicles filled Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Can even ancient times be rivaled?”","“Even the Immortal can be slain!”","Jian Wushuang unleashed all his divine power, focusing it on the sword.","The immense power shattered the surrounding spacetime.","The entire spacetime shattered, leaving only a vast abyss.","Buzz!","With a single slash, he left the most stunning color in the void.","The sword light covered the entire Northern Spacetime.","Countless cultivators gazed in awe at the power of this sword.","Mie Sheng, holding the long spear, laughed maniacally.","“Haha!” He swung the spear, facing death head-on!","As the sword light approached, his divine body and Origin Source began to shatter, and his consciousness started to collapse.","Before falling, Shan Jun and Mie Sheng split.","“...” Mie Sheng, in a daze, stared at the sword light and murmured, “After guiding so many souls, who will guide me?”","This was his final sentence in this world.","Shan Jun did not look at the sword light but at Qishen Temple.","With one glance, he saw through it.","He saw the woman in red.","Finally, he smiled.","He recalled the first time he encountered Mie Sheng in Moro Spacetime.","At that time, he was full of vigor!","The Eighth Tribulation seemed within reach, but Mie Sheng’s appearance gradually caused him to lose himself.","Now, looking back, he had lost far more than he had gained.","“Sorry!”","Shan Jun’s last glance was at Zhen Ling.","At the last moment, his figure twisted and reverted to its original form.","The blue sword light pierced through everything.","It leveled everything.","All ties of gratitude, enmity, and resentment were written off in one stroke!","Jian Wushuang held his sword, remaining silent for a long time.","Clang!","He sheathed his sword.","It was as if the murderous intent had also been retracted.","The void returned to tranquility, and rain began to fall from the sky.","It wasn’t blood, but a gentle, clear rain!","Jian Wushuang reached out to catch the rain, feeling a trace of warmth, even though the rain was cold.","“It’s over!”","Sizzle...","Inside Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source, the Supreme Treasure Divine Domain could no longer withstand his immense divine power and completely shattered at this moment.","Immediately, the suppression of the Northern Spacetime descended.","However, such suppression was nothing to Jian Wushuang now.","If he wished, he could break through any suppression.","After all, he had the combat power of a Universe God.","It was the saying from before: “One force can break ten thousand methods.”","“Whew!” Jian Wushuang was about to retract his aura and suppress his divine power when he noticed cracks appearing in his divine body and Origin Source.","“What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","The next moment, both his Origin Source and divine body completely shattered.","The feeling of tearing in his will arose spontaneously.","That heart-wrenching feeling could only be experienced by those who had tried it.","“Ah!!!”","Jian Wushuang clutched his head, and his figure slowly descended.","His vision blurred, and the last thing he saw was Wu Zuo and the Realm King.","Then he lost consciousness.","The calamity of the lower spacetime, or rather the entire Northern Spacetime, had finally ended.","However, apart from some strong individuals from Qishen Temple, no one knew what had happened.","The strong individuals from the middle spacetime were watching, and those from the upper spacetime were also observing.","Only the strong from the lower spacetime were mourning.","They mourned for those who had perished in this battle.","From the moment the Temple of World Annihilation appeared, many Dao Lords, Emperors, and Universe Masters had fallen, and now they could rest in peace.","For this reason, the Grave God Mountain had moved to the most central Original Universe of the lower spacetime.","Because all the tributaries of the lower spacetime had converged, there was only one spacetime river left in the entire lower spacetime.","Before leaving, Realm King personally penned a name for it!","“Fallen Spacetime!”","Fallen Spacetime!","With the Original Universe as its center.","After losing its strongest opponent, the expansion of Qishen Temple went extremely smoothly, without any opposition.","The current Original Universe had become a holy land in the lower stream or lower level spacetimes.","Countless cultivators yearned to enter the Original Universe.","The four secret realms of Qishen Temple had also become a thing of the past.","Their current role was the same as at the beginning, to cultivate heirs.","The first generation of heirs was carefully selected by Zhen Ling.","Apart from the Original Universe, the others were some of the top Dao Lords, who even mastered the ultimate way.","The number of strong individuals born was also the highest.","For instance, Shang, Lord Guangying, Gu Qianluo, and others.","The second generation of heirs was selected during the confrontation with the Temple of World Annihilation.","They were considered sect members.","The representative was Luo!","As for the third generation of heirs, they were extraordinary.","Realm King had tilted the Origin Source, bestowing the lower spacetime with vast Origin Source power, resulting in a massive outburst within a million epochs, producing several Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation.","As for the Eighth Tribulation realm...","That was a bottleneck.","Qishen Temple had only one individual of the Eighth Tribulation.","Even so, no one dared to underestimate Qishen Temple.","Because of that battle, many strong individuals from the middle spacetime came, and even the super strong individuals from the upper spacetime descended one after another.","They came to observe the traces left on the battlefield at that time, benefiting greatly, and stayed to cultivate.","Wu Zuo took the opportunity to charge an observation fee, fleecing everyone.","The strong individuals from the middle spacetime were no match for Wu Zuo, and the strong individuals from the upper spacetime, knowing Wu Zuo’s relationship with the Realm King, dared not do anything and obediently handed over their treasures.","It wasn’t that Wu Zuo was stingy.","But now, the expenses of Qishen Temple were huge.","The key was that Wu Zuo himself had also founded a sect.","Qishen Temple was the source of all sects.","The heirs also founded sects and accepted many disciples.","Finally, they were sent to Qishen Temple, in exchange for some treasures.","Wu Zuo didn’t recruit disciples for those treasures but rather had to send treasures to Qishen Temple.","Firstly, to fulfill his master’s dream of making Qishen Temple glorious again.","Secondly, to satisfy his own unfulfilled aspirations.","The Dao Palace he built had now become one of the top three sects in Qishen Temple.","In Qishen Temple, apart from the heirs of Tomb God Mountain, other forces were scattered.","For example, Yuanyang Palace.","However, the positions of the four halls were maintained.","A million epochs had passed, yet the battle from that time was still vivid in memory.","Everyone fantasized about the scene of that battle, but no one imagined who the combatants were.","Mie Sheng had become a taboo, rarely mentioned.","As for the other, everyone knew who he was.","Because his statue was in the desolate region of the far universe.","Desolate Region!","It was actually the original Great Wilderness.","It lay at the junction of the Tongtian Buddha Realm and the Great Si Region.","The birthplace of Qishen Temple.","The place where Jian Wushuang’s life changed.","It was also where he met Hu Qing.","The current Desolate Region was no longer desolate.","It had become the core of the Original Universe.","Because Qishen Temple was also located there.","Naturally, it was the center of the strong.","Whoosh!","On this day, two strangers arrived in the Desolate Region. Their attire was strange, and they had no aura, so no one noticed their arrival.","“So many cultivators!” said an older middle-aged man, standing in midair, looking at a small city, sighing, “Little Si World, this seems to be the hometown of Brother Wushuang!”","Beside the middle-aged man was a bald boy with green skin, clearly not a human cultivator.","“It is and it isn’t!” the boy said indifferently, “It should be the rebuilt version!”","“What a grand undertaking!” The middle-aged man sighed, feeling a bit sad as he thought of his own lost family and hometown.","The two did not stay long in the Little Si World, their figures slowly flying away, quickly leaving the Little Si World, heading towards the core of the Desolate Region, Qishen Temple."]},{"number":6105,"title":"Chapter 6105: Many Years Later","paragraphs":["Chapter 6105: Many Years Later","If Jian Wushuang saw them, he would surely be very happy.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were both in deep sleep now.","“Brother Danbao!”","Outside the Qishen Temple, Wu Zuo, dressed in a yellow Daoist robe and wearing his usual Daoist crown, saw Danbao and Wu Li from afar and shouted, “I’ve finally waited for you!”","“Sorry!” Danbao came before Wu Zuo and cupped his fists in a greeting, but Wu Zuo quickly stopped him.","“No need for that. You are now the God of Life and have created the resurrection secret method. If those scattered Tribulations saw you treating me like this, they’d surely kill me!” Wu Zuo joked.","Although it was a joke, it wasn’t an exaggeration.","Danbao had created the resurrection secret method, and now the entire Northern Spacetime revered Danbao as a father.","All the Scattered Tribulations, even the Universe Masters, had placed statues of Danbao in their sects or caves.","The resurrection secret method!","Not only were the scattered Tribulations waiting, but the Realm Kings were also waiting.","They had waited for countless years for the God of Life.","After waiting for millions of epochs, Danbao created the resurrection secret method.","The Realm Kings were very pleased. The sooner the resurrection secret method was created, the stronger the foundation of the Northern Spacetime would be.","Because every day, Scattered Tribulations would fall.","Although Jian Wushuang had provided a lot of Life force back then, it was only distributed to the major powers or the Eighth Tribulation experts.","The true lower-tier Scattered Tribulations couldn’t get any Life force.","With the advent of the resurrection secret method, a general amnesty was declared.","All the scattered Tribulations condensed new Origin Sources.","The entire Northern Spacetime’s Origin Source was enhanced.","Now, the divine power capacity of the Northern Spacetime could reach 30 million.","Danbao’s next step was to enhance the life Origin Source of the entire Northern Spacetime.","At that time, Nine Tribulation Realm experts could be born.","Wouldn’t the Universe Masters revere him!","“Brother Wu Zuo, you’re joking again.” Danbao’s face turned red, and he could only respond with a smile.","Although millions of epochs had passed, Danbao hadn’t changed at all and still appeared shy.","Wu Li, who was behind him, couldn’t help but ask, “Wu Zuo, hurry and take us inside. I’ve been itching to see it.”","Over the years, he had returned to the Upper Spacetime and heard about the Qishen Temple, always wanting to see it.","So this time, he thickened his skin and came to the Lower Spacetime with Danbao.","“My bad!” Wu Zuo slapped his forehead, realizing his mistake. “I’ve been talking non-stop. Please, come inside!”","Usually tough with everyone, Wu Zuo was very respectful to Danbao, and consequently polite to Wu Li.","Because of Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Only Danbao could repair Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","Only the God of Life could achieve this.","He was afraid of offending Danbao, fearing he wouldn’t properly repair Jian Wushuang.","Upon entering the Qishen Temple, Wu Zuo had already prepared drinks.","He even invited Shang and Luo to accompany them.","To put on a grand show, he even brought out Zhen Ling.","Danbao saw all this and lightly shook his head, speaking solemnly, “Take me to see Brother Wushuang first!”","“Alright... alright! Alright!” Wu Zuo said three times in succession.","Even Luo thought Wu Zuo had changed, becoming like a sycophant.","Bowing and leading the way for Danbao.","Was this still the Wu Zuo who almost fought with Wu Tian over a disciple?","In the Qishen Temple, except for Zhen Ling, Wu Zuo was arrogant with everyone.","But now he seemed like a different person.","Shang, understanding the situation, also smiled and followed, mimicking Wu Zuo’s actions.","Zhen Ling personally led the way.","He took everyone to the God’s Tomb.","At the peak of the Grave God Mountain.","Two ice coffins, emanating cold air, lay silently in a pool of clear water.","“Brother Wushuang!” Seeing the ice coffins, Danbao’s eyes reddened.","The usually cheerful Wu Li also quieted down, feeling distressed seeing Jian Wushuang in his current state.","Back then, as Jian Wushuang’s third uncle, he had boasted a lot about his nephew.","Now seeing Jian Wushuang lying quietly in the ice coffin, he felt a twinge of sadness.","Fortunately, this time Danbao came to heal Jian Wushuang.","He would soon be able to awaken.","A million eras had passed since that battle ended, and they had finally waited for this day.","If Danbao hadn’t been in seclusion at the time, Jian Wushuang could have been awakened","much earlier.","Realm King had no choice but to wait.","He personally waited in the Immortal Temple for a million eras.","Suddenly, he received two pieces of good news.","After learning about Jian Wushuang’s situation, Danbao dropped everything and rushed over","immediately.","The matter of the resurrection secret technique was entrusted to the Realm King to spread.","However, the Realm King also went under Danbao’s identity.","He strongly advocated for the God of Life.","Within just a few years, the resurrection secret technique had spread completely.","Even a rogue cultivator could obtain the resurrection secret technique.","“Ladies and gentlemen, please step back half a step!” Danbao turned his head and said softly,","“I still need some time.”","“No rush, take your time!” Wu Zuo pulled everyone back several steps, afraid of affecting Danbao’s performance.","Danbao took a deep breath, gathered green Life force in his hands, and began to inject it into the ice coffin where Jian Wushuang lay.","Buzz!","The Life force was injected into Jian Wushuang’s body.","This process lasted a full quarter of an hour. After a short rest, Danbao continued to inject Life","force.","Jian Wushuang’s appearance didn’t seem to change much, but his consciousness had already","begun to become active.","“Hmm?”","In the void, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes.","But all he saw was darkness.","Only his consciousness was active; he couldn’t feel anything.","“Where am I?”","He felt confused.","His nerves were still in a tense state.","“Mie Sheng!”","“Whoosh!” He gasped for breath, trying to mobilize his divine power, but the next moment","The remembered that Mie Sheng was already dead.","Moreover, he couldn’t gather any divine power!","“Where am I?” He opened his eyes wide but still couldn’t see anything. He only felt that his consciousness was slowly growing stronger.","Until he regained the ability to think, a large portion of his memories re-entered his mind.","The scene of defeating Mie Sheng seemed to have just happened.","He saw Wu Zuo and the Realm King walking towards him, and then he lost consciousness.","“Is it the Life force?” With some Thought power in his consciousness, he could now feel his physical body, but he couldn’t move. Only then did his consciousness let out a sigh of relief and speculated, “I must be injured, and someone is healing me!” Thinking of this, he felt something was amiss and thought of Jian Wushuang.","Why was there no consciousness of Hu Qing?","Now his consciousness was independent, which meant that he and Hu Qing had separated!","Surrounded by warmth, his Thought power grew stronger and stronger.","He could already control his divine body.","Buzz!","The closed Origin Source slowly opened.","At this moment, he finally saw some light.","He saw his Origin Source Universe.","His avatar clone also began to condense.","Splash!","“Whoosh!” The first breath he took was actually from his Origin Source Universe."]},{"number":6106,"title":"Chapter 6106: Resurrection","paragraphs":["Chapter 6106: Resurrection","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He stepped into Tianqing Mountain and stood at the peak, attempting to summon his Origin Source.","“Ha!” Despite concentrating his mental power, he couldn’t mobilize it in the slightest.","“How badly am I injured?”","After defeating Mie Sheng, he only remembered the tearing of his consciousness and had no idea where his injuries came from.","Not even the Realm King knew why Jian Wushuang was injured.","Moreover, he had been separated from Hu Qing.","They weren’t supposed to be able to separate.","However, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were separated after the collapse of the Divine Domain.","It was indeed strange.","After analyzing it, Realm King could only speculate that the backlash was caused by the significant fluctuations in divine power.","Originally, the backlash was enough to annihilate Jian Wushuang’s consciousness.","Fortunately, it happened in the North Spacetime, where the backlash was suppressed.","Thus, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing could withstand it.","They merely fell into slumber, with a possibility of awakening.","Otherwise, they would have perished along with Mie Sheng.","If that had happened, Jian Wushuang’s luck would have been dreadful.","Thankfully, at that time, the Northern Spacetime still had a limit of 20 million divine power.","If it were now, he would have been gone.","“Hmm?” The power of life gradually awakened his Origin Source, enhancing his mental power, and he was now able to mobilize his Origin Source.","With the Origin Source, he could generate the power of life to restore his divine body.","“My divine power has fallen to zero?” Sensing his divine body with his Thought power, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Zero!","He was no different from a mortal now.","After mobilizing his Origin Source, he began to use the power of all things to replenish his divine power.","He needed to replenish a lot, and he even took out a primordial stone to enhance his divine power.","“10,000!”","100,000!","The power of All Things replenished quickly, and the stronger his Thought power became, the more he could feel the uniqueness of that Life force.","Such a special Life force reminded him of Danbao.","He couldn’t help but smile.","“A million!”","Yet, he still couldn’t mobilize his divine power to wake himself up.","His base divine power was now 8 million.","He needed to restore at least 50 percent of his divine power.","“I don’t know how long I’ve been asleep, it shouldn’t have been too long!” He guessed internally, and soon replenished half of his divine power.","Drip!","A droplet of water fell on his face from the ice coffin.","The cold water droplet was reminiscent of the rain he encountered before losing consciousness, though the temperature was different.","Perhaps it was due to a different environment.","“He’s awake!” Uzou’s eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang, and the moment his finger moved, he jumped up.","Zhen Ling coughed lightly. If it weren’t for the presence of outsiders, he would have kicked Uzou. Instead, he reminded him verbally, “Uzou, don’t be rude!”","“We’re all friends here, no need to be polite!” Wu Li turned to Zhen Ling with a smile.","Danbao also noticed that Jian Wushuang was about to wake up, and the power of Life slowly stopped.","They waited for Jian Wushuang to wake up on his own.","“Rise!” After who knows how long without controlling his body, Jian Wushuang used all his strength but couldn’t open his eyes.","It was more exhausting than fighting.","After several attempts, his eyelids finally moved.","To seize the momentum, he adjusted his breathing, recalling the sensation of controlling his body.","“Whoosh!”","His lips parted slightly, and after breathing in the outside air, it felt like vitality was injected into him, and he successfully opened his eyes.","A pair of clear eyes first saw the sky of the divine tomb.","Stars dotted the sky.","Those were all universes.","“Brother Wushuang!”","“Wushuang, my dear brother!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","Everyone stepped forward together, forming a circle around him.","Seeing familiar faces and their smiles, the feeling was genuinely heartwarming!","The smiles seemed as eternal as honor itself!","The battle was fought to protect something.","Perhaps it was to protect these very smiles.","...","However, after a while, he began to feel awkward about these smiling faces.","A group of people was surrounding him, watching.","Yet he couldn’t even stand up after the fight.","His lips trembled slightly, unable to utter a single word.","“Wa...water...” The first word he managed to say was due to the scorching sensation in his throat, making him unbearably thirsty.","A perfect physical body, and yet it still needed water?","He was a bit curious. His gaze shifted away from those smiling faces and landed on the ice coffin.","Only then did he understand why he was so thirsty.","Hearing the word “water,” Wu Zuo quickly took out a jug of wine from his mustard seed and poured it into Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","“Ugh!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened as a heart-wrenching sensation surged from his throat.","He immediately sat up, shouting hoarsely, “Who the hell gave me wine?”","Everyone was momentarily stunned by his sudden movement, then they all stepped back, their eyes falling on Wu Zuo.","Wu Zuo, holding the wine jug, scratched his head and said, feeling wronged, “Well...usually in this kind of situation, one needs to drink three cups of wine, right?”","Jian Wushuang stared at Wu Zuo with bloodshot eyes, and after a while, he laughed, “Once I recover, I’ll definitely drink thirty thousand cups with you!”","“Alright...alright!” Wu Zuo, excited, took a sip himself and laughed heartily, “Once you recover, we can drink for thirty thousand years!”","Everyone laughed at his words.","Only Danbao took out a jug of water and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","“This time, you worked hard!” He took the water jug, gulped down a large mouthful, and finally felt his entire body relax.","As his divine power gradually restored, he became more familiar with his physical body and leaped out of the ice coffin.","Danbao smiled lightly, “This is what I should do!”","Jian Wushuang also smiled.","Indeed, nothing had changed.","“Lord Zhen Ling!”","“Shang, Luo!”","After greeting everyone, he looked at Wu Li.","“Third Uncle, your divine power has increased a lot!”","Hearing this title, Wu Li smiled awkwardly, “It’s been so long, and you still remember it, Brother Wushuang!”","“How could I forget!” Jian Wushuang’s gaze grew deep as he recalled the events in the upstream spacetime.","Back then, the two of them supported each other, traveling from the Roman River to the Dragon God Continent, where they met Danbao.","And the Frost Demon clan that made them despair.","He glanced around and didn’t see Hu Qing.","Only then did he notice another ice coffin, where Hu Qing lay.","“How is Hu Qing?”","“Just like you!” Zhen Ling stepped forward and explained, “He has been asleep for a million eras. He was severely injured by Mie Sheng back then!”","“A million eras?” Jian Wushuang was surprised to find that he had slept for so long.","The time he spent sleeping had exceeded the time he spent cultivating.","Although he had left Qishen Temple millions of eras ago, he had entered the Myriad Willows Godwood Universe Sea midway, where the flow of time was different from the outside world, and only a few eras had passed.","It was almost the same as the time he spent traveling back.","In total, he had left Qishen Temple for less than ten eras.","But this time, he had slept for a million eras.","This was the fastest passage of time he had ever experienced, as if everything had just happened yesterday."]},{"number":6107,"title":"Chapter 6107: We Really Win This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 6107: We Really Win This Time","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When he woke up, a million eras had passed.","“Danbao!” Jian Wushuang turned his head to look at Danbao.","Danbao understood without needing words.","“Don’t worry, I will revive him!” Danbao said, then began to gather life force and injected it into Hu Qing’s body.","It didn’t take long for Hu Qing’s consciousness to awaken as well.","Similar to Jian Wushuang’s situation, Hu Qing’s eyelids twitched a few times before he fully woke up.","A group of people gathered around again.","Hu Qing blinked.","Everyone was blinking at him too.","On this day, the two greatest heroes of Qishen Temple had both awakened.","The entire Qishen Temple was in celebration.","The Tianjie Yuanyang Palace even hosted a grand banquet.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing sat on either side of Zhen Ling.","“Haha!” Zhen Ling, with a face full of joy, looked at the prosperous scene before him, turned to Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, and happily said, “I’ve waited a million eras longer than you two for this day!”","After Mie Sheng fell.","Qishen Temple lost its greatest opponent and became the dominant force in the downstream spacetime.","However, Zhen Ling never held a banquet because of that battle.","At this moment, Wu Zuo looked at Jian Wushuang and repeated what Zhen Ling had said to everyone back then.","“The main characters haven’t awakened, so what’s there to be happy about?”","Hold a banquet?","For whom?","A celebration without the heroes?","Would it still be called a celebration?","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang revealed a slight smile, though his eyes showed a bit of sadness.","He raised his glass, and with a hint of reverence in his voice, said, “Lord Zhen Ling, this toast is for you!”","“No, no!” Zhen Ling shook his head and said, “This toast should be from all of us to you and Hu Qing!”","Zhen Ling raised his glass, and everyone in the hall fell silent.","Countless eyes were fixed on Zhen Ling above.","Some were Universe Masters who rose after Mie Sheng’s fall, while others had lived under the threat of the Temple of World Annihilation.","There were also generational inheritors, and even some elders within Qishen Temple.","Such as the former Yuanyang Palace Master “Qing Niu!”","And Wu Zuo’s life-and-death brother “Lu Hua!”","Many, many people.","They were all watching.","This toast was for everyone!","Everyone drank together!","Afterward, they each did as they pleased.","Originally planning to drink for thirty thousand years with Jian Wushuang, Wu Zuo ended up competing with Wu Li. The two used their spatial treasures to drink, with rivers of alcohol flowing within them.","No one knew where Wu Li got the divine fruit liquor from, but just one pot was enough to knock Wu Zuo out.","It made everyone laugh.","Jian Wushuang also learned about the events of these years from Zhen Ling.","A million eras were enough to change many things.","However, he didn’t care about the development of Qishen Temple, as without an opponent, there would naturally be no waves.","Instead, he asked about the shattered Temple of World Annihilation.","And the whereabouts of Broly.","He hadn’t killed Broly; the other should still be alive.","He realized this later.","If Broly had recovered back then, no one would have been able to stop him.","Upon inquiring, Zhen Ling told him that the Realm King had thrown Broly into the abyss, and he shouldn’t be able to come out.","Even if he did, it would be on the Realm God Continent.","Broly, like a beast, being thrown into the abyss, was considered his final resting place.","If it weren’t for the backlash putting him to sleep, Broly would have perished.","After chatting with Zhen Ling for a long time, Jian Wushuang was pulled away by Wu Li to drink, putting all matters aside.","This unprecedented banquet lasted for a month.","Danbao and Wu Li also reached the time to bid farewell.","The two had played in Qishen Temple for several years, and only reluctantly left.","Before leaving, Wu Li even urged him to go to the Realm God Continent as soon as possible.","Because it was truly wonderful there, with many strong people.","And many opportunities.","Much more exciting than in the Northern Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang merely nodded; he hadn’t made up his mind yet.","Moreover, the affairs of the Northern Spacetime were still unresolved.","According to his initial intentions, he planned to unify the Northern Spacetime.","However, from what he learned from Wu Li, it wouldn’t be long before the entire spacetime river of the Northern Spacetime would condense into one.","At that time, the entire Northern Spacetime would undergo an overall enhancement.","This made him temporarily shelve his idea.","Currently, the situation was also good.","Poised and ready.","Externally, there was no competitive pressure, but internally, the pressure was still significant.","Otherwise, several Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulations Realm wouldn’t have emerged successively within a million years.","Among them were Xin Jiu and Gong Miaoyi’s son, Gong Ming.","All ten Divine Lords of Qishen Temple had already reached the Seventh Tribulation realm.","No one had any objections to this.","With Danbao’s departure, Jian Wushuang also found some leisure.","For a time, without any goals, he first restored both his Origin Source and divine body to their peak.","After sleeping for a hundred million epochs, he no longer wanted to go into seclusion for cultivation.","So, he left Qishen Temple and wandered in the desolate domain.","He visited Little Si World, or the Xiaosi Domain, and the Tongtian Buddha Realm.","And also the hometown of Ji Chaoyang.","The Ji family’s dynasty still existed.","Moreover, it was flourishing.","“The beauty of the capital is indeed beautiful!” With nothing better to do, he entered the capital of the Ji family’s dynasty and played around like a mortal.","As he wandered, he ended up in the imperial palace.","He couldn’t help it; he just followed the widest path.","Passing through various gates, the guards acted as if they couldn’t see him.","In fact, they really couldn’t see him.","“The harem?”","As he walked, he felt something was off and found himself in the harem.","While playing around, he had heard that the current emperor had taken 3,000 concubines, and this harem...","Thinking of this, a mischievous smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face. Humming a little tune, he walked in with small steps.","Don’t get the wrong idea, he wasn’t there to have fun.","“Little one!”","In front of a rock garden, faint cries could be heard. Jian Wushuang lowered his head and came to a little girl, making a funny face to scare her. “Little one, if you keep crying, I’ll take you away!”","“You... you can take me away!” The little girl, tired from crying, said between gasps, “My mother is gone, anyway... anyway, no one wants me!”","This little girl was no ordinary child but the little princess of the Ji family.","She held a very high status.","Yet she had a tragic life.","Her mother was just an ordinary concubine, who had been favored by the current emperor only once, and then she was born.","“Take you away?” Jian Wushuang retorted, “Don’t falsely accuse me and ruin my reputation!”","The little girl’s words startled him. He had only been here for half a day and hadn’t done anything improper.","Placing his hand gently on the little girl’s head, Jian Wushuang instantly understood.","It turned out her mother had already passed away.","She had died three months ago.","Without her mother, the little princess had a hard life.","The emperor of the Ji family had tens of thousands of children, if not hundreds of thousands.","He probably didn’t even know who this little girl was born to, so how could he care about his little daughter’s well-being?","Without her mother’s protection, the little girl was bullied, even by eunuchs and palace maids.","“So pitiful!” Jian Wushuang sighed.","The sorrow of being born in an imperial family!"]},{"number":6108,"title":"Chapter 6108: Poor Little Thing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6108: Poor Little Thing","It made him think of someone.","Jinchen!","The other party was the same.","He was willing to die.","Although he thought the other party was foolish, there were also pitiable aspects.","“Little one, I’ll take you to find your mother!”","He wrapped the little girl in his mental power and casually tossed her into a space.","It was a world inside a cave.","Creating a world was very simple for him.","Moreover, there were some life forms inside.","But those life forms were very weak, the strongest being only at the Yanxian level. “Here it is!” He pointed a finger and threw the little girl into a lush green forest. The little girl looked around at the unfamiliar surroundings, feeling a bit scared. After a long while without seeing anyone, she started crying loudly again.","Before long, her cries attracted a boy who was gathering firewood. He put down the bundle on his back and hurried over.","The boy was an orphan. When he was young, he also had a sister, but their poor family had to abandon her in the mountains due to their bastard father.","His mother died of depression because of this.","As for the father, whether it was retribution or bad luck, he drowned after falling into a river drunk.","The boy became an orphan and went to the mountains every day to gather firewood, hoping to find the sister who was abandoned.","Unexpectedly, he actually found her this day.","Jian Wushuang observed for a long time, and a faint smile appeared on his face.","“Little one, see you in ten thousand years!”","The little girl, with Ji family blood running through her veins, would not be hidden by the mundane world.","She would rise to prominence.","But it would take time.","However, this story was very ordinary.","Small characters with big ambitions.","Jian Wushuang collected the world inside the cave and then left the palace leisurely.","Years later, the Ji family’s ancestral hall discovered that a person was missing.","After some investigation, the matter was left unresolved.","Because no one cared that a person was missing, the investigation was just a formality.","They would never have thought that not long after, the Primitive Universe would see the rise of an extraordinary, heaven-defying Daoist.","Jian Wushuang walked in the Primitive Universe, his steps growing larger.","He walked out of the Primitive Universe, into the River of Time and Space, casually observing the lives within it.","He had once fantasized about this day, but he never expected it to come so soon.","With his mastery over time and space, he could observe any place in any time and space. “Rewind!” Jian Wushuang moved his finger, and time continuously flowed backward. Each rewind spanned millions and billions of eons.","He returned to the time when the Qishen Temple entered the downstream time from the midstream time.","Behind the Qishen Temple, there was a man in a yellow robe, none other than Wu Zuo.","Time rewound again.","In the Original Universe, the first practitioner appeared.","Before the first practitioner, there was a vast era of common mortals.","That era had no practitioners because the downstream time had not yet condensed its Origin","Source.","The mortals of that era showed great imagination.","They also created a brilliant civilization.","A glance at eternity.","Jian Wushuang immersed himself in it, observing for ten thousand years.","He watched the evolution of life from the beginning.","That was the origin of all life.","“River!” Jian Wushuang murmured, the first life in the downstream time came from the","flowing River of Time and Space.","And the River of Time and Space originated from the ultimate place upstream.","“In the future, when I have time, I must take a look!”","He wandered the downstream time for tens of thousands of years, and then returned to the","Qishen Temple.","Now the inside of the Qishen Temple had been completely transformed by Zhen Ling and Wu","Zuo.","The auxiliary halls were all dismantled.","Now only the four secret realms within the main hall remained.","The four secret realms were also divided by levels and functions.","Inheritors below the Yan Immortal level were in the Human Realm Secret Realm, those from Yan Immortal to Emperor were in the Earth Realm.","After reaching the Emperor level, one qualified to advance to the Heaven Realm.","Those who completed special tasks as Emperors could enter the God’s Tomb and go to the Grave God Mountain to become true Inheritors.","Apart from the four secret realms, the Origin Source Sea of the Qishen Temple was also completely open.","Because Hu Qing controlled the Heavenly Dao, he expanded the entire Origin Source Sea by","10,000 times.","Now, as long as one was a Universe Master, they could reside in the Origin Source Sea.","According to Zhen Ling’s original plan, only Divine Lords could reside there.","Now everyone had a share.","The Origin Source Sea became bustling.","The Universe Masters of the downstream time already exceeded ten thousand.","Among them, there were more than a dozen Universe Masters at the Seventh Tribulation","level.","There were as many as a hundred Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation level.","This was greatly related to the treasures Wu Zuo brought back.","It allowed the high-end combat power of the Qishen Temple to advance rapidly.","However, in Jian Wushuang’s view, the foundation was still lacking.","In the upstream time, to have a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation level, one needed","tens of thousands of Universe Masters.","That was because resources were limited.","Now Wu Zuo was desperately filling the Qishen Temple with treasures, which would not form","a good trend.","Jian Wushuang came to the Sea of Origin this time to express some of his own opinions.","At the moment, he had nothing else to do.","His cultivation had been put aside, and as for heading to the Realm King Continent, that was a","matter for after the Eighth Tribulation.","In the Cosmic Sea, there was Henggu Mountain.","This mountain was a famous mountain from the Realm King Continent, secretly brought here","by Wu Zuo.","Its power was comparable to that of a divine artifact.","It was named Henggu Mountain because it was originally the supreme treasure of a Universe","God.","Later, when that Universe God fell, it was lost and its Origin Source was depleted, greatly reducing its value. Somehow, it ended up in Wu Zuo’s possession.","Now it was placed in the Cosmic Sea, serving as the core of the Cosmic Sea.","Those Universe Masters who settled in the Cosmic Sea entrusted their universes there, and","their divine bodies also resided in Henggu Mountain.","As soon as Jian Wushuang arrived at the foot of the mountain, he encountered many Universe","Masters.","They all stepped forward to greet him.","Most of these people were unfamiliar faces, so he did not linger. He just nodded slightly in acknowledgment and proceeded towards the mountain top.","Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation Realm only opened cave residences at the base of","the mountain.","Only those of the Fifth Tribulation had the qualifications to reside halfway up the mountain.","Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation could live at the top.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang’s cave residence was also at the top of Henggu Mountain.","Given their current status, going to Mie Sheng Mountain to compete for cave residences with","those Inheritors seemed inappropriate.","He was happy to settle in Henggu Mountain.","Upon reaching the palace at the mountain top, he sensed with his mind that Wu Zuo’s divine","body was also present and entered the grand hall directly.","Inside the grand hall, Wu Zuo appeared busy, flipping through some scrolls.","Seeing Jian Wushuang enter, he exclaimed in surprise, “Brother Wushuang, what wind blew","you here, and it’s your true self too!”","Usually, when one’s true self appeared at Henggu Mountain, it was for secluded cultivation.","Normally, everyone was busy with their own affairs.","Some Universe Masters even needed to guard certain secret realms.","Although there was no danger in the Qishen Temple, some strange treasures in certain secret","realms were quite good.","The main reason, however, was that they did not like to gather together. Just like Jian Wushuang, who preferred to find a quiet place to cultivate alone. Therefore, it was rare to encounter the true bodies of Universe Masters on Henggu Mountain; mostly, it was their divine bodies. Usually, they discussed the Dao together, which had its","own charm."]},{"number":6109,"title":"Chapter 6109: Planning a Succession for the Divine Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 6109: Planning a Succession for the Divine Temple","“Me, a wanderer without a base, I don’t need the wind to blow!” Jian Wushuang retorted to Wu Zuo. He wasn’t wrong; he truly was a wanderer.","After the threat was neutralized, he felt as if something was missing, spending his days wandering from place to place.","Hearing this, Wu Zuo thought Jian Wushuang wanted a base, so he generously said, “Why, have you taken a liking to a place? I’ll take it for you!”","He didn’t care about his reputation, even going as far as to take the Emperor’s territory, knowing Jian Wushuang wouldn’t lower himself to do it, so he prepared to play the villain himself.","Nowadays, Qishen Temple was teeming with talent, but the downstream river of time was small, the wasteland was vast, but it wasn’t suitable for cultivation.","In comparison, the middle stream wasn’t small either, but each strong individual occupied large territories.","If some peak experts’ territories were placed in the middle stream, even a Universe Master couldn’t cover them.","“Don’t say that, I actually have thought about it, but I won’t trouble you with it!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand in refusal. This time, he came for the future planning of Qishen Temple.","After all, he wouldn’t stay at Qishen Temple forever; he would leave eventually. Before leaving, he hoped to set Qishen Temple on the right path.","“Are you kidding me again? I’m just helping Lord Zhen Ling!” Wu Zuo said, but in reality, he had nearly rendered Zhen Ling powerless.","Everyone knew that the real leader of Qishen Temple now was Wu Zuo.","Even the Shang and Luo couple couldn’t compete with him.","Among the ten divine lords, Jian Wushuang and Hui Qing were both hands-off leaders, not involved in affairs.","Yet, Wutian’s flourishing demon sect had almost become a public enemy, but it couldn’t compete with Wu Zuo either.","“Alright, no more jokes. Today, I came to discuss the future planning of Qishen Temple!” Wu Zuo frowned, exclaiming, “Planning? In the entire Northern Starry Sky, who can compete with us? Once the barrier disappears, we’ll take over the middle and upper stream of the time space!”","His words were boastful, but not just empty talk; he had the strength and confidence to back them up.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t see it that way.","If they relied on power to suppress others, they had to have a solid foundation.","They couldn’t continue as they were today, using their influence to suppress others, benefiting the small ones below who would eventually retaliate.","When they were no longer around, who would protect Qishen Temple?","So Jian Wushuang planned to leave behind his teachings, establish a sect, and take in disciples.","To pass on his knowledge and legacy!","It wasn’t like Wu Zuo’s internal power struggles, but a true legacy.","“Brother Wu Zuo, simply put, I want you all to leave behind your teachings. The Northern Starry Sky is ultimately just a fleeting dream for us; we can’t stay here long or we’ll lose ourselves!” He expressed his thoughts, “Back then, I also thought that after the great war, each of us becoming an ancestor of our own territory was nice. But these days, as I’ve traveled the world, I’ve changed my mind!”","Over the years, he had seen prosperity and tranquility, as well as filth and ugliness.","This wasn’t what he wanted.","Just like the little girl he took from the Ji family; if it weren’t for his intervention, her talent would have been wasted.","It was a loss.","A loss for Qishen Temple and the Northern Starry Sky.","So he wanted to change.","The strong should be respected.","He wanted to carry this through to the end.","To hold a grand trial, selecting the strong.","To give them pressure, instead of the current stagnant state.","“You’re crazy, crazy!”","Wu Zuo shook his head, “Wushuang, leaving behind a legacy is fine. It’s normal for us to leave someday, but such trials consume too many treasures. You’ve been asleep for millions of epochs and don’t know; I owe a huge debt of treasures in the upper stream time space. The debt collectors are almost at my door!”","He understood Jian Wushuang’s intention and knew it was right.","But where would the treasures come from?","Currently, Qishen Temple nurtured legacies from the offspring of major strong individuals, with a high chance of producing strong individuals, and they could control the number, thus relieving the pressure on resources.","But if they were to conduct a broad trial selection, where would they find the necessary treasures?","The treasures of Qishen Temple had long been emptied by Zhen Ling, and later on, Wu Zuo had to use his own resources.","“I have the power of life...” Jian Wushuang began to say, but then he realized that the resurrection secret technique had now spread widely, and the value of life force had","plummeted.","Its value had decreased by ten thousand times.","Now, life force was only used for healing during battles, and even if he offered a lot of it, he","couldn’t sell it.","Thinking of this, he felt he had been somewhat idealistic.","On second thought, he came up with a solution.","“Then let’s start the selection with the Yanxian. Each of us will choose disciples, and before they reach the Dao, we will hold a trial. Whoever’s disciple is eliminated will be responsible for providing the treasures needed by Qishen Temple. How about that?”","This proposal made Wu Zuo’s eyes light up. He had been doing this for years and naturally had confidence in himself.","It would depend on how many people participated!","Teaching disciples, especially competing when they were Dao Lords, had little to do with the","master’s combat strength.","Having a Universe Master at the Seven Tribulation Realm teach a group of Yanxian was like using a sledgehammer to crack a nut, but with the prize Jian Wushuang proposed, it made","more sense.","Wu Zuo immediately called Zhen Ling, and the three of them planned together for a while before finalizing the decision.","Zhen Ling personally made arrangements and called upon the ten Lords, the four temple leaders, and the elders of the divided Yuanyang Palace.","Those elders were originally the hall masters of Yuanyang Palace, but after becoming Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, they each established their own sects and were separated by Zhen Ling.","No single power could dominate; otherwise, it would lose its purpose.","In Qishen Temple, all 18 Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation gathered, all present except Jian Wushuang, who was represented by his avatar.","“Leave behind your Dao!”","Zhen Ling looked at everyone and continued, “Everyone, the external expansion of Qishen","Temple has reached its limit, and the barriers in the lower levels have not been opened. But we cannot slack off; we must consider the future and leave our legacies for emergencies!” “Umm...” Many people whispered to each other, feeling that this matter required more","discussion.","They couldn’t ruin their previous efforts on impulse.","At least the current Qishen Temple was stable. If they made changes now, they would fall into","chaos again.","But they didn’t realize they had already fallen into a comfort zone, which was an even bigger","trap.","Moreover, what they were doing now was establishing their own sects, not much different","from what Zhen Ling proposed!","“I know what you want to say. Indeed, you have established your own sects and have your own disciples, but ask yourselves, are those true disciples?”","Zhen Ling’s words were sharp.","In reality, to put it bluntly, the disciples they took in were all good-for-nothings, just there","to handle various chores for them.","Were there any true disciples?","“I’ll make it clear. Currently, Qishen Temple’s resources are limited. This time, leaving","legacies is not just about selecting disciples; it’s also about selecting you. Whoever loses will cover the shortfall of Qishen Temple. I don’t care what method you use, even if you have to rob, you must fill the gap!”"]},{"number":6110,"title":"Chapter 6110: Wind and Clouds Rise Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 6110: Wind and Clouds Rise Again","Seeing Zhen Ling being so serious, everyone turned their heads and started to take things seriously too.","The current deficit of Qishen Temple was a huge number.","The foundation of the downstream spacetime was the weakest, and the resources were the least.","If it weren’t for Wu Zuo bringing treasures from the upstream spacetime, Qishen Temple would not have expanded to its current state.","To prevent the decline that comes after prosperity, internal cleansing had to start first.","Leaving behind a legacy, selecting true cultivators, and training them to become the pillars of Qishen Temple’s future was the goal.","In simple terms, it was to have them bear the burden in the future, as Jian Wushuang and the others would not stay in the Northern Spacetime for long.","“I’ll take this on!” Wutian was the first to speak up.","Among the group, he was considered relatively reliable.","His disciples, many of whom had received his teachings, were not true heirs, but he was most knowledgeable in teaching methods.","Under his tutelage, there were already Universe Master level disciples.","He didn’t think he would lose to anyone else.","“I’ll take it too!” Dongsheng and Wanyan answered in unison.","Wu Zuo and Jian Wushuang, as the initiators, naturally did not hesitate and raised their hands. “Good!”","Huiqing clasped his hands together. These days, he was also not focused on deep cultivation and took this opportunity to pass the time.","Ever since he learned from Danbao that it was possible to resurrect cultivators who had lost their souls, he had been thinking about going to the Realm God Continent.","However, the time was not yet right, so he, like Jian Wushuang, wandered aimlessly in the Northern Spacetime, waiting for that moment.","Before Danbao left, he had already informed them.","It would not take much time for the Northern Spacetime to give birth to a Ninth Tribulation realm.","At that time, it would also be their time to leave.","“Since there are no objections, let me explain the rules. In ten thousand years, I will bring a group of Yan Immortals into Qishen Temple for a trial. Then, everyone will select disciples together. There is no limit to the number of disciples. After taking them as personal disciples, each of you will teach them for an epoch. A competition will then determine the top ten. Whoever’s disciples do not make it into the top ten will handle Qishen Temple’s deficit!” As soon as Zhen Ling finished speaking, everyone nodded, thinking it was reasonable. Top ten!","Jian Wushuang reminded everyone, “Just a reminder, the top ten might all be taken by one person!”","In ten thousand years, they would recruit at least dozens of disciples.","Those who caught their eyes were at least candidates for the Ultimate Dao.","They might all make it into the top ten.","At that time, the other seventeen would be embarrassed.","Upon hearing this, everyone gasped.","The stakes were high this time, and they couldn’t afford to be careless.","At least one disciple had to make it into the top ten.","Originally, everyone had gathered with the intention of discussing the Dao, but with this pressure, they quickly dispersed after the announcement.","They began preparing treasures for the Yan Immortal to Grand Yan Immortal and also organized their inheritances.","From Xian to Emperor, they needed to cover everything.","There would be Universe Masters later on.","Jian Wushuang left with the others.","This was his idea, and if he didn’t teach well, it would be embarrassing.","He wasn’t in a hurry about the treasures.","The key was his Dao!","When he was a Dao Lord, he mainly cultivated the Extreme Dao and the Sword Dao.","He had some understanding of all Daos, but his best was still the Sword Dao.","Regarding the Extreme Dao, besides himself, he had never seen a second person who mastered it.","So, he could only choose Sword Dao geniuses.","He had to organize his Sword Dao, creating some divine abilities and ultimate skills suitable for the Xian.","Below the Emperor or the Tribulation Realm, it was still mainly about the Origin Source.","There were very few cultivators of divine power.","This was because divine power treasures were rare, and they also had high requirements for","oneself.","After returning to his own cave, he picked up his pen and began writing!","From the Yan Immortal to the Emperor’s Sword Dao ultimate skills and divine abilities.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!”","This was his most powerful secret technique to date.","He planned to leave it behind, but he didn’t know if anyone could successfully inherit it.","As for the ultimate skills from Yan Immortal to Emperor, he only left a simple inheritance.","It must not be lightly passed on, nor passed on upon death.","If it is not suitable later, it must still be revised.","“Star Sword Intent!”","The beginning of the Sword Dao Space was also the beginning of the Emperor.","If one could integrate this sword intent, it would signify having the combat power of an","Emperor.","But this was far from enough.","When he was a Dao Lord, he could kill even a supreme-peak level cultivator as easily as","chopping vegetables.","“Star River Intent!”","This sword intent, once integrated, could rival the peak of a tier 3 Emperor.","Then he continued to write, “Star River Lake Sea!”","This was a sword technique he had created back then, but now it had been improved and was","different from before.","When he performed it back then, he was only a Yan Immortal.","Now it had been elevated to the level of an Emperor.","Stars, galaxies, lakes, and seas.","Four types of sword intent, from ordinary Emperor Lords to peak Emperor Lords.","If one could integrate and understand them, they could battle sixth-level Emperor Lords.","“Almost enough!” he exhaled deeply.","He carefully stored the complete Chronicles.","After a pause, he picked up his pen again.","The Chronicles was too difficult, and he feared no one could inherit it.","So he left behind a simplified version of the Chronicles.","“Universe Chronicles, Spacetime Chronicles, Starry Sky Chronicles!”","The three charts represented three paths.","If one could cultivate the Universe Chart to perfection, they could become a complete Eighth","Tribulation realm powerhouse.","If one could perfect the Spacetime Chart, they could become an Eternal Being.","The Starry Sky Chronicles, however, had no upper limit.","Even without using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, performing the Starry Sky","Chronicles could still kill an ancient existence.","He carefully stored the three charts, and in the outside world, ten thousand years had passed.","Improving the Star River Lake Sea only took an hour.","But improving the Starry Sky Chronicles took him 10,000 years.","“As for the divine body, divine power, and secret techniques, it still depends on those","disciples!”","Walking out of the cave mansion, the Henggu Mountain was bustling that day.","In these ten thousand years, news of the trial had spread completely.","Many major families, especially those of the Universe Masters, were desperately cultivating","Yan Immortals and then sending them to Zhen Ling.","Originally, it was meant to be fair and select from the entire downstream space.","There was no way around it, the scope was too broad.","A few good words from Zhen Ling’s old subordinates had him agreeing.","Jian Wushuang could only sigh at this.","There was no helping it; birth determined everything.","However, this trial had also greatly elevated the Yan Immortals of the entire downstream","spacetimes.","Apart from those Universe Masters’ families, some sects also trained a large number of Yan","Immortals after hearing the news.","All for this opportunity.","17 Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters, plus 1 Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, openly","accepting disciples.","Not to mention the downstream space, even the upstream spacetimes would be shaken. Moreover, all the top experts of the downstream spacetimes were participating.","10,000 years passed.","Everyone gathered.","The target was a cave world within the Qishen Temple, personally refined by Zhen Ling,","capable of accommodating Emperor and sufficient for the trial of Yan Immortals. “Apart from some family and sect prodigies, the rest were all personally captured by me, rest assured!” Zhen Ling looked at the gathered Yan Immortals and smiled."]},{"number":6111,"title":"Chapter 6111: Prodigy","paragraphs":["Chapter 6111: Prodigy","This trial was different from before.","At least no one would lose their life.","Zhen Ling had personally arranged for over ten thousand emperors to enter. As long as there was a breath left, they could be revived. If anyone was unlucky enough to fall, they couldn’t blame anyone else.","“With Lord Zhen Ling handling this, we can naturally be at ease!” Wu Zuo didn’t forget to flatter him, as he had also sent someone into the trial.","Over the millennia, not everyone had prepared for the secret methods as earnestly as Jian Wushuang.","Many had secretly cultivated Yan Immortal and then thrown them into the trial field, letting them choose themselves in the end.","In fact, Jian Wushuang also had a candidate, currently in his cave.","It was the little girl he had taken from the Ji family back then.","“By the way, the rules for this trial are simple. I’ve calculated that the total number of captured and sent Yan Immortal is ten billion. They will fight each other until a thousand remain. These will then engage in a tournament to determine the rankings. The rest is up to you!”","Zhen Ling’s rules were simple. The final thousand Yan Immortals would be ranked, serving as a reference for them.","One point made everyone uncomfortable.","They had become the ones to be chosen.","Those Yan Immortals would pick their own masters.","This depended on their personal charisma and methods.","If those they sent in made it to the top thousand, they would naturally become their disciples.","There was no need to be chosen.","“Since there are no objections, let’s go!”","Zhen Ling stood up, tore open space, and led everyone directly into the cave.","However, they all entered with their Dharma bodies; otherwise, the cave would have shattered.","The entire cave was a landscape, very suitable for mortals to live in.","“This viewing platform was built especially for you!” Zhen Ling pointed to a massive plaza. At that moment, tens of thousands of strong practitioners had already taken their seats, all present with their avatar clones.","In the center of the plaza, besides the enormous canopy, there were millions of Yan Immortals.","No need to look; these were the prodigies of the families and sects.","Unexpectedly, they had gathered so many.","Including those painstakingly selected by Zhen Ling, they had indeed reached ten billion.","However, those who mastered the ultimate way were less than one in ten thousand.","Even among the prodigies, they were rare.","“Welcome, Divine Lords!”","Jian Wushuang and others sat in the highest seats. Many strong practitioners below came to flatter them, evidently wanting them to open a back door.","But this time, the stakes were too high. No one would be careless; they all kept a stern face.","It was a reminder to them not to try any tricks.","These strong practitioners were sensible. Seeing the stern faces of the Divine Lords and Palace Lords, they naturally didn’t dare to say anything more and returned to their seats.","Once back, they began transmitting messages to their junior prodigies.","“Wanshan, don’t let down the family’s expectations. Make it to the top thousand and restore the Wanjia’s former glory. Don’t forget the ancestral teachings and the old ancestor Wan Xing!” The head of the Wan Family, a descendant of Wan Xing, was now a Fourth Tribulation Universe Master.","After the great battle, Zhen Ling, though silent, had done a lot for the families of some fallen strong practitioners.","He had tilted resources significantly, even paying out of his own pocket.","Besides the Wanjia, there was also the Jiajia.","“Ji Ye, Ji Hao, make it to the top thousand. You will be the pride of the family!” The old ancestor of the Ji Family looked at the two top prodigies of the family with expectation. Meanwhile, many super families were giving instructions to their descendants.","Even the ninth Divine Lord, Gong Ming, let his family’s younger generation participate.","“Gong Ping, remember who you wield your three-foot sword for!”","This voice reached the ears of a quiet, sword-wielding youth in the plaza. Hearing this, the youth’s expression trembled.","His three-foot sword was forged by the Ancestor.","It was the Ninth Divine Lord of Qishen Temple!","The recent transmission was from the rumored Ancestor.","Initially steady, he revealed an excited expression upon hearing these encouraging words.","The young geniuses below, after hearing transmissions from their family’s Ancestor or elders, were high-spirited!","Jian Wushuang, having no juniors, naturally skipped this part.","However, within his cave world, it was a different scene.","Atop a mountain peak.","An old white-haired demon was slain by a single sword, blood splattering on the spot.","The one who wielded the sword was a young girl, her eyes cold and her white clothes","unstained by dust.","Behind the girl stood another person.","He crossed his arms, holding a long sword, with an arrogant expression, yet he gave the girl high praise: “The old demon was a Grand Yan Immortal, and you managed to slay him with one sword strike. It seems Master will take you away this time.”","“Why do you say that, Senior Brother? Didn’t you also slay a Grand Yan Immortal?” The girl turned to the man, her expression unchanged, still cold.","“Why is Junior Sister always so cold? Master will soon take us both away from this world. Why not be a little happier?”","The arrogant man displayed an aloof demeanor towards everyone, except for this girl.","The girl, however, did not change her attitude, still coldly saying, “It’s none of your","business!”","With that, she walked down the mountain.","“Is it because of your useless brother?” The arrogant man sneered, “Even Master can’t help","him. You’d better give up. Besides, he’s not even your blood brother. He has barely survived for so many years with the Thousand Flowers Poison. Why be so persistent? We have already","become immortals!”","Swoosh!","The cold divine sword instantly unsheathed.","The tip of the sword was just a hair’s breadth from the arrogant man’s neck. The girl, her eyes filled with anger, said word by word, “In front of me, you are not worthy to mention him!”","With that, the divine sword returned to its sheath.","The girl left directly.","The arrogant man touched his neck, coldly snorting, and thought to himself, “So foolish, caring so much for a useless person. Just wait, once we get out, I will surpass you. Then...”","He revealed an evil smile.","Jian Wushuang witnessed everything.","“It has a bit of Jiang Shang’s taste!”","He smiled bitterly, his mind returning to the wooden house at the foot of the mountain.","The young girl was the one he had taken from the Ji family, now already a Yan Immortal.","When it came to planning, who could surpass him?","Time here was altered by him; outside, only tens of thousands of years had passed, while here","it had been a hundred thousand years.","About three to four times slower.","He even specifically found her a master.","Her master was not an outsider either.","“Brother Lu Hua, thank you for your hard work this time!”","In the wooden house, Jian Wushuang and Lu Hua sat facing each other.","The master found was the former Palace Master of Yuanyang Palace, Wu Zuo’s life-and-death","brother.","“You’re too kind. It was just an avatar clone body. I was curious why you asked me to teach her","back then, but now I see you had a plan all along!”","Lu Hua chuckled lightly.","Back then, when Jian Wushuang sought him, he thought Jian Wushuang intended to use this","matter to give him a treasure."]},{"number":6112,"title":"Chapter 6112: Ji Tang","paragraphs":["Chapter 6112: Ji Tang","Unexpectedly, Qishen Temple was holding a trial again after such a long time, and it was conducted by the top figures in the temple to recruit disciples and teach them.","Initially, he had planned to send a group of Yan Immortals in himself, but upon reflection, he realized that with his current status, he didn’t rank anywhere in Qishen Temple. Moreover, he had no family power and held no position in the temple.","Without power or influence, what was the point of nurturing Yan Immortals?","He could have sought shelter under Wu Zuo, but he couldn’t bring himself to do so. Wu Zuo had once worked under him.","Now it was his turn, and he couldn’t lower himself, so he found a quiet place in the small world of the Desolate Domain to meditate in seclusion.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t personally invited him, he wouldn’t have come out.","Moreover, this matter held significant meaning for him.","He knew Jian Wushuang wanted to train disciples, and once they achieved great success, they wouldn’t forget him.","Why not do it?","It was indeed a good thing, otherwise Jian Wushuang wouldn’t have sought out Lu Hua.","Back then, Emperor Lu Hua had helped him a lot.","Moreover, he and Wu Zuo had once tricked Emperor Lu Hua, causing him to lose his position as palace lord first.","This could be considered compensation!","As the two reminisced, a cold voice came from outside the door.","“Master!”","Hearing the voice, Lu Hua smiled and said, “Ji Tang, come in quickly!”","Creak!","The wooden door was pushed open.","It was the young girl who had previously killed the white-haired old demon with a single sword on the mountaintop.","She was also the little princess of the Ji family dynasty.","Upon entering the room, Ji Tang saw Jian Wushuang, and with just one glance, she sensed his extraordinary nature.","The entire person was reserved and introverted.","With sword-like brows and starry eyes, he looked like a divine sword ready to be unsheathed.","Besides these, there were some vague memories.","In the hazy memories, she seemed to have seen him before.","“Ji Tang, do you recognize this senior?” Lu Hua stood up and introduced, “Without him, you and I wouldn’t have this bond!”","Jian Wushuang made a funny face, stood up, and said with a light smile, “Little girl, long time no see!”","“It’s you?” Ji Tang’s face lit up with joy as she exclaimed, “Was it you who brought me here back then?”","Although the memory was fuzzy, she always remembered a man with a funny face carrying a sword who threw her into the mountains.","Later, she was found by her brother.","“Yes, it was me!” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Now that you have completed your studies, do you want to go out and see the world?”","Ji Tang hesitated at these words.","“Don’t hesitate. Your brother’s matter can be handled by him!” In fact, Emperor Lu Hua could","have taken care of this, but Jian Wushuang had suppressed it.","Jian Wushuang’s real intention was not just to train Ji Tang.","There was also her brother.","He created this paradise because of that young man.","Later, he discovered that Ji Tang’s character was very suitable for practicing swordsmanship, so he brought her in as well.","“Shen Jian!”","That young man had great potential.","He was the most promising candidate to inherit Jian Wushuang’s Starry Sky Chronicles.","At the very least, he could inherit the Spacetime Chronicles.","The Starry Sky Chronicles was too difficult, requiring the mastery of the power of the Starry Sky.","This alone stumped almost everyone.","The first five sword moves of the Starry Sky Chronicles were relatively easy; mastering the","power of the Starry Sky was enough.","But to master all nine sword moves...","Forget others, even Jian Wushuang couldn’t do it.","Back when he fused with Hu Qing, he could only perform the sixth sword move.","At that time, his combat power had already reached the level of a Universe God.","A Universe God could only perform the sixth sword move.","To master all nine swords, what kind of power would that require?","Moreover, to practice the ninth sword, one would need the Origin Source of the starry sky.","No one could do that except him.","But being able to master the first five swords was enough to dominate the entire Northern","Starry Sky.","“Your brother Shen Jian will also leave with you!”","This time, he came personally to take Shen Jian and Ji Tang away together.","However, there was one more thing to do before they left.","When Ji Tang heard that her brother could leave with her and that his injuries could be healed,","her eyes turned red.","For tens of thousands of years, she had been searching for an antidote to save her brother.","“Let’s go!” Lu Hua raised his hand and pointed outside, saying, “Yan Shuang has also","returned!”","Yan Shuang was that arrogant man.","In fact, he was also arranged by Jian Wushuang.","It was to temper Shen Jian.","Back then, Shen Jian was poisoned by Yan Shuang.","It couldn’t be said that Jian Wushuang had no direct connection, but there were many intricate","links.","Outside the wooden house, they happened to meet Yan Shuang returning.","“You...” Yan Shuang saw Jian Wushuang and stepped back in fear!","That face, he would never forget in his lifetime.","A demon!","A devil!","Jian Wushuang, however, smiled and transmitted a message: “Yan Shuang, it’s time for you","to make a sacrifice!”","He didn’t pay much attention to Shen Jian and Ji Tang.","But he had spent a lot of effort on Yan Shuang.","This was a test set up for Shen Jian.","If he passed, he would transform like a carp into a dragon.","But even if it meant eternal damnation.","He would also give Yan Shuang an opportunity.","No one could say he was biased.","“Yan Shuang, don’t be rude!” Lu Hua knew this was Jian Wushuang’s plan and glared: “This","senior is someone I specifically invited to take you away from this world, come and pay your","respects!”","Upon hearing this, Yan Shuang hurriedly stepped forward and saluted: “Greetings, senior!”","But his eyes were avoiding, as if he had a guilty conscience.","Jian Wushuang stood aside with a harmless look, completely different from what Yan Shuang","had seen. Only Jian Wushuang and Lu Hua knew Yan Shuang’s true identity.","In the mundane world, he was a child raised by a bandit, who had committed arson, murder,","and robbery from a young age.","Later, he was chosen by Jian Wushuang, sent to Lu Hua’s side, and played the role of a great","demon, always holding Yan Shuang’s weakness.","The scheme against Shen Jian back then was instigated by him.","But Yan Shuang also had his own selfish motives, he desperately wanted Ji Tang, but he could","see that Ji Tang had no interest in him at all, so he deeply hated Shen Jian.","Thus, he had the idea of scheming against him.","Jian Wushuang gave a little guidance, and the following events happened.","He gave Shen Jian the opportunity to temper himself and Ji Tang the motivation to","continuously surpass herself.","It was a win-win situation.","Lu Hua took the three of them around the wooden house to a cave mansion at the back of the","mountain.","This was where Shen Jian was to heal.","To prevent Ji Tang from knowing his arrangement.","This time, he chose mental tempering.","The four stood outside the cave.","Jian Wushuang only pointed a finger, and a dark red light entered the cave mansion.","In just an instant!","The originally weak and powerless Shen Jian reappeared at the cave entrance, full of spirit,","with flying sideburns, like an immortal.","No, he had already achieved the status of a Derived Immortal.","Moreover, on his back, he carried a broken sword.","As for Yan Shuang, he stood in place with vacant eyes, no longer moving.","His soul had already been extracted by Jian Wushuang and sent to reincarnate in the Original","Universe.","The mental trial was very fast for them."]},{"number":6113,"title":"Chapter 6113: Shen Jian","paragraphs":["Chapter 6113: Shen Jian","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In just an instant, everything ended without a trace.","But for Shen Jian, thousands of years had passed.","In the illusion, he saw Yan Shuang and Ji Tang getting married, and he was powerless to stop it.","Later, he discovered that his poisoning was Yan Shuang’s doing, but by that time, Ji Tang had already given birth to a son and a daughter with Yan Shuang.","He lost his will for revenge, and lived in depression and despondency every day.","Later, he came across a painting.","Picked up a short sword.","Riding a skinny horse, he began searching for the place in the painting.","There, he met Jian Wushuang.","After mastering his skills, he exposed Yan Shuang’s ugly face.","And set up a challenge.","Scenes from the illusion flashed before Shen Jian’s eyes.","So real!","To the point where tears welled up at the corners of his eyes.","“Master!”","This time, Shen Jian knelt before Jian Wushuang.","“Shen Jian, remember, the sword must point to the heart!” Jian Wushuang praised, lightly tapping his chest with a fist, “This time, you did very well!”","Ji Tang didn’t know what had happened and was about to speak when Shen Jian pulled her into his arms, holding her for a long time without letting go.","As for Yan Shuang, he stood there with vacant eyes from beginning to end.","Only Jian Wushuang cared about his fate, and was now refining a reincarnated body for him!","Though he had served as a whetstone for others, Jian Wushuang did not treat him poorly.","Reincarnated into a prominent family in the original universe, he would achieve great things in the future.","However, Jian Wushuang had erased his memories.","These memories were a dark history for Jian Wushuang, and naturally had to be erased.","“I’ll give you the time of an incense stick to prepare. When you go out, there will be a big battle waiting for you!” Jian Wushuang reminded them, then left the back mountain with Lu Hua.","He returned to the wooden house to wait for their farewell.","As long as they could make it into the top thousand, this cave world would be theirs.","They could come and go as they pleased.","“Since there’s nothing more for me here, I’ll take my leave and watch this trial from the outside!” Lu Hua stood up to say goodbye.","Jian Wushuang asked, “Not going to say goodbye?”","“We’ll have plenty of opportunities to meet again in the future. For you and me, passing time is the easiest thing!”","With a sense of having seen through everything in the world, Lu Hua’s avatar dissipated and returned to his true self.","Killing time.","For Jian Wushuang, it was not a simple matter.","When he saw Shen Jian, he felt a desire to retreat into meditation.","Once everything was done, it would be time to seclude himself and break through to the Eight Tribulations Realm.","Moreover, there was still one thing he hadn’t done.","That was the Beast God Weapon.","One more piece was needed to complete it.","Originally, he had planned to collect the Beast God Weapon completely before heading to the Realm King Continent.","But he didn’t know where the last piece was.","Even asking the Realm King, the other couldn’t locate it.","This indicated it wasn’t in the Northern Space.","Or it had entered the abyss at the end.","If it had truly entered the abyss, it would be impossible to find.","There was also a very small chance it had entered the Realm King Continent.","It all depended on his luck.","The time of an incense stick quickly passed.","Shen Jian and Ji Tang arrived on time.","“Keep these two tokens well, they contain everything you need to know!” He casually tossed out two tokens.","They were trial tokens refined by Zhen Ling.","The tokens contained information about the trial and an introduction to Qishen Temple.","Of course, he also added a lot of information.","It was about Ji Tang’s identity.","“Remember, don’t push yourself!” Jian Wushuang reminded one last time.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian both nodded.","However, their eyes showed many more colors.","It was a longing for the great world.","This feeling was the most familiar to Jian Wushuang.","Every time he encountered something new, it always felt this way.","If he had known the Realm King and couldn’t leave the Northern Spacetime, he probably would have looked the same after getting the Realm King Token.","What he lacked now was this.","Motivation!","The motivation to go to another world.","With a swish!","After taking a deep look, he tore the space, wrapped the two of them in his mind power, and disappeared from this cave world.","They went to a larger and more mysterious world for Shen Jian and Ji Tang.","There was also a place that made Ji Tang sad.","In her token, Jian Wushuang detailed how her mother died.","This was the motivation he gave her.","When they reappeared, Jian Wushuang had already disappeared, and Shen Jian and Ji Tang found themselves on a plaza.","Apart from Jian Wushuang and Zhen Ling, no one knew their identities.","Swish!","Consciousness returned to his true self, and Jian Wushuang turned to nod at Zhen Ling.","It could begin.","If it hadn’t been for his delay, the trial would have started long ago.","Zhen Ling took a deep breath and shouted loudly, “The trial now officially begins. Transmission will start after three breaths!”","Not only did the geniuses in the plaza hear Zhen Ling’s voice, but so did the outside Yan Immortals who had been plundered.","The one billion Yan Immortals who received the tokens already understood what they would face next.","No one was afraid.","There was only fighting spirit.","Whether they were the geniuses of sects and families or the elites who had been plundered, they were not afraid of battle.","“Transmit!” Zhen Ling moved his Thought power.","One billion Yan Immortals were instantly transported to a canyon in the trial world.","Swish swish swish!!!!!","The one billion Yan Immortals were gathered together.","After being stunned for a moment, the shouts of killing shook the entire canyon.","Many people on the viewing platform cursed Zhen Ling for being too sinister.","In this way, many gifted Yan Immortals might be besieged.","This was unfair.","Especially those family geniuses, each with treasures shining brightly, were obviously targets for besieging.","Many of the geniuses among the Yan Immortals fell in the contact battle.","Most of them were the family geniuses.","They were directly besieged by tens of thousands of Yan Immortals, and even their supreme treasures were shattered.","If they hadn’t shouted out surrender and been rescued by the Emperor, they would definitely have fallen.","After surrendering, their tokens also fell.","Seeing the tokens, the battle continued.","From the initial contact battle to the later battles for tokens, it never stopped.","Some lucky ones at the edge of the canyon took the opportunity to slip away.","Among them were Shen Jian and Ji Tang.","Although they had fighting spirit soaring to the sky, being besieged was not a good feeling.","And they were too lazy to collect tokens.","It would be better to wait until others had collected enough, then go out and fight those super geniuses.","Have a good fight.","The battle in the canyon lasted for several months before gradually calming down.","There were fewer and fewer people.","Everyone knew that fighting in the canyon did not allow them to fully exert their advantages.","But there were also those who could kill all around.","For example, the super genius of the Wan family.","One person fighting against ten thousand Yan Immortals.","Just one person defeated hundreds of thousands of Yan Immortals.","Currently ranked first.","This made the head of the Wan family extremely proud.","He felt that nurturing this junior was not in vain.","The displayed combat power indeed made many Universe Masters reveal amazed expressions.","With such combat power and talent, even without this trial, he could have become a disciple of a Universe Master."]},{"number":6114,"title":"Chapter 6114: Snatching","paragraphs":["Chapter 6114: Snatching","However, because of this trial, more prodigies would rise. There would also be many such super prodigies.","The first three years of the trial were the most intense.","However, the viewing pleasure was relatively low.","It seemed intense, yet it was also quite inferior.","There was nothing particularly eye-catching.","Jian Wushuang spread his thoughts but already had a goal in mind.","He also had people he favored.","Besides Shen Jian and Ji Tang, there were a few young ones who used swords, all with very good talent.","They were much stronger than he had been during his time in the Yan Immortal stage. Some even had cultivated the Ultimate Path to the Great Achievement stage, comparable to ordinary Dao Masters.","Among the top group, Jian Wushuang only had his eyes on one person.","A young girl who had mastered the Moon Sword.","She had already defeated millions of Yan Immortals.","Securing a spot in the top thousand was a certainty.","Though on average, one only needed to collect a million tokens to enter the top thousand.","But among these Yan Immortals, even the weakest were elites in the outside world, many being prodigies in their respective realms or universes. How could they stop just because they had enough tokens?","Moreover, before entering the trial, the ancestors of their families or the elders of their sects had given clear instructions.","Collecting tokens was only the first step.","The most crucial part was to be impressive.","To make those bigwigs on the viewing platform remember them.","That was considered a success.","“Tsk tsk, Wan Shan, who is currently ranked first, has already collected ten million tokens. Now, among the tens of thousands of surviving trial participants in this cave heaven, the number is nearing a thousand. Do you think he can collect over a hundred million tokens in the end?”","Zhen Ling, seeing that everyone was a bit bored, started talking about the strongest participant in this trial.","In the eyes of Jian Wushuang and others, Wan Shan’s performance was not particularly impressive, because Wan Shan had already cultivated his Ultimate Dao to the Great Achievement stage.","Although he was a Yan Immortal, his Dao was very close to that of a Dao Master.","At such a level, dealing with those trial participants who had just mastered the Ultimate Path was like crushing them.","Collecting over a hundred million tokens would not be difficult for Wan Shan!","The difficult part was how to hunt down those trial participants who were running away. “His strength is indeed good. As long as he has enough time, he can collect over a hundred million tokens. However, his Dao is somewhat special. It is said to be the Ultimate Path, but it lacks that kind of cohesion. Instead, it’s very similar to Wanxing back then. All paths are open, and it’s steadier than Wanxing back then. He takes one step at a time, moves fast, and walks steadily!”","Wu Zuo commented indifferently. Although Wan Shan’s strength was good, he was not suitable for him.","In their eyes, being fast and steady was only the foundation.","What they truly sought was a pure heart.","For instance, that Ji Ye of the Ji family, whose strength could only rank in the top twenty among the trial participants.","But her Dao Heart was extremely complete. Even as a Yan Immortal, she could maintain her original intention, unaffected by the outside world.","Many people cast admiring glances at this prodigy of the Ji family.","Jian Wushuang did the same, but unfortunately, her sword was not the same as his Dao.","If he had to choose, it would still depend on the pursuit of Dao.","Otherwise, taking her under his wing would be a waste of her talent.","“Brother Wu Zuo, speaking of which, this Wan Shan is quite suitable to be under my tutelage!” Shang smiled upon hearing this. His cultivation was also steady and firm.","He was once the first Ultimate Emperor of the Primordial Universe and the first Tribulation Realm and Universe Master of the entire lower spacetime.","He walked fast, and he walked steadily.","That described him.","Although now surpassed by Jian Wushuang and others.","But over the years, his strength had gradually approached that of Wu Zuo and others.","The distance to the Eighth Tribulation was not far.","He had never stopped.","This also made Wu Zuo and others feel some tension.","Those who went to the upper level spacetimes had all received the inheritance or bestowed opportunities from the Realm Kings, far beyond what Shang could compare with. Yet now, Shang was gradually catching up.","It was like fulfilling Wu Zuo’s words back then.","Those who went to the upper spacetime were not as good as Shang, who was guarding Qishen Temple. Saying it out loud would be shameful.","Now, Shang was the first to actively extend an olive branch to the trial participants.","Everyone else no longer held back.","They all revealed their favored candidates.","Although it was not yet time to choose, they were already arguing heatedly.","All fighting for people.","Even Hu Qing, who was usually honest and mild-tempered, was flushed and arguing","intensely.","Because this time, he also had a favored candidate.","It was a Golden Body Arhat from the Tongtian Buddhist Realm.","Although the current Tongtian Buddhist Realm no longer had the Tongtian Buddha.","But the Wuliang Buddha of the past had become the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation","realm.","He was now the First Buddha Lord of the Tongtian Buddhist Realm.","Hu Qing followed the Heavenly Dao and only retained his Buddha body.","Tongtian Buddha transformed into the Wutian Demon Lord.","In the end, it was still the Wuliang Buddha who won.","He won the Tongtian Buddhist Realm and also won over the Tongtian Buddha.","“This Arhat is not following the Heavenly Dao, and his temper is not that great. He keeps","talking about the World Honored Ksitigarbha. He’s not on the same path as you. Why not let","me have him!”","The one competing with Hu Qing was Wutian.","He believed that the Golden Body Arhat had a demonic seed in his heart.","More suitable for falling into the Nether Hell.","Hu Qing took a deep breath and stood firm, resolutely saying, “He will choose me. The demon","can be removed.”","This remark left Wutian speechless.","In reality, at their level, there was no longer a distinction between good and evil.","Everyone argued for a long time.","They couldn’t come to a conclusion, and in the end, it still depended on how those trial","participants would choose.","So, they stopped arguing and began to ponder how to tackle the problem effectively. “Hmm?” Wu Zuo turned his head to glance at Jian Wushuang, noticing that Jian Wushuang hadn’t spoken a word from beginning to end. Curious, he asked, “Brother Wushuang, could it be that none of them caught your eye?”","Wu Zuo’s words drew the attention of the others, and they all looked at Jian Wushuang.","It was only then that they realized Jian Wushuang hadn’t spoken at all. “The ones I’m interested in might not appeal to you. The only one that caught my eye, Xie Yue, has already been reserved by you!” Jian Wushuang said with a wry smile.","In his heart, he actually admired many of them, seeing that each of those Yan Immortals was","stronger than he was in the past.","He suddenly felt that times had changed.","It was just like the Yan Immortal from the upstream spacetimes.","When he went there initially, he was also taken aback, and in the blink of an eye, the downstream spacetimes had caught up to the upstream spacetime in the level of Yan","Immortal.","Next, they would cultivate even more powerful Dao Lords, catching up to the upstream","spacetimes.","Even the Emperors would catch up to the pace of the upstream spacetimes.","This was what he needed to do.","So, he didn’t have too high expectations for his disciples.","Even if he lost, going to fetch treasures wouldn’t be a big deal.","It would just be a good deed, leaving something behind for Qishen Temple.","When he went to the Realm King Continent, who knew when he would return?","They still didn’t know about the matter with Zamasu.","The greater pressure lay ahead!","Just like those trial participants.","The current trial was just the beginning.","The bigger tests were yet to come.","Everyone felt that there was something off about him today, but they couldn’t understand","why.","In the trial world, the battles continued.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian’s performances were not particularly outstanding."]},{"number":6115,"title":"Chapter 6115: A Lonely Old Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 6115: A Lonely Old Man","Despite Lu Hua’s guidance, compared to the prodigies from the Universe Master families, they had already lost a lot at the starting stage.","Now, neither of their rankings had entered the top 10,000.","But there was one crucial point.","That was their speed of growth in battle was much faster.","Emerging from a small world, they quickly caught up with the steps of those prodigies.","In fact, in terms of combat talent, they even surpassed their counterparts.","This was what deserved attention.","It was just a pity that Wu Zuo and the others could not see these small details.","There was no clear standard for the trial time.","A hundred years passed in the blink of an eye.","Tens of thousands of Yan Immortals were reduced by a hundredfold.","Now, only a few thousand remained.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian were still there.","They were still among the unnoticed few.","However, even the unnoticed ones, with only a few thousand left, had caught the attention of some Universe Masters.","“Ji Tang?”","Especially the head of the Ji family, who only then noticed that Ji Tang had the blood of the Ji family in him.","But compared to Ji Ye and Ji Hao, he was still lacking quite a bit.","However, being able to persist until now, he undoubtedly had talents beyond the ordinary.","Even if he could not enter the top thousand this time, he would take Ji Tang back to the family and train him diligently.","He just inquired around, and all the branches of the family didn’t know about this person.","“He is not from the branches or the main family. He should be a bloodline wandering outside!” The head of the Ji family sighed, “The bloodline wandering outside has such talent. Heaven has not been unkind to my Ji family!”","He immediately ordered the family to search for those wandering bloodlines.","There might be some with extraordinary talent. They should be brought back to the family as soon as possible.","It would be a pity outside.","The Ji family!","From the early period of the Primordial Universe, it had been a superpower.","The early hegemon of the Primordial Universe.","Until now, it remained a superpower.","Flourishing without decline.","It was because of the emergence of super experts stationed there.","From the first ancestor, the tier 4 Emperor, to the later Ji Chaoyang, who elevated the family’s foundation to a new height.","It was a pity that the latter fell, or the Ji family would be even stronger now.","Even now, with Ji Shuang, a peak Sixth Tribulation expert stationed, it ranked in the top ten families in the entire downstream spacetimes.","Moreover, the Ji family had intricate ties with Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, the two Divine Lords.","They had people and influence.","Their foundation was strong.","Naturally, it remained unbroken through the ages.","Among the Ten Great Divine Masters,","Few families had such bonds, only Dongsheng and Wanyan had family ties.","The others, at most, cultivated some forces.","Jian Wushuang had no choice. The place where he was born had already disappeared.","He became a lonely old man.","This time, he took in a few disciples to leave his path behind.","As for the bloodline, he had long stopped thinking about it.","Perhaps he would meet the right person in the future...","Maybe he wouldn’t meet anyone.","On the side of the trialists, only the last few thousand remained.","Everyone on the observation platform had their suitable candidates.","Those who had only recently exploded would be very few; almost no one was hiding their strength anymore.","Now was the best opportunity to break into the 10,000.","“Zhen Ling, can you narrow down the trial area a bit? I’m almost falling asleep!” Wu Zuo","yawned.","They had been watching continuously for over a hundred years.","No matter how patient they were, they couldn’t withstand this kind of torture.","It was like adults watching children play house. At first, it seemed fresh and new, but eventually, they grew weary of it.","Having already chosen their candidates in their minds, they naturally wanted to end it","quickly.","Hearing this, Zhen Ling scratched his head. Narrowing the range was actually quite simple,","but unfortunately, he hadn’t prepared for it.","“Let me do it!” Jian Wushuang raised his hand and pointed.","A barrier descended.","And it began to shrink continuously.","It started contracting from the edge of the world.","Seeing this, Zhen Ling immediately conveyed a message to the tokens of those undergoing","the trial.","The barrier would continue to shrink until only the last thousand remained.","This was the final countdown.","Judging by the speed of the barrier’s contraction, it would take at most a month.","This left those trial participants hoping to take advantage of the situation in despair.","Facing great temptation, there were still those who chose shortcuts.","Many of the trial participants were not very powerful, yet they found a place to hide right","from the start.","They managed to sneak into the top ten thousand by hiding well.","Calling them despicable wasn’t quite fitting.","Being able to remain hidden without being discovered was also a skill.","But when it came to real combat strength, they were very weak.","Even those Universe Masters looked down on them, let alone Jian Wushuang and the others.","Trying to rely on trickery was not going to get them selected.","The trial participants understood this, but before entering the trial, their families had told","them that even if they didn’t get selected, making it into the top 1,000 would still mean being","taken as a disciple by a Universe Master.","So, they all wanted to try their luck.","But as the barrier continued to shrink, it shattered all their hopes.","Swoosh!","A trial participant, who had no choice but to reveal himself, was struck and had his body","shattered by a single sword as soon as he showed his head.","His primordial spirit admitted defeat to save his life.","He was then casually taken away by an Emperor.","However, only a few dozen tokens were left behind.","The trial participants who made the strike didn’t even bother to pick them up and left grandly.","Scenes like this were playing out all over the trial world.","The month passed quickly.","The barrier shrank to a range of 10,000 miles.","In this range, Yan Immortals’ Thought power could cover it all.","There was no place left to hide.","The number of people had also reduced by more than half.","Now, there were only over a thousand left.","It would only take half a day to reduce the number to a thousand.","This was also an opportunity for those trial participants who were ranked lower.","If they could defeat a trial participant ranked in the top 1,000, they could replace them.","Such an environment drove many trial participants into a frenzy.","Some trial participants, originally in the top 1,000, were besieged by two lagging participants","and ultimately defeated.","They refused to admit defeat even in death.","Falling was no longer possible. The Emperors had long received a transmission from Zhen","Ling.","Some trial participants, who were sure to lose, would be taken away preemptively.","No talent would be lost due to the trial.","Zhen Ling also announced that even if they didn’t make it into the top 1,000, they could still","enter Grave God Mountain and become Inheritors of Qishen Temple.","Becoming an inheritor of Qishen Temple was a dream for practitioners in the lower","downstream spacetime.","The current top Universe Masters were all Inheritors of Grave God Mountain.","From the first generation to the third generation disciples now, every era produced a large","number of super strong practitioners.","Once someone became an Inheritor, their family or their faction would rise with them.","Inheritors were also united.","Becoming an inheritor meant one foot was already in the high ranks of the lower downstream spacetime.","As long as one became a Universe Master, they could anchor their universe in the sea of the","universe.","It was an infinite honor.","In the lower downstream spacetimes, apart from the Universe Masters born among inheritors, there were also some who became Universe Masters through their own efforts."]},{"number":6116,"title":"Chapter 6116: The Ji Family’s Glory","paragraphs":["Chapter 6116: The Ji Family’s Glory","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After all, resources were limited and could only be used to cultivate elites.","It was impossible to include everyone.","Therefore, they had to compete for opportunities and rankings.","The top two thousand trial participants were guaranteed to become Inheritors of Qishen Temple.","The top ten thousand trial participants would also enter the Four Great Halls.","Each of them had a bright future.","This was the goal they were competing for.","However, the remaining trial participants were no longer satisfied with just being Inheritors.","They wanted to become the direct disciples of the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","To cultivate the strongest path.","In the trial world, within a range of thousands of miles, the sound of battle cries arose.","The number of participants continuously decreased.","But there were also trial participants who began to rise at this time.","For example, Shen Jian and Ji Tang.","At this time, the combat power they displayed could already place them in the top one hundred.","This made Jian Wushuang very pleased.","It proved that their progress had not halted despite the decreasing number of participants.","Following this trend, it wouldn’t be long before they surpassed the people ahead of them.","Of course, the one ranked first, Wan Shan, was indeed too terrifying.","His realm far exceeded that of many trial participants.","Anyone who faced him couldn’t withstand a single punch from him.","This terrifying combat power made no one dare to approach him.","Fortunately, Wan shan had collected one billion tokens and was too lazy to bully those trial participants.","As the last person was eliminated.","The top one thousand trial participants officially emerged.","Buzz!","After a long, resonant bell sounded.","The surrounding barriers instantly disappeared.","The one thousand trial participants were also teleported to the center of the square.","Next, there would be arena battles.","This would be faster.","Moreover, in the trial world, most had already faced each other.","The final rankings wouldn’t change much.","After a day of arena battles.","The final rankings were as expected.","The only highlights were Ji Tang and Shen Jian.","Both of them had made continuous breakthroughs.","Now, Shen Jian was ranked nineteenth, and Ji Tang was ranked twentieth.","Shen Jian was still unknown.","However, Ji Tang’s performance shocked the Ji family head.","Even Ji Shuang personally sent a transmission to inquire.","“Brother Ji, congratulations this time. Among the top twenty, there are three from your Ji family. Remarkable!”","Many people offered their congratulations.","The Ji family head was also all smiles; this time, he indeed gained much face.","But when he transmitted to Ji Tang, she completely ignored him.","This made the Ji family head very embarrassed.","Fortunately, it was a transmission.","If he had spoken aloud and been ignored, it would have been even more humiliating.","“What’s going on?” The Ji family head took a deep breath, somewhat puzzled, and turned to the emperor of the Ji family dynasty beside him, asking in surprise, “Her bloodline is most similar to yours. Quickly think of when she was left behind!”","Entering the top 20 meant they would surely become the direct disciples of the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Their future achievements would be boundless and could not be taken lightly.","If they didn’t return to the Ji family and instead resented them, it would be a great loss.","“Family head, you know me. With so many descendants, how could I remember when she was left behind!”","The Ji family head frowned, “What a blunder!”","He immediately instructed Ji Ye to go and converse with Ji Tang, attempting to win him over.","Once someone became the personal disciple of those super-strong experts, trying to win them over would be too deliberate.","This was the only time to form some ties.","There would be no such opportunity in the future.","Besides these family recognitions, some powerful Universe Masters also took the initiative to extend olive branches.","Among the over a thousand people, not everyone could be selected.","Additionally, apart from these thousand seed players, there were also some who had been eliminated but were not weak in strength.","They all had quite good talents.","These were all talents.","Moreover, they were the super-strong experts of the next era.","As long as they survived, it wouldn’t be difficult for them to become Universe Masters.","Many people went ahead and offered their tokens.","If they were not selected as disciples, they could join their sects after entering the Grave God Mountain.","This was considered a very good fallback.","Some who lacked confidence naturally accepted these tokens.","But more people still hoped to be accepted as personal disciples by the super-strong experts.","On the viewing platform, Zhen Ling rubbed his hands and, after glancing at the crowd, said, “Let’s start. I see you’re all anxious. Let’s begin from the back, a hundred people each time!”","Starting from the end.","A hundred trial participants successively stepped onto the viewing platform.","In the square, they could mostly see the Universe Masters below the viewing platform.","Once on the viewing platform, they witnessed the strongest batch of beings in the downstream spacetimes. Even though they were the pride of the heavens, their breathing still quickened, and their expressions were nervous.","“Little guys, don’t be afraid. This time, you’re choosing your master. But let me be clear first, you can choose first. If they don’t agree, you’ll have to be chosen. If the one you choose doesn’t agree and you aren’t selected during the choosing, don’t hold any grudges. I will personally take you into the Grave God Mountain to become the fourth-generation Inheritors!”","The fourth generation!","This was also the beginning of the next spacetime.","They were considered the first batch, and the benefits naturally needed no further explanation.","“Alright, let’s start!” Zhen Ling waved his big hand and stopped speaking.","Not speaking was better. Speaking only made these trial participants more nervous.","Letting them choose first, in case they chose someone who didn’t want them, it would be awkward to enter another great power’s sect during the choosing.","So many trial participants were looking at Jian Wushuang and the others, not daring to speak lightly.","Wu Zuo was the most cunning, winking at the disciples he wanted, showing a stance of “I’ll accept you if you come.”","For a while, many trial participants wanted to apprentice under Wu Zuo.","Because in this way, they wouldn’t offend anyone.","“Wu Zuo, you really have no shame!” Wu Tian frowned. If he were still Tongtian Buddha, he could put down his face, but after becoming the Demon Lord, his face became thinner than before.","However, he still learned from Wu Zuo, winking at those trial participants.","Among the hundred trial participants at the end, only a dozen or so were truly favored.","Jian Wushuang didn’t favor any of them.","The path he left this time was actually for three people.","These three were all in the top hundred.","His pressure was greater.","Among the hundred trial participants, some were quite proactive.","The proactive ones were all geniuses from great families and sects. After entering the top thousand, the ancestors of the sects or families had made clear the backgrounds of the eighteen super-strong experts to them.","The first choice was Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing, these super-strong experts who had learned from the upstream time-space.","Then it was Shang and Luo.","The rest was up to personal willingness.","Among the Seventh Tribulation realm, the gap in combat power and path was significant.","Naturally, they wanted to apprentice under the strongest one.","Therefore, many trial participants appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","“Jiang Chen, you cultivate the Thunder Dao and have mastered the ultimate lightning snake. You came to apprentice under me, but you found the wrong person. I’ll point you to a way out!” Jian Wushuang directly sent them away and gave suggestions one by one, asking them to switch to another person.","Very quickly, he sent them all away."]},{"number":6117,"title":"Chapter 6117: Three Disciples","paragraphs":["Chapter 6117: Three Disciples","Several promising candidates had come to seek him as their master. The selection phase for the trial participants passed quickly.","Then it was their turn to choose.","Only Wu Zuo chose two candidates, while the others remained silent.","It was evident they were not impressed.","In the end, out of the last hundred trial participants, twenty-two were selected.","Mainly because Wu Zuo alone accepted five candidates.","Three came to seek him as their master, and he chose two more himself.","One could say he did not refuse anyone.","He had the demeanor of a teacher who did not discriminate.","“Alright, those who were not selected, you can wait in the square, and later someone will take you to the Grave God Mountain!”","As for those who were selected, they naturally stood obediently by their master’s side, barely able to contain their excitement.","The first batch of selections ended.","The second batch soon followed.","This time, Jian Wushuang remained indifferent, offering kind words to those who were to be selected.","He politely yielded to others.","Wu Zuo, on the other hand, did not refuse anyone; he accepted anyone he chose.","The others were much more stringent.","A disciple is also one’s heir.","Naturally, they had to be careful.","A new batch came up.","Only he and Hu Qing had not selected anyone.","Hu Qing favored a few who were at the top of the list.","They were all waiting for the last batch, those in the top hundred trial participants.","“This is the last batch. If you two don’t choose now, it will be considered an automatic forfeit!” Zhen Ling looked at him and Hu Qing, saying calmly, “Don’t be too picky, accept those who catch your eye. There may not be much time left!”","Knowing what the other meant, Jian Wushuang silently nodded.","He waited for the last batch to come on stage, then his expression relaxed.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian had just stepped onto the observation platform when they saw Jian Wushuang.","This was their first time seeing Jian Wushuang in person.","The restrained sword intent emanating from him made the two yearn for more.","During the selection phase for masters, the two did not hesitate and went straight to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Shen Jian, willing to be your disciple, Senior!”","“Ji Tang, willing to be your disciple, Senior!”","This was the last batch.","Many people were watching!","Especially the Universe Masters below.","When the head of the Ji family saw Ji Tang seeking Jian Wushuang as a master, he clenched his fists.","Although he had sent Ji Ye to build a relationship, he hadn’t been able to learn about his background or show him any kindness.","This was not a problem.","As long as Ji family blood flowed through him.","It would add to the Ji family’s prestige.","After all, everyone knew Ji Tang was from the Ji family, and that was enough.","And now, proactively seeking Jian Wushuang as a master, and also using a sword.","This made the head of the Ji family very excited, hoping to enter Jian Wushuang’s tutelage.","The Ji family already had ties with Jian Wushuang and Hui Qing, and if he entered Jian Wushuang’s tutelage, it would strengthen these ties.","In a short time.","Several more trial participants appeared before Jian Wushuang.","Even Wanshan, who ranked first, sought to be his disciple.","“Ji Tang, Shen Jian, you two stay behind!”","These two were originally nurtured by him, so naturally, they stayed.","Even Ji Tang and Shen Jian found it normal.","The head of the Ji family also stood up excitedly.","In this trial, his Ji family had gained the most.","Although Ji Ye, who was highly anticipated, had not become Jian Wushuang’s disciple.","But it didn’t matter anymore, having one person enter Jian Wushuang’s tutelage was enough. “Why not me?” Ji Ye couldn’t accept it. She ranked ninth and was also from the Ji family like Ji Tang.","Wan Shan was also somewhat disappointed upon hearing this result.","But he wasn’t the type to dwell on it. He quickly regained his composure and returned to his original position, waiting to be chosen by other strong individuals.","Jian Wushuang called Shen Jian and Ji Tang to his side, smiling, “From now on, you will train with me. If there’s anything you can’t let go of, you can tell me.”","These words were directed at Ji Tang.","Shen Jian came from his cave world and had nothing to hold onto; the entire cave world could","be entrusted to the other party.","However, Ji Tang had many things he couldn’t let go of.","It was because of the Ji family.","But it wasn’t appropriate for him to intervene directly; Ji Tang would have to face it alone in","the future.","Shen Jian, upon hearing his words, shook his head in confusion.","Ji Tang hesitated for a moment and then slowly shook his head as well.","A stubborn temper.","Jian Wushuang merely smiled lightly and didn’t speak further.","Besides the two he accepted, most of the others were not refused.","They were all accepted.","After all, they were the top hundred trial participants, and there was no reason to refuse.","Even Hu Qing accepted four people in one go.","Among them was the golden-bodied Arhat.","This made Wutian still hold a grudge.","There was also a swordsman among the trial participants who ranked in the top three.","Actually, only slightly weaker than Wan Shan.","That icy girl who practiced the Moon Shadow Sword.","But she went to Luo’s side.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t do anything about it.","Sword practitioner Xie Yue, mastering the Ultimate Dao.","Moreover, she had cultivated to an extremely profound realm.","If she were under his tutelage, she could potentially achieve great mastery in the future.","It was a pity.","Jian Wushuang sighed lightly.","Having only two disciples felt somewhat inadequate.","He still had some doubts about his teaching ability.","But his judgment in selecting people was still sharp.","He had to choose another one.","But for sword practitioners, it was either choosing him or choosing Luo.","Luo didn’t refuse and accepted all.","The sword practitioners he rejected were indeed not suitable, either in skill or temperament.","“Wan Shan!” He took a deep breath, and another thought emerged in his mind.","His super ancient transformation was the ultimate secret technique of divine power.","It was time to find someone to pass it on to.","But this time, he was focused on the way of the sword.","Divine power didn’t count as a path, more like a culmination of various skills.","Wan Shan had this potential.","“It seems I need to prepare a Super Eternal Ancient Transformation technique!” He smiled lightly in his heart, thinking about having just rejected Wan Shan and now choosing him","again.","There were competitors, after all.","Now, it was their turn to select people.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about face anymore; even though he had just rejected Wan Shan, he","was the first to stand up and said, “Wan Shan, would you be willing to join my tutelage?”","“Huh?”","This sentence stunned everyone.","He had just refused Wan Shan, and now he was actively recruiting him.","“Wushuang, this is too much; are you playing with us?”","“Yes, didn’t we agree that Wan Shan would be mine?” Shang was also a bit annoyed, trying to","argue for Wan Shan, as his cultivation steps suited him very well.","Wu Zuo snorted coldly and scolded, “When was it agreed that he would be yours? I said they","were all my disciples!”","“Then I won’t hide it from you all; my divine power secret technique also needs an inheritor.","If you think your divine power can surpass mine, go ahead and try!” Jian Wushuang finished speaking and sat back down.","Behind him, Ji Tang and Shen Jian exchanged glances. Hearing about Jian Wushuang’s divine","power secret technique, they didn’t quite understand.","But the others did!","Not only Wu Zuo and the others knew, but many Universe Masters below also knew.","Back when he fought Mie Sheng..."]},{"number":6118,"title":"Chapter 6118: His Teaching","paragraphs":["Chapter 6118: His Teaching","Jian Wushuang’s Super Eternal Ancient Transformation astonished everyone.","Unmatched power!","The head of the Wan family, upon hearing about the secret divine power technique, immediately thought of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and hastily transmitted a message to Wan Shan, “Don’t hesitate, joining the First Divine Lord’s faction is the best","choice you’ll make in your life!”","Wan Shan took a deep breath, his previous disappointment instantly vanished.","“I am willing!” He had already chosen Jian Wushuang.","Even if the family head hadn’t said anything, he would have agreed.","Because he participated in the trial to become Jian Wushuang’s disciple.","To become the strongest by apprenticing under the strongest.","Jian Wushuang saw Wan Shan agree and also breathed a sigh of relief, beckoning him, “You shall be my last disciple!”","Shen Jian was his first disciple in Qishen Temple!","Then there was Ji Tang.","Finally, Wan Shan.","“Yes, Master!” Wan Shan, filled with excitement and the joy of surviving a great tribulation, respectfully stood behind Jian Wushuang.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian also smiled.","After all, Jian Wushuang had declared Wan Shan his last disciple.","From now on, the three of them would be the closest individuals.","They would train together for a long time.","Naturally, they needed to become close.","Wan Shan was very polite to his future senior brother and sister.","They began chatting with each other.","After accepting his last disciple, Jian Wushuang no longer paid attention to the others. He waited for the end of this conference.","In the Origin Source, his avatar was improving his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","When he first performed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his power had already reached 700,000 divine power.","Although he was an Emperor at that time, the myth he created as an Emperor was something few in later generations could surpass.","It was hard enough to surpass his record as a Dao Lord.","Let alone during his time as an Emperor.","So, improvements were necessary.","Otherwise, Wan Shan wouldn’t be able to achieve it.","“Let’s start with the Ancient Transformation!”","That was the ultimate technique he obtained from the Three King Courts.","However, it also needed some improvement.","Ancient Transformation, Myriad Transformation, Eternal Transformation.","The Eternal Transformation required at least 200,000 divine power to perform.","The Myriad Transformation was much simpler, requiring only 50,000 divine power.","When he was a Dao Lord, having 50,000 divine power was considered the limit for cultivators.","Wan Shan could achieve this; it wasn’t too difficult.","The Ancient Transformation required even less, achievable with just 10,000 divine power.","Mastering the Ancient Transformation made one nearly invincible during the Dao Master period.","But this still didn’t meet Jian Wushuang’s standards.","Dao Masters performed the Myriad Transformation.","Emperors performed the Eternal Transformation.","Universe Masters performed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Divine power techniques and secret methods were the simplest, yet the hardest.","The difficulty lay in combat techniques.","Increasing divine power wasn’t hard; Jian Wushuang could provide treasures to Wan Shan.","But divine power couldn’t just be accumulated for free.","To defeat an opponent with double his divine power, Wan Shan needed to enhance his power again.","This cycle of accumulation would slowly produce a super strong individual.","After setting Wan Shan’s training plan, the external trial conference was also nearing its end.","All the top 100 trial participants were selected.","None were left out.","Among the top 1,000 trial participants, over 400 were chosen.","On average, each person had over ten candidates.","However, Jian Wushuang and Hui Qing had the fewest.","One had three, the other had four.","Wu Zuo had the most, selecting a hundred disciples by himself.","This made the trial participants who chose Wu Zuo begin to doubt their life choices.","With so many people, the competition was fierce!","Moreover, Wu Zuo only had a few tricks, his peak secret techniques were all learned from the Realm King.","He was competent during the Emperor period, but it was tough to cultivate super strong individuals as a Universe Master.","But from Dao Master to Emperor, everyone was the same; they were adept at nurturing.","So, no one could be careless.","“The trial is over, so I will now announce the post-trial matters!”","Zhen Ling cleared his throat and began to speak, “Young ones, you may not know this, but the trial to become an apprentice is only the beginning. The road ahead is long and fraught with challenges. For you, the first hurdle will come after one epoch. By then, most of you will have become Dao Lords. At that time, there will be a Dao Conference held by Qishen Temple, where competitions will take place. You will represent your respective masters in these competitions. Losing won’t result in any punishment for you, but it won’t bode well for your","masters.”","“Ahem!” Wu Zuo felt that speaking this way would hurt their pride and put too much pressure","on the disciples, so he added vaguely, “Let’s not talk about punishment; let’s talk about honor. In the future, you will be the face of Qishen Temple and the super talents of the downstream spacetime. Naturally, you must uphold the honor of Qishen Temple and aim to become strong. Do not slack off!”","The selected disciples, feeling excited, shouted in unison, “Yes!”","Not only were they motivated by Wu Zuo’s words, but also by the teachings of their elders.","The chosen disciples were all prodigies from various major families.","Many family elders felt immense pride seeing their descendants become the disciples of","legendary figures.","“Remember, the end of this path is to become the strongest!”","“Work hard and follow the way of the master!”","“Do not disappoint your family!”","Voices of encouragement came from all directions.","These voices came from their families.","Wu Zuo’s voice represented Qishen Temple and an even larger realm.","For these young ones, Qishen Temple was already vast.","Yet, they also yearned for an even bigger world.","“Since there is nothing else, I shall take my leave first!” Wutian waved his hand and left with","his new disciples.","Wu Zuo was about to say something more, but seeing everyone eager to leave, he decided not","to say anything further and left with his own disciples.","“See you in one epoch!” Jian Wushuang glanced at the crowd and then tore through space,","leaving with his three disciples.","To be honest, he didn’t have a specific place to go.","Wu Zuo had his own force, the Dao Palace.","Shang and Luo were even more well-established.","Wutian also had his own forces.","Dongsheng and Wanyan had their own families and vast territories.","Hu Qing... Hu Qing could return to the Tongtian Buddha Realm.","“It seems I am the only one without a place to stay!”","After leaving Qishen Temple with his three disciples, he glanced at the Original Universe.","Although the Origin Source power here was the densest, it was also crowded with cultivators.","It was not suitable for cultivation.","“Forget it, I’ll go to my own universe!”","He carried his universe with him, and in the Origin Source Starry Sky, its power was 10,000","times more concentrated than outside.","It was far more powerful than any secret realm of Qishen Temple.","With this thought, he used his mind to send the three disciples directly to the Tianqing","Mountain of his Origin Source Universe.","Few, if any, had entered his Origin Source Universe for cultivation.","Only Weiss had once lived in his Origin Source Universe for a while.","Although some things had been moved away, the general outline remained.","He casually arranged a few things.","He created some caves and training grounds, along with some auxiliary cultivation treasures","suitable for Dao Lords and Emperors.","These were all personally refined by him, unique in the world.","The three disciples, upon entering the Origin Source Starry Sky, were extremely surprised by","the dreamlike place before them!"]},{"number":6119,"title":"Chapter 6119: Jian Wushuang’s Harshness","paragraphs":["Chapter 6119: Jian Wushuang’s Harshness","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Especially when they saw the vast Starry Sky, they were momentarily stunned.","When they came to their senses, they realized that the powerful force was all around them, ready to be absorbed at will.","Wan Shan, as the foremost prodigy among the Yan Immortals of the Wan family, was well-informed and exclaimed excitedly, “Master, could this be your Origin Source Universe?”","“Indeed!” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and said, “In the time to come, you will practice here for a while. When you reach the level of Yan Immortal, I will take you out once. The subsequent plans will be discussed later. First, I will teach each of you a technique. Come see me again after you have mastered it completely!”","Jian Wushuang’s method of teaching his disciples was very straightforward.","Progressive and step-by-step.","He would never overwhelm them with too much at once.","Everything required time to refine.","“By the way, I found a sparring partner for you!” He turned and shouted toward the arranged cave residence, “Babata!”","Swish!","Babata, clad in dark red battle armor, flew out from the cave residence. With a small stature and curved horns on its forehead, it stood obediently before him and said, “Master!”","“Its name is Babata. It is not a life form but should not be treated disrespectfully. Besides sparring with you, it will help guide you in areas you don’t understand. Do you remember?”","Wan Shan, shocked to see the intelligent Babata, recalled hearing about puppets in Qishen Temple that had exquisite hearts but could not practice.","He never expected his master to have a puppet capable of cultivating.","He was deeply astonished!","Ji Tang and Shen Jian did not understand this; to them, Jian Wushuang was omnipotent.","“We remember!” The three replied respectfully.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Babata, first familiarize them with the surroundings. After that, they can begin their self-cultivation!”","“Yes!”","After giving his instructions, Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered and disappeared from Tianqing Mountain.","He left Babata with the three disciples.","“Let’s go!” Babata smiled. Since the destruction of the pyramid, it had been alone on Tianqing Mountain and was extremely bored. Now, with company, it was in high spirits.","The journey was filled with chatter and laughter as Babata introduced the special features of Tianqing Mountain to the three.","Jian Wushuang took one last deep look at the Starry Sky, then closed his eyes.","Leaving his teachings was merely a backup plan.","He also had his path to follow.","In this era, he would still guide them somewhat, but once this era ended, he would let them fend for themselves.","After the Dao Lord, he would point the way, but the rest would be up to them.","No one would always shield them from the storms.","Time flowed silently.","Ten years later.","Wan Shan was the first to completely master the technique he had been taught.","This was in line with Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","After all, it had only been ten years. No matter how talented Shen Jian and Ji Tang were, it was impossible for them to surpass Wan Shan.","“Wan Shan!” Jian Wushuang personally descended and had Wan Shan demonstrate the technique fully.","He was very satisfied.","To completely grasp the technique in ten years, Wan Shan truly deserved to be the top in the trials.","Inheriting his divine power method was indeed a perfect fit.","“Master, although I have completely mastered the technique you taught, there are some aspects I do not fully understand!” Wan Shan honestly voiced his confusion.","Jian Wushuang appreciated this and nodded, “If you understood it all, that would be extraordinary.”","The technique he taught Wan Shan followed his own divine power route.","Without an explanation, the other party would never comprehend it in a lifetime, only mastering a useless technique.","Even an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master could not see through his divine power route.","Let alone a young Yan Immortal.","“This is my divine power route. You might not fully understand divine power yet because your physical body is incomplete, and your divine body is lacking, so you cannot grasp divine power!”","“Divine power?” Wan Shan’s eyes flashed.","He had heard the elders of his family mention it.","Only after the divine body reached 10,000-fold could one grasp divine power.","But his current divine body was only at a thousand times.","A Yan Immortal with 1,000-fold divine body was already quite impressive.","When Jian Wushuang was a Yan Immortal, he did not even have 1,000-fold divine body.","“Yes, divine power!” Jian Wushuang raised his palm, exerting slight force, causing a trace of golden arc to appear. He then said, “Keep this arc safe; it is what you will use in your next stage. Now, I will refine your physical body for you!”","Whoosh!","A majestic mountain appeared in the starry sky. With a flick of his finger, the mountain ignited in flames.","The set of techniques used to refine the body on Demon Flame Mountain back then had already been relocated.","A strong body was only useful to an Emperor.","Upon reaching the Tribulation stage, the body became Immortal.","Therefore, it didn’t need to be exceptionally strong, but it couldn’t be weak either.","The Nine Refinements were essential.","The Tenth Refinement were out of the question for Wan Shan at that moment.","Back then, he barely survived the Tenth Refinement after reaching the level of Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","“Go now. After refining your body, absorb that trace of golden arc. I give you a thousand years. After that, come see me again!”","Wanshan did not hesitate and nodded, saying, “Yes!”","After speaking, he directly entered the burning Fire God Mountain.","The Dao should not be easily imparted.","As a member of the Wan family, how could Wanshan not understand this?","He also understood his master’s intentions.","First, establish a solid foundation before training to inherit the teachings.","One step at a time.","Without haste or impatience.","This suited Wan Shan’s character well.","It was for this reason that Shang fought for Wan Shan.","He was a pure cultivator, a rare find.","Jian Wushuang grew more fond of him the more he observed.","After arranging the subsequent plan for Wanshan, he closed his eyes again to cultivate.","A hundred years later, Shen Jian also mastered the technique.","However, the technique he mastered was different from Wan Shan’s.","Wan Shan followed the path of divine power.","Shen Jian, on the other hand, pursued the ultimate swordsmanship.","The foundation of Sword Dao was the mastery of the Dao.","In the ensuing time, Jian Wushuang personally guided Wan Shan in swordsmanship.","Likewise, he did not directly impart any divine skills to him.","Ji Tang was the last to master the technique.","By the time Wan Shan had successfully refined his body, Ji Tang had just mastered the technique.","It wasn’t due to a lack of comprehension.","It was a matter of talent.","Among the three disciples, Wan Shan was the best in divine power.","Shen Jian excelled in swordsmanship.","Ji Tang’s outstanding points were not obvious.","But one should not underestimate such a cultivator.","He might be a late bloomer.","Having too prominent outstanding points wasn’t necessarily good.","In the following days, Jian Wushuang guided Ji Tang and Shen Jian in their Sword Dao realms.","As for Wan Shan, he was absorbing that trace of golden arc.","It seemed like he was letting Wan Shan fend for himself.","But actually, the path he faced was the best one.","It completely relied on himself.","Once the golden arc was absorbed, the divine body could grow a thousandfold.","The remaining time would be spent breaking through his own realm, reaching the Nine Revolution Yan Immortal as quickly as possible.","By then, Jian Wushuang would set some tests for Wan Shan.","The reward would be divine power treasures.","Once his divine power reached 10,000-fold and he mastered it,","he would almost be ready to accept Jian Wushuang’s inheritance.","However, even the inheritance would start from the most basic level."]},{"number":6120,"title":"Chapter 6120: Wan Shan’s Cultivation Speed","paragraphs":["Chapter 6120: Wan Shan’s Cultivation Speed","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Starting from the Ancient Transformation.","Shen Jian and Ji Tang found it even more challenging to reach their desired stage.","The realm of the sword was not something that could be achieved overnight.","And so it was.","Hundreds of thousands of years passed in a flash.","Wan Shan was the first disciple to receive his legacy.","Having obtained the ancient transformation, his own realm had already risen to the level of Dao Lord.","For divine power practitioners, the realm did not matter; divine power did.","Back then, Jian Wushuang himself, an Emperor, matched the Universe Master with his divine power.","That’s how it happened.","However, Wan Shan still envied Ji Tang and Shen Jian, who were always personally guided by Jian Wushuang.","While he was almost left to grow on his own.","Although he grew quickly, he still wished to train alongside his master.","Shen Jian and Ji Tang, on the other hand, envied Wan Shan for receiving the legacy early on.","They all worked hard desperately.","An era passed quickly.","For the current Jian Wushuang, it was merely a time for seclusion, a blink of an eye.","Or perhaps an epiphany.","In an instant.","All three disciples had received the legacy.","In the span of an era, they had made the greatest progress.","From Yan Immortal to Dao Lord, they made rapid progress.","Only a month remained until the Dao Assembly.","Jian Wushuang also took them back to the original universe.","Within the Xiaosi Domain.","In a mountain valley where Master Lu Hua secluded himself.","Jian Wushuang and Lu Hua sat on the ground, savoring tea.","The three disciples were besieging a wild beast with peak combat strength.","“Not bad, good tea!”","“Not bad, their performance is quite impressive!”","Jian Wushuang was talking about the tea, while Lu Hua was referring to Jian Wushuang’s disciples.","The combat strength of the three amazed Lu Hua.","“Haha, if I hadn’t experienced your era, I would also be shocked by their combat strength!” Lu Hua said with a smile, “But you should not be complacent. A few days ago, I visited Qishen Temple and saw that Wu Zuo’s disciples were not inferior either!”","Jian Wushuang smiled indifferently, “It doesn’t matter. I have seen what I wanted to see. As for their future, I can only hope. That is all I can do.”","Seeing the brilliance of the Qishen Temple was enough to make him happy.","As for the outcome, it no longer mattered.","Now Ji Tang had mastered Star, River, and Lake.","He was not far from the “Star Sea.”","After the Dao Assembly ended, they could all prepare for integration.","Once they became Emperors, fully mastering the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, they would be invincible.","Shen Jian was the same.","However, once they reached the Universe Master level, their paths would diverge.","The Universe Diagram, the Spacetime Chronicles, and the Starry Sky Chronicles would all be left to them.","Even if he couldn’t fully master them.","He would leave them to his disciples.","Future generations would eventually fully grasp them.","As for Wan Shan.","His divine power was now fifty thousand times stronger, and his combat strength was terrifyingly formidable.","In combat, he could single-handedly suppress the peak.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian were no match for Wan Shan.","Moreover, Wan Shan had also begun to grasp the Ancient Transformation.","Once the technique was used, divine power could still surge.","This time at the Dao Assembly, Jian Wushuang could hardly lose.","If he did lose, he would actually be happy.","Happy because of the abundance of talented people.","Seeing his expression, Lu Hua thought of something and asked, “Wushuang, to be honest, you must be close to the Eighth Tribulation realm now, right?”","“My level is sufficient, but... I’m not ready!” He wasn’t prepared for what came after reaching the Eighth Tribulation; in other aspects, he was almost there.","“Sigh!” Lu Hua couldn’t help but sigh after hearing this, “I truly envy you all!”","In the past, Emperor Lu Hua was just slightly weaker than Wu Zuo.","Now, he was embarrassed even to compare himself to Wu Zuo, let alone Jian Wushuang.","As a Universe Master of the Four Tribulations Realm, he wouldn’t have had the confidence to reach the Fifth Tribulation without the treasures given to him by Jian Wushuang.","“Haha, let’s stop talking about this, the more we talk, the more jealous you’ll become!” Jian Wushuang laughed loudly. In truth, he also envied the other’s leisurely days.","Once he reached the Eighth Tribulation, he would soon leave the Northern Spacetime to venture to the completely unfamiliar Realm King Continent.","Though he now had expectations for the unknown, he still felt some reluctance to leave his homeland.","Every time he changed places, he felt this way.","It started with passion and novelty.","Then came the weariness.","Now, all that was left was responsibility.","After some reminiscing,","The three disciples also slew the wild beast.","This drew applause from Lord Lu Hua.","“The Dao Assembly is approaching, and as your senior, I won’t speak in vain. These three Eternal Treasures are my gifts to you!” Emperor Lu Hua took out three identical suits of armor and handed them to the three.","Eternal Treasures.","For a Dao Master, this was quite generous.","Jian Wushuang had not given them such precious treasures.","He had only given them innate supreme treasures.","Emperor Lu Hua, on the other hand, bestowed the finest Eternal Treasures.","This indeed made their eyes light up.","“Brother Lu Hua, their strength is still too weak, such precious treasures are wasted on them!” Jian Wushuang smiled wryly. For a Dao Lord to use an Eternal Treasure, it was far beyond their ability to fully utilize its power.","Although he had received a divine weapon when he was a Dao Lord, the pieces on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard could aid his cultivation.","But Eternal Treasures couldn’t.","Lord Lu Hua quickly waved his hand, saying, “Think of it as battle attire!”","“Thank you, senior!”","For Ji Tang and Shen Jian, it was their first time receiving an Eternal Treasure, and they couldn’t put it down, immediately recognizing it and wearing it.","However, Wan Shan, who came from a noble family,","Already possessed an Eternal Treasure.","After becoming a Dao Master, Jian Wushuang had taken him back to his family.","It was due to a trial that happened to be held in the Wan family.","After the trial ended, the family bestowed a large number of treasures.","But they were all taken away by his master.","He knew it was because his master feared it would affect his cultivation.","One couldn’t become strong in a single breath.","If it was just about simply increasing realm and divine power,","Jian Wushuang could elevate a pig to the level of an Emperor.","Just choose the simplest Dao, and even a pig could integrate with the Dao.","Divine power treasures were abundant, capable of amassing divine power.","For Jian Wushuang, these were all simple.","The problem was, the pursuit of the ultimate in Dao required gradual progression.","One couldn’t be reckless.","“It’s time to go!” Jian Wushuang stood up and said, “Brother Lu Hua, come along, let’s gather in Qishen Temple. After this Dao Assembly ends, I will enter seclusion, and who knows when I will emerge!”","“Alright!”","The Dao Assembly consisted of the disciples of various super beings, naturally attracting many strong practitioners to watch.","And also those Universe Masters.","After all, many were from noble families.","For example, Wan Shan and Ji Tang were also from noble families.","The five of them entered Qishen Temple.","Although his three disciples had been to Qishen Temple before, they hadn’t had a proper tour.","With a month left until the Holy Assembly, he gave the three time to relax, sending them to roam freely in the Heaven Realm.","Jian Wushuang and Lu Hua went to the Ancient Mountain in the Cosmic Sea.","First, they visited some treants.","Then Jian Wushuang went alone to the mountain peak.","The avatars of the 10 Divine Lords and the 8 Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation realm had all gathered."]},{"number":6121,"title":"Chapter 6121: The Dao Assembly Begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 6121: The Dao Assembly Begins","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There was evidently a high level of attention paid to the Holy Assembly.","After all, it concerned their own interests.","“Wushuang, we were just waiting for you!” everyone called out.","Jian Wushuang also took his seat.","He chatted leisurely with everyone.","From the expressions on their faces, it was clear that they were all confident.","A month passed in catching up.","The Dao Assembly arrived as well.","The event was held on Yuanyang Island in the Heaven Realm.","To avoid suspicion, “Luo,” the host, had Zhen Ling preside over it personally.","When Jian Wushuang saw Zhen Ling again, he sensed divine power from him.","In fact, he had already learned from his conversations with Wu Zuo and others that Zhen Ling had made a great contribution in the matter of Mie Sheng and was rewarded with a divine body by the Realm King.","Now, he was almost like a practitioner.","His divine power was also increasing; he could now be considered a Universe Master at the seven Tribulations level.","If he could merge the Origin Source Sea of Qishen Temple into his divine body, he would at least have the combat power of the Eighth Tribulation level.","No wonder Zhen Ling was always cheerful.","The Dao Assembly officially began with Zhen Ling’s announcement.","It was divided into qualifying matches and arena matches.","The most crucial part was the Thunder Sky Match.","The qualifying match was essentially a screening.","If one failed in the qualifying match, it could only be said they were too weak.","However, the qualifying standard this time was extremely exaggerated.","“The Divine Desolation Tower!”","It had nine levels.","The Dao Lords participating in the assembly had to climb the tower within one day, and the fastest hundred would enter the arena matches.","When this rule was announced, Jian Wushuang and the others found it a bit exaggerated.","The nine-level Desolation Tower.","The first level had a desolate beast of the Tier 4 Emperor.","The second level had 10 of them.","By the fifth level, there were 10,000.","From the sixth level onwards, the desolate beasts were at the Tier Emperor level.","The seventh level had 10.","The eighth level had 100.","The ninth level was the most terrifying, directly having a desolate beast at the Tier 6 Emperor’s level.","Not all Dao Lords could match the pinnacle.","Without much time to think, the qualifying matches began.","Jian Wushuang had confidence in his three disciples, knowing their abilities.","This round was not difficult for them.","But for others, it was challenging.","The Divine Tower opened.","All the disciples entered their respective Divine Desolation Towers.","Wan Shan led the way, flashing past the first level.","The second level was the same.","He directly reached the fifth level in one go.","But he only spent a breath on the fifth level.","Then he reached the sixth level.","With almost no pause, he reached the ninth level.","It was only on the ninth level that Wan Shan spent the time of one incense stick.","The rest combined didn’t take one incense stick’s time.","He originally thought he would be the first to come out.","But when Wan Shan was teleported out, he saw three figures.","Luo’s first disciple, “Xie Yue”","Hu Qing’s prized disciple, “Golden Body Arhat”","And one of Wu Zuo’s disciples, the masked Dao Lord.","Among these three, except for Xie Yue, he hadn’t paid attention to the others and didn’t expect them to be faster than him.","However, he hadn’t used his full strength, not even the Ancient Change.","“Ji Tang, Shen Jian, hurry up!”","He knew the strength of the two; passing was no problem, but he was just worried they might waste time without using their full power.","A quarter-hour passed, and dozens had already finished.","At this moment, Ji Tang and Shen Jian leisurely walked out.","Seeing so many people, their faces were full of surprise.","They obviously didn’t expect so many to be faster than them.","“What, even faster than you!” Ji Tang was even more shocked when he heard Wan Shan was only fourth.","Even Jian Wushuang and others watching found it unbelievable.","“It seems this arena battle will be very exciting!”","Because the Dao Lords had the combat power of the pinnacle.","This would definitely be an exceptionally rare competition.","Disciples taught by 18 super beings, and they were all personally taught disciples, truly unprecedented.","The nine-level Desolation Tower quickly screened out the top hundred.","All the personal disciples who participated in the Dao meeting actually had the ability to pass.","It was just a matter of time.","Some were particularly unlucky, hiding some of their strength, thus being just a little slower.","When they walked out of the Desolate Tower, their auras had changed.","Wu Zuo, who was sitting on the spectator platform, was no different.","He had the most disciples and often told them to be low-key in conduct but high-profile in actions.","This time it seemed he had failed in teaching conduct.","Actually, the top one hundred, even without hiding their strength, were the strongest.","So the arena competition began as usual.","Based on drawing lots.","The first round had fifty battles.","The second round had twenty-five battles.","In the third round, there were byes, with only twelve battles.","In the fourth round, there were also byes, depending on who had better luck.","Entering the top ten by luck.","This was deliberately arranged by Zhen Ling.","Luck also represented strength.","However, the personal disciples who could enter the top one hundred did not deign to rely on byes.","The draw for the first round was concluded.","The three disciples of Jian Wushuang drew strong opponents.","Moreover, they were all Wu Zuo’s disciples.","There was no choice, even after so many of his disciples were eliminated, Wu Zuo still had more than thirty disciples entering the top one hundred.","Each had supreme combat power.","But even within supreme combat power, there were strengths and weaknesses.","50 battles began simultaneously.","This was the top-notch showdown.","The duration of the battles was not resolved in one move; some even lasted several hours before a victor was determined.","The losing side was only a move short.","Even Ji Tang and Shen Jian won with great difficulty.","However, these two did not use the ultimate skills taught by Jian Wushuang.","Only Wan Shan, from the beginning, displayed the Ancient Transformation and directly crushed his opponent.","“Ancient Transformation!” Seeing this familiar name, Hu Qing turned and said, “This should be the improved version of the Eternal Transformation!”","Jian Wushuang did not hide it and said calmly, “Pretty much, it’s a divine power ultimate skill more suitable for Dao Lords.”","“With this ultimate skill, it shouldn’t be much of a problem for Wan Shan to enter the top ten this time!”","Everyone was generous with their praise.","A disciple trained by Jian Wushuang being able to enter the top ten was normal.","No way around it, the master himself was a freak.","The records created by the Dao Lord had not been broken by anyone to this day.","Few even came close.","Only Wan Shan, Xie Yue, and others could approach the brilliance left by Jian Wushuang.","“Let’s wait and see!”","Jian Wushuang did not find Wan Shan’s performance impressive.","Compared to the trial, Wan Shan’s suppression power had decreased significantly.","During the trial, he completely crushed his way to first place.","It would be embarrassing if he couldn’t take first place after becoming his disciple.","And it would be Jian Wushuang’s embarrassment.","The first round of arena battles ended quickly.","The second round began soon after.","There was not much delay.","The Origin Source and divine power consumed by the Dao Lords could be quickly recovered.","Continuous fighting was also to maintain their form.","The draw for the second round was unfavorable for Jian Wushuang.","Among his three disciples, two drew seed contestants.","Ji Ye from the Ji family drew Ji Tang.","Wanyan Lie from the Wanyan family drew Shen Jian.","Only Wan Shan’s opponent was unknown but equally strong."]},{"number":6122,"title":"Chapter 6122: You Don’t Understand!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6122: You Don’t Understand!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the second round, if one was not careful, it was very likely that two would be directly eliminated.","Ji Ye was Luo’s disciple and also used a sword.","Moreover, her swordsmanship had already reached the fifth layer, at the edge of the Dao Merge. If it weren’t for participating in the Dao Assembly, she could have completely unified with the Dao.","“Ji Tang, you have the blood of the Ji family in you. Even if you don’t acknowledge it, you can’t change it!”","Over the years, people from the Ji family had also sought out Ji Tang.","Jian Wushuang did not intervene, but Ji Tang did not waver in her Dao Heart.","If her master had not taken her away from the Ji family back then, she wouldn’t have lived long, let alone achieved what she had today.","Everything she had now was unrelated to the Ji family.","If there was any connection, it was hatred.","Her mother had died in the Ji family.","This debt would be settled sooner or later.","The Ji family did not know about this relationship and thought that Ji Tang looked down on the Ji family after she had attached herself to Jian Wushuang.","So they kept trying to win her over.","“You will never understand the enmity between me and the Ji family!”","An era’s time had allowed Ji Tang to grow a lot.","She was not a lunatic buried in hatred.","She could distinguish who was an enemy and who was innocent.","Ji Ye was of the same clan as her, but there was no affection or enmity between them.","There was no need to argue with a clan’s favored young master about how the Ji family was.","What she needed to do was defeat her opponent and bring honor to her sect.","That was enough.","Clang!","A cold gleam flashed, and the sword light was sharp and domineering.","With the first strike, she unleashed the Star Lake Sword Intent.","A massive lake spread out from the sword’s shadow, enveloping Ji Ye completely.","“I don’t understand your enmity with the Ji family, but can I not understand swordsmanship?”","Ji Ye’s sword broke through the enemy, and his Luoshui Sword Intent had also reached a high level.","With just a few strikes, he broke the Star Lake Sword Intent.","For him, this was far from enough.","On the platform, the duel between the two Ji family prodigies drew exclamations from the Universe Masters watching.","They all envied that the Ji family had produced three direct disciples.","The future prospects were limitless.","They were definitely not ordinary individuals.","This battle was actually a loss for the Ji family.","Because both Ji Ye and Ji Tang’s strength were enough to enter the top twenty.","Now, however, they had to determine a winner.","Besides Ji Tang, Shen Jian was also in a deadlock.","Wan Shan had already finished his match.","Although the opponent’s direct disciple was not very powerful, having strength at the threshold of the pinnacle, he was still far inferior to Wan Shan.","Wan Shan, using the Ancient Transformation technique, had already reached pinnacle combat strength.","He easily crushed his opponent, displaying the same dominance he had in the trials.","All 25 matches had concluded.","Only Shen Jian and Ji Tang were still struggling on the platform.","Currently, neither of them was in a good state.","Ji Tang was being severely suppressed by Ji Ye, and Shen Jian was not faring any better.","But just at the moment of determining the winner, a vast ocean descended from the sky.","“Star Sea Sword Intent!”","Both of them unleashed it simultaneously.","With just one strike, they turned the tide of the battle.","“Shen Jian, wins!”","“Ji Tang, wins!”","Many people did not react. Clearly, they were about to lose, yet they made a comeback.","Ji Ye was even more unable to accept it; she couldn’t accept losing to a girl from the Jian family who had been wandering outside.","Clearly about to win, she was defeated by a single sword strike.","“I... actually lost!” Ji Ye took half a step back, standing under the arena, unable to calm down for a long time.","Jian Tang sheathed her sword and slowly walked to the edge of the arena, speaking with a determined tone, “You don’t understand grievances, nor do you understand the way of the sword!”","After leaving this remark, she left straight away and walked into the group of winners.","Not understanding grievances was normal, just like how Ji Ye didn’t understand why Jian Tang didn’t return to the family. She hadn’t experienced the suffering of others yet demanded that they be the same as her.","It was indeed somewhat ridiculous.","Not understanding the way of the sword was even more evident.","The sword intent just now had reached the pinnacle of supreme combat power.","That sword move was by no means comparable to Star Lake.","No matter how many lakes there were, they couldn’t converge into a sea.","Even the smallest sea was still a sea.","The Star River Lake Sea!","Once thoroughly understood, one would be an invincible Emperor.","No longer comparable to a Dao Lord.","Seeing his two disciples breaking through one after another and winning the competition, Jian Wushuang felt very gratified.","He didn’t say anything, just nodded.","This was enough for the disciples to feel the true intent.","Wan Shan’s performance was also good, but the divine power route was not so complicated, nor did it have the possibility of such a comeback.","Everything was a gradual performance.","“The third-round draw, now begins!”","Finally, it was time for the third round of the competition.","This time, the top ten would be decided.","A bye meant direct entry into the top ten.","Among the 12 winners, there would be an additional match to determine 2 losers.","Now only 25 people were left.","In the spectator stands, someone had already closed their eyes.","Wu Tian closed his eyes.","His disciple hadn’t even made it into the top 25.","As for Wanyan, he was the same.","Of the disciples who entered the top hundred, only one remained, and in the second round, he drew Wan Shan.","He was unlucky.","Some were disappointed, while others were happy.","Gu Qianluo’s only remaining disciple, “Duobao Daoist,” drew a bye, lying down to enter the top ten, becoming the first trialist to enter the top ten in this Dao Assembly.","“Luck!”","Gu Qianluo laughed proudly, “Zhen Ling said it right, luck is also a part of strength. My disciple’s strength doesn’t even rank in the top ten among peers, yet he made it through the first two rounds and drew a bye!”","“Hmph, this is an internal competition. If it were an external fight, he would have fallen long ago. Don’t be so smug!”","Several Universe Masters at the Seventh Tribulation stage, who had lost hope, looked very embarrassed at this time.","Gu Qianluo, however, deliberately showed off at this moment, naturally inciting everyone’s attack.","“Jealousy, you’re all jealous of me!”","Zhen Ling coughed and paused before saying, “Enough talking, the third round begins now. The top 10 will be decided soon!”","Among the current 24 Dao Lords, Jian Wushuang alone accounted for three.","Wu Zuo also accounted for three.","Hu Qing had one, who was the Golden Body Arhat.","Shang had only one left.","Luo was the same.","The rest were either completely wiped out or had only one left.","This battle was decisive.","All were personally directing their disciples, pointing out their opponents’ weaknesses.","Once they lost, their future days would be difficult.","Now, the resources in the lower-level time-space had all been developed.","To make up for the deficits of Qishen Temple, they needed to fight in the mid-level spacetimes or upper-level spacetimes against peers.","Many understood Jian Wushuang’s intention.","Those suitable for teaching disciples could stay and teach.","Those who were not suitable would go out and explore.","They needed to leave their comfort zone.","Now Qishen Temple was constantly expanding and needed to let off some steam.","They needed to send a group of strong people to the mid-level or upper-level spacetimes.","They needed to establish Qishen Temple’s reputation in advance.","Otherwise, when the barrier disappeared, Qishen Temple’s overall strength would still be insufficient.","At that time, Jian Wushuang would have to step in again."]},{"number":6123,"title":"Chapter 6123: Extreme Luck Is Also Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 6123: Extreme Luck Is Also Strength","He could protect them for a moment, but not for a lifetime.","He could only use this method to change Qishen Temple.","The third round of battles began soon after.","This time, the draw was favorable for Jian Wushuang’s three disciples.","Wan Shan was sure to win.","Ji Tang and Shen Jian, using the Star Sea Sword Intent, also won their matches.","They thoroughly entered the previous life.","The two who took the longest time, even if they won, would not make it into the top ten.","After the first ten matches ended, the last two arenas automatically declared forfeits. Thus, the ten candidates emerged.","All three of Jian Wushuang’s disciples made it into the top ten, and they won beautifully. Then there was Hu Qing’s Golden Body Arhat and Luo’s Xie Yue.","The remaining five were Duobao Daoist, Ji Hao from the Ji family, and Gong Ping from the Gong family.","The last two were from sects and rogue cultivators captured by Zhen Ling.","Ten candidates were selected.","Wu Zuo was the most embarrassed; all three of his remaining disciples were defeated.","This time, only six people survived.","Jian Wushuang took up three spots.","Luo took two.","Then there was Gu Qianluo, along with Shang, Hu Qing, and the Lord Guangying.","The rest were unlucky and would have tough days ahead.","Especially Wu Zuo, who owed a large amount of treasures to Tian Cang Palace.","When he went to the upstream time and space again, he would surely be pursued for debt.","Eighteen superpowers had to leave twelve people this time.","The internal pressure in Qishen Temple eased significantly.","Moreover, a large number of treasures would flow in.","The foundation would become increasingly strong.","The fourth round of battles lost its original purpose, leaving only the strongest duels.","After five matches, Shen Jian and Ji Tang were defeated.","Wan Shan entered the top five.","Bone Qianluo’s disciple, the “Treasure Seizing Daoist,” narrowly won again with a peculiar magic weapon.","In the fifth round draw, he once again showcased his extraordinary luck, getting a bye.","This time, Wan Shan faced a strong opponent, Hu Qing’s personal disciple, the “Golden Body Arhat.”","Finally, he used the Ancient Transformation to defeat his opponent.","Wan Shan, who used the Ancient Transformation, was approaching the level of the legendary Jian Wushuang back then.","If he could master the Ancient Transformation, he might reach comparable heights.","The final top three duels.","Wan Shan versus Xie Yue, the two fought to a draw.","Duobao Daoist, with luck, took the first place.","This ended the relatively serious competition.","The Dao Assembly ended.","Jian Wushuang gathered with everyone for a while, then announced his plan to go into seclusion.","This time, the seclusion would be very long.","He would either reach the Eight Tribulation Realm upon emerging, or Danbao would elevate the life level of the Northern Spacetime, allowing the birth of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Otherwise, he would not come out.","This determination made Wu Zuo and others take a deep breath.","Even if they ventured out, they would stop cultivating.","Otherwise, they would fall too far behind Jian Wushuang.","After saying goodbye, Jian Wushuang left Qishen Temple with his three disciples.","He also told his three disciples about his seclusion, as there was nothing to hide about this","matter.","In the span of an era, as their master, he had naturally taught everything he needed to.","Living and conducting oneself, and most importantly, the inheritance.","Now, it was time for them to face the mundane world.","At the edge of the primitive universe.","Jian Wushuang brought his three disciples into an ordinary secret realm and set up a thatched hut, leaving Babata there.","He instructed the three disciples that if they had any important matters in the future, they could come here to find him.","Of course, his true self could not stay here; he would have Babata guard this place, and Babata would inform him of any issues.","“Wan Shan, you are following the divine power route. Remember, the most important thing is not treasures that enhance divine power, but methods to amplify it. Accumulating divine power is something anyone can do, but amplifying it is not something everyone can achieve!” Before parting, he still worried that Wan Shan would not be able to resist the temptation of using family treasures to enhance his divine power, disrupting his own path.","To this end, he also instructed the Wan family not to easily enhance Wan Shan’s divine power.","At the Dao Lord level, a base divine power of 50,000 was sufficient; the rest was about how to amplify one’s divine power.","Cultivate the Ancient Transformation and Eternal Transformation.","At the Emperor level, maintain a divine power of 100,000.","Comprehend even more powerful Eternal Transformations.","Once reaching the Universe Master level, there would be no such constraints.","By that time, the disciple should understand his master’s good intentions.","“Master!” Wan Shan’s face was resolute as he respectfully said, “Disciple will definitely remember!”","The Eternal Transformation and Super Eternal Transformation had also been passed on to","him.","The future path would be his own.","After giving instructions to Wan Shan, Jian Wushuang looked at Ji Tang and Shen Jian.","These two inherited his swordsmanship, which was the most difficult. Moreover, the enhancement of their Origin Source was very slow, and they would enter a period of silence.","“As your master, I have left you three Chronicles, divided into the Universe, Spacetime, and Starry Sky. Do your best. The Universe Chronicle is also good, and the complete five sword moves are enough to be stand proud in the Northern Spacetime. There is no need to pursue the extreme. Once you reach the Universe Master level, you can also graduate and pass on these","inheritances for me!”","Pass them on!","Jian Wushuang had naturally left, intending to teach some disciples.","But he didn’t have the time to do so.","So he entrusted his three disciples.","“Alright, I should go into seclusion now. If there is anything in the future, you can tell Babata,","and he will inform me. You can also share your thoughts with him!” After explaining","everything, Jian Wushuang turned and walked into the thatched hut.","The three disciples bowed deeply and did not rise for a long time.","Wan Shan took a deep breath, knowing that the road ahead depended on him, and said,","“Senior Brother, Senior Sister, do you have any places to go?”","The two shook their heads.","A magnificent path of cultivation would also unfold for the three of them.","...","As for Jian Wushuang, after entering the thatched hut, he left behind only an avatar clone.","His true self had already drifted away.","He didn’t care about the retreat places in the downstream spacetimes.","So he chose to retreat in his Origin Source Starry Sky.","His true self went to the end of the universe to experience desolation and calm his mind.","A million eras of stagnation, without battle, without cultivation.","It was time to cultivate properly.","“Buzz!”","On Tianqing Mountain.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist and burst with energy, his divine power directly reaching 30","million.","This was also the current limit of the world.","His base divine power was 8 million, plus the 2 million from the Tribulation Armor, making a","total of 10 million.","There was nothing more to improve.","Anyway, he didn’t need to fight now. Enhancement was something to consider after the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The divine power secret technique “Super Eternal Ancient Transformation” had reached a","perfect level. Ordinary Super Eternal Ancient Transformation only amplified divine power by one time. Perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could amplify it by two times.","The prerequisite was the environment.","And the foundation of one’s divine power.","Sometimes, perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could not amplify by two times.","He still needed to make some adjustments.","The troublesome part of the divine power route was the amplification secret technique.","This was the most time-consuming, enhancing not the realm but the combat power.","Swoosh!","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the Starry Sky, continuously improving the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation in his mind."]},{"number":6124,"title":"Chapter 6124: Secluded Cultivation (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6124: Secluded Cultivation (1)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In pursuit of achieving the most perfect form.","Time flew by like a white colt passing through a gap, and one seclusion lasted for 100,000 epochs.","Many things happened during this period.","Babata not only informed him about the matters concerning his three disciples but also collected some information about Qishen Temple. He even gathered a lot of information about the middle-stream and upstream spacetimes.","These 100,000 epochs were not only a transformation for the lower stream spacetimes but also for the entire Northern Spacetime.","The Resurrection Secret Technique had enhanced the overall strength of the Northern Spacetime by several folds.","After all, the Scattered Tribulation was much more numerous than the Universe Masters.","Once these Scattered Tribulations were reborn, their strength quickly caught up to the Universe Masters.","However, some unlucky ones failed their Tribulation, leading to their complete demise, and such cases couldn’t be resurrected.","Overall, undergoing Tribulation carried significant risks. Failure was permissible, but if one fell during the Tribulation, no one could be blamed.","Moreover, for the resurrected Universe Masters, undergoing Tribulation was several times more difficult than for the normal Universe Masters.","Each failure would multiply the difficulty several times.","This continued until their ultimate demise.","Despite this, those Scattered Tribulations were still very happy to have this opportunity.","Back when Jian Wushuang befriended the Divine Craftsman Lian Xing in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Lian Xing had now become an Eighth Tribulation Realm Universe Master.","His foundation was very deep; even as a Scattered Tribulation, he possessed the combat strength not weaker than that of a Universe Master.","Now, he had leaped to become an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Such occurrences happened many times in the Northern Spacetime.","The number of Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters increased several times.","Those Eighth Tribulation Scattered Tribulations also gained the most benefits from this Resurrection Secret Technique.","They began preparing for the Ninth Tribulation.","However, this time, no one dared to undergo the Ninth Tribulation voluntarily. They all waited for the God of Life to elevate their life level.","The three Ancient Beings were no exception.","Jian Wushuang himself was not in a hurry; he was currently only at the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","Apart from some major events in the Northern Spacetime, Qishen Temple also underwent significant changes.","The number of Seventh Tribulation realm cultivators kept increasing, but the Eighth Tribulation still had only Hu Qing.","The number of Sixth Tribulation Realms was also quite impressive.","The newly ascended Universe Masters were ten times more than before.","Currently, the downstream spacetimes had 10,000 Universe Masters.","Although it was still not as many as the Universe Masters of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, with time, they would eventually surpass the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","As for surpassing the entire upper stream spacetimes, that was impossible.","Because the resources of the upper stream spacetimes were beyond comparison to the lower stream spacetimes.","The resources of the Ancient Moon Spacetime alone surpassed those of the entire lower stream spacetimes.","If it weren’t for some Seventh Tribulation experts led by Wu Zuo fighting for resources outside, Qishen Temple’s development would have long reached its end.","They needed to compete for resources now.","In the future, they would need to compete for territory.","Survival of the fittest.","The weak would enter the lower and even the bottom ranks.","The strong would gather at the top ranks.","The Northern Starry Sky would also reverse the heavens and earth.","At present, they were just waiting for the opportunity for a barrier to disappear.","Even if the barrier didn’t disappear.","Qishen Temple already had a large number of strong experts beginning their advance into the middle-rank Starry Sky.","Moreover, they had already taken over a middle-rank Starry Sky.","Currently, a large number of strong experts from Qishen Temple were migrating.","His three disciples had also left the lower-rank Starry Sky.","In the span of 100,000 eras.","His three disciples had all reached the level of Universe Masters.","Wan Shan didn’t need to improve his realm much, he could completely rely on his strength to withstand tribulations.","He was now a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation level.","Moreover, his divine power had already surpassed a million.","He was a prodigy of the current Qishen Temple.","Although Ji Tang and Shen Jian were somewhat slower, their strength was not inferior.","Among them, Ji Tang’s performance was more outstanding.","This was something Jian Wushuang had anticipated.","After reaching the Universe Master level, Ji Tang went to the Ji family to understand their grievances, and his strength advanced rapidly again.","He directly mastered the Spacetime Chronicles.","He caught up with Shen Jian’s pace.","Both of them mastered the Spacetime Chronicles.","As for the Starry Sky Chronicles, it was originally left as a notion by Jian Wushuang.","The things he said back then were to prevent the two disciples from forcibly cultivating the Starry Sky Chronicles, which would only result in getting stuck and unable to advance.","From their performance, it seemed he had overthought it.","Before Wan Shan and the others left, they each took on several disciples to continue the legacy.","But those things had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang anymore.","This time he stopped cultivating for 100,000 eras only because the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation had reached a perfect level.","In the future, when he used the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it would not weaken due to his own divine power being too strong.","However, the current amplification was greatly reduced.","Jian Wushuang considered it a compromise he made for himself.","Originally, he pursued the extreme in divine power.","In the end, he let go of the extreme improvement.","A perfect Super Eternal?AncientTransformation would double his divine power.","An ordinary Super Eternal Ancient Transformation would only increase divine power by 50 percent.","For example, his current divine power was 10 million. When he fully utilized the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power would increase to 20 million.","It seemed much weaker than before.","But when his divine power reached 20 million, the fully utilized Super Eternal Ancient Transformation would be 40 million in divine power.","Before the modification, when his basic divine power reached 20 million, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation might not even double it.","The current Super Eternal Ancient Transformation had a larger scale.","This was the change he spent 100,000 eras on.","When he reached the Eighth Tribulation level, his basic divine power could reach 20 million.","By then, using the fully utilized Super Eternal Ancient Transformation would be 40 million in divine power.","Adding the Origin Source Dao Arena.","His divine power would surpass the Ninth Tribulation level.","With such divine power, he had the confidence to go to the Realm God Continent.","In the coming time, he needed to enhance his Origin Source Starry Sky.","Currently, he was short of one enlightenment and the expansion of his Origin Source Starry Sky to reach the Eighth Tribulation level.","Nine super perfect universes were his goal.","He wouldn’t undergo Tribulation until he reached it.","Lighting up two universes was simple, but connecting nine universes into a line was difficult.","It was harder than starting his cultivation anew.","First, he needed to connect all things in the nine universes.","Different spaces were manageable.","But time had to be equivalent.","Otherwise, how could they be connected into a spacetime?","This required a lot of time.","Sitting and cultivating in solitude.","Loneliness and anxiety entangled him.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to rest once every ten thousand eras of cultivation.","To get into the state as much as possible, he didn’t hesitate to split his Origin Source and fight himself.","He pursued the purity of the Origin Source.","Time in cultivation passed the fastest.","The first million eras passed quickly.","The major events outside were also relayed to his mind one by one.","The second Eighth Tribulation Universe Master of Qishen Temple had emerged.","After such a long time, the emergence of a second Eighth Tribulation Universe Master was normal. However, the one who emerged as an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master surprised Jian Wushuang.","“Gu Qianluo!”","The tenth Divine Lord of Qishen Temple.","Jian Wushuang never expected that the extremely jealous Gu Qianluo would become an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master."]},{"number":6125,"title":"Chapter 6125: Secluded Cultivation (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6125: Secluded Cultivation (2)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He was the second one after Hu Qing.","He was also the second one from Qishen Temple.","Just sixty thousand eras ago, he successfully passed the Tribulation.","It was said that the reason for this smooth Tribulation was because of his disciple.","At that time, even Jian Wushuang felt that the ‘Duobao Daoist’ had immense fortune.","This disciple of Gu Qianluo had obtained a wisp of strange power rising from the abyss in the middle-tier spacetime.","Unable to understand it himself, he presented it to Gu Qianluo.","Initially, Gu Qianluo couldn’t comprehend it either. Later, after mastering it, he merely absorbed that wisp of strange power, which caused his divine power to soar by 10 million.","Taking advantage of this, he passed the Eighth Tribulation.","His disciple, who also absorbed a portion, became a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","For a time, they overshadowed Wan Shan.","Currently, Wan Shan was just a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, and his progress had slowed down in recent years.","Now, the most renowned figures in Qishen Temple were Gu Qianluo and his disciple.","After becoming an Eighth Tribulation master, Gu Qianluo’s peak divine power exceeded fifteen million, and he seized three spacetime territories in the middle-tier spacetime.","This provoked the Abyssal Lord’s wrath, and if it weren’t for Hu Qing’s intervention, a war would have erupted.","Hu Qing intervened and easily dealt with the Abyssal Lord.","In the lower-tier spacetime, there was now a desire to overthrow the higher tiers, and everyone could see this trend.","Even if Gu Qianluo did not make a move, someone would have willingly joined Qishen Temple.","The pressure Qishen Temple exerted on the middle-tier spacetime was immense.","In a million eras, many powerful beings had emerged, rushing to the middle-tier spacetime.","Hu Qing, with his peak battle strength, could suppress the entire middle-tier spacetime alone.","There were also many top-tier forces.","Unable to win in battle, the middle-tier spacetime had thoughts of giving up.","Especially Immortal Lord Juyang from the Giant Peak Spacetime, who, before leaving the Northern spacetime, handed over the second-most powerful Giant Peak Spacetime to Hu Qing.","The entire middle-tier spacetime had lost its sharpness.","The Abyssal Lord only dared to be so bold because he hadn’t seen Jian Wushuang.","If Jian Wushuang went to the middle-tier spacetime again, they would indeed collectively surrender.","Although Qishen Temple threatened the safety of the middle-tier spacetime, it also brought them hope.","In the future, without barriers, joining Qishen Temple early would allow them to advance to the upper-tier spacetime.","Why not? There was no hope in resisting anyway.","The competition in the upper-tier spacetime was even more intense.","A large number of powerful beings suddenly emerged, naturally vying for treasures and opportunities.","It had long since turned into a fierce battle.","The Realm King was pleased with this; it was much better than a stagnant situation.","Moreover, he had extracted many time-space secret realms from the Realm God Continent and placed them in the upper-tier spacetime.","As for the middle and lower tiers, there was no indication.","Even if Wu Zuo caused a commotion, it was the same.","Either compete in the upper-tier spacetime or go hungry.","He would not favor any faction.","He could bestow treasures upon individuals but would never encompass their factions.","Even if Qishen Temple had made great contributions, it was the same.","Jian Wushuang admired this point.","Upstream was upstream, and downstream was downstream.","Once the barrier was removed, there wouldn’t be so many issues, and by then, everyone would rely on their own abilities.","Jian Wushuang began the next phase of his cultivation.","At present, he had already lit up the ninth universe.","The treasures he consumed were almost exhausted.","Fortunately, when everything was connected, he didn’t need to use any more primordial stones.","Otherwise, the primordial stones he had accumulated over the years would not have been enough.","In the future, when he underwent Tribulation, he would also need to venture out into the world.","He would search for treasures to undergo the Eighth Tribulation.","But that was for later.","He had no clue how to connect the nine universes into one line.","He was stuck on the aspect of time.","An endless amount of time.","He was completely immersed in his cultivation, not pausing at all.","He didn’t even feel the passage of time.","He sat motionless in the spacetime.","One session lasted nine million eras.","Outside, the snow melted and withered trees were reborn countless times.","But Jian Wushuang remained unchanged.","He sat stiffly in the spacetime.","Behind him, the nine great universes shone brightly, with countless threads of time converging into one.","The prototype of time and space was gradually forming.","To condense time and space, he had to cultivate time to perfection.","Now, Jian Wushuang had finally achieved it.","This was completely different from divine power.","Do not be misled by the current cultivators who, after reaching the Eighth Tribulations Realm, continued to blindly pursue divine power, focusing on strength and ignoring realms.","When they reached the Ninth Tribulation realm and became demigods, to take another step and become Universe Masters, they had to make up for everything.","Jian Wushuang had to take a different path.","His perfect universe could rival a Universe Master.","As long as he mastered one universe, he could actually challenge to become a Universe Master.","But he was different.","Cultivators could at most become Universe Masters, but he insisted on becoming a God of Time and Space or even a God of Spacetime.","Not a bestowed God of Spacetime, but one who became a God of Spacetime through his own cultivation.","The position of a god was inherently elusive.","Mie Sheng was a God of Spacetime.","Didn’t he eventually fall?","The so-called gods were just like that.","Jian Wushuang, in the past, had already slain gods.","He had long since torn away that mysterious veil.","A god was not completely invincible.","It was just that one’s vision wasn’t high enough and one’s strength wasn’t strong enough, using it as an excuse.","Becoming a god was not the goal.","The goal was to defeat them.","Clap!","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes, a brilliant light shot out, which was his incredibly powerful Origin Source.","Crack!","As he slowly stood up, a series of bone-cracking sounds came from his body.","Only when he was fully upright did the sounds cease.","“Babata!” The first thing Jian Wushuang did upon exiting seclusion was call for Babata.","Swoosh!","A small dark red demon appeared in front of him.","They hadn’t seen each other for millions of eras, and Babata’s strength had significantly improved.","However, he wasn’t suited for cultivation, much like Babidi.","But wisdom was also a form of strength.","“Master! You have finally come out of seclusion. Three thousand eras ago, the Realm King completely broke the barrier. Now, the Northern Spacetime can give birth to Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters!”","This news didn’t surprise Jian Wushuang.","It was something normal.","If the universe could give birth to Universe Masters, he might be surprised!","“By the way, the three Ancient Beings in the upstream spacetimes successfully underwent Tribulation and reached the level of Ninth Tribulation. After countless years of accumulation, I estimate that they already have the peak strength of the Ninth Tribulations realm. Now, they have all left the Northern Spacetime and gone to the Realm King Continent. Before leaving, Elder Tian Cang entrusted Wan Shan to tell you that the Northern Spacetime has now entered a period of expansion. Cultivators with divine power exceeding 30 million must leave, otherwise, they will affect the development of the Northern Spacetime!”","Babata said a lot in one breath, and Jian Wushuang absorbed it all.","Divine power exceeding 30 million?","His current divine power was only 10 million.","With a normal state of 10 million divine power, there was no burden on the Northern Spacetime.","This calculation was for basic divine power.","Since the three ancient existences had all left the Northern Spacetime, it indicated that their basic divine power had already exceeded 30 million.","Then they indeed should have left."]},{"number":6126,"title":"Chapter 6126: Coming Out of Seclusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 6126: Coming Out of Seclusion","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“30 million?” Jian Wushuang murmured, clenching his fists and shouting in anger, “Ha!”","A powerful aura surged into the sky, directly sending Babata flying away.","In the Origin Source Starry Sky, divine power could receive the greatest amplification.","And it was an automatic amplification.","After all, it was in his own Dao Arena.","Buzz!","A blue aura appeared, and Jian Wushuang’s divine power skyrocketed from 10 million directly to 20 million.","Now, the Origin Source Starry Sky was equivalent to having a miniature river of time and space enhancing his divine body.","The amplification of divine power also reached as high as double.","20 million divine power doubled again to become 40 million.","The powerful divine power in his Origin Source Starry Sky was like a fish in water, without any sense of strain.","But if he left the Origin Source Universe, suppression would likely occur.","Although the life levels in the Northern Spacetime had significantly improved.","It could now maintain fifty million divine power.","However, the number of cultivators had also increased.","Surpassing thirty million divine power occupied too much space.","For the younger generation to grow, they needed to take the initiative to leave.","It wasn’t that they couldn’t sustain more than thirty million divine power.","“Hu!”","The divine power returned to its normal state, and he didn’t need to maintain the super ancient transformation all the time.","In the Northern Spacetime, it naturally wouldn’t affect anyone.","However, it was time to come out of seclusion.","The barrier disappeared, and he needed to implement his plan to lead Qishen Temple to impact the upstream time and space.","Swoosh!","His consciousness pulled back from the Origin Source Starry Sky to reality.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was sitting cross-legged at the edge of the abyss in the end space.","He slowly stood up, glanced down at the abyss, and then looked up at the Starry Sky.","Buzz!","With one step, he directly arrived at the Original Universe.","He hadn’t appeared for tens of millions of epochs.","The Qishen Temple had undergone earth-shattering changes.","There were now very few who knew of him, the First Divine Lord.","During the first million epochs of Jian Wushuang’s seclusion, Gu Qianluo had become an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","In the following nine million epochs, Wutian and Wu Zuo had successively become Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","Even Shang and Luo had also reached the same level.","Dongsheng and Wanyan had average talents and were currently stuck at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","Among the younger generation, however, quite a few Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters had emerged.","Among them was Gong Ming, the son left behind by Gong Miaoyi, and Xin Jiu, whom Jian Wushuang had saved back then.","And there were many more.","At present, Qishen Temple had ten Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","It seemed like a lot.","But compared to the middle-tier spacetime, it was still lacking.","However, half of the territory in the middle-tier spacetime was now occupied by Qishen Temple.","Currently, in the lower-tier Qishen Temple, only Zhen Ling was stationed.","Jian Wushuang tore through space effortlessly and entered Qishen Temple, heading straight for the Sea of Origin Source.","He soon sensed Zhen Ling’s presence.","He was also at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Moreover, the Sea of Origin Source of Qishen Temple had completely merged with Zhen Ling.","Despite not having an Origin Universe, within Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling could unleash 20 million units of divine power.","“Jian Wushuang?” On the peak of Henggu Mountain, Zhen Ling rose to face the First Divine Lord who hadn’t appeared for countless millennia and said excitedly, “You’ve finally come out of seclusion. If you stayed in any longer, I was going to come find you!”","It had been too long of a silence.","So much so that many had never seen Jian Wushuang.","He hadn’t even left his avatar on Henggu Mountain, so many new thSeven Tribulation and even Eighth Tribulation masters had never seen Jian Wushuang.","And Jian Wushuang’s prestige had been gradually declining.","Now, it was not even as good as the three disciples he had left behind.","Shen Jian and Ji Tang had both reached the Seventh Tribulation realm and had become Dao Companions, forming the second strongest Dao Companion combination in Qishen Temple.","The first, of course, was Shang and Luo.","“This seclusion was of great importance and indeed took a lot of time. Thank you for your hard work during this period, Lord Zhen Ling!”","It was he who had suggested the changes, but then he went into seclusion, leaving everything behind.","He felt somewhat guilty.","Zhen Ling smiled and said, “I don’t mean that. It’s just that you were in seclusion for so long that many have forgotten the first Divine Lord. It’s time for you to go out and shake the four corners!”","This was exactly what Jian Wushuang had in mind.","It was indeed time to go out and intimidate the various realms, and simultaneously lead Qishen Temple to charge towards the upper-tier.","Before he went into seclusion, he had instructed Babata to collect information on the upper-tier spacetimes.","Finding the weakest spacetime to establish a foothold.","There were nine major upper-tier spacetimes.","Originally, the Ancient Moon Spacetime was the weakest, but with the Celestial Maiden relinquishing the Origin Source, the Ancient Moon Sect had become a force comparable to the three Eternal Beings.","The weakest spacetime had become the “Fallen Soul Spacetime.”","This spacetime had once been decent, having given birth to a God of Death.","But after losing contact with the God of Death, the Fallen Soul Spacetime had completely declined.","Even though a hundred schools of thought contended now, it was still a stagnant pool.","If Qishen Temple hadn’t threatened the Abyss Spacetime, the Abyssal Lord would have led his people to flatten the Fallen Soul Spacetime long ago.","Now, it was a great gift to Jian Wushuang.","He just happened to be short of treasures needed for Tribulation crossing.","So, he would go to the Fallen Soul Spacetime to take a look.","If they were reasonable, then perhaps they could join the middle-tier spacetime, leaving them with a decent territory.","If they were unreasonable, then there was no need for words.","He would act directly.","The law of the jungle.","It played out every day.","If you didn’t fight for it, others would.","“I’ll handle this matter!”","Zhen Ling asked, “You alone?”","“Isn’t sending too many people to such a task just bullying?” Jian Wushuang smiled wryly. “Though the strong are respected, one must not go too far. If it can be done peacefully, it’s better to keep a low profile. I’ve heard that the Eighth Tribulation masters in the upper-tier spacetime are like locusts. Being too high-profile, even if we take down the Fallen Soul Spacetime, it won’t be easy to defend!”","His power alone was indeed strong.","But to defend a spacetime, more super-strong individuals were needed.","Otherwise, others might obey you on the surface but defy you in secret, trapping your forces. You couldn’t just fight your way through every obstacle!","Sometimes, in the world of the strong, it wasn’t all about fighting.","It was about human relationships and the ways of the world.","Before Tian Cang left, his parting words held other meanings.","It was an opportunity to visit Tian Cang Palace and first deal with the three great Eternal Beings, allowing Qishen Temple to establish a firm foothold in the upper-tier spacetime. Otherwise, it would be hard to convince everyone.","And there was another, which was to recover the middle-tier spacetime.","And he now had a legitimate reason.","Qishen Temple originally belonged to the Moluo Spacetime of the middle-tier spacetime.","Now, going to unify the middle-tier spacetime was quite reasonable!","Besides, without him, the middle-tier spacetime would have fallen into Beirut’s hands.","At that time, not to mention removing the barriers, the middle, upper, and lower tiers would be completely severed.","His current mission to recover the middle-tier spacetime was also logical and justified.","Understanding Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, Zhen Ling clapped her hands in delight and said, “If that Abyssal Lord had half your insight, none of this would have happened. I fully support you. Go ahead, and I’ll immediately notify Wu Zuo to take over the territory!”","“Isn’t this a bit too hasty?” Jian Wushuang felt that Zhen Ling was more anxious than he was and even more shameless."]},{"number":6127,"title":"Chapter 6127: Meeting the Abyssal Lord Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 6127: Meeting the Abyssal Lord Again","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He hadn’t even reached the mid-tier or mid-stream spacetimes yet and was already thinking about how to divide the territories.","“Other things can wait, but this matter must be addressed quickly. You don’t know this, but Qishen Temple is nearly out of resources. Once someone becomes a Universe Master, they can no longer exchange treasures at Qishen Temple. Now we can only train some Dao Lords and Emperors!” Zhen Ling sighed and shook his head. “All these years, we’ve relied on Wu Zuo and Hu Qing to sustain us by scouring secret realms for treasures to fill the gaps at Qishen Temple. If I didn’t have to oversee the low-tier spacetimes, I would have gone myself.”","Zhen Ling made himself seem extremely pitiful.","Like a lonely, elderly man who had no choice but to risk his life.","Even though Jian Wushuang knew Zhen Ling was putting on a show for him, he couldn’t help but pat Zhen Ling on the shoulder and comfort him, “Don’t worry, as long as I’m here!”","After comforting Zhen Ling, Jian Wushuang immediately set off.","Currently, there were few strong individuals in the low-tier spacetimes; most had moved to the mid-tier spacetimes’s Qishen Temple.","What Zhen Ling said about only training Dao Lords and Emperors was not entirely true.","Universe Masters were unwilling to stay in the low-tier spacetimes and naturally did not need to remain at Qishen Temple.","Even if they wanted to train others, they wouldn’t look favorably upon them!","“Sigh!” Jian Wushuang could only sigh helplessly.","Zhen Ling still liked to play the victim.","There was no change from before.","“Babata!” After leaving Qishen Temple, a brand-new pyramid appeared in front of him.","Unfortunately, this pyramid had speed but no defense or attack capabilities.","Even so, Babata had paid a high price to refine it.","This new pyramid flying boat could reach cosmic-level speeds, powered by Jian Wushuang’s divine power.","This time, he could use it confidently.","A single injection of divine power was enough to make the pyramid circle the entire Northern Spacetime.","And it was incredibly fast.","Traveling to the mid-tier spacetimes, which used to take an era, now only took three years.","Taking advantage of this time, he looked into the current situation.","The upper-tier spacetimes was occupied by three major eternal forces.","Then there was the Ancient Moon Sect.","The other Spacetimes were still fragmented, but if attacked rashly, even sand would form a tower.","They couldn’t be underestimated.","He could only consider the Fallen Soul Spacetime.","As for the forces in the mid-tier spacetimes, he didn’t take them seriously.","He had told the Abyssal Lord before that coming to the mid-tier spacetimes again would be different.","Buzz!","The pyramid shuttled through spacetime, heading to the mid-tier spacetimes at the fastest speed.","Along the way, he saw many warships, all heading to the mid-tier spacetimes.","Few were coming from the mid-tier spacetimes to the low-tier spacetimes.","Most were returning to move their clans to the mid-tier spacetimes.","The low-tier spacetimes wasn’t unsuitable for Universe Masters to cultivate, just that it couldn’t accommodate too many.","Dao Lords and Emperors were not affected.","Originally, he planned to move the entire Qishen Temple to the upper-tier spacetimes, but then he thought it would be better to leave a branch temple to train Dao Lords and Emperors.","Universe Masters below the Fifth Tribulation realm would stay in the mid-tier spacetimes, with some Seventh Tribulation masters guarding it.","The remaining Universe Masters would move to the upper-tier spacetimes.","Resources should be used where they were needed most.","Layer by layer, they advanced.","There was no need for a sudden transition that would break their established foundation.","The upper-tier spacetimes might not have enough territory to train Dao Lords and Emperors.","It wasn’t as vast as the low-tier spacetimes, which allowed for unlimited selection of elites!","Anyway, no one would compete for the low-tier spacetimes.","This way, Qishen Temple’s legacy could continue indefinitely.","Now it seemed like they were already on the ninth generation of inheritors.","Each generation was stronger than the last.","Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters were now in groups.","Sooner or later, they would surpass those eternal forces.","For now, they needed to slowly expand their territory.","Three years passed in the blink of an eye.","The pyramid arrived at the Abyssal Spacetime.","At this time, outside the Abyssal Spacetime, there were various battle formations and countless strong individuals guarding it.","They were all preparing for the powerhouses of Qishen Temple.","Not everyone in the mid-tier spacetimes liked to align with Qishen Temple. Some still resisted and sought refuge in the Abyssal Spacetime, giving the Abyssal Spacetime a chance to contend with Qishen Temple.","After today, that chance would be gone.","Jian Wushuang stepped out of the pyramid.","When this pyramid, which had once terrified the mid-tier spacetimes, reappeared, few recognized it.","After all, millions of eras had passed.","But some sharp-eyed individuals still recognized it.","The pyramid!","Jian Wushuang!","“It’s over!”","They knew who had arrived.","Jian Wushuang slowly raised his hand, looking at the spacetime restrictions, and casually tore them apart, directly ripping the formation to shreds.","The entire formation was torn to pieces by him.","However, he did not harm the cultivators.","He only destroyed the formation.","Even though this formation couldn’t stop him.","It was just a show of force.","Swoosh!!!!","With the formation destroyed, several super strong individuals from the Abyssal Spacetime appeared.","Leading them was the Abyssal Lord.","The current Abyssal Lord had already reached the peak of the Eighth Tribulation, but he lacked the confidence to pass the Ninth Tribulation.","His own combat power had reached twenty million.","Therefore, he dared to take the lead.","He dared to compete with Qishen Temple.","Under his command were several Universe Masters with divine power of 15 million.","In terms of combat power, they were almost on par with Qishen Temple, only losing to Hu Qing.","But now Jian Wushuang had appeared!","The Abyssal Lord knew that the person in front of him was not as easygoing as that bald monk, so his expression softened and he revealed a smile.","“So it’s Daoist Wushuang. It’s been many years since we last met. When did you come out of seclusion?”","Seeing that the other party wanted to catch up with him, Jian Wushuang was in no hurry. He calmly replied, “I just came out of seclusion. Hearing that the Abyssal Lord’s strength has grown, I couldn’t wait to spar with you!”","Spar!","The current Abyssal Lord indeed had this thought.","He had reached a level comparable to the Ninth Tribulations Realm, with basic divine power of twenty million. By using divine power secret techniques and Origin Source Dao Arena, his power exceeded 25 million.","With his current vision, he could see that Jian Wushuang was still a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","He couldn’t believe that Jian Wushuang was truly as powerful as the rumors said.","“Please enlighten me!” The Abyssal Lord wasted no words, waving his hand for the people behind him to retreat.","Buzz!","The Abyssal Lord erupted first, his divine power directly surpassing twenty million.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved, only raising his hand calmly and saying, “Moluotime, Jian Wushuang seeks your guidance!”","As soon as he finished speaking, with just a glance, he pierced through the Abyssal Lord’s weak spot.","An extreme Origin Source and powerful divine power burst forth instantly.","In his peak state, Jian Wushuang flashed to the Abyssal Lord’s front in an instant, shattering the opponent’s divine body with a single punch, along with the collapse of his Origin Source Dao Arena.","“You...” The Abyssal Lord’s expression was filled with a mix of emotions, disbelief, reluctance, confusion, fear, and dread.","A Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation broke through his divine body and Origin Source Dao Arena with a single punch.","Defeated!","Completely defeated.","He had originally thought that if it wasn’t a crushing defeat, he could still hold on.","But ever since hearing Jian Wushuang mention Moluotime, he had completely lost.","Lost to a successor of a middle-level spacetime.","Chapter 6125, they were all his own people!","Qishen was originally a powerhouse of the middle-level spacetime, something the Abyssal Lord knew.","Jian Wushuang could be considered a disciple of Qishen.","Naturally, he could represent Moro Spacetime.","“Abyssal brother!” Jian Wushuang withdrew his divine power, condensing a ball of life force and handing it to the other party.","This was sincerity."]},{"number":6128,"title":"Chapter 6128: Submit","paragraphs":["Chapter 6128: Submit","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Accepted, everyone would be considered one of their own. If not accepted, then he wouldn’t be polite about it.","While the Abyssal Lord was in a daze, the Universe Masters who had taken refuge under him were already moved.","None of them were fools; they knew what Jian Wushuang had come for this time.","Just one punch had shattered the Abyssal Lord, completely breaking their spirits.","They no longer dared to have any thoughts of resistance.","Submitting to Qishen Temple early on could secure a good position.","They couldn’t win in a fight, so they had no choice but to follow along.","“Thank... thank you!” The Abyssal Lord understood that if he didn’t accept this life force, the second punch would land on his face.","A wise man submits to circumstances!","Submitting to Qishen Temple was not a big deal.","At least it would ensure they could enter the upper-tier spacetimes in the future.","Jian Wushuang was a person who was the fairest.","He treated everyone the same, regardless of closeness.","As long as they were his own, they would benefit.","“No need to be polite, we are all one family!” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","The Abyssal Lord followed with an awkward smile.","The Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm behind him also laughed.","“Yes, yes, we are all one family now. We will rely on the care of the First Divine Lord in the future!”","One of the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation even opened the portal of the Abyssal Spacetime and respectfully said, “Divine Lord, please come in!”","Such a quick change in attitude left Jian Wushuang both amused and exasperated.","It seemed Hu Qing had been too kind to them.","He had just scared them a little, and they became so attentive.","In the entire mid-tier spacetime, one punch ended the dispute.","It also saved a lot of resources.","“No, I won’t go in and sit. Later, you all will head together to Qishen Temple in Giant Peak Spacetime to discuss the migration to the upper-tier spacetimes!”","His words left everyone stunned.","Even the Abyssal Lord hadn’t expected it to be so soon.","One moment they had just resolved the issues in the mid-tier spacetime, and the next moment they were to move to the upper-tier spacetime.","It was indeed Jian Wushuang.","He was decisive in his actions.","The Abyssal Lord quickly understood.","After the three Eternal Beings became Ninth Tribulation, they quickly left the Northern Spacetime.","When they left, they left a message.","When their divine power reached 30 million, they needed to leave the Northern Spacetime.","The divine power Jian Wushuang had just demonstrated definitely exceeded 30 million.","It was even much stronger than that of the Ninth Tribulations Realm.","He probably wouldn’t stay in the Northern Spacetime for long.","So he urgently wanted to enter the upper-tier spacetimes.","“Alright, we will go immediately!” The Abyssal Lord also completely accepted the idea.","Jian Wushuang would soon leave the Northern Spacetime.","After joining Qishen Temple, he might still be able to continue his carefree life.","Some of the early strong ones from the mid-tier spacetimes who joined Qishen Temple had now risen to high positions.","In Qishen Temple, strength was respected.","Although there were many factions, strength and hierarchy were still prioritized.","There was no such thing as family bloodlines.","If one’s strength was insufficient, even if they were the son of Qishen, it wouldn’t matter.","For example, some of the original divine generals had become Universe Masters, but if their strength was too weak, they would either be given an idle position in the lower-tier spacetimes or continue to strive in the upper-tier spacetimes. There was no such thing as people who just idled around.","With the Abyssal Lord’s strength, joining Qishen Temple, it wouldn’t be long before he became part of the higher echelons, or even the top tier.","He could once again enter the upper-tier spacetimes.","All the pressure was borne by Jian Wushuang.","Even if Jian Wushuang left in the future, his strength, coupled with the backing of Qishen Temple, would allow him to stand firm in the upper-tier spacetimes.","As for his own family!","There were only a few of them, and they needed to understand the importance of strength.","Always under his protection, they found it hard to grow.","Seeing the other party so cooperative, Jian Wushuang said nothing more. After entering the pyramid, he headed straight for the Giant Peak Spacetime.","Nowadays, the Giant Peak Spacetime had become the headquarters of Qishen Temple in the middle-tier spacetimes.","The main hall of the lower-tier spacetime was led by Zhen Ling.","Thus, the Qishen Temple in the middle-tier spacetimes was headed by Wu Zuo.","It was appropriate since Wu Zuo was a proper middle-tier spacetime cultivator.","Letting him take charge was the right decision.","Wu Zuo had taken control of seventy percent of the middle-tier spacetime.","The last remaining Abyssal Lord was also dealt with by Jian Wushuang.","Since then, Qishen Temple had mastered both the middle and lower-tier spacetimes.","They were about to impact the upper-tier spacetimes.","Buzz!","The pyramid tore through space and instantly entered the Giant Peak Spacetime.","Swish!","After walking out of the pyramid, Jian Wushuang glanced at the Giant Peak Spacetime. Although he knew the current foundation of Qishen Temple was terrifying, he couldn’t help but sigh when he saw it.","The entire Giant Peak Spacetime had more than twenty Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation level.","There were hundreds of Universe Masters at the Seventh Tribulation level.","The slightly weaker ones numbered in the thousands.","In the past, this could have swept through the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Unfortunately, Qishen Temple was not the only powerful side.","The entire Northern Spacetime was growing rapidly.","Just like Qishen Temple.","Rising again, becoming great again.","They had now achieved it.","If Shan Jun could see it, he might feel a bit relieved.","“Wu Zuo!”","He called softly.","A figure instantly appeared, and upon seeing him, his face lit up with joy. “I heard from Zhen Ling that you were on your way to the middle-tier spacetime, I didn’t expect you to arrive so quickly!”","“It’s all thanks to the pyramid you sponsored. Now it can easily burst into cosmic speeds, much faster than before!”","When Babata had initially crafted the pyramid, Wu Zuo had helped a lot, both financially and with efforts.","He never had the chance to thank him.","Hearing this, Wu Zuo quickly waved his hand and said, “This is nothing. I used to think your greatest achievement was eliminating Mie Sheng. Later, I realized your vision was the sharpest. You drove us out of Qishen Temple early on, leading to today’s glory!”","A grand gamble of millions of eras ago.","Most had accepted their loss.","But some were still dissatisfied.","Jian Wushuang went into seclusion, ignoring major and minor matters alike.","He didn’t properly teach his disciples.","But now?","Qishen Temple had become the overlord of the middle-tier spacetimes.","In time, it could take over the entire Northern Spacetime.","It could even advance towards the upper-tier spacetimes.","This was the biggest gain.","It also proved Jian Wushuang’s vision back then.","If they had stayed in the lower-tier spacetimes for stable development.","They wouldn’t have so many Eighth Tribulation level beings now.","He had opened a door for them.","“You’re too kind!”","“Come, let’s take a look at my territory. I’ll introduce you to some juniors. You’ve been in seclusion for millions of eras. How much has your strength grown? Among the juniors, there are now peak Eighth Tribulation level powerhouses. If you’re careless, you might get surpassed!” Wu Zuo said as he walked.","He still didn’t know that Jian Wushuang had already dealt with the Abyssal Lord easily."]},{"number":6129,"title":"Chapter 6129: Wu Zuo’s Surprise!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6129: Wu Zuo’s Surprise!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang simply nodded silently, not saying much. He was quite satisfied just watching the enthusiastic practitioners along the way.","“This one, the Golden Body Arhat, do you remember? He was once Hu Qing’s disciple and is now in the Eighth Tribulation realm!” Wu Zuo pointed to a golden ancient Buddha lecturing in a Dao Arena, introducing him.","The Golden Bodhisattva’s real name was Shi Nan.","During the Daoist Assembly, he had shown remarkable talent.","Now, he was the highest achiever among that batch of personal disciples.","As for Jian Wushuang’s three disciples, only Wan Shan had reached the Eighth Tribulation realm. However, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was still a significant burden for Wan Shan.","Moreover, he lacked the power of the Starry Sky, relying only on divine power.","The golden divine power was much inferior to the blue Starry Sky power.","After its display, the augmented divine power was also somewhat lacking, making him not particularly outstanding among the many in the Eighth Tribulation realm in Qishen Temple.","“By the way, look who this is?” Wu Zuo pointed to another dojo.","A woman in plain clothes was lecturing on swordsmanship.","It was Ji Tang.","Though she was in the Seventh Tribulation, she possessed combat power comparable to the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Walking with Wu Zuo around the hall, Jian Wushuang got a sense of the current foundation of Qishen Temple.","“Just watch, it won’t be long before we can take down the Abyssal Spacetime!” Wu Zuo envisioned the future with delight.","But at that moment, someone outside transmitted a message that all the Eighth Tribulation realm beings in the Abyssal Spacetime had suddenly gathered and arrived outside the Giant Peak Spacetime.","Wu Zuo was startled upon hearing this. Although he had reached the Eighth Tribulation realm, his combat power was inferior to that of the Abyssal Lord.","Moreover, Hu Qing was not in the middle-tier spacetimes, but fortunately, Jian Wushuang was here; otherwise, this time would be a huge loss.","“Brother Wushuang, I must ask for your help again. Hu Qing, he...”","Wu Zuo was about to explain something when Jian Wushuang interrupted by waving his hand and saying, “Let them in. They are already one of us.”","“One of us?”","The Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm guarding the formation outside also transmitted a message to Wu Zuo, saying that the Abyssal Lord had gathered dozens of Eighth Tribulation realm Universe Masters and was standing outside the formation, claiming to discuss matters regarding the upper-tier spacetimes!","This news excited Wu Zuo greatly. He looked at Jian Wushuang and asked excitedly, “When did you manage to settle them?”","Back then, even with Hu Qing’s help, he couldn’t take down the Abyssal Spacetime.","He knew the divine power of the Abyssal Lord exceeded 20 million.","Currently, the strongest few Eighth Tribulation realm Universe Masters in Qishen Temple only had divine power barely reaching 20 million.","They were no match for the Abyssal Lord.","Jian Wushuang had just entered the middle-tier spacetimes and managed to settle the Abyssal Lord without making a sound.","“Have you become an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master?”","Wu Zuo couldn’t see through Jian Wushuang’s realm and thought he might have reached the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Otherwise, no matter how strong he was, he couldn’t have settled the Abyssal Spacetime so quietly.","Could it be that he reasoned with the Abyssal Lord and persuaded him to surrender?","Having fought the Abyssal Lord for so long, Wu Zuo knew his temperament well and thought it was impossible for him to surrender easily.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “I have not yet passed the Tribulation. The Abyssal Lord is just a minor issue. Let them in, so we can discuss matters regarding the upper-tier spacetimes.”","“No problem!” Wu Zuo immediately gave the order to let the Abyssal Lord and his people in.","With Jian Wushuang present, he was not afraid of them causing any trouble.","Originally, when Zhen Ling informed him that Jian Wushuang was coming to the middle-tier spacetimes, Wu Zuo had planned to explain the complexities of this place.","Unexpectedly, in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, no matter how complicated things were, they seemed simple.","“Haha, Hall Master Wu Zuo, long time no see. Your strength has improved quite a bit!”","The Abyssal Lord, from a distance, loudly flattered.","But upon reaching Jian Wushuang, he turned and respectfully saluted.","Wu Zuo didn’t mind these formalities and invited everyone into the guest hall.","He also summoned all the high-ranking members of Qishen Temple to discuss the matters regarding the upper-tier spacetimes.","The upper-tier was different from the middle-tier.","Otherwise, Jian Wushuang would not have sought out Wu Zuo but would have directly attacked the upper-tier spacetimes.","Now, killing was different from before.","In the past, he would have simply killed his way through.","“Duanya Spacetime!”","The target proposed by Wu Zuo was quite different from what Jian Wushuang had in mind.","Duanya Spacetime was an incredibly powerful spacetime, on par with Ancient Moon Spacetime.","There were hundreds of experts at the Eighth Tribulation.","Among them, ten were super experts with divine power exceeding 20 million.","The top expert of Duanya Spacetime, the “Lord of Moya,” was rumored to be undergoing the Ninth Tribulation.","He might become the fourth Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation realm in Northern Spacetime.","Such a figure was not someone Jian Wushuang dared to provoke.","Moreover, this spacetime was qualified to be in the upper-tier spacetimes.","There was no need to seize Duanya Spacetime.","But Wu Zuo kept insisting.","Jian Wushuang sensed something was off, suspecting someone was behind the scenes.","A Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation realm was highly regarded by even the Realm King.","How could they allow internal conflict?","“Wu Zuo Hall Master, you might be going too far!” The Abyssal Lord thought Wu Zuo had gone mad.","Just because of Jian Wushuang’s presence, it didn’t mean they could do as they pleased.","Provoking Duanya Spacetime was no different from attacking an eternal power.","Even if Jian Wushuang conquered it, there would be future restrictions.","It would cause the superpowers of the upper-tier spacetimes to unite and besiege Qishen Temple.","This was something no one wanted to see.","The Abyssal Lord adjusted his breath, then turned to Jian Wushuang and advised, “Divine Lord Wushuang, what do you think?”","His proposal was in line with Jian Wushuang’s thoughts.","Both aimed to occupy Fallen Soul Spacetime.","It had weak foundations and power.","Its resources were relatively fewer.","But they could securely hold this position!","“Wu Zuo, if there’s anything, why not just say it? From now on, we’re all on the same side, no need to hide it!”","He knew Wu Zuo had some unspeakable difficulties. It was better to lay everything out rather than whispering behind his back, ensuring everyone’s confidence.","Now, almost only Wu Zuo supported attacking Duanya Spacetime.","Wu Zuo’s face darkened, he glanced at him, and sighed, “Brother Wushuang, it’s not that I don’t want to say it. This matter is very complicated. Let me put it this way, if we take down Moya Spacetime and kill the Lord of Moya, the Realm King will bestow treasures upon us!”","The Realm King!","Upon hearing this title.","The Abyssal Lord was stunned. He knew about the Realm King.","Once very mysterious, but since the barrier was lost, all gods descended together, enhancing the foundation of Northern Spacetime.","Many at the Eighth Tribulation knew of the existence of gods.","Furthermore, they knew that the Northern Spacetime Master was the “Realm King.”","So hearing the term “Realm King” left him astonished!","He didn’t expect Wu Zuo to have a connection with the Realm King.","Actually, this wasn’t a secret in the upper-tier spacetimes.","Only experts in the middle-tier spacetimes were less informed.","“Hall Master Wu Zuo, you mustn’t joke about this. You need to explain it properly!” Abyssal Lord became somewhat excited upon hearing about the Realm King.","He also grew curious about Wu Zuo’s identity.","The Eighth Tribulation realm experts following the Abyssal Lord were equally shocked, perking up their ears, eager to learn more."]},{"number":6130,"title":"Chapter 6130: Duanya Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 6130: Duanya Spacetime","In their eyes, they were just cultivators.","The gods were the truly exalted beings.","Revival Secret Technique!","Life Secret Technique!","Spacetime Barrier!","These things could be produced just by asking for them.","They were causing the entire Northern Spacetime to ascend.","To them, this was all too mysterious, and the information they knew was very limited.","That’s why they were so curious.","Jian Wushuang was different. When he heard that the Realm King would bestow treasures, he realized that this Duanya Spacetime must be entangled with things it shouldn’t be.","For instance, threats from the Realm King Continent!","Based on the intelligence he had, the Lord of Moya should also have a Realm King Token, being one of the first batch of eight Tribulation realm powerhouses to venture to the Realm King Continent.","Later, when the Great Tribulation descended, he had no choice but to undergo the Tribulation, but he still failed.","He became a Scattered Tribulation, until the Revival Secret Technique emerged.","He became a Universe Master once again.","This would be his second attempt to pass the Ninth Tribulation.","Yet, the Realm King wanted to eliminate the Lord of Moya.","This made perfect sense.","Something must have gone wrong!","“Explain!”","Wu Zuo remained silent. He couldn’t bring himself to explain.","Because it was embarrassing.","Of course, it was embarrassing for the Realm King.","But as a direct disciple of the Realm King, he had to share in that embarrassment.","So he was unwilling to speak.","Jian Wushuang just glanced at him, then slowly stood up, “I see, there’s no need for an explanation!”","Seeing Wu Zuo’s liver-colored face made it clear.","The Realm King must have stumbled and been outwitted.","This was also good!","It was legitimate!","“The Realm King commands: eliminate the traitors, capture Duanya Spacetime, kill the Lord","of Moya, and reward with the Realm King Token!”","Cleaning up for the Realm King was acceptable.","He had done such things more than once or twice.","But the benefits had to be clarified in advance.","The treasures for crossing the Ninth Tribulation had to be provided by the Realm King.","And some Realm King Tokens had to be given to those who contributed.","Duanya Spacetime wasn’t just one person’s territory.","Besides the Lord of Moya, there were many other super strong individuals.","Others had to contribute as well.","Currently, Qishen Temple could mobilize ten Universe Masters of Eighth Tribulations with divine power exceeding 15 million.","The Abyssal Lord naturally had to go as well.","If he wasn’t allowed to go, he would be anxious.","His divine power was already at 25 million, yet he hadn’t been to the Realm King Continent.","He knew the importance of the Realm King Token.","He stood up directly and volunteered to lead the charge.","“I’ll handle the Yin and Yang Elders of Duanya Spacetime!”","These two had divine power around twenty million each.","Hui Qing was currently in seclusion, striving for the ninth Tribulation and couldn’t spare the time.","Only the Abyssal Lord could handle them.","Wu Zuo took a deep breath and first sent a message to the Realm King, conveying Jian","Wushuang’s demands.","He waited for a reply.","He didn’t dare to agree in advance.","The hall remained silent for a long time before Wu Zuo’s expression softened, and he said,","“Then let’s set off immediately!”","“I’ll depart first, the pyramid is left for you all!”","He hadn’t been to the upper-tier spacetimes for a long time, and there were some old friends","to visit.","He left the pyramid to Wu Zuo and others, as his speed was not inferior to the pyramid.","This matter had to be resolved quickly, lest it drag on too long.","He was now close to reaching the eight Tribulations, only lacking the necessary treasures.","The Lord of Moya was in seclusion, striving for the Ninth Tribulation.","If delayed, the other party might succeed in crossing the Tribulation.","He didn’t doubt the other party’s success; anyone who made the Realm King bear such a grudge must have obtained something they shouldn’t have, or met someone they shouldn’t","have met.","His strength was not to be underestimated.","30 million at the minimum.","It might even surpass 30 million divine power.","Wu Zuo was astonished and said, “No need to be so hasty, why not go together...”","“There’s no need. You should also hurry and cultivate; otherwise, you’ll fall behind when you go to the Realm King Continent!” Jian Wushuang teased, then his figure began to disappear.","He left behind a triangular pyramid.","Whoosh!","After his figure completely disappeared, a buzzing sound resonated through spacetime.","Even after Jian Wushuang had left, the Abyssal Lord couldn’t help but exclaim, “The strength of the First Divine Lord is indeed unfathomable. Just in terms of speed, it probably surpasses the Ninth Tribulation!”","“Stop flattering and quickly arrange the people!” Wu Zuo said irritably. He had been contending with the Abyssal Lord for so long and had never shown him a good face.","The Abyssal Lord didn’t mind and simply turned to look at his subordinates and then said,","“All of you, go!”","Most of the people he brought along were those who had joined him halfway, all driven by","self-interest.","The Realm King’s Token was something everyone desired, so naturally, they all wanted to make contributions to earn it.","However, at Qishen Temple, there wasn’t such fierce competition.","As long as the divine power reached 20 million, Wu Zuo could request the Realm King’s Order directly from the Realm King without risking his life.","This was a personal favor between the Realm King and Wu Zuo, not a special treatment for","Qishen Temple.","In the upper-tier spacetimes, as long as one’s divine power reached 20 million, they would","also receive the Realm King Token, although the process might be slower.","Wu Zuo only needed to give a nod, making it much more convenient.","Therefore, he didn’t plan to bring too many people.","He only selected ten Universe Masters whose divine power exceeded 15 million.","In the upper-tier spacetimes, there was also a branch of Qishen Temple, though its scale was","small.","There were a few superpowerful beings in the eight Tribulation realm.","Among them was Jian Wushuang’s disciple, Wan Shan!","“The rest of you can prepare to head to the Duanya Spacetime and arrange for the integration into Qishen Temple!” Wu Zuo deliberately gave orders in front of the Abyssal Lord, then","turned around and said with a smile, “Brother Abyssal, there shouldn’t be any problem on","your side, right?”","Abyssal Lord shook his head upon hearing this.","No problem.","In the future, to obtain the Realm King’s Token, he would still have to rely on Wu Zuo.","Naturally, there wouldn’t be any issues.","Moreover, he had agreed, so he cooperated obediently.","“That’s good, that’s good!” Wu Zuo nodded in satisfaction and waved his hand, saying, “In","that case, let’s set off as well, and not fall too far behind Brother Wushuang!”","“Babata, activate the pyramid!”","Buzz!","Wu Zuo’s side made slight adjustments and also began advancing toward the upper-tier","spacetimes.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had already left the Giant Peak Spacetime.","His figure was like a towering mountain, walking through the long river of spacetime.","From time to time, tiny glimmers of light flashed by him.","Although the light seemed insignificant, each was a being of the Seventh Tribulation realm, and some were even Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm. However, compared to Jian Wushuang’s divine body, they were far inferior.","With his 40 million divine power fully unleashed, his speed indeed surpassed some of the","Ninth Tribulation realm beings.","“Jian Wushuang!”","A voice came from the depths of spacetime, a familiar voice that made Jian Wushuang’s eyes","brighten and his speed slow down.","“Realm King!”","The two consciousnesses met and smiled at each other.","“The matter of Duanya Spacetime will trouble you again this time!” The Realm King smiled","with a bit of embarrassment.","Troubling Jian Wushuang again made him feel somewhat uneasy.","He came over in advance and handed the treasure Jian Wushuang needed.","Jian Wushuang accepted it without hesitation and politely said, “Realm King, you speak too","highly. I am a cultivator of Northern Spacetime, and anyone who threatens Northern Spacetime threatens me. Naturally, I have to step forward to resolve this. However, what is the background of this Lord of Moya?”","“Lord of Moya!” The Realm King’s eyes held a trace of reminiscence, and he sighed deeply, “Actually, it’s also my fault!”","The memories converged into a scene, recounting some distant grievances in the Northern","Spacetime."]},{"number":6131,"title":"Chapter 6131: Who Will Give Me a Way Out?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6131: Who Will Give Me a Way Out?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Back in the Northern Spacetime, there were actually several Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation level with extremely high talent.","Among them was the Lord of Moya.","He was a strong figure of the same batch as Tian Cang and the other two ancient existences.","Moreover, their relationships were very good.","At that time, the strength of the Lord of Moya was even slightly stronger than the three ancient existences.","As their strength continued to grow, they also received some inheritances from the Realm King and later went to the Realm God Continent.","But it was at this time that the Lord of Moya began to change.","He witnessed the strength of the outside world.","He was unwilling to stay in the Northern Spacetime.","Only then did he learn that the cultivators of the Northern Spacetime could not pass the ninth Tribulation because their life levels were insufficient.","This realization had a significant impact on them at the time.","However, as their strength continued to grow, the Supreme Tribulation of the Origin Source was unavoidable.","One had to undergo the Tribulation, but failure was inevitable.","It would have been better if the Realm King hadn’t spoken, but once he did, everyone’s mindset changed.","Yet, they were powerless.","During that period, the four of them were disheartened and abandoned their ambitions.","They lost their fighting spirit.","The Realm King, feeling guilty, sought help from the Great Realm King and obtained three divine fruits that could stabilize the Origin Source and continuously suppress their realm.","Until the birth of the God of Life.","This created a special tier.","Ancient Beings!","Like the Universe Gods, without Tribulations, evading the Supreme Law?Rules.","But there were only three divine fruits.","The Realm King had no choice.","He had to set up trials.","In the first trial, a competition of combat strength, Moya came first!","In the second trial, a competition of divine power, he was still first!","But in the third trial of willpower, the Lord of Moya fell far behind the top three, even lagging behind the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation level.","The Realm King was very conflicted at first, but then he encountered a prophet from the divine realm.","An omniscient prophet from the Starry Sky.","From the prophet, the Realm King received three names.","It was clear to Jian Wushuang who these three were.","The Lord of Moya was not selected.","He could only face failure.","“I told him back then that when the resurrection secret method was revealed, he would be the first resurrected cultivator!” the Realm King sighed and shook his head.","Even the fact that Moya had lived for so many years was due to the Realm King using the power of Life to sustain him.","But the Lord of Moya still ended up on the wrong path.","Jian Wushuang sighed and said, “Different mindsets lead to wrong paths, I understand.”","The second time he crossed the Ninth Tribulation, the difficulty increased several times.","The Lord of Moya had been hanging on by the power of Life for these years, unable to accumulate Origin Source at all. After resurrection, he had to cultivate step by step again.","Time had worn down his patience.","All his patience had been used up waiting for the God of Life.","After resurrection, he couldn’t even cultivate in seclusion.","At that moment, he understood that he was finished.","His whole life was ruined.","No one could save him!","He watched helplessly as the three practitioners of his era, who were once inferior to him, all stepped into the Nine Tribulations realm, and the resentment hidden deep in his heart surfaced.","That mix of unwillingness and hatred drove the Lord of Moya onto a path of no return.","“Jian Wushuang, if possible, give him a way out!” Realm King sighed. Actually, he wasn’t wrong.","Because there was no other choice at that time.","If there had been four divine fruits, even if the prophet had said Moya was unsuitable, he would still have given him a divine fruit.","During the dark ages of the Northern Spacetime, it was these four dazzling Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulations realm that gave the Realm King hope.","He saw the glorious future of the Northern Spacetime through them.","His feelings for the four were special, so he didn’t want to see anyone fall.","Jian Wushuang, however, felt the Realm King was too soft-hearted and said sharply, “Lord Realm King, this matter has nothing to do with you. I still maintain that he poses a threat to the entire Northern Spacetime and doesn’t deserve another chance.”","Though his mindset had changed a lot now, even becoming bloodthirsty, he was not a saint!","Those who should be killed must be killed.","The Realm King had supported the Lord of Moya for so many years, only to be betrayed.","This ingrate must die!","If it were someone else, he might give the Realm King some face, but the Lord of Moya deserved to be executed!","“He’s also a pitiful person...” The Realm King wanted to say more, but Jian Wushuang interrupted him with a wave.","“I’m not Hu Qing, I face reality!”","If someone was truly forced, with a knife to their neck, he would cripple their Origin Source and divine body. If not, he would kill them.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered.","“Let’s go!”","He didn’t waste more words, his figure flashing continuously as he headed towards the upper-tier spacetimes.","He had a rough understanding of the Lord of Moya’s situation.","Betraying the Northern Spacetime?","This matter probably had something to do with Zamasu.","He couldn’t be careless.","He traveled at full speed, taking decades.","He arrived at the upper-tier spacetimes again.","The upper-tier spacetimes had changed a lot compared to before.","There were spacetime-level continents or secret realms everywhere.","And some very large universes.","He didn’t stop along the way, contacted the Qishen Temple branch stationed in Duanya Spacetime, learned the exact location, and set off again.","At the same time, he notified Wu Zuo and the Abyssal Lord.","He informed them of the situation in Duanya Spacetime.","If it was indeed related to Zamasu, even he would be in danger.","Not to mention Wu Zuo and Abyssal Lord.","To be safe, he also contacted Divine Wood King.","As an ancient master of the Eighth Tribulations realm, after resurrection, his foundation was very strong.","With the treasures bestowed by Realm King, his current strength was among the top ten in the Northern Spacetime.","From their conversation, he learned that the Divine Wood King was now the Guardian Leader of the Ancient Moon Sect.","His status was almost on par with the Ancient Moon Pope.","Hearing that Jian Wushuang was going to eliminate the traitors of the Northern Spacetime, he immediately gathered ten Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulations realm, each with divine power of 15 million.","They rushed straight to Duanya Spacetime.","With Jian Wushuang leading, he naturally had no worries.","He was just going to get some benefits and catch up with Jian Wushuang.","He had met Hu Qing and felt inferior. Hu Qing told him Jian Wushuang was even stronger.","This made him curious about how strong Jian Wushuang was, daring to go alone to kill the Lord of Moya, while he was only responsible for dealing with the weaker ones outside.","Actually, Jian Wushuang was worried about the experts on the Qishen Temple’s side.","He feared that if something went wrong, without support, they would be besieged by the powerful ones in Duanya Spacetime.","For so many years, it hadn’t been easy for the Qishen Temple to accumulate these resources, which were the result of Wu Zuo and others’ hard work. They couldn’t afford to lose such strong individuals due to a reckless move.","Asking Divine Wood King for help was just a matter of sharing some treasures.","Treasures could be fought for, but once people were lost, they were truly gone.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s body shook and he stopped.","The surrounding spacetime began to collapse.","“Hanying Villa!”","This was the Qishen Temple’s branch in Duanya Spacetime.","The upper-tier spacetimes were originally under Hu Qing’s responsibility, and the headquarters was set in Fallen Soul Spacetime.","The early targets were the same, all in Fallen Soul Spacetime.","Although they didn’t have large territories in the upper-tier spacetimes, they occupied many universes and secret realms within some spacetimes.","This depended on the strength of the spacetime."]},{"number":6132,"title":"Chapter 6132: Sudden Change of Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6132: Sudden Change of Plan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Duanya Spacetime could rank in the top five.","Now, it was even stronger than the Eternal Spacetime and was vaguely the first.","Therefore, Qishen Temple’s branch in Duanya Spacetime was very small.","It was just a small territory in a narrow crack in Duanya Mountain, a reward from the Lord of Moya after killing a demon lord of Duanya Spacetime.","The powerful figure stationed here was none other than someone very familiar with Jian Wushuang.","“Lord Guangying!” Jian Wushuang slowly descended.","A figure had already been waiting here.","Lord Guangying looked solemn and said in a low voice, “Jian Wushuang!”","It was indeed too sudden.","In just 100 years, Qishen Temple’s plan had undergone significant changes.","From initially focusing on the Fallen Soul Spacetime to changing it to Duanya Spacetime, it had taken less than 100 years!","This rendered many of the planned arrangements futile.","Qishen Temple’s layout in Fallen Soul Spacetime was extensive.","After Hu Qing went into seclusion, Wu Tian personally went to Fallen Soul Spacetime to oversee it. The direct force, Wujian Sect, had infiltrated Fallen Soul Spacetime for millions of eras.","Now, they suddenly announced an attack on Duanya Spacetime.","Many people were unaware of this matter.","Even Lord Guangying, who was stationed in Duanya Spacetime, had just found out.","How could he not be anxious?","As soon as Jian Wushuang arrived, he was pulled into a secret room, and layers of barriers were set up!","Only then did Lord Guangying dare to ask, “What exactly happened? It’s hard to say on the way; you need to explain it to me now!”","“It’s a long story!”","“Then make it short!” Lord Guangying appeared very angry.","Qishen Temple had reached its current position through years of effort, and the sense of belonging had long been maximized.","Marching into the upper-tier spacetimes had been a set plan for years. They had been infiltrating Fallen Soul Spacetime, turning one-third of its high-level officials. Suddenly changing the strategy was hard for many to accept.","Lord Guangying had been stationed in Moya Spacetime for many years, mainly to stabilize the high-level officials there.","When Qishen Temple attacked the upper-tier spacetimes, the remaining eight major spacetimes would certainly not sit idly by. Anyone could see Qishen Temple’s ambition, and maybe they would be the next target.","Currently, the three Great Eternal Realms had tacitly approved.","This was because of Wu Zuo’s influence.","Then there was the Ancient Moon Spacetime. Jian Wushuang had some connections with the Ancient Moon Pope, and with the guarantee of Divine Wood King, there were no objections.","Moya Spacetime was also a target for alliance.","The combined strength of the other three spacetimes was average, so intimidation was sufficient.","Lord Guangying’s mission here was significant. He had been wooing those high-level officials for years, and now that they were planning to attack Moya Spacetime, knowing Moya Spacetime’s strength, he couldn’t sit still.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were the only ones who could handle the two supreme powerhouses, not to mention the Lord of Moya himself.","Their peak combat power was simply insufficient.","When the time came, the Lord of Moya and his two protectors would restrain Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, leaving the other powerhouses free to flatten Qishen Temple.","Moreover, Hu Qing was currently in seclusion, striving to break through to the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Lord of Moya was also in seclusion, attempting to break through to the Ninth Tribulation realm.","No matter what, they had to wait until both of them succeeded.","The best-case scenario was for the Lord of Moya to fail while Hu Qing succeeded. This would simplify matters considerably.","Qishen Temple could directly become an eternal power.","They could break the current structure of the Northern Spacetime early and crush the Lord of Moya.","But this possibility was extremely slim.","Even Jian Wushuang, who knew the inside story, thought it was impossible, let alone Lord Guangying, who didn’t.","It wasn’t that they didn’t recognize Hu Qing’s talent, but he had just entered seclusion, and it was impossible for him to emerge so soon. The shortest time estimated was a million eons, and the longest was indefinite.","Hu Qing had only been in seclusion for a few days!","Lord of Moya, on the other hand, had been in seclusion for tens of thousands of eons.","With the treasures given by Zamasu, he might be close to succeeding.","Even if he hadn’t succeeded, his current strength was terrifying.","Conventional wisdom estimated his power to be over 30 million, and with Zamasu’s help, it couldn’t be measured by normal standards, starting at 35 million.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved. After hearing Lord Guangying’s analysis, he felt he had been a bit reckless, but the arrow was already on the bow and had to be shot.","He then revealed the truth to Lord Guangying.","Realm King’s Tokens were minor.","The threat from Zamasu was significant.","“What?” Lord Guangying was incredulous and asked, “We can’t handle this on our own; we must mobilize other forces!”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned awkward. After a dry cough, he said, “Guangying, we can’t let outsiders know about this. Otherwise, when the Duanya Spacetime is vacated, who do you think will claim it?”","“But...” Lord Guangying looked troubled.","He was right; the Duanya Spacetime would definitely be divided among the major powers, and they wouldn’t get much.","If they wanted to have it all, they needed to show some sincerity.","Of course, Jian Wushuang had mainly been careless, thinking he could handle it alone, along with the Abyssal Lord and others.","He hadn’t anticipated the complexity of the situation.","Moreover, the treasures offered by the Realm King were exactly what he needed to survive the Eighth Tribulation!","Realm King knew his Tribulation was unique and had prepared many rare treasures.","His life force was no longer as unique as it used to be.","To gather such treasures again, he would have to struggle.","Who knew how long that would take?","This was a fast track.","Not only could he eliminate Zamasu’s minions, but he could also obtain the treasures for the Eighth Tribulation. Why not?","On a larger scale, this was a threat to the Northern Spacetime that had to be eliminated.","Lord Guangying saw his determination and said, “Are you sure you can handle it alone?”","“Don’t worry!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He had prepared well. He would disguise his aura, and they wouldn’t recognize him immediately.","Then, he could deplete the resources of the Duanya Spacetime, making it easier for Wu Zuo and others to take over.","Otherwise, they couldn’t handle the strong ones in the Duanya Spacetime.","“In that case...” Lord Guangying’s eyes gleamed as he thought of a brilliant plan. “You should go to the Moya Mountains and create a big disturbance. Then I’ll enter the core of the Duanya Spacetime under the pretense of aiding them and deliver a heavy blow from behind!”","Hiss!","Jian Wushuang felt a chill down his spine.","Dozens of Eighth Tribulation peak powerhouses suddenly attacking the Duanya Spacetime’s strong ones would be spectacular.","He had thought Lord Guangying had mellowed over the years, but it turned out he was fiercer than Jian Wushuang himself.","“By the way, inform the Realm King. Once we act, seal off the Duanya Spacetime to prevent others from taking advantage of the situation!”"]},{"number":6133,"title":"Chapter 6133: Begin","paragraphs":["Chapter 6133: Begin","Lord Guangying mobilized the powerful beings of the Northern Spacetime, planning every step meticulously.","This time, aside from the experts from Qishen Temple, Jian Wushuang had also informed Divine Wood King, the second-in-command of the Ancient Moon Sect, who could lend a hand. For him, it was a free helper, and the reward would be given by Realm King.","Moreover, the Realm King had also dispatched strong individuals from Tiancang Palace to assist.","With the experts from Qishen Temple, it was nearly enough.","Duanya Spacetime.","Above Moya Palace.","A cold current swept across the sky, cutting through the dark mountains.","This place was named Duanya Spacetime for a reason.","It was a cliff moved here from the Realm God Continent.","Moya Palace, established by the Lord of Moya, was located above the cliff.","Jian Wushuang transformed into the night, revealing only a pair of blue eyes.","Hidden in the night sky, no one could detect his presence.","Wait!","After leaving Lord Guangying, he had been lurking here, waiting for the Lord’s orders.","He was also waiting for the army to assemble.","Wu Zuo and Abyssal Lord, along with their men, had almost reached the upper-tier spacetimes.","Divine Wood King was already in the upper-tier spacetimes and had now arrived outside Duanya Spacetime, accompanied by the Blood Demon Hall Master of Tian Cang Palace.","This Blood Demon Hall Master was once a super-powerful being at the Eighth Tribulation level. Due to Jian Wushuang, he had once gone to the Realm God Continent. He had reached the limit of the Eighth Tribulation level and was preparing to break through to the Ninth Tribulation if not for the Realm King’s mobilization.","These two super beings had divine power exceeding 25 million, possibly reaching 30 million.","“Lord Guangying, I have arrived!”","“Guangying!”","After the two arrived at the designated location, Lord Guangying in the secret chamber of the villa revealed his face through the dim light. He did not respond to the two but silently transmitted a message to Jian Wushuang.","“Take action!”","The voice echoed in Jian Wushuang’s mind. This was the opportunity he had been waiting for! Buzz!","His eyes opened, and the divine power in the surrounding world was instantly absorbed by his terrifying devouring force.","It shook the entire sky!","“Kill!”","With a simple word, he exuded an overwhelming sense of oppression.","Moya Palace.","The most powerful force in Duanya Spacetime, ruling the region for countless ages.","In an instant, the divine power was drained, and the weaker emperors could barely maintain themselves with their Origin Source.","However, the Universe Masters with extremely strong divine power were in trouble, nearly suffocating.","Fortunately, the divine power stored in the Origin Source Universe quickly replenished their divine bodies.","In just a moment.","The numerous strong individuals in Moya Palace had just reacted when they saw a towering figure in the sky, already swinging a fist towards Moya Palace.","“Heavens!” A Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation level who had grown up in Moya Palace exclaimed in disbelief at the scene, as if in a dream.","Even in his dreams, he never thought that one day a divine demon would attack Moya Palace.","Boom!","The divine demon’s giant fist struck down on Moya Palace.","The endlessly powerful formation began to crackle and snap.","Even the ordinary Tribulation level beings could sense that the formation would not hold for long.","This time, the high-level Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters finally reacted.","“Bold!”","“Who dares?”","“Who dares to act recklessly in Duanya Spacetime!”","In an instant, several angry shouts erupted simultaneously.","A total of 6 Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters, each with divine power around 20 million.","Swish!","The six strong individuals from Moya Palace instantly appeared in the sky.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s exposed divine power was about 25 million.","“Hmm?” He frowned, “The two Guardian Gods didn’t come out?”","With such a commotion, even if it didn’t draw out the Lord of Moya, it should have at least brought out the two Guardian Gods!","Based on the intelligence from Lord Guangying, the two Guardian Gods were last seen returning to Duanya Spacetime a few years ago. They had emerged from a super secret realm in the upper-tier spacetimes.","At that time, Lord Guangying was curious about why the two Guardian Gods had returned so","suddenly.","After learning that the Lord of Moya was involved with Zamasu, he speculated that they had returned to protect the Lord of Moya.","Now that Jian Wushuang had caused such a commotion without drawing out the two Guardian Gods, it was likely that the Lord of Moya’s Tribulation site was not in Moya Palace!","Or perhaps they did not think highly of him.","They believed that the 6 Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulations level could handle him.","They underestimated him greatly.","“Ha!”","Jian Wushuang transformed into a towering divine demon, battling six of them alone.","He did not use the Wanjie Sword but wielded two broadswords, the most suitable weapons for a divine demon.","“Who are you to dare attack Moya Palace? Do you know that the three eternal forces are allied","with Moya Palace?”","Boom!","Jian Wushuang ignored them, swinging his broadswords and relentlessly attacking the six, like a mindless beast.","He overwhelmed the Universe Masters, even distracting himself to destroy the formation of","Moya Palace.","Crack!","After thousands of attacks, although they didn’t land in one spot, they still shattered the formation of Moya Palace.","Instantly, countless figures flew out of Moya Palace.","Most of the weaker ones were taken into the pocket dimensions of the Universe Masters,","leaving only the Universe Masters of Fifth Tribulations level fleeing.","The Universe Masters of Eighth Tribulations level stayed behind.","As the formation of Moya Palace shattered, an even more majestic divine demon stood up","from within the palace.","It was a formation.","At least 18 Universe Masters formed it.","All of them were of the Eighth Tribulation level. Individually, their divine power might not be significant, but combined, their divine power soared to 26 million.","They were determined to stop Jian Wushuang.","“Still not coming out?” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly.","He initially thought that after breaking Moya Palace, the two Guardian Gods would come out,","no matter what.","He didn’t expect them to remain so calm.","So he couldn’t be blamed for bullying the weak.","Swish!","The divine demon he had transformed into instantly dissolved, and countless divine powers","returned to the heavens and the earth.","Jian Wushuang, clad in black armor and wearing a mask, stood proudly in the void. He reverted to his true form and lightly pointed. A blue light instantly tore through spacetime,","piercing the formation that had just been established.","Boom!","A thunderous explosion shook the heavens and the earth.","The 6 Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation level who had previously besieged Jian","Wushuang held their breath.","“He still hid his divine power!”","The divine power Jian Wushuang had just unleashed was only over 20 million, enough to","easily suppress the 6 Universe Masters with 20 million divine power each, but not enough to","deal with the formation of the divine demon.","This time, by disguising his aura and revealing his true form.","He defeated the divine demon with just one finger.","“It’s over. Inform the palace master and the Guardian Gods!”","Knowing it was futile, they didn’t stay to fight.","They scattered and fled.","Jian Wushuang’s target wasn’t these people, so he didn’t bother with them.","Instead, he waited for those hidden eyes to open.","Buzz!","An ancient aura emanated from above the cliff.","Jian Wushuang’s expression darkened."]},{"number":6134,"title":"Chapter 6134: Three Ninth Tribulation Realm Cultivators","paragraphs":["Chapter 6134: Three Ninth Tribulation Realm Cultivators","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That aura did not belong to one person!","But three!","Three ancient auras erupted simultaneously.","Each one had divine power exceeding 30 million.","Every one of them was in the Ninth Tribulation.","This time, it was Jian Wushuang who found it hard to believe.","Originally, he wondered if the Lord of Moya could even reach the Ninth Tribulation, but unexpectedly, even the two Guardian Gods had become Universe Masters in the Ninth Tribulation.","It was difficult!","“How could this be?” He was only slightly surprised and then immediately informed Lord Guangying.","Go!","No!","Escape!","“Quick, run!”","“Don’t worry about the others, just leave Duanya Spacetime first!”","Suddenly, there were three more Universe Masters in the Ninth Tribulation.","Even the Realm King didn’t know; it was evidently Zamasu’s scheme.","What seemed like a sure thing turned out like this.","Had he known, he would have waited until he had passed the Eighth Tribulation before coming.","Now his divine power was too strained to deal with three Ninth Tribulation beings.","Even at his peak state, with 40 million divine power, it was still very difficult.","Because he didn’t know how much divine power the other party possessed.","Anyone associated with Zamasu couldn’t be underestimated.","Upon hearing his urgent voice, Lord Guangying did not hesitate. He took a few trusted followers and directly tore through spacetime to leave Duanya Spacetime.","Although he didn’t know what had happened, the moment that powerful threat emerged, he couldn’t help but tremble.","It was definitely a super strong being in the Ninth Tribulation.","He had once witnessed the battle between Broly and Mie Sheng.","After so many years of cultivation, he himself had reached the complete state of the Eighth Tribulation and could roughly sense it.","The divine power contained in that aura, though not as terrifying as Broly’s, was still much stronger than Jian Wushuang back then.","The reason they could defeat Broly and Mie Sheng was due to the fusion of Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing. Otherwise, for them, those two threats were like an insurmountable mountain.","Now, the threatening power once again invaded this spacetime.","Lord Guangying didn’t dare think much.","He immediately sent a message to Wu Zuo and the other strong ones preparing to enter Duanya Spacetime.","Now, it depended on whether Jian Wushuang could hold on.","The original three Ancient Beings, after becoming Ninth Tribulation beings, had left Northern Spacetime.","It wasn’t possible for them to return so easily.","Now only Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing could hold them off.","But Hu Qing was still in seclusion!","Still at the critical moment of crossing the Ninth Tribulation, no one dared to disturb Hu Qing.","The Realm King was the same.","His Northern Spacetime had three new Universe Masters in the Ninth Tribulation, which should have been a good thing, but unexpectedly, they were three enemies.","“Who are they!” The Realm King clenched his fist, turning his head to look towards the end of the upper-tier spacetimes.","He always felt that Zamasu’s people were hiding in Northern Spacetime, which was why they were being plotted against repeatedly.","And this time, three Ninth Tribulation beings suddenly emerged.","Fortunately, Northern Spacetime had stabilized.","If they were hiding, they might still cause some damage.","But now that he had discovered them, they were no longer much of a threat.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t handle it alone, but he could arrange for Tian Cang and others to quickly return to Northern Spacetime.","It was no longer as passive as before.","“Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing!” The Realm King’s profound eyes sparkled.","These two were the future pillars of his Northern Spacetime.","And there were also Wu Zuo, Wutian, and Divine Wood King; all of them would grow to the Ninth Tribulation, or even become Universe Gods.","At that time, he wouldn’t fear Zamasu.","Especially Jian Wushuang!","Once he reached Universe God and merged with Hu Qing, that power!","He could hardly imagine it; the gods would all kneel.","Just like when they had beaten Mie Sheng brutally.","What if the gods merged?","They would still fall.","Thinking of this, Realm King clasped his hands behind his back and muttered to himself, “The secret fusion technique, I wonder if Great Realm King has it!”","This kind of thing should always be on hand!","Unfortunately, after inquiring, his heart sank.","This secret technique was only possessed by the Realm God.","Only when the next Realm God appeared would another piece be added.","In other words, Zamasu didn’t have it either; only the current Realm God had it.","Of course, since it could be created, there would naturally be one somewhere in the Starry Sky, but at his level as a Realm King, he couldn’t reach it.","Maybe he could ask Zhen Ling; perhaps he could get it.","But that was for later.","In Duanya Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, tearing off his disguise, revealing his true form.","His blue hair fluttered, and the Wanjie Tribulations Sword on his back hummed.","Ready to be unsheathed at any moment.","Facing three Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters was indeed tricky.","One sword strike might not be enough!","“It’s you!” A voice of anger echoed from the depths of the Moya Palace.","The voice was not from the Lord of Moya.","Jian Wushuang had stopped disguising himself because there was no need.","The strongest sword in the entire Northern Spacetime was with him.","Once he drew his sword, he would be recognized, so why hide?","Moreover, since Guangying’s plan had been destroyed, he was left to face the entire Duanya Spacetime alone, making concealment even less necessary.","“Jian Wushuang!”","A robust voice came from the Moya Palace, followed by three streams of light breaking through the mountains and rushing out from the secret chamber.","“Lord of Moya!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head without any panic.","Facing three Ninth Tribulation masters, he had this confidence.","Even after surviving the tribulation, the regular divine power of a Ninth Tribulation master was only about 30 million.","At most, 35 million.","What was the concept of surpassing 40 million?","It was already at the demigod threshold.","Perhaps they underestimated the demigod threshold; on the Realm God Continent, a demigod generally required 45 million.","In the Starry Sky, it would be around 50 million.","A Universe God might need over 100 million divine power.","He didn’t think these three lackeys could be that strong.","The Lord of Moya, leading the group, stared at Jian Wushuang. He didn’t know much about this rising star, but he learned from Zamasu that Jian Wushuang was extraordinary, with divine power exceeding 30 million.","And he was still a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","This shocked him even more.","Although his expression was cold and severe, at this moment, he didn’t want to cause more trouble. Betraying the Northern Spacetime was for power, not for face. Even if his lair was destroyed, he could rebuild it.","So, upon seeing Jian Wushuang, he forced a smile and said ambiguously, “Friend, our Moya Palace has always respected your Qishen Temple. What brings you here today?”","He knew a lot about Qishen Temple, but it was out of resentment.","Because of Wu Zuo!","Wu Zuo was the disciple of the Realm King.","So he hated!","Why wasn’t he chosen back then?","If he had been chosen, he wouldn’t have betrayed the Northern Spacetime.","So he hated the Realm King.","Ruined his path to cultivation.","Hated the weakness of the Northern Spacetime.","Wished he could be reborn in another spacetime.","At this time, Zamasu noticed him and made him a pawn.","Jian Wushuang knew the general situation of the Lord of Moya.","The story of the Lord of Moya was straightforward.","Lacking mental strength, even if he became an ancient existence, he might not withstand the birth of the God of Life."]},{"number":6135,"title":"Chapter 6135: Who Will Return My Cultivation Path?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6135: Who Will Return My Cultivation Path?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He might betray the Northern Spacetime halfway through.","Besides, the Realm King hadn’t treated him badly!","He had been provided with the best food and drink.","Yet, in the end, he chose to betray them.","He deserved to die!","“My enmity with you is immense!” Jian Wushuang didn’t hide his feelings. He pressed his hand lightly on the sword’s hilt and said coldly, “Do you know Zamasu?”","Hearing this name, the Lord of Moya was taken aback. Just as he was about to retort, his gaze turned cold.","Whoosh!","The phantom of the Realm King descended beside Jian Wushuang.","That resentment filled the will of the Lord of Moya.","Since that one time, he hadn’t seen the Realm King again.","All the treasures had been given to the Lord of Moya through Tian Cang and others.","Seeing him again now, they were mortal enemies.","It had always been this way!","If he had cut off his path of cultivation, what else could they be but mortal enemies?","“Moya!” The Realm King’s voice carried guilt as he said softly, “It’s still not too late to turn back. Go to the Realm King Continent, and from then on, we owe each other nothing!”","The Lord of Moya’s eyes widened in anger, and he pointed at himself with a trembling finger, shouting, “Owe each other nothing? Who will repay my path of cultivation?”","“Arrogant!” Jian Wushuang’s gaze turned cold. “Moya, this is the chance the Realm King is giving you. If you don’t seize it, today will be your death!”","“Hahaha!!!”","The Lord of Moya laughed maniacally at Jian Wushuang’s words. “When did it become your turn to speak, junior? You’re just a dog beside Realm King, yet you’re feeling self-satisfied. You, a lower-tier creature, do you think you have the right to speak to me just because you’ve gained some inheritance?”","“Moya!”","Realm King was also enraged, glaring at the other.","“What?” Moya was slightly surprised. “Did I say something wrong?”","Back then, he was just like Jian Wushuang, staying by Realm King’s side.","Yet he faced that kind of choice.","If he hadn’t been better than Tian Cang and the others back then, he would have willingly cut off his cultivation path.","He even had thoughts of giving up his position after the competition ended.","But he never expected Realm King to make such a choice!","“Back then, I only had three!” Realm King gritted his teeth and said, “You can blame me, but this has nothing to do with the Northern Spacetime, or those cultivators! I don’t know why you’ve become like this, but you’d better not believe Zamasu’s words!”","The Lord of Moya’s body trembled slightly. After taking a deep breath, he said excitedly to the Realm King, “That’s why I hate you, and I hate this world even more. But those were my choices. However, it was you who cut off my path of cultivation, your choice!”","“I’ve never believed Zamasu’s words, but he can make me stronger, and that’s enough!” The Lord of Moya’s aura began to surge, demonstrating his divine power. He then turned to Jian Wushuang, his voice icy, “Creature from the lower tiers, don’t think that just because you’ve gained some inheritance you can disregard everything. Today, I’ll show you how capable I am!”","Buzz!","As soon as he finished speaking.","The Lord of Moya raised his hand and condensed a light wave, directly piercing through the phantom of Realm King.","The projection was in the void, and that void was destroyed by the Lord of Moya, causing the Realm King to disappear from Duanya Spacetime.","There was no need for him to come again.","He just wanted to give the other a chance.","Since he didn’t heed the advice, everything was left to Jian Wushuang.","Facing the attack from the Lord of Moya, Jian Wushuang didn’t stop him.","He thought that the Realm King’s presence would only waste his time with unnecessary chatter.","It was better to eliminate the opponent quickly; he still had to face the Eighth Tribulation!","“Finally some peace. If you don’t make a move soon, I might have to.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, exerting a bit of force with his arm. The azure blade was already drawn from his back.","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword was unsheathed, and the surrounding spacetime instantly turned blue.","A powerful aura filled the entire Duanya Spacetime.","It seemed like it might break again.","“Hmm?” The Lord of Moya was momentarily stunned. That terrifying aura made him feel dazed.","40 million divine power was just Jian Wushuang’s peak divine power.","But if you were to talk about his strongest means, it would still be his Sword Dao.","As soon as this indestructible aura emerged.","The well-versed Lord of Moya instantly understood the gap.","“Are you capable of fighting well or just taking a beating?”","Jian Wushuang sneered, his sword shadow dancing with his body.","An indescribable, stunning sword shadow erupted from the Wanjie Sword Tomb.","“Today, I’ll let you experience the Tenth Tribulation!”","Buzz!","The sword shadow hummed!","“Spacetime Reincarnation!”","The strongest sword move.","No extra display, just that simple.","“Form the array!” The Lord of Moya roared angrily, his divine power surging to its peak, but it was only around 38 million.","Even if he succeeded in overcoming the Tribulation, he would only be on par with Tian Cang and the others.","The two Guardian Gods, who had just reacted, also erupted simultaneously.","Their divine power was about 35 million each.","The three formed an array, their divine power slightly over 40 million.","Not to mention whether they had the time or not, even if they did, they couldn’t stop Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword move now.","The fifth sword move was his peak.","As for the sixth sword move, he couldn’t use it at all.","Back then, when he transformed, he could barely use it.","At that time, the Origin Source he could mobilize was immensely powerful.","He was already at the level of a Universe Master.","Now, he couldn’t even reach the demigod level; he was still far from it!","Of course, to deal with 3 Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters, the sixth sword move wasn’t necessary.","That was for slaying gods.","Spacetime Reincarnation.","First, spacetime was sealed, and time slowed down.","The sword shadow seemed slow.","But it made the opponents feel incredibly fast.","So fast that they couldn’t react.","It was about to end.","The sword shadow cut through spacetime, piercing the Lord of Moya’s divine body.","Time then slowed down.","Then came reincarnation.","From death to life!","Then from life, to death!","“Poof!”","The Lord of Moya spat out a mouthful of brown blood, staring at Jian Wushuang in disbelief. His voice trembled as he spoke, “What kind of sword technique is this?”","“Spacetime!”","“Reincarnation!”","“No wonder... I lost without grievance!” At this moment, the Lord of Moya no longer had any bravado or resentment; instead, he was completely relieved.","This was the power of the Spacetime Reincarnation.","Some could comprehend the true meaning of life and death from this sword.","Others could understand the mysteries of time and space from it.","One sword strike, two lifetimes!","“Moya, you are a practitioner from the Northern Spacetime. Even if you lose your Origin Source, you will return to the Northern Spacetime. But because you are involved with Zamasu, your Origin Source will not return to the Northern Spacetime; it will be completely obliterated by me. Moreover, your soul will shatter, and you will never be able to reincarnate!”","To make the other party understand the despair of betrayal, Jian Wushuang spoke each word deliberately.","This was the consequence of betraying the Northern Spacetime.","In fact, the Realm King had not given such orders, but he intended to do so.","To prevent future imitators.","With more and more powerful beings from the Northern Spacetime heading to the Realm God Continent, it was inevitable that some would be swayed by Zamasu.","Therefore, he had to make an example out of them. This incident would certainly be made public in the future."]},{"number":6136,"title":"Chapter 6136: Venomous Trick!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6136: Venomous Trick!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The life force within the Lord of Moya had already begun to wane, unable to last even a quarter of an hour. Hearing this outcome, his face showed no sign of distress; instead, he laughed.","Jian Wushuang thought that Moya was going to go mad.","But at this moment, madness was futile. His divine body and Origin Source were shattered, his Life force was ebbing away, and any movement might cause his soul to disperse completely.","“Do you think this will make me afraid?” The Lord of Moya shook his head with pride.","Jian Wushuang frowned, too lazy to waste words on a dying man, simply stating the cold reality, “You think Zamasu will have your back?”","“Aren’t you striving to become stronger?”","“But from now on, you will be completely annihilated, forever despised by the entire Northern Spacetime, the first to betray it!”","“Your people, your disciples, your sect will all be obliterated!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t know if the other had considered these consequences; he was reminding him!","The Lord of Moya, however, grew more composed. “You’ve said it all: I will never be reborn, my soul will scatter. No matter how much you say, you can’t harm me!”","“Have you ever thought about why you did all this?” Jian Wushuang, without realizing it, began to engage with a dying man, his own mindset becoming unsettled.","He didn’t realize that he was already falling into a trap.","If Jian Wushuang thought more, he would understand.","Back when he defeated Broly and killed Mie Sheng, what a great feat it was.","How could Zamasu arrange for 3 Ninth Tribulation experts to deal with the Northern Spacetime?","Wasn’t that just sending them to their deaths?","Even if they took advantage of Hu Qing’s seclusion, they couldn’t threaten the Northern Spacetime!","Such an obvious insertion must have had ulterior motives.","This was an open scheme!","A blatantly open scheme, but Realm King and Jian Wushuang thought it was a conspiracy.","The Lord of Moya, about to fall, understood everything from a single sword.","He looked at Jian Wushuang with pitiful eyes, saying word by word, “For... for the chance to make a choice!”","A choice!","An opportunity to make a choice.","He had fantasized about that chance.","If one day, he needed to choose a person.","That person would be Realm King.","He wouldn’t hesitate.","He wanted Realm King to understand that he had made the wrong choice back then.","He was the best.","Realm King chose wrongly.","That opportunity was ultimately a fantasy.","In reality, however... such an opportunity was indeed presented before him.","“Ridiculous!” Jian Wushuang raised his sword, intending to end the other’s life completely.","Suddenly, he felt a shadow envelop his mind, making him very uncomfortable.","Now, he just wanted to deal with the other party and quickly pass the Tribulation.","“Wait!” The Lord of Moya called out to Jian Wushuang, who was about to act. He looked at Jian Wushuang, and a deliberate sense of resentment and unwillingness appeared in his eyes.","Because he knew Zamasu’s plan was a decoy.","The ultimate goal was to break Jian Wushuang’s mindset.","Although he had taken the other’s benefits, at the moment of death, he still chose the Northern Spacetime.","He chose Realm King.","He didn’t continue with what he originally planned to say but instead showed fear and unwillingness.","This gave Jian Wushuang some mental comfort.","“I regret it!” Tears fell from the Lord of Moya’s eyes as he said excitedly, “Jian Wushuang, don’t destroy my soul. I will tell you the ultimate secret of the Northern Spacetime, one even Realm King doesn’t know!”","This statement indeed caught Jian Wushuang’s attention, and his sword stopped.","It wasn’t because of what was said, but because the other showed a satisfied expression, and then stopped.","His mindset gradually stabilized.","As for the secret, he disdained it.","What hadn’t Jian Wushuang seen? He had been to the Starry Sky, seen the Star Spirit.","Northern Spacetime!","What secret could the Northern Spacetime have?","He merely enjoyed the other’s expression of unwillingness and resentment.","“Speak well, if your words please me, I might shatter your soul and let you be reborn, giving you a chance to merge in the future. But by that time, I will probably be the god you look up to, and you will never be able to make any waves!”","Lord of Moya’s face trembled, but he smiled bitterly in his heart. A dying man had to worry about the person who was about to kill him.","“The ultimate secret of Northern Spacetime lies at the end of the upper-tier spacetimes. You will understand everything once you go there. Also, be careful of Zamasu!”","“Be careful of Zamas...”","These were the last words left by Lord of Moya. Jian Wushuang then carefully collected the Origin Source. He dared not devour such an Origin Source recklessly.","As for the soul, he casually crushed it.","He collected it as well.","Whether it reincarnated or not was still up to him.","As for the place of secrets mentioned.","He scoffed.","The end of the upper-tier spacetimes was where he intended to go anyway, no need for the other party to remind him?","But because of this, he had to be more cautious.","“Phew!”","After perfectly killing Lord of Moya and others, he let out a long breath.","For some reason, although he resolved the trouble with one sword, it brought him immense pressure.","He blamed everything on Zamasu.","In fact, he wasn’t wrong, just a little misdirected.","And very wrong in many ways.","The decay accumulated over years of seclusion had harmed him.","“Guangying, take people and move. Lord of Moya and the two Guardian Gods have fallen. Leave no one related to the Moya Palace. As for the others... investigate clearly. If there’s no problem, spare their lives!”","He didn’t act too ruthlessly.","The Moya Palace truly couldn’t remain.","Only by entering did he realize that the things Zamas gave were similar to Mie Sheng’s and had spread to many people.","It had to be eradicated.","Otherwise, it would be a problem.","One thing puzzled him though, why did Zamasu send 3 Ninth Tribulation beings to deal with him?","And at this particular time.","Northern Spacetime already had 3 Ninth Tribulation beings.","Even if he failed, Hu Qing was in seclusion.","He could suppress the matter and wait for Tian Cang and the others to return to resolve it.","He just needed to know that Duanya Spacetime had 3 Ninth Tribulation beings.","If he couldn’t win, he could still escape.","This was something Zamasu probably wouldn’t overlook!","Yet, he still did it.","Thus, Jian Wushuang was somewhat perplexed and couldn’t understand.","Without the Moya Palace, Duanya Spacetime was like a chopped tree trunk, looking good but useless.","Guangying personally mobilized, and three forces attacked Duanya Spacetime.","Wu Zuo led the experts from the middle-tier Qishen Temple.","Wu Tian replaced Hu Qing and led experts from the upper-tier spacetimes branch and also rushed in.","Wan Shan was among them, but he had a mission at hand. After sensing Jian Wushuang’s presence, he couldn’t go to greet him and could only hope to end this conflict quickly.","For the first two teams, Guangying instructed them to act with restraint. Those unrelated to the Moya Palace were spared.","Those related were investigated, detained for a while, and if cleared, released.","If they had issues, no need to say more."]},{"number":6137,"title":"Chapter 6137: Miserable!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6137: Miserable!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, Divine Wood King, leading the members of the Ancient Moon Sect, had no such scruples.","Especially Divine Wood King, he only knew that someone had plotted against the Northern Spacetime, and Realm King had issued a kill order!","In fact, it was Jian Wushuang who had told him.","In the outside world, he had seen Realm King, but had noticed that his expression was somewhat grim and dared not approach to speak.","So, he thought of slaughtering everyone here to help Realm King vent his anger.","Therefore, he struck the hardest.","As long as it was a branch of the Moya Palace, it was directly exterminated by his Moya Vine, leaving no one behind.","Some families backed by the Moya Palace were left to the disciples of the Ancient Moon Sect.","Those families were not much anyway.","They were all families of Universe Masters, with the strongest ancestor being at most a Fifth Tribulation. A Sixth Tribulation was enough to take them down.","However, the disciples of the Ancient Moon Sect, to plunder treasures more quickly, directly slaughtered everyone, took the treasures, and left.","“Kill!!!”","In a microcosm within Duanya Spacetime.","Slaughter was rampant.","In a giant valley, more than a thousand Universe Masters were fighting.","This place was a famous secret realm in Duanya Spacetime.","Later, it was acquired by a powerful Seventh Tribulation and transformed into his own microcosm.","Families and sects cultivated here.","But because one of the family’s younger generation was a disciple of the Moya Palace branch, it attracted the slaughter.","Leading them was a Universe Master of the Ancient Moon Sect, at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation.","He held a blood-stained giant blade, dragging the blade as he slowly walked up the blood-stained steps, saying coldly, “Leave no one alive!”","“Yes!”","Several Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters behind him also joined the slaughter.","And that Seventh Tribulation master holding the giant blade came to an old man’s side.","“Shangguan Xiong, weren’t you quite impressive in the Eternal Realm of Tian Cang last time?”","“Xue Dao!”","The old man named Shangguan Xiong was no match for Xue Dao now.","His Origin Source had already been shattered by an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Xue Dao was here to finish things up.","To say finishing up was actually to gather some treasures and clean up the traitors.","“I can die, but give them a chance to live!” Shangguan Xiong, once a proud figure in the world, had lost his spirit.","But facing the fall of his family’s younger generation one by one, even as a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, he wept, willing to fall himself to save his family’s younger generation.","This was his accumulation over several eras!","The family’s prosperity.","But just because of a slight connection with the Moya Palace, they were to be cleaned up!","“Old thing, stop struggling, this time the heavens want you dead, do you understand?”","Xue Dao sneered.","Those were the orders he received.","The heavens wanted the Moya Palace gone!","Even the three Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters fell within a quarter of an hour.","Now, no one could protect the cultivators associated with the Moya Palace.","“Xue Dao!” Shangguan Xiong mustered his last bit of strength to shout.","He wanted to self-destruct!","But a cold blade had already pierced his chest!","Splurt!","The cold blade sliced through Shangguan Xiong’s chest.","“You...” Shangguan Xiong gripped the blade lodged in his chest, his eyes bulging.","Behind him lay a little girl, dressed in white, lying in a pool of blood, her eyes filled with fear and tears.","A moment ago, this place was as warm as a picture.","Now, it had become a sea of blood.","Everything felt like a dream.","“Grandpa!” The little girl called out to Shangguan Xiong from the cold ground.","Before Shangguan Xiong could turn his head, the blood-stained blade was abruptly pulled out of his chest.","Thud!","Shangguan Xiong completely lost consciousness, but his final glance was at the little girl.","He understood that today, his family, sect, and disciples would all be annihilated.","When the heavens decree death, who can resist?","“Well, well, there’s still one left!” Xue Dao looked at the little girl with a playful gaze.","The blade was already aimed at the little girl.","Just as he was about to strike, a blue aura blocked the blade.","A tremendous force snapped the blade, forcing Xue Dao to step back several paces.","A figure shrouded in blue slowly descended.","The figure glanced coolly at the scene in the valley and couldn’t help but sigh.","“Who are you?”","Xue Dao quickly stood up, knowing he was no match and began to announce his identity.","“I am an emissary of the Ancient Moon Sect, I...”","“Shut up!” The figure in the blue aura roared.","The figure was none other than Jian Wushuang.","He had traversed Duanya Spacetime and seen too many scenes like this.","But what could he do?","Not kill?","Yet the things left behind by Zamas had already infiltrated the Origin Source of many.","Kill?","But it involved too much.","Compassion was not something he should have.","But seeing it, he found it hard to remain indifferent.","Xue Dao was also intimidated by Jian Wushuang’s words and didn’t dare speak again.","However, he had already transmitted a message to the accompanying Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Upon hearing the figure in the blue aura, the Eighth Tribulation Universe Master immediately recognized him as Jian Wushuang.","The Divine Wood King had mentioned him to them before.","When Jian Wushuang made a move in the Primordial Black Heaven, many had witnessed it.","Hearing it was Jian Wushuang, Xue Dao felt even more aggrieved.","Wasn’t this Jian Wushuang’s order?","Why stop him now?","Jian Wushuang’s order was simply to eliminate hidden dangers.","The Shangguan family!","Was it a hidden danger?","Perhaps he didn’t think so, but his subordinates didn’t see it that way.","Better to kill ten thousand than to let one escape.","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. Knowing he couldn’t stop it, he enveloped the little girl in his aura and instantly vanished from the valley.","Leaving behind a stunned Xue Dao, uncertain whether to continue or stop.","After hesitating for a long time, he eventually waved his hand and left the valley with his men, taking all the cultivators beyond the Celestial Immortal level with him.","Even if Jian Wushuang intervened, the necessary actions had to be taken.","Otherwise, what would this mean?","Jian Wushuang himself might still be conflicted.","He glanced at the unconscious little girl and casually tossed her into a blessed land in Duanya Spacetime, a paradise without cultivators.","Annihilating a spacetime still left this last bit of kindness.","It was only after leaving Duanya Spacetime that Jian Wushuang exhaled a long breath.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Lord Guangying sensed his aura and immediately approached.","He directed the strong from three sides to enter Duanya Spacetime but did not enter himself.","Seeing Jian Wushuang emerge, his eyes held respect. This time, Jian Wushuang had taken down three Ninth Tribulation Universe Masters, which shocked him no less than the Jian Wushuang of old.","“Mm!” Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned before looking at Lord Guangying, calmly saying, “You’ve worked hard this time, but the aftermath...”","“You don’t need to worry about the aftermath. We owe it all to you this time!” Lord Guangyig replied courteously, “Without you, we wouldn’t have taken down Duanya Spacetime, let alone protected ourselves!”","Jian Wushuang sighed, “It’s nothing.”"]},{"number":6138,"title":"Chapter 6138: Creator?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6138: Creator?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“By the way, what are your plans next?” Lord Guangying asked.","“Next?”","After this event, Qishen Temple had firmly established its footing in the upper-tier spacetimes.","With the conquest of Duanya Spacetime, Qishen Temple only needed a little more development to seamlessly annex Fallen Soul Spacetime.","Out of the nine great spacetimes, taking two was significant.","Once Huiqing successfully underwent his Tribulation and reached the Ninth Tribulation, they could even establish an Eternal Realm.","By then, it might be time to leave.","Huiqing was pursuing the resurrection of Jiang Shang’s soul, while Jian Wushuang sought even greater strength in his path. There were also some powerful opponents to contend with.","“I plan to head to the upper-tier’s endpoint and then start my Tribulation!”","Hearing the mention of Tribulation, Lord Guangying recalled that Jian Wushuang was still in the Seventh Tribulation Realm. It was indeed time for him to undergo the Eighth Tribulation. Some of his peers were already preparing for the Ninth Tribulation.","Although Jian Wushuang’s pace seemed slow, no one doubted his strength.","“This is something Realm King asked me to give you. He also instructed that you contact him after you successfully undergo the Tribulation!” Lord Guangying handed a mustard seed to Jian Wushuang.","Taking the mustard seed, Jian Wushuang didn’t need to think to know that it contained treasures prepared for his Tribulation.","He had come here for treasures, but now that he had obtained them, his mood was somewhat dampened.","It was unclear whether it was due to the fall of the Lord of Moya or the hellish scenes he witnessed in Duanya Spacetime.","After a brief recovery, Jian Wushuang bid farewell to Lord Guangying.","At this moment, Divine Wood King also sent a message, inviting him to enter Duanya Spacetime to divide the treasures.","Jian Wushuang declined with a smile, leaving the task to Wu Zuo and others.","With a single movement, he headed towards the ultimate point of the upper-tier. Passing through Ancient Moon Spacetime, he sensed a familiar presence.","Li Sheng!","Back then, the head of the Li family of Yue Kingdom had established a connection with Jian Wushuang in the boundless universe.","After leaving the boundless universe and finding his family destroyed, Li Sheng had gone mad for a time.","However, his strength remained, and after regaining his human form, he didn’t rebuild his family but instead founded a Daoist temple, becoming a Daoist ancestor at the Seventh Tribulation level.","The Empress had similarly reached the peak of the Seventh Tribulation, and Queen Yun Zhi had advanced to the Eighth Tribulation.","These familiar presences were merely swept away by his senses.","Old grievances had long since ended, and there was no need for further meetings.","They all had their own fortunes and paths to follow, which had diverged significantly.","Naturally, there was no need to meet, and doing so would only be awkward.","Jian Wushuang’s figure trembled as he completely left the nine great spacetimes, heading into the desolate land in search of the abyss or the cliff waterfall above it.","The cliff there was part of the same mountain range as the one in Duanya Spacetime.","This was something he had just learned.","The abyss!","Like the abyss in the lower reaches, it was filled with endless terror and was bottomless.","It wasn’t the kind constructed by the Realm King God, which had a bottom.","Passing through the desolation, he reached the ultimate point.","Northern Spacetime, upper, middle, and lower tiers.","The ultimate land of countless universes.","Life had begun to stand here, time had started here, and space had extended from this place.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, gazing at the cliff.","The cliff had black water flowing down, cascading into the abyss below.","The huge sound was deafening.","“Rewind!”","Jian Wushuang forcefully tore through spacetime to perform a temporal rewind.","He wanted to see what had happened here in the past.","He had done this many times with the universe.","At first, there was no sound.","The water flowing down the cliff was not black but clear.","However, at a certain point in time, a black-robed figure appeared on the cliff.","He stepped lightly into the water, and his flesh began to disintegrate.","Then his divine body cracked, his Origin Source collapsed, and his soul shattered until he completely transformed into black river water that flowed into the abyss.","Life in Northern Spacetime began to flourish.","Cultivators emerged.","Jian Wushuang watched in disbelief.","They truly had a Creator. “A black-robed figure? Who was he?”","Realm King had never mentioned this, the creator of Northern Spacetime.","Is he Realm King?","Clearly not. It should be the Realm King God.","The rewind continued until it reached a point just before Jian Wushuang arrived.","He stopped because before he came, there was a figure in the water.","Splash!","Jian Wushuang smoothed out spacetime and instantly drew his sword.","“Come out!” he shouted at the water surface, “What’s the point of hiding? Come out and fight me!”","The water’s surface was turbulent, and his voice was drowned within it, receiving no response for a long time.","Yet, when time was rewound, he clearly saw that figure in the water, wearing a mask.","There couldn’t be a mistake.","For such a long time, there had been no appearance.","But just before he arrived here, a face was revealed.","There was definitely a problem.","It might very well be another of Zamasu’s tricks.","This time, after slaying the Lord of Moya, he felt something was off.","Moreover, Realm King also believed that the frequent crises in Northern Spacetime were because Zamasu had spies there.","Otherwise, how could Jian Wushuang encounter trouble right after exiting seclusion?","He had been in seclusion for such a long time without any mishap.","The most crucial revival secret technique went smoothly.","Raising the life level of the spacetime also went very smoothly.","Jian Wushuang’s emergence from seclusion wasn’t on any significant day, yet he encountered the traitor, the Lord of Moya.","Either Jian Wushuang was a harbinger of disaster, or Zamasu had unspeakable secrets in Northern Spacetime.","The latter seemed more accurate.","Amid the flowing water, a pair of eyes stared at Jian Wushuang, completely blending with the water, making it impossible for Jian Wushuang to notice.","“Hehe... I’m discovered!”","A strange voice, as if speaking to someone.","Before long, it indeed attracted a cold voice.","This voice was very familiar to Jian Wushuang; it was Zamasu.","“Hmph, losing Northern Spacetime is nothing, but the human race must die. Let’s first give them some hope. If this time we couldn’t shake his Dao Heart, then get ready to face the opponents on the Realm God Continent!”","The figure in the water paused and said in surprise, “It’s already certain that you will become the Realm King. Acting against cultivators at this time, I fear...?”","“I’m not that foolish, and he isn’t worth my effort. Someone else will deal with him!”","“By the way, you can gather your true form and come with me. There’s no need to stay in Northern Spacetime anymore!”","Whoosh!","The figure in the water felt a surge of emotion.","He could finally leave this damned place.","Zamasu had arranged for him to wait here for countless years, and today was his liberation.","“Realm God Continent, your king has returned!” The figure in the water slowly condensed.","A burly body instantly formed.","Buzz!","A powerful force directly pushed Jian Wushuang back ten thousand miles from the water’s edge."]},{"number":6139,"title":"Chapter 6139: Kuder","paragraphs":["Chapter 6139: Kuder","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Staring at the stout, well-built man with smooth and distinct lines, Jian Wushuang was surprised and exclaimed, “Frost Demon Clan?”","He looked very similar to the ancient temple and ancient warriors he had once slain.","But the opponent’s power was too overwhelming.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t even sense the opponent’s presence.","“Boy, remember my name. Once you arrive at the Realm King Continent, it will be very interesting!” The stout man sneered and, before the surrounding spacetime could condense, he leapt into the abyss along the river.","Splash!","A figure emerged from the water once more.","This time, Jian Wushuang recognized the person.","“Zamasu?”","Indeed, it was Zamasu’s hidden hand at play here.","But what intrigued him was Zamasu’s mention of the Realm King Continent. The power of the Frost Demon Clan member was far superior to his own. If the demon had wanted to make a move, Jian Wushuang would have been doomed, but the demon chose to leave instead.","“Jian Wushuang, aren’t you curious why he didn’t attack you just now?” Zamasu spoke with his hands behind his back, his tone arrogant.","The way he spoke made Jian Wushuang very uncomfortable.","He didn’t respond directly but stared coldly at Zamasu.","The surrounding spacetime completely froze, and the figure of the Realm King was also transmitted to the scene.","“That person just now, was it Kuder?”","As soon as the Realm King descended, he spoke in surprise.","The presence just now was too familiar.","It was the former king of the Realm King Continent.","A super strong Universe God.","Originally thought to have fallen, it turned out he was hiding in the Northern Spacetime.","Zamasu, seeing the Realm King’s arrival, sneered, “Just a reminder, I am about to enter the Starry Sky for the Realm King God’s trial. During my absence, you need to find an opponent for your Northern Spacetime!”","“Kuder!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t know who the opponent was; he only knew the person was from the Frost Demon Clan.","“Realm King God’s trial?” The Realm King’s expression was very unpleasant. He hadn’t expected Zamasu to grow so quickly, already reaching the point of participating in the Realm King God’s trial.","Once the trial was successful, he would become a probationary Realm King God, and at that time, he would truly be the second strongest on the Realm King Continent.","“That’s right!” Zamasu casually opened a spacetime passage and, before entering the tunnel, reminded, “When I return, there will no longer be four major spacetimes.”","After speaking, he disappeared into the Northern Spacetime.","This time, he might never return to the Northern Spacetime because the coordinates of the Northern Spacetime were with Kuder, who had already returned to the Realm King Continent. Zamasu had also lost the coordinates, making it impossible to find the Northern Spacetime unless he became a Realm King God.","After Zamasu left, the Realm King’s face was silent, his gaze somewhat dazed.","However, many doubts arose in Jian Wushuang’s heart, such as the identity of that Frost Demon Clan member.","The Realm King, knowing the other party’s identity, showed great fear.","Now that Zamasu had left, shouldn’t it bring peace?","“Jian Wushuang!” Realm King glanced at Jian Wushuang, feeling a bit guilty.","He felt guilty towards all the practitioners who traveled from the Northern Spacetime to the Realm King Continent.","Because, inadvertently, he had caused them a lot of trouble.","“Lord Realm King!” Jian Wushuang looked unaware, though he understood in his heart.","They hadn’t even reached the Realm King Continent yet, and they had already made quite a few enemies.","Going there would be dangerous.","But he was never afraid of such things.","Without danger, where would opportunities come from?","A strong person doesn’t come from timidity; they crawl out from death.","So there was nothing to fear.","He knew what Realm King was going to say and immediately interrupted him, saying, “Lord Realm King, no need to say more. Why not explain Zamasu’s words to me, and about that ice demon clan member.”","When Zamasu left, he mentioned attending the Realm King God’s trial and that Kuder claimed to be the king of the Realm King Continent.","It sounded impressive.","The power he had just shown was also very strong.","It was better to understand the opponent first!","Moreover, it seemed that Zamasu’s target was not the Northern Spacetime, but the four major spacetimes.","Clearing the four major spacetimes?","In Jian Wushuang’s view, weren’t the four major spacetimes the subsidiary spacetimes of the Starry Sky?","They could maintain the Starry Sky.","The Realm King, hearing this, smiled bitterly and said awkwardly, “Jian Wushuang, you overestimate me and the subsidiary spacetimes.”","Without the four major spacetimes, the Starry Sky would still be the Starry Sky.","It couldn’t even affect the Realm King Continent.","Otherwise, Zamasu’s several arrangements in the Northern Spacetime would have long provoked the wrath of the Starry Sky.","But in these few times, no one had paid attention.","Back then, Mie Sheng threatened the Northern Spacetime, and it was only because he violated the supreme rule that his identity was erased.","As for the Northern Spacetime, in the eyes of the gods of the Starry Sky, it was not that important.","Or rather, life was not that important.","The four major spacetime rivers were originally subsidiary.","Lives and such could regenerate.","When Weiss came, it wasn’t because of the safety of the Northern Spacetime but because of the Heavenly Maiden. Later, he stayed because of Jian Wushuang.","This was also why the Realm King reacted so strongly when he saw Zhen Ling.","Because such a super character as Zhen Ling wouldn’t care about any subsidiary spacetimes. Being able to go to the Realm King Continent was a great favor to the Realm King God.","Moreover, the so-called subsidiary spacetimes weren’t used to stabilize the Starry Sky but to suppress the myriad worlds.","A glimmer of light appeared on the Realm King’s heavy face.","“Jian Wushuang, the four major rivers surround the Starry Sky, connected to each other. What about the other places?”","This question really stumped Jian Wushuang.","Worldview!","His worldview had changed many times.","He used to think the spacetime rivers were already very powerful.","Looking up at the Starry Sky, that was his heaven.","But now the Realm King’s question made it clear it wasn’t that simple. He shook his head and listened attentively.","Realm King smiled faintly, walked to the riverbank, sat cross-legged, and gestured for Jian Wushuang to sit opposite him.","Seeing the posture, Jian Wushuang felt it wasn’t simple. He also sat down and took out tea, pouring some for the Realm King.","After sipping the tea lightly, the Realm King began to speak, “We can all see the Starry Sky. Beyond the Starry Sky is the spacetime river. Above the river lies the Realm King Continent. Around the continent, there are uncharted Infinite Lands. There is no Dao there, but Dao exists everywhere. For instance, with a casual punch, you can open a path of fists. With a casual sword stroke, it’s a sword path. You can even open a world of swords. It’s a hundred thousand times simpler than within the spacetime!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was startled.","A hundred thousand times simpler than cultivating in the spacetime.","In an instant, he thought of the place he had once visited in the Starry Sky.","The primitive world.","Infinite Lands.","Opening a path casually.","It depended on whether you had the strength.","As long as you had ambition, you could become a super existence.","Back then, seeing that ancient primitive person, he thought of the ultimate.","So there was the Extreme Starry Sky.","Because what he could see was the Starry Sky.","So he took the Starry Sky as the end point.","“Could it be that the place I visited back then wasn’t the Starry Sky, but the Infinite Lands?” Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched, revealing a look of shock."]},{"number":6140,"title":"Chapter 6140: Infinite","paragraphs":["Chapter 6140: Infinite","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Realm King did not mind; he assumed Jian Wushuang was astonished, which was normal. Everyone reacted this way the first time they heard about it.","He continued, “Think about it, cultivation has no end, yet it is extremely simple. What would appear in the Infinite Lands?”","“Invincibility!” Jian Wushuang stood up abruptly.","Without rules to bind them, invincibility was inevitable.","As long as one continued to cultivate and with an infinite number of cultivators, an invincible being would eventually emerge.","“The Infinite Lands!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “It’s indeed a place of invincibility!”","If everyone went to the Infinite Lands to cultivate, wouldn’t the overall strength increase infinitely?","But then, thinking it over, since the Realm King had said so, there should be no one who would willingly go there to cultivate.","Realm King explained, “If it were as you said, it would be a bad thing. A world without rules is a terrifying place. That’s why the Four Great Spacetimes exist, to isolate external time and space. Whether there is life in the Four Great Spacetimes does not matter. This is also where Zamasu’s confidence lies.”","“I see!” Jian Wushuang slowly sat back down, realizing he had oversimplified the situation.","A place like that, once truly opened, might not be a good thing for the Starry Sky.","The four spacetimes surrounding the Starry Sky were meant to isolate the Infinite Lands.","It was quite interesting.","Isolating time and space!","This way, no one could leave.","Thus forming an inner circle and outer square.","Places with rules were round, and places without rules were boundless.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang thought of the Master of the Starry Sky.","The Starry Sky had a master.","So where did this being who opened up the Starry Sky come from?","The Infinite Lands?","As soon as he thought this, a massive buzzing noise appeared in his mind, like a punishment for blaspheming a god.","Buzz!","His consciousness in his mind seemed to explode, and Jian Wushuang quickly held his head, trying to clear his mind.","The Realm King saw this and was not surprised, smiling faintly, “Haha, it seems you’ve fallen into the trap. Haven’t you heard a saying during your mundane days?”","“What?”","“Three feet above your head, there is a god!”","Slap!","Jian Wushuang slapped his head and said, gasping for breath, “I thought I had reached the level of slaying gods!”","“The being who opened the Starry Sky is not a god. Those he appoints are gods, and the divine positions are decided by him. Who do you think is more powerful?” Realm King smiled and said, “The reason I’m telling you this is to make you understand that there is always someone better and you must not slack off. As for the matters of the Infinite Lands, don’t think about it. When you make a name for yourself on the Realm God Continent, you will know more!”","Telling Jian Wushuang now was indeed somewhat unnecessary.","He was only a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, not even having ventured out of spacetime.","It was indeed unnecessary to concern himself with the Infinite Lands.","At least he had to become a Universe God before he could think about it.","The Infinite Lands was the nightmare of the entire Starry Sky.","How vast was the Starry Sky?","To Jian Wushuang, it was like the sky!","The greatest.","But to the Realm King, the Starry Sky was too small.","Compared to the Infinite Lands, it was very small.","Furthermore, the threat was even greater.","Without the protection of the four spacetime rivers, the wars outside the starry sky might have lasted for endless years.","The reason why the four great spacetimes could sustain life was due to the Great Realm King’s efforts.","This was to enable proactive attacks in the future and to explore the origins of cultivation, or rather, the origins of life, in Infinite Lands.","The God of Life in the Northern Spacetime was Danbao, which even Jian Wushuang knew.","The Realm King knew who the God of Life in the starry sky was; it wasn’t a secret.","But where did the life in Infinite Lands come from?","Who created it?","Everyone was pursuing this secret.","This time, Jian Wushuang had truly gained insight.","In an instant, he seemed to see his own fate.","Searching and seeking.","The secret of Infinite Lands?","The nurturing of Teacher Xuan Yi?","Shaking his head, he decided to stop thinking about it.","Turning to Realm King, he wearily said, “Let’s talk about something lighter. I see you are very afraid of a certain Frost Demon called Kuder. Is he really that powerful?”","“I’m not sure, but don’t underestimate Kuder. You may have only heard of Infinite Lands, but Kuder is an enemy you will have to face. He was once the king of the Realm King Continent and held considerable power in the starry sky. He offended the Realm King God and was suppressed. Later, he disappeared, and I thought the Realm King God had killed him, but it turns out he switched allegiance to Zamasu!” The Realm King’s expression changed when he spoke of Kuder.","In those days, Kuder’s era oppressed the gods of the Realm King Continent to the point where they couldn’t lift their heads. He was indeed a king.","If it weren’t for the Realm King God, no one would have been able to rise.","The only one who could compete with him was the Great Realm King.","Even the Great Realm King wasn’t his match at that time, as you can imagine.","After listening, Jian Wushuang remained calm and said, “As long as the strength is reasonable, there’s nothing to fear. After I pass the Eighth Tribulation, I will head to the Realm King Continent!”","“So soon?” The Realm King worriedly asked, “When you reach the Eighth Tribulation, how much divine power will you have? Will you even be a demigod? Why not wait until you pass the Ninth Tribulation and go to the Realm King Continent with Hu Qing, so you can look out for each other? As for the limit of the Northern Spacetime, you don’t need to listen to Tian Cang and the others. I can open a micro world for you to practice in, and there will be plenty of treasures!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect the Realm King to care so much about him, saying so much that he felt a bit embarrassed.","Practicing in a small world with plenty of treasures!","He had imagined such a life before.","But now, it was no longer necessary.","Without the time for battle, life would be dull.","Endless eons had made him lose much.","He didn’t want to live that endless, monotonous time anymore; it was still the repeated battles that made him grow faster.","“Thank you for your kindness, Realm King, but I would rather enter the Realm King Continent as soon as possible!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and refused.","After hearing what the Realm King said about Infinite Lands, he was even more eager to learn the secrets of the starry sky.","Entering the starry sky to meet the gods.","He had imagined that scene.","Perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi was there.","Realm King, knowing Jian Wushuang’s character, didn’t persuade him further. Instead, he solemnly handed over some treasures, saying, “You are the pride of the Northern Spacetime, as are Hu Qing and Wu Zuo. I will always support you. Before you enter the Realm King Continent, at least raise your basic divine power to 30 million. Otherwise, it’s too dangerous.”","“Isn’t Xi Lu that strong?” Jian Wushuang scratched his head and continued, “Although Kuder is powerful, he’s a big figure. He wouldn’t target an Eighth Tribulation from the Northern Spacetime; it’s not that exaggerated!”","“Better to be safe than sorry!”","Realm King just handed over the treasures to Jian Wushuang, though what he really wanted to say was that once they reached the Realm King Continent, he could no longer protect them."]},{"number":6141,"title":"Chapter 6141: The Eighth Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6141: The Eighth Tribulation","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang knew he had to be careful.","Falling in the Northern Spacetime was one thing; he could arrange for a rebirth. But falling in the Realm King Continent? There would be no coming back from that.","“Got it!” Jian Wushuang nodded as he took the treasure, looking at the disheveled face of the Realm King. He reassured, “I haven’t left yet. Besides, I can hide my aura. I’m not foolish enough to seek out Xilu!”","Currently, this threat was the only one continually watching him. However, Xilu’s divine power was only so-so, reaching demi-god at best.","To him, it wasn’t a threat right now, and once he reached the Eighth Tribulation, it would be even less of a threat.","The Realm King, slightly embarrassed, added, “I forgot to remind you, Xilu seems to have allied with the mechanical clan of the Southern Spacetime. Do you remember the intelligent brain you killed? He had an older brother who is looking for you and has brought several metal beings that were teleported away back then. They have special means to track you, and their divine power surpasses that of a demigod!”","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang was startled.","Before he could ask further, the Realm King hurriedly left.","No wonder he had advised against going too early.","It turned out there was more than one threat left behind!","This didn’t even include the pink meatball.","Then there were the more powerful Kuder and Zamasu, who went to participate in the Realm King’s trial.","Such a small Northern Spacetime had attracted the attention of so many powerful beings.","It was truly a tough job for the Realm King.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a sigh, finished his last sip of tea, and stood up.","Standing by the shore, he admired the spectacular scenery.","“This place is also a good spot for Tribulation. I’ll undergo my Tribulation here!”","Buzz!","The surrounding spacetime began to converge until it formed a small cave heaven and stopped.","He stepped forward, entering the cave heaven directly.","The void cave heaven was pitch black and empty.","Finding it somewhat dull, he used his mind to create light!","The ground rose up accordingly.","Mountains stretched to the horizon.","At the end was an endless sea.","All kinds of plants and living creatures appeared.","This was his current mastery over spacetime.","He had reached a high level of proficiency.","Compared to the Realm King, he was not far off.","The spacetime lord he once envisioned was probably at this level!","Buzz!","Sitting cross-legged on the mountain ridge, his mind entered his Origin Source Starry Sky.","Nine perfect Origin Source Universes shone brightly.","This was his foundation.","The threshold for the Eighth Tribulation was nine Origin Source Universes.","To undergo the Ninth Tribulation, he might need a spacetime river.","Divine Tribulation!","The final Tribulation, once successful, would make him a Universe God.","At that time, what level did he want to reach?","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, stopping his thoughts.","Adjusting his mindset, countless treasures to supplement divine power and origin source floated before him, ready for his selection.","While selecting treasures, the eighth divine body Tribulation began.","He had long been accustomed to the relentless grinding and tempering.","Divine power was crushed from millions down to ten thousand.","Then replenished from ten thousand back to millions.","Over and over again.","His divine power, initially golden, transformed once more.","This time, it neared the muddy color of spacetime.","This indicated his divine power had reached the spacetime level.","Gold was the universe.","The muddy color was the spacetime level.","Starry Sky?","Jian Wushuang thought of the power of the Starry Sky, which was blue.","In his hesitation, he performed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","The perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation had stabilized.","His pure divine power doubled.","From 10 million, his divine power surged to 20 million.","As the Tribulation descended again, the muddy power vanished.","The blue power followed.","Buzz!","The Starry Sky divine power fully embedded in his body.","His basic divine power went from 10 million to 15 million.","Maintaining the lowest state of Super Ancient Transformation, his hair and aura were blue.","This meant his divine power would now always be the Starry Sky divine power.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Jian Wushuang roared, “Ah... ha!!”","With a loud boom, a powerful wave of divine power erupted in the dim Starry Sky.","His divine power surged directly to around 30 million.","It was much easier than before, and he felt he hadn’t reached his limit yet; his aura could still rise, reminiscent of Broly’s infinite growth.","His divine power stabilized at around 35 million.","Using origin source amplification, despite the current high strength of his divine power reducing the amplification’s effectiveness, he could still easily reach around 50 million.","This was without undergoing the Supreme Tribulation, and he was already this strong.","If the Realm King knew, he would be reassured.","Metal beings?","Xilu?","They were no problem.","Even Kuder, while Jian Wushuang at the Eighth Tribulation might not be a match, at the Ninth Tribulation, he had confidence in a battle.","“Supreme Tribulation!”","Jian Wushuang looked up at the turbulent dragon in the Starry Sky. The test of the Supreme Tribulation had just begun.","However, this time, he would succeed.","Qishen had fallen at the Eighth Tribulation, but he would not.","Buzz!!!","The tribulation of his divine body had cost him ten thousand eons.","The Supreme Tribulation, on the other hand, consumed only a few eons. He completely slayed the dragon and stabilized his Origin Source.","Eighth Tribulation!","On this day, Jian Wushuang reached the Eighth Tribulation, just one tribulation short of the Universe Master’s limit.","If not for the unique nature of the tribulation, with his current divine power, he could have directly passed the Divine Tribulation.","After stabilizing his realm, Jian Wushuang began to accumulate his basic divine power.","This tribulation had inexplicably increased his divine power by 5 million.","And it was Starry Sky divine power.","Indeed, it brought him quite a surprise.","But with surprises came shocks.","He suddenly discovered that his divine power could not be increased any further.","Or rather, the treasures given by the Realm King could no longer be used.","This panicked him.","He quickly sent a message to the Realm King.","He thought something had gone wrong during his tribulation.","The Realm King was also startled when he heard this.","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s explanation, he understood.","“Ahem, Jian Wushuang, your current divine power is Starry Sky divine power. Naturally, you need to use the power of the Starry Sky to replenish your divine power. Enhancing your divine power also requires Starry Sky treasures. The Origin Source may not be divided, but divine power is different. You cannot treat them the same way!”","Jian Wushuang then realized where the problem was.","It couldn’t be said that he lacked knowledge.","He had mastered the Starry Sky Origin Source early on, and replenishing the Origin Source was not so particular. However, now replenishing Starry Sky divine power required Starry Sky treasures.","The treasures given by the Realm King were wasted.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang felt a pang of heartache.","The Realm King, on the other hand, cut off communication because Starry Sky treasures were very special and could not enter the Northern Spacetime.","Even on the Realm King Continent, they were top-notch treasures, which he did not possess.","He could only leave Jian Wushuang to find a solution on his own.","“Basic divine power is only 15 million!” Jian Wushuang shook his head; the gap was still significant.","After passing the Eighth Tribulation, the Tribulation Armor could increase basic divine power by 5 million."]},{"number":6142,"title":"Chapter 6142: Number One in Northern Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 6142: Number One in Northern Spacetime","It was an unexpected surprise.","This was refined from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard at that time.","He kept the Tribulation Armor for himself and gave the Sky Eye to Hu Qing.","That thing was really not suitable for him.","Originally, he thought the main benefit was given to Hu Qing, but he didn’t expect the Tribulation Armor to give him quite a few surprises as well.","An increase of 5 million base divine power, which in the outside world, was absolutely comparable to a miracle.","“20 million base divine power, the limit of the Eighth Tribulation Realm, and the threshold of the Ninth Tribulation Realm, it’s almost there!” He clenched his fist and suddenly boosted his aura, doubling his divine power.","Now, without using the Origin Source’s boost, his divine power was already at 40 million.","If he used the Origin Source Dojo’s boost, he could easily surpass 50 million.","He had already reached a demigod state.","It was also time to leave the Northern Spacetime.","Swish!","He stepped out of the cave world he had built, tore the space casually, and returned the spacetime to its original state.","“It’s time to say goodbye to Qishen Temple!”","He had been gone for over 100,000 eras.","The headquarters of Qishen Temple in the upper-tier spacetime should have stabilized by","now.","Just as he stepped out, he received a transmission from Babata.","The structure of the upper-tier spacetime had undergone significant changes.","He originally thought that Hu Qing’s crossing of the Ninth Tribulation would be very slow.","Unexpectedly, a few days ago, he had also come out of seclusion.","He became a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master and transformed the former Duanya Spacetime into the Eternal Realm.","It was named “Fallen Spacetime.”","Also called the Fallen Eternal Realm.","In memory of the powerful beings who had fallen in the lower-tier spacetime back then.","Thus, the present Qishen Temple was born.","The middle and lower-tier spacetimes were completely unified.","Zhen Ling stationed in the lower-tier spacetime, continuously sending geniuses to the middle-tier spacetime.","As long as one became a Universe Master, they could go to the middle-tier spacetime.","Upon reaching the middle-tier spacetime, they were handed over to Wu Zuo.","After reaching the Sixth Tribulation Realm, they could then proceed to the upper-tier Qishen Temple.","As a result, in the over 100,000 eras, the development speed of Qishen Temple had crushed the three great Eternal Realms.","Now it was considered the number one force.","Because Hu Qing was still in the Northern Spacetime.","Coupled with the foundation of Qishen Temple being elevated.","In the entire Northern Spacetime, the number one force was “Qishen Temple.”","It was once again glorious!","He made it.","Jian Wushuang stepped out and had already reached the outside of the former Duanya Spacetime, now the “Fallen Spacetime.”","He restrained his aura and did not notify anyone, wanting only to quietly observe the current Qishen Temple.","Universe Masters were everywhere.","Disciples were trained not only in the middle and lower-tier spacetimes but also in the","upper-tier, though the number was very few.","Only elites were accepted.","Inside the Fallen Spacetime.","Qishen Temple was still just a symbol.","Most of it was still those sect forces.","There were as many as ten thousand sects.","Among them was a sect that evoked Jian Wushuang’s thoughts.","“Jian Pavilion!”","Revering the sword!","It only recruited super geniuses of the Ultimate Sword Dao.","It was rumored to have mastered the strongest sword path in the entire Northern Spacetime.","Over the years, even the super families within the three great Eternal Realms had used their connections to send their descendants here.","All of this started from the time when Jian Wushuang killed three Ninth Tribulation Realm beings with one sword.","It was during that battle that Jian Wushuang’s name was forever etched into the hearts of the strong in the Northern Spacetime.","And the master of Jian Pavilion was his personal disciple, “Shen Jian!”","Now, Shen Jian, who was already a top Eighth Tribulation Realm powerhouse, had gone far on","the path of the sword.","He had completely mastered the Spacetime Sword.","As for the Starry Sky Sword, it would depend on his own fate.","But even mastering the Spacetime Sword had made him immensely famous.","Seeing his former disciple able to carry forward his legacy made Jian Wushuang very pleased.","He only paused for a moment, observing briefly, and then flew towards Qishen Temple.","The things left behind did not need his worry.","If he went, it would instead make things awkward.","He hoped that someday, there would be a successor of his sword path who could fight","alongside him!","Fallen Spacetime.","At the upper headquarters of Qishen Temple.","This place was personally overseen by Hu Qing.","Of course, many strong individuals also had their true selves stationed here.","Zhen Ling’s true self was in the lower-tier, but he also had an avatar training here.","Most of the strong individuals stationed in the middle-tier spacetimes were avatars, with","their true selves in the upper headquarters.","After all, this was the Eternal Realm, a more stable environment.","Moreover, Qishen Temple was now the leader among the four major eternal forces.","Staying in the upper-tier offered more benefits as well.","Jian Wushuang entered Qishen Temple alone. The internal space was similar to the lower-tier","but significantly larger.","The four great secret realms remained the core.","Each secret realm was of spacetime-level.","Qishen Temple had developed countless times stronger than before.","Recalling the early days of Qishen Temple, it didn’t even have a single Tribulation level.","But now, Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation level were everywhere.","There was even a Ninth Tribulation level overseeing the place. “Whoosh!” Jian Wushuang floated in the void and stepped into the Heaven Realm.","The core of the upper-tier Qishen Temple was still the Heaven Realm.","Here, countless mountain halls stood.","Hu Qing and Wu Zuo were among them.","With a light step, he instantly arrived in front of the mountain hall.","Swish!","As soon as he entered Qishen Temple, Hu Qing sensed his presence. “Brother Wushuang, congratulations!” Hu Qing said with a faint smile, clearly celebrating Jian Wushuang’s successful passage of the Eighth Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit embarrassed hearing this.","He had only just passed the Eighth Tribulation, while his disciples were already at the Eighth Tribulation level. As their master, he had just crossed the Eighth Tribulation, which made him","feel slightly awkward.","Hu Qing, on the other hand, had retreated for several tens of thousands of eras and emerged having passed the Ninth Tribulation.","He had become a supreme power in the universe.","Just by sensing Hu Qing’s aura, Jian Wushuang could tell that his divine power had reached a","demigod level.","It was not weaker than his own, possibly even stronger.","Since entering Qishen Temple, it seemed only Hu Qing could keep up with him, sometimes","even surpass him.","The others lagged far behind.","Wu Zuo and the others’ divine power was average. Although they had reached the threshold","for the Ninth Tribulation, passing it in one go was still uncertain.","They were all waiting to venture to the Realm King Continent with him.","After all, resources in the Northern Spacetime were limited.","They still needed to explore beyond. “Congratulations to you instead. We haven’t seen each other for years, and you’re already at","the Ninth Tribulation!” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly, marveling at Hu Qing’s rapid","progress.","Both his realm and divine power had advanced rapidly.","Hu Qing remained as humble as ever, saying, “It took millions of eras for me to advance from","the extreme of the Eighth Tribulation to the Ninth Tribulation. Compared to others, I’ve been","quite slow!” “Others?” Jian Wushuang was curious. Could there be someone who progressed even faster?","Just as he was about to ask, he sensed two auras rising to the sky, arriving in an instant.","It Divine Wood King!","And Wu Zuo!","Both had also reached the Ninth Tribulation.","But when he had just arrived, he didn’t notice this.","In just tens of thousands of eras, he didn’t expect anyone else to reach the Ninth Tribulation.","Looking at it this way, he was the one falling behind!","He was still at the Eighth Tribulation.","“Haha, Brother Wushuang, it’s been many years, and you’re still as dashing as ever!”","At this moment, Divine Wood King was in high spirits!"]},{"number":6143,"title":"Chapter 6143: The Situation of the Realm King Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 6143: The Situation of the Realm King Continent","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because he not only possessed the aura of a Ninth Tribulation, but also had a Ninth Tribulation level Moyun Vine.","His combat power was not inferior to a Ninth Tribulation expert.","Suddenly, with two more Ninth Tribulation experts, Jian Wushuang was quite surprised.","He couldn’t help but speculate in his heart, wondering if the other party had secretly consumed some treasure, as they had all advanced so quickly.","Wu Zuo took a deep breath, patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, and slowly explained, “Wushuang, don’t doubt yourself. The reason Divine Wood King and I were able to successfully break through to the Ninth Tribulation is because the Realm King took us to a place where there is a treasure that can make divine power boil. Do you remember the disciple of Gu Qianluo who obtained a wisp of power in the abyss?”","“I remember. Didn’t they say it was a power from the Starry Sky?” Jian Wushuang vaguely recalled something.","“Yes and no. That power did not come from the Starry Sky but was born in a super-secret realm within the Realm King Continent. That secret realm is a rare Starry Sky secret realm. There are fewer than ten such realms on the entire Realm King Continent, and it was moved here from the Starry Sky. A super-powerful being, a Universe God, once sat in meditation there, and that power came from this being.","This time, it was truly thanks to the Realm King. He helped us obtain several spots, otherwise, it wouldn’t have been so smooth!” Divine Wood King said, clenching his fist in excitement, still feeling like he was dreaming. The second time he crossed the Ninth Tribulation, he hadn’t expected it to go so smoothly.","Jian Wushuang, however, caught the implication in their words—it wasn’t just the two of them.","Were there others?","How could such a good opportunity not fall to him?","He had painstakingly crossed the Eighth Tribulation and couldn’t even find a single Starry Sky treasure.","The Realm King just turned around and gave them such a great chance.","He, the greatest contributor, seemed like a mere ornament.","However, even if he had gone, he wouldn’t have been able to directly cross the Ninth Tribulation!","He did want to know how many people had gone this time. Their increased strength would benefit him too; in difficult times, he wouldn’t be the only one facing the challenges.","“Who else reached the Ninth Tribulation?”","Hu Qing, Divine Wood King, and Wu Zuo.","Three more newly advanced Ninth Tribulations.","Including Tian Cang and the others, there were already six.","As for the Eighth Tribulation, there were too many to count.","In the future, more Ninth Tribulation experts would emerge.","Eventually, a Universe God would be born, and by then, the Northern Spacetime would truly reach its peak.","“There’s one more person you know!”","Divine Wood King looked at him with a slight smile and said, “It’s Wu Li. I’ve heard him talk a lot about your past!”","“Wu Li!” Jian Wushuang also smiled.","He hadn’t expected it to be this guy.","He thought that after Wu Li had latched onto Danbao, he had forgotten about him. It had been so many years, and he had only come to see him once.","But he couldn’t blame Wu Li; he had been too busy, always in seclusion.","He had just come out of seclusion not long ago and then went back to cross the Tribulation again.","He hadn’t expected that when he came out, everyone had surpassed him, becoming Ninth Tribulation experts.","It indeed had become quite lively.","“Come on, let’s go inside and talk!” Wu Zuo finally remembered that they were still standing outside the main hall and hurriedly pulled Jian Wushuang inside.","They hadn’t been Ninth Tribulation experts for long and had just stabilized their realms.","They were planning a trip to the Realm King Continent.","This coincided with what Jian Wushuang had in mind.","Realm King Continent.","Only Jian Wushuang had never been there; the others had visited several times.","Especially Wu Zuo, who had frequently traveled to the Realm King Continent over the years.","Although the place he went to was just a microcosm of the Realm King, his knowledge in this aspect far surpassed theirs.","“Wushuang, since you haven’t been to the Realm King Continent, let me explain some of its layout to you!” Wu Zuo slightly raised his head, paused, and then began to speak.","“The Realm King Continent, as the name implies, is a continent, but don’t underestimate it. Its space is larger than the combined Four Great Spacetimes, and the number of experts is comparable to that of a world in the Starry Sky. The number of Universe Gods is numerous, and even the gods of various spacetimes are very low-key on the Realm King Continent. Generally, they don’t manage affairs, and Universe Gods are the most powerful.”","You can ask Wu Li about this. He once roamed the Realm God Continent under the name Dan Bao and almost got himself killed!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang gasped and nodded silently.","Wu Li was indeed capable of such things.","“This time, we are going to the Realm God Continent, which belongs to a great world outside the Realm King Universe. It’s not actually a secret realm but a territory occupied by a demigod powerhouse, named Zalong Mountain. The spatial secret realm that the Realm King took us to back then is right next to Zalong Mountain. We’ll first explore Zalong Mountain, make a name for ourselves, and then head to that Starry Sky secret realm!”","Wu Zuo had already planned everything, just waiting to set off.","The plan sounded good.","They had already explored that starry sky secret realm before, but the treasures they obtained were minimal, almost pitiful compared to those strong ones from the Realm God Continent.","So Wu Zuo and the others wanted to go again.","Hu Qing had never been there, and neither had Jian Wushuang.","There was no reason not to go.","“No problem!” Divine Wood King was the first to agree.","Hu Qing also nodded, having nowhere better to go.","Following Wu Zuo for a bit of adventure seemed like a good idea.","However, Jian Wushuang had something on his mind.","Before leaving, he needed to collect the Beast God Soldiers.","He had already mentioned this to the Realm King a long time ago, but there had been no news.","Then there was the matter of his enemies on the Realm God Continent.","The threat of Xilu needed to be eliminated quickly. Xilu had been growing rapidly, reaching such a level in the Northern Spacetime, and with Zamasu’s help on the Realm God Continent, his divine power might reach the demigod level. This had to be dealt with sooner rather than later.","After expressing his concerns, Wu Zuo, who seemed to have been prepared, said, “Brother Wushuang, this is not just your problem. I already had Danbao ask a friend about it. The Beast God Soldiers you are looking for are conveniently located near Zalong Mountain. We can help you find them this time. As for Xilu and any other metal lifeforms, you can rest assured. Let them come; I’ll kill each one that comes!”","Wu Zuo was very confident in his divine power.","Having reached the Ninth Tribulation, his basic divine power had increased to 30 million.","With the Realm King Fist, his peak divine power could break 40 million.","He indeed had the right to be arrogant.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang had no further objections.","“Since no one has any objections, we will set off in three days. Say your goodbyes and pack up. We will gather here in three days!”","“Alright!”","Everyone nodded.","They dispersed.","Although Divine Wood King was the Guardian Leader of the Ancient Moon Sect, he had always stayed in the Qishen Temple. This time, before leaving, he had to go back once.","He had not turned Ancient Moon Spacetime into an Eternal Realm because his Ancient Wood Sect no longer existed.","Although he had re-established the Ancient Wood Sect back then, it was destroyed again in later conflicts. Helplessly, he took the remnants and joined the Ancient Moon Sect, but he never felt a sense of belonging."]},{"number":6144,"title":"Chapter 6144: Farewell Before Leaving (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6144: Farewell Before Leaving (1)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for entering the Realm King Continent, he would have directly joined Qishen Temple.","However, now that he had reached the Ninth Tribulation, his vision should be broader. There was no need to fixate on the limited land of the Northern Spacetime. It was time to explore a larger world.","He had been silent for so many years, not because of the prosperity of the Northern Spacetime.","It was for the new chapter of the Realm King Continent.","Wu Zuo was the same. Ever since Qishen Temple reached its peak, he had not intervened in its development. He spent his days in seclusion, and this time he was just bidding farewell before leaving.","In this regard, it was similar to Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang had one more thing to do.","That was to discuss the matter of the Beast God Weapon with Shang and Luo.","With a thought, he discovered that the two were not in Qishen Temple but were exploring a secret realm in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Shang and Luo were also quite powerful, though still far from the Ninth Tribulation. Reaching the Eighth Tribulation over the years was already quite impressive.","This indirectly proved that Zhen Ling had a good eye. Even without the help of the Realm King, given enough time, Shang reaching the Seventh Tribulation wouldn’t have been an issue. With later opportunities, he achieved the Eighth Tribulation.","As for the Ninth Tribulation, it depended on personal fortune.","Zhen Ling could no longer help any of them. Now, guarding the old site of Qishen Temple, it was heard that he had created a continent similar to the one in Moro Spacetime and was embarking on a new journey.","They all had their own paths.","Just like Shang and Luo, who were exploring a secret realm.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang casually tore through the spacetime and stepped into the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","With one glance, he pierced through that secret realm of spacetime.","Without any hindrance, he strolled into the most dangerous secret realm of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Before entering, he greeted Shang.","However, he didn’t directly mention the matter of the Beast God Weapon.","After undergoing the tribulation this time, he had mastered the Starry Sky divine power and left behind many treasures, enough to exchange for the Beast God Weapon in Shang’s hands. But forcing a friend was ultimately inappropriate.","He still had to inquire indirectly.","Originally, this matter was for Zhen Ling to handle, but now he was pretending to be oblivious and not addressing it.","He had left the difficult task to him.","Swish!","“You’re here!” Shang wiped the bloodstains from his body and smiled when he saw Jian Wushuang.","Luo, beside him, did the same.","The two were well-known Dao Companions in the Northern Spacetime, always together, with similar strength and background.","This kind of celestial couple, even if they didn’t possess Jian Wushuang’s powerful divine power, were a rare and widely praised pair.","“Long time no see!” Jian Wushuang nodded politely.","His relationship with Shang wasn’t particularly close. They hadn’t adventured together, and their meetings were always polite.","Although there was some distance, they were still considered allies.","The three of them met, first reminiscing about old times and discussing the changes at Qishen Temple over the years.","However, they did not delve into a long conversation.","Soon, Shang brought up the main topic, “I heard that Wu Zuo is already packing his belongings. It seems you are preparing to leave the Northern Spacetime!”","“Yes, in three days!” Jian Wushuang nodded, his tone devoid of excitement and tinged with sadness instead.","Seeing this, Luo smiled faintly and said, “Wushuang, you shouldn’t be one to hesitate. A true man, born between heaven and earth, should not linger in places of comfort!”","“Exactly, cheer up. You represent not just yourself, but the entire Northern Spacetime!”","Shang wiped the dirt off his hands and took out a mustard seed. Since you are leaving, take all your things!","He said this while throwing the mustard seed to Jian Wushuang.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised, catching the mustard seed with a blank expression. Inside, two massive Beast God Weapons were floating.","Jiangliang Polearm and Fengyu Spear!","Before he could speak, Shang had already given him the two treasures.","This made Jian Wushuang feel a bit awkward. Just as he was about to explain, Shang interrupted him.","“No need to say anything. It wasn’t Lord Zhen Ling or anyone else who mentioned anything. Your quest to find Beast God Weapons was impossible to hide from us. If it were before, I might have been reluctant, but now I have no use for Beast God Weapons. Not long ago, my divine power reached 15 million, and the Realm King bestowed upon us a pair of even more perfect semi-divine artifacts. These Beast God Weapons are no longer needed. I was going to leave them at Qishen Temple, but considering Lord Zhen Ling’s nature...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes reddened, and he couldn’t help but laugh at the last sentence.","With Zhen Ling’s personality, he would probably extort him a bit before letting it go.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, took out a mustard seed, and was about to hand it over when Shang turned his head, facing away from him, and said, “Don’t bother, I won’t take it. I don’t lack treasures. I came here just to stretch my muscles. Hurry up and go, your disciples probably want to see you one last time. It’s been many years since they’ve seen you. Stop chatting with this old friend!”","“Umm...”","Jian Wushuang turned his head and smiled, feeling relieved in his heart.","He had oversimplified their bond and underestimated the pride of strong individuals.","These treasures were precious, but dignified warriors would not accept them.","They wanted to rely on their own strength to obtain everything.","Swish!","The void cracked open, and with a gentle wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang’s figure slowly disappeared.","Only then did Shang turn back, smiling, “Don’t slack off. I will soon bring Qishen Temple into the Realm King Continent!”","“I’ll be waiting for you!!!”","The Beast God Weapons, the seventh “Jiangliang Polearm” and the eighth “Fengyu Spear,” returned to their places.","Jian Wushuang wore them completely, and the Origin Source of the beast gods began to fuse automatically.","At this moment, he looked like a true beast god.","Wearing the Vermillion Bird Crown on his head, the Beast God’s Eye on his brow shone brightly.","That was the Eye of the Candle Dragon.","His wings spread open behind him, fluttering with the Qilin Cloak.","He wore Azure Dragon Boots on his feet.","Gently putting on the “Taotie” mask, an ancient Beast God’s aura burst forth.","“The power of the Beast God!”","“Ha!”","He clenched his fist and exploded with divine power, his base divine power of 20 million surged directly to 30 million.","It increased by a full 10 million.","This was already the limit of the Beast God’s Origin Source.","There was no way around it; he was still missing one piece, and without forging the Beast God Weapons into a unified whole, the effect was minimal.","Additionally, they could not stack.","Once he used the Super Eternal Transformation, the Beast God Weapons might not be able to withstand such power and would shatter directly.","“No rush, once I gather all nine Beast God Weapons and find a Universe God to help me forge them, then...”","At that time, the power of the beast god could be combined with the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","And he could seize the opportunity to create an even stronger Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","But those were matters for the future.","In the coming time, he bid farewell to everyone.","Before leaving the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he left some treasures for Queen Yun Zhi and Empress Fengchen.","The origin of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could not be separated from these two individuals.","Queen Yun Zhi had given him guidance. Without that guidance, he would have taken many detours."]},{"number":6145,"title":"Chapter 6145: Farewell Before Leaving (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6145: Farewell Before Leaving (2)","Empress Fengchen, however, gave him immense pressure.","She left him alone at the bottom of the Roman River to face so many wild beasts.","In the end, he erupted, using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","There was actually another person to thank.","But unfortunately, that person was no longer around.","He simply lit three sticks of incense, placing them in the Roman River, carried by a small wooden boat.","Eternally enduring.","After handling these matters, he went to see his three disciples.","Through their introduction, he learned about some of the prodigies in the Jian Pavilion.","Facing those juniors, he could only say, “The future holds great promise.”","Then he drifted away.","Even those simple 5 words made those young ones extremely excited, giving them motivation to cultivate.","He spent nearly all three days saying his farewells.","In the last hour, he went to see Zhen Ling.","This initial guide.","Considered a mentor.","Although there was prejudice in the early stages, as he couldn’t stand him, ultimately,","through his own efforts, he made the other party acknowledge his excellence.","“Lord Zhen Ling!”","Zhen Ling here was just an avatar.","He was fishing on a small boat in the middle of a spiritual lake.","Jian Wushuang’s voice was soft as he slowly sat by the edge of the boat, waiting for Zhen Ling to speak.","The two remained silent for a long time.","It was unclear whether Zhen Ling was really fishing or simply didn’t know what to say.","He also knew that Jian Wushuang was leaving.","He was leaving along with his proudest disciple Hu Qing and Qishen’s only descendant, “Wu Zuo.”","These three were the closest people to him.","This farewell was far different from before.","Once they left, it could be for millions of years or several reincarnations.","“Have you packed everything?”","“Yes, it’s all packed!”","“Good!”","With those words, they fell into silence again.","Jian Wushuang sat quietly by the boat’s edge, not speaking.","The hour passed quickly.","Before long, Hu Qing and Wu Zuo arrived.","Jian Wushuang then understood that they were waiting for everyone to arrive before speaking!","But even after Hu Qing and Wu Zuo boarded the boat, there was still no intention to speak.","They waited.","The appointed time arrived.","“It’s time to go!” Wu Zuo whispered.","Upon hearing this, Zhen Ling only blinked, smiling lightly, “Be careful over there. No one will be there to back you up anymore!”","“Absolutely!”","The three stood up together, disappearing from the lake surface.","Zhen Ling, left alone, had reddened eyes and sighed softly, “Alas, they couldn’t stay, and they don’t even keep this old man company!”","“Sigh....”","With a long sigh, the scene shattered.","Outside Qishen Temple.","Countless people saw them off.","Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing, Wu Zuo, and Divine Wood King.","They all looked back once before resolutely crushing the Realm King Order.","Spacetime trembled.","Under everyone’s gaze, Jian Wushuang and the others completely vanished from the Northern Spacetime.","The people of Qishen Temple also dispersed.","Starting their own paths.","In the Northern Spacetime, in the boundless expanse, stars dotted the sky.","To the weak, it seemed like endless danger.","But to Jian Wushuang and the others, it was a scene of peace.","Yet this time, the Realm King Continent looking up at the starry sky posed infinite challenges","for them.","Swoosh!","The four figures paused, feeling only a moment of discomfort before arriving at a familiar","hall.","“Immortal Temple!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in surprise, “The transmission point is here!”","“Haha, Brother Wushuang, you finally arrived!”","As soon as they landed, a familiar voice rang out.","It was Wu Li.","He had followed Dan Bao to the Realm King Continent back then and was doing really well.","Compared to Divine Wood King who stayed behind, he was indeed superior.","He had already reached the Ninth Tribulation level.","With a thought.","In the Immortal Temple, there were two familiar auras.","They also walked out of the hall, coming outside.","“Brother Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","Danbao and Elder Blu also approached.","Having not seen each other for a long time, they were particularly excited to meet again.","He pulled a few people together into the hall to taste the fine wine and delicacies of the Divine","Domain.","Then he began to discuss the plan for this time.","Five people.","Himself, Hu Qing, Wu Zuo, Divine Wood King, and Wu Li.","They were going on an adventure together.","The region where the Immortal Temple was located was called the “Star Field of the Gods.”","It was once the core of the Realm King Continent.","Unfortunately, it had now declined, because the Spacetime God only mastered one path.","It couldn’t compare to the Universe Gods born from cultivation.","So, the Star Field of the Gods naturally fell into decline.","Now, there were almost no people there, and no attractive secret realms.","Nowadays, the core of the Realm King Continent belonged to the “Divine Domain.”","There were many Universe Gods there, a gathering place for the strong.","Bruce, relying on the gift of the Star Field of the Gods, had already cultivated his divine power","to the demigod level. Although his realm was average, he had 45 million divine power, and he occasionally ventured out, gaining more experience than Wu Zuo. He then told them about","some recent events on the Realm King Continent.","“Divine Domain!” Jian Wushuang, upon hearing this, felt it was too dangerous. He wasn’t","suitable to go there now.","The current opportunities were enough for him to strive for.","Bruce said warmly, “I only heard about this recently. It seems that an extraordinary being has descended upon the Divine Domain. Recently, it has been quite chaotic there, and even","Universe Gods have fallen!”","“What!” Wu Zuo was startled.","Even Universe Gods had fallen.","That definitely meant they couldn’t go to the Divine Domain.","The confidence that came with just becoming a Ninth Tribulation quickly shattered.","If they went, they would be finished by any random wave.","Just like Zhen Ling said, this time, no one would back them up.","The connections of the Realm King wouldn’t be enough.","They struggled to protect them even in the Northern Spacetime, let alone on the Realm King","Continent.","Seeing Wu Zuo like this, Jian Wushuang swallowed back the words he was about to say.","The strong one who had just descended to the Divine Domain was likely “Kuder”, who left the","Northern Spacetime.","If Wuzuo knew this, he might be scared and go back immediately. Fortunately, Kude had just returned and didn’t have time to deal with them.","By the time Kude was settled, they would almost have the ability to protect themselves.","After gaining a general understanding of the Realm King Continent, Jian Wushuang was eager","to head to Zalong Mountain for an adventure.","The time given to them was not much.","As soon as he descended, he felt a strong causality coming towards him.","It might be the metallic lifeform.","He could only sense a trace of causality and couldn’t perceive the opponent’s divine power.","The strength wouldn’t be weak.","As for Xilu, he couldn’t sense him at all. Either the causality was cut off, or he was much stronger than him.","No matter which possibility, he couldn’t be careless.","“Leaving now?” Danbao was a bit surprised, not expecting Jian Wushuang to leave so soon.","He quickly took out a jade slip and handed it over, “This is a map I asked a prophetic friend to","help you get. According to the route on it, you should be able to find the last piece of the Beast","God’s weapon!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned after hearing this, “Prophet?”","This was similar to Hu Qing’s deduction. The Realm King Continent was indeed full of","wonders."]},{"number":6146,"title":"Chapter 6146: Wu Li’s Brother","paragraphs":["Chapter 6146: Wu Li’s Brother","“Mm!” Danbao nodded and said, “By the way, that friend of the Prophet is also very curious about the Beast God Weapon, and he is a Divine Craftsman. Even Universe Masters seek him out for forging. If you gather all the Beast God Weapons, you can come back to find me, and I will take you to the Prophet to help you forge the Beast God Weapon!”","Having just arrived, Jian Wushuang heard a piece of great news, and his furrowed brows relaxed.","Great kindness requires no thanks.","The Prophet should be setting off for Zalong Mountain soon.","After waving goodbye, the five of them leapt down from the Immortal Temple together.","The Divine Hall floated high in the air.","Below it was the continent.","After leaping down together, only Jian Wushuang felt somewhat uncomfortable.","Because the Realm God Continent was too stable, the gravity was very strong.","Ordinary life forms from spacetime could not reproduce here.","Only the mortals of the Realm God Continent could survive.","Moreover, the space here was so stable that it was difficult to tear apart.","Traveling required flying.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had the pyramid.","“Babata!”","With a command.","The five of them had not yet landed.","They entered the pyramid.","Swoosh!!!!!!","In the resting cabin.","Wu Li found a seat and lay down directly, comfortably saying, “It’s still better lying down. Flying in the Realm God Continent is too tiring!”","“That’s because you’re too lazy!” Wu Zuo rolled his eyes and frowned, saying, “Seriously, can you handle it? Don’t mess up when we enter Zalong Mountain.”","“Don’t worry!” Wu Li was very confident.","This time, their mission at Zalong Mountain had two objectives.","The first was to search for the Beast God Weapon for Jian Wushuang. The second was to follow the young master of Zalong Mountain to a spacetime gorge to find another treasure.","However, they didn’t know what that treasure was.","Wu Li had spearheaded this matter.","The reward was substantial.","The requirement was for as many experts with thirty million divine power as possible. “Beast God Weapon!” Jian Wushuang stood aside, holding a jade slip to examine the map.","At the same time, he had Wu Li inform Babata of the location.","“Zalong Mountain!”","The location was the same.","The marked location inside the jade slip was Zalong Mountain.","The task Wu Li accepted was also to meet at Zalong Mountain.","There might be no delay.","“To reach Zalong Mountain, using cosmic-level speed, it would take twelve thousand years?” Jian Wushuang was stunned by Babata’s report.","Cosmic-level speed was one-third of his full speed.","That meant it would take him four thousand years of full-speed flight to reach Zalong Mountain.","The location of the Immortal Divine Hall was at the edge of the Star Field of the Gods. Speaking of which, Zalong Mountain was actually within the sphere of influence of the Immortal Temple.","Unfortunately, Danbao’s strength was not enough, and he was too easy-going.","The demigod of Zalong Mountain had been occupying it and had no intention of moving away.","This time, Wu Li’s task was still to help the son of the Lord of Zalong Mountain to find a treasure.","It was said to be a rite of passage trial.","Even though it was called a rite of passage, the time spent cultivating might be much longer than theirs.","It was just that he had a good father.","Having just become a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master, he could head to the spacetime gorge.","His strength would not be inferior to theirs.","The demigod on Zalong Mountain was no ordinary being, and his direct descendants would not be weak either.","They had been able to dominate the Star Field of the Gods for so many years. Without some strength, they would have long been chased away by Elder Blu.","“Brother Wushuang, regarding the matter of the Beast God Weapon, don’t worry. I am sworn brothers with that young master. This time, I’m purely going to help out. After it’s done, I’ll ask for a Beast God Weapon. That shouldn’t be too much to ask, right?” Wu Li said simply from the side.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile. If only it were that simple.","If it were so straightforward, he wouldn’t mind setting up a few tables and forming a","brotherly bond with the other party.","But would it really go that smoothly?","12,000 years passed in the blink of an eye.","Through the pyramid, they saw Zalong Mountain.","The grand mountain pierced through the clouds.","Below was an ancient city full of a wild aura, extremely impressive.","It was the stronghold of a demigod expert.","Such an exaggerated place made Jian Wushuang feel it was a bit absurd.","Logically, his strength should be about the same as the other party’s.","Could he also secure some territory?","After some thought, he decided against it.","He still had enemies hunting him. Getting territory would just be a burden. If things went","south, he could leave without any attachments.","“We’re here. Head to the Qingshui Hall in the eastern city. Young Master Hong Long is","waiting for us there!” Wu Li controlled the pyramid, entering the ancient city, casually tossing out several mixed yuan stones and a token. The guards who had intended to stop the pyramid saw the token of Zalong Mountain and retreated.","Wu Li was quite proud of this and said with a faint smile, “This time, thanks to this pyramid, I usually take millions of years to fly here. This time, it only took ten thousand years.”","Jian Wushuang sighed at this.","He originally thought the other’s vision should be broader, having stayed on the Realm God Continent. But it seemed things were the same as before.","This was nothing.","Flying at full speed, utilizing the Origin Source, he probably wouldn’t need a thousand years.","Even without the Origin Source, he could reach Zalong Mountain in four thousand years.","There was no other way. The Realm God Continent was too vast, and the space was too stable","to tear through. Essentially, their speed was slowed down.","Zalong Mountain belonged to the Star Field of the Gods.","Beyond Zalong Mountain was another star field.","The star fields on the Realm God Continent were countless.","However, many had been destroyed, and the surviving star fields were few.","Around the Star Field of the Gods, outside Zalong Mountain, lay a mostly ruined star field.","“Silver Blue Star Field.”","It was also the star field where Wu Zuo and others had gone to that starry sky secret realm.","In that starry sky secret realm, the fallen Universe God was once the Emperor of the Silver Blue Star Field. After his fall, the star field declined, but there were still several Universe Gods.","Each star field had Universe Gods, just in varying numbers.","The relatively weaker Silver Blue Star Field had only four Universe Gods, and their strength was just average among their peers. Yet, they were not figures Jian Wushuang and his group","could provoke.","Now, facing even a demigod, they had to be extremely cautious.","There was no choice. Some demigods hid their strength deeply.","The threshold for demigods was 40 million.","That was the threshold in spacetime.","The threshold on the Realm God Continent was 45 million.","This was just the threshold; demigods weren’t necessarily just this strong.","Just like how 1 million divine power was the threshold for the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","No one would believe the other party only had 1 million divine power. There might be a heaven-defying existence with 50 or 60 million divine power.","Some heaven-defying demigods even had hundreds of millions of divine power.","Those were the truly super strong.","However, the Lord of Zalong Mountain did not have that kind of strength.","He should be about the same as Jian Wushuang at his peak.","It was just hard to probe with mental power; otherwise, he would have checked thoroughly.","If their divine power was similar, he could definitely go and negotiate for a Beast God","Weapon.","If not strong enough, it would be better to obediently flatter Wu Li’s sworn brother!"]},{"number":6147,"title":"Chapter 6147: Young Master Hong Long","paragraphs":["Chapter 6147: Young Master Hong Long","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just arriving at the Realm King Continent, it was best to remain low-key for now.","Buzz!","The pyramid-shaped object gradually shrank, passing through the city’s restriction barrier and stopping above a serene hall.","Clang!","A metal plate slowly descended from the bottom of the pyramid.","Led by Wu Li, five people slowly walked down from the metal plate.","As soon as they landed, a voice echoed from within the hall.","The tone was extremely polite, and a figure instantly walked out from the hall.","“Wu Li, you really kept me waiting!” A handsome young man in a white robe stepped out of the hall and greeted them.","As soon as the other party appeared, Jian Wushuang cautiously used his mind power to probe.","Ordinary divine power, around thirty million.","Just after breaking through, he already had 30 million divine power.","It was evident that the master of Zhalong Mountain valued this son greatly, providing him with a large amount of resources.","It should be known that the cherished treasures of these Realm Kings received similar treatment.","Although the Realm King had no physical form and his combat power was like air, he had connections and treasures.","This was much stronger than a demigod.","The status of a young master of Zhalong Mountain, comparable to the disciples of a Realm King, was already quite good.","With a base divine power of 30 million, if his divine power secret techniques were strong enough, it wouldn’t be a problem to burst to 38 million. Given his status, with some treasures, he could reach 40 million divine power.","All five of them, including Jian Wushuang, had divine power above 40 million.","Their base divine power, except for Jian Wushuang himself who only had 20 million, was at least 30 million, with Wu Li even reaching around 35 million.","None of them were weaker than the other party.","This allowed Jian Wushuang to breathe a sigh of relief. Their hidden divine power was stronger than the other party’s, so they could handle any urgent situations that might arise.","Wu Li, on the other hand, engaged in a dramatic reunion with the other party, playing out a long-lost brotherhood.","The two embraced and sighed, “Since our parting years ago, I have missed you dearly!”","This acting, compared to the past, had somewhat declined, Jian Wushuang mused silently.","Under the surprised gazes of the others, Wu Li felt it was about time, so he released the other party and began to introduce Jian Wushuang and the others to the young master of Hong Long.","“Come, these are all prodigies from the Star Field of the Gods. If I’m not around in the future, just look for them; it’s all the same.” Wu Li boasted as if the Star Field of the Gods was their home turf.","Jian Wushuang smiled wryly to himself and could only nod.","The young master of Hong Long was also a straightforward person. He immediately waved and ordered the servants, “Go, summon Brother Shangyang and Elder Zhuge, and tell them we have distinguished guests!”","“Please!” After instructing the servants, he immediately smiled and courteously invited everyone into the hall.","From this, it was clear that the other party was not a spoiled brat; he valued friendships and connections.","This exceeded Jian Wushuang’s expectations, and he looked at Wu Li with newfound respect, grateful he hadn’t found a troublesome friend.","Entering the hall, they each took their seats.","Jian Wushuang had the lowest apparent strength. Although the other party couldn’t discern his realm, they could feel his divine power. There was no need for him to hide it.","Concealing his realm was fine.","He boldly revealed his 20 million divine power.","Among them, he was the weakest, naturally taking the last seat, listening as Wu Li praised them from above.","Young Master Hong Long also politely toasted each of them, sharing many details about Zhalong Mountain during the banquet.","This helped Jian Wushuang understand that practitioners on the Realm King Continent also faced significant pressure.","Take Young Master Hong Long, for instance; he had seven brothers.","Four of them had died young.","Now, only two elder brothers remained.","He was the youngest.","Both elder brothers were in the Ninth Tribulation.","Their divine power was stronger than his.","Who would inherit Zhalong Mountain in the future was uncertain.","His father, the lord of Zhalong Mountain, was a powerful demigod and an ancient one at that.","Currently, he was planning a major tribulation.","The divine tribulation was no joke.","When crossing the tribulation, it was earth-shattering, and there was no need to hide anything.","But if he failed, he needed a successor.","Three sons, countless disciples.","He had to choose one.","For now, the disciples could wait.","After all, not all the sons were dead yet!","Moreover, the remaining three sons were all quite excellent.","Especially the youngest, Hong Long.","He had the shortest training time but considerable strength and had even received a special inheritance.","He was the most likely to succeed Zhalong Mountain.","Mainly because his personality was suitable.","He could be accommodating.","He made friends widely and was loyal and righteous.","His father felt reassured about passing Zhalong Mountain to his youngest son.","So, he invested heavily in him.","The young master of Hong Long worked hard to live up to his father’s expectations.","This trial in the spacetime canyon could be considered the final test.","Once he obtained that treasure, using it to train for millions of epochs, his divine power could reach the threshold of a demigod, allowing him to take over Zhalong Mountain.","Thus, the old lord could focus on crossing the tribulation.","As they got to know each other, they chatted for less than a quarter of an hour before there was a commotion outside the hall.","Soon, two figures walked in simultaneously.","One was a young man, frivolous in demeanor, with handsome features that rivaled the young master of Hong Long but fell short compared to Jian Wushuang.","The other person, who appeared elderly with numerous wrinkles crisscrossing his face, should be Elder Zhuge mentioned by Young Master Hong Long.","Just by looking at his face, one could tell that this Elder Zhuge had experienced a lot.","His basic divine power alone was around 36 million.","At his peak battle strength, he might have reached the threshold of a demigod.","He was definitely not an ordinary strong practitioner.","“Come, let me introduce you all. This is my guest from Zalong Mountain, Brother Shangyang. Though he is young, his peak divine power exceeds 40 million. And this is Elder Zhuge, who followed my father for many years. He should be in his years of seclusion, but due to the matter of the Spacetime Canyon, we still have to trouble this Elder Zhuge!” Young Master Hong Long introduced the two strong practitioners with great formality.","However, Jian Wushuang could tell from his words that these two were not his people.","Or rather, they were not people of Young Master Hong Long.","Guest Elder “Shangyang” merely smiled and cupped his hands towards them, showing respect as a guest to the host.","But Elder Zhuge, after finding a place, only cupped his hands slightly towards Young Master Hong Long before sitting down casually and closing his eyes to rest.","Although Young Master Hong Long felt a bit embarrassed about this, he did not blame him, as Elder Zhuge was an old servant.","He changed the topic and started talking about the spacetime rift.","Speaking of which, this spacetime rift was a treasure trove discovered by his father.","Some treasures would drift inside.","It opened once every 100,000 eras and would accumulate some treasures each time.","However, when it opened, it was still their Zalong Mountain that went to search for them.","Such lucrative opportunities did not fall to others.","There were treasures, but also dangers.","Some demonic creatures fallen into spacetime would also enter the spacetime rift."]},{"number":6148,"title":"Chapter 6148: Star Field Bandits","paragraphs":["Chapter 6148: Star Field Bandits","He was quite powerful, almost reaching the demigod level.","This time, he went to the spacetime rift because his father informed him that a remarkable treasure had floated in from the spacetime rift. It was considered a semi-divine artifact, and it was an auxiliary type of treasure.","Obtaining this treasure would not only quickly make him a demigod but also nurture his divine body.","If he failed, this matter would be handed over to his two brothers.","So, he had to succeed.","For this, he even dug out an elder and a guest from his father’s side.","As for himself, he had a few confidants, specially arranged by his father to be by his side.","They were all disciples of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Their peak divine power was around 40 million each, a total of six people.","It could be considered a small squad to protect him.","Originally, he planned to bring these people with him, but when he heard that Wu Li was bringing friends to join in the fun and gain some benefits, he readily agreed.","Regarding the treasure in the spacetime rift, he only wanted that one item, and the rest he didn’t care about.","It was the first time Wu Li heard about the spacetime rift, and after listening, a trace of greed appeared in his eyes, though he hid it well.","He turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang and the others, laughing, “Then everyone, please accompany my brother on this trip!”","As for the treasure in the spacetime rift, everyone wasn’t very concerned.","They just wanted to help the other party so that Jian Wushuang could ask for that Beast God Weapon.","But after hearing about the origin of the spacetime rift, they started communicating with each other, each becoming like a greedy wolf.","The spacetime rift opened once every hundred thousand epochs, bringing in some floating treasures.","So, how many treasures did the first discoverer of the spacetime rift, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain, obtain?","The quantity was probably unimaginable.","Moreover, since the Lord of Zhalong Mountain took over this place, he had been very low- key, which was unlike his usual personality.","He even gave up the right to his territory, fully entrusting it to his subordinates, and had been in seclusion.","It was probably because he had obtained a large number of treasures and had no interest in managing any territory, focusing solely on rushing towards becoming a Universe Master.","If...","Their thoughts were similar, all driven by poverty, and upon hearing that Zhalong Mountain was still a treasure trove, they all had evil thoughts.","“Forget it, we just arrived, and I think this Young Master Hong Long looks good too, so let’s not have any ideas about him!”","Jian Wushuang hurriedly stopped them, fearing they would go too far.","Those treasures were indeed tempting; there might be a large number of Starry Sky treasures that could help him enhance his basic divine power and even treasures that could boost his Origin Source.","He might even be able to face the Ninth Tribulation soon.","But compared to the beast divine weapon, he thought more long-term and steadier.","The key point was that Young Master Hong Long did not hide these secrets from them.","It was clearly no longer a secret.","There were probably many people with the same idea.","There were still many demigod territories near Zhalong Mountain.","Even territories of Universe Masters, if they hadn’t acted, it wouldn’t be that simple for them to just come and take.","“Cough, cough, we should plan this out carefully, let’s get the beast divine weapon first!” Wu Li also paused, transmitting his voice to everyone.","At the wine table, they happened to be talking about Jian Wushuang.","Wu Li took the opportunity to give a slight reprimand.","“My little brother here, his strength isn’t that great, he came this time just to broaden his horizons!” Wu Li sat at the top, like an elder brother, which made Divine Wood King very unhappy.","In the past, he would have pulled him down long ago.","In terms of seniority.","Divine Wood King was the elder brother.","In terms of strength, it was Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","At this moment, he could only endure.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind, back then, he was Wu Li’s nephew, and even tracing back to the Origin Source, he reincarnated into the Wu family and should be calling Wu Li an ancestor.","These were all just jokes.","Taking this opportunity, Wu Li asked, “By the way, Brother Hong Long, does that shop in Zhalong City have any treasures containing Starry Sky power? I happen to need some this time!”","“Then you’re asking the right person. Brother Shangyang is the owner of the largest shop in Zhalong City. You should ask him.”","Jian Wushuang was delighted in his heart, not expecting Wu Li to remember what he had said. The first thing he needed was Beast God weapons, and the second was treasures containing","Starry Sky power.","However, this statement caught the attention of Elder Zhuge.","Elder Zhuge cast a cold glance at Wu Li.","Wu Li’s body froze at the sight.","If the other party weren’t an elder of Zhalong Mountain, he would have dragged him out for a","beating.","Such arrogance and disrespect.","When they reached the spacetime rift and encountered terrifying monsters, he would have to calculate against the other party.","“The whole Zhalong City is out of stock!” Elder Zhuge said coldly, “Just yesterday, they were bought out by a group of Star Field bandits!”","Star Field bandits?","This was the first time Jian Wushuang and the others had heard of them.","Wu Li, however, pretended to understand and asked, “Star Field bandits? They dare to appear","in the Star Field of the Gods? Have they gone far? I’ll inform my martial uncle to wipe them","out!”","“Hmph!” Elder Zhuge sneered, “They have four demigods. Can you wipe them out?”","Young Master Hong Long frowned, feeling that this elder was being somewhat excessive. He quickly changed the topic by bringing up the Star Field bandits.","He took the opportunity to shift the conversation.","Star Field bandits were a group of rogue cultivators drifting between various star fields,","forming a super force.","This force was generally scattered, but whenever they formed a group, they became","extremely terrifying.","They dared to steal and even rob from anywhere except the territory of the Universe Gods.","Therefore, ordinary demigod territories were not just afraid of provoking them; they were","afraid when they arrived.","However, the Star Field bandits who came to Zhalong Mountain seemed to have some sense, knowing that the lord of Zhalong Mountain was not to be trifled with, so they did not linger. They left after buying the treasures containing Starry Sky power from the shop. Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was not interested in the Star Field bandits but was very intrigued by the person who bought the treasures containing Starry Sky power.","Buying so many at once.","Either they needed treasures containing Starry Sky power, or they were cultivating some kind","of Starry Sky secret technique.","Or... they had mastered Starry Sky divine power or Starry Sky Origin Source.","He belonged to the latter group.","Not only had he mastered Starry Sky divine power, but he also controlled Starry Sky power.","Generally, those who mastered Starry Sky divine power were already rare.","If this were true, then it could only be said that he was lucky this time.","He had encountered a peer.","Both of them had mastered Starry Sky divine power and needed treasures containing Starry","Sky power to enhance their divine power.","Jian Wushuang conveyed this information to everyone through voice transmission.","He reminded them to be careful.","This group of Star Field bandits might have a complicated purpose.","Coupled with the previous spacetime rift incident and his own suspicions.","If it truly were someone who had mastered Starry Sky divine power, they might indeed dare to","attack Zhalong Mountain.","The group chatted until it got dark.","They also agreed on a time to depart the next morning.","Originally wanting to take a walk around Zhalong City, Jian Wushuang chose to stay indoors instead, preparing for the departure the next day."]},{"number":6149,"title":"Chapter 6149: Caught","paragraphs":["Chapter 6149: Caught","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They stayed in the same grand hall.","However, within the hall, there was no one.","Only a triangular pyramid.","“Phew!”","Upon entering this place, everyone finally breathed a sigh of relief.","“A temporal rift!”","“Hu Qing, what do you think about this?”","Jian Wushuang threw the matter to Hu Qing. He spoke the least, but he certainly had his own ideas.","They were not discussing how to seize Zhalong Mountain but were instead discussing the origin of the temporal rift.","Upon hearing this, Hu Qing expressed his opinion.","“This temporal rift should be somewhat similar to the abyss in the Northern Spacetime, only the temporal rift here is more powerful!”","Divine Wood King asked, “What do you mean by that?”","Everyone looked at Hu Qing.","“Brother Wushuang, are you certain the Beast God Weapon is in Zhalong Mountain?”","“Certain, and it’s most likely in the hands of the lord of Zhalong Mountain!” Jian Wushuang nodded. Although he dared not sense it directly, the prophet map given by Danbao marked Zhalong Mountain.","If it were in Zhalong Mountain City, he would have discovered it long ago.","If it were on Zhalong Mountain, a treasure drifting from the Northern Spacetime would most likely be obtained by the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Upon hearing the definitive answer, Hu Qing provided his conclusion.","It was simple.","The Beast God Weapon likely drifted through the temporal rift and was obtained by the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","100,000 epochs, a very brief period.","Every 100,000 epochs, the lord of Zhalong Mountain would plunder treasures.","Opportunities rarely remained for future generations.","This time, it was a test for Young Master Hong Long.","Moreover, the lord of Zhalong Mountain was so certain there was a semi-divine weapon because he had visited the temporal rift. After finding no special treasures, he gave this opportunity to his son. Or perhaps there were special treasures, and he simply took them himself.","Speaking of which, this treasure land made Hu Qing very tempted.","Visiting once every 100,000 epochs was like harvesting crops.","It could also be set to be harvested once every million epochs.","Or even ten million epochs.","Everything was decided by the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Occupying such a treasure land, there was indeed no need to struggle.","It was like sitting in an infinitely growing treasure vault.","If it were him, he wouldn’t venture out either. Who knows, perhaps one day, a divine artifact might drift over from a spacetime rift.","Such a high-level treasure land, yet it was occupied by a demigod.","It shouldn’t be.","There was definitely a secret.","If it was truly occupied by a demigod, it would probably be kept under wraps.","“Stop thinking about it. When I become a Universe Master, I’ll bestow this treasure land upon you all!” Wu Li laughed heartily, leaned back in his chair, and closed his eyes to rest.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and also closed his eyes.","The next morning.","As the first ray of sunlight fell, everyone was already packed and ready.","The pyramid was also put away.","Just as they stepped out of the hall, they saw that Young Master Hong Long was already waiting.","This time, the team originally consisted of nine people.","Young Master Hong Long, Guest Elder Shangyang, Elder Zhuge, and six guards.","Now, with Jian Wushuang and his four companions, there were already 14 people.","Each possessed divine power of 40 million.","If they reached the Northern Spacetime, they could sweep through it.","In the Realm God Continent, however, they seemed worthless.","They had gathered so many strong individuals so easily.","“Let’s go!”","With Young Master Hong Long’s command, everyone boarded a flying bird, soared into the sky, and left the Qingshui Hall.","As they departed, a crow perched on a wooden building across the street let out a call and then flew away.","As the treasured flying bird Bluebird just flew out of Zhalong City, a message was transmitted to the outside world.","A team of black-clad figures, hidden in the mountains not far from the spacetime rift, received the message.","“Lion King, the crow has sent word; they’ve already set off!”","In the mountains, the leader, a man in golden armor, tore off his black cloak and grinned, “Prepare to follow them!”","“Aren’t we waiting for the crow?” A voice from the shadows sounded somewhat apprehensive.","The Golden Armored Lion King pulled the figure out of the darkness, revealing an extremely strange face with stitches at the corners of his mouth and bizarre patterns painted on his face.","“Xi Jiu, if you’re scared, stay here. I’ll leave a share of the treasure for you!” The Lion King’s cold gaze bore into the other, and after receiving no response for a long time, he sneered, “Then follow me closely, you freak!”","After casually tossing Xi Jiu aside, the Lion King continued to observe the edge of the spacetime rift with a special power.","The darkness in the mountains lit up, revealing a teleportation array.","Once activated, it could enter the spacetime rift.","The chaotic spacetime within would conceal their entry.","But Xi Jiu, the freak, was still very afraid.","He knew how many strong individuals had fallen within the spacetime rift.","There was even a demigod with divine power of 70 million.","That’s why no one dared to covet Zhalong Mountain.","The lord of Zhalong Mountain was more like a freak, having killed countless who had tried to spy on this place.","Yet, they still dared to come.","Fortune favors the bold.","Moreover, this time, they were only after the treasures within the spacetime rift.","However, the leading Lion King did not think so.","He wanted the entire spacetime canyon.","“Zongzheng, I’ll enter soon. If what you gave me doesn’t work, I’ll make sure you pay!” The Lion King sent a threatening message to the outside world.","By a lake near Zhalong Mountain, a noble man in luxurious clothes disdainfully responded to the Lion King’s message.","“Stop spouting nonsense. This time, I’m staking my life on it!”","This group was the same star field bandits who had previously come to Zhalong City to procure items containing Starry Sky power.","They were indeed after the spacetime rift, just as Jian Wushuang had guessed.","Now they were here to seize it.","And they had a plan to deal with the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Meanwhile, on Jian Wushuang’s side.","Zhalong City was very close to the spacetime rift.","It took only half a day to reach it.","The Bluebird’s speed was similar to the secret realm speed of the pyramid.","If it were the pyramid using cosmic-level speed, it would take the time of one incense stick to reach.","For Jian Wushuang, at full speed, it would only take a few breaths.","For the lord of Zhalong Mountain, it would be an instant!","That’s why Zhalong Mountain was chosen as the sect’s base.","Only when it was nearby could they feel at ease.","As for why they didn’t make this place the sect’s base.","That would be too exaggerated.","The surroundings were desolate.","Not suitable, nor appropriate.","Too conspicuous would not be good either.","Being able to reach it instantly was enough.","No need to station there.","The spacetime rift wouldn’t disappear; if anyone dared to come, they would be killed.","There was no getting past this checkpoint.","“We’ve arrived!” Young Master Hong Long was the first to disembark from the bird, pointing to the large formation ahead, “This is a large formation crafted by a Universe Master my father hired. Once activated, even a Universe Master would need three breaths to break it. In those three breaths, my father could reach the formation and defend it, holding out for a month.”"]},{"number":6150,"title":"Chapter 6150: Small Interlude","paragraphs":["Chapter 6150: Small Interlude","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Then what?” Divine Wood King directly asked.","For a moment, the atmosphere became extremely awkward.","Even Wu Li, who usually spoke without thinking, didn’t know how to smooth things over.","Hong Long, however, remained calm. He glanced at Divine Wood King and explained, “A month from now, the spacetime fissures will collapse, and no more treasures will appear after that!”","“Brilliant!” Wu Li quickly flattered, “Your father’s technique is truly unique, even the Universe Masters are helpless against it, simply admirable!”","“You flatter me. It’s just that those high and mighty Universe Masters don’t care about these treasures. If they did, my father would probably have to give them up, considering the cost of offending a Universe Master is too great!” Hong Long was very humble.","However, Jian Wushuang felt that the cost was enough.","If you offend someone, so be it, but you can’t just hand things over to others, right?","It’s likely that the Lord of Zalong Mountain had secretly competed with many Universe Masters and ultimately won, allowing him to maintain control of this place.","Fortunately, they didn’t follow up on this topic yesterday, or it would have been a death sentence.","It’s more practical to cooperate honestly.","“Alright, let’s go in directly!” Hong Long said without further ado, taking out a token and directly opening the entrance to the formation.","But just as everyone was about to enter, a mountain peak not far from there suddenly exploded.","The massive commotion momentarily distracted everyone, drawing their attention to the exploding mountain.","A purple stone Qilin suddenly burst out from the mountain, its divine power already reaching 40 million.","“It turns out to be a purple stone Qilin, just a low-grade divine beast. Qing Xuan, go and drive it away!” Hong Long casually instructed, then turned his attention back to the formation.","After checking the formation and finding no changes, he felt relieved.","No one thought it was a coincidence.","They all found it somewhat suspicious.","After confirming there was no issue with the formation, Hong Long finally sighed in relief.","His guard captain, Qing Xuan, had already returned.","Hong Long was not surprised by his own people; how could he not know their strength?","This was also to warn the others, letting them know that his subordinates were not weaker than them.","Especially to warn Elder Zhuge.","Just because you’re experienced doesn’t mean you can do whatever you want and disregard him.","His guard captain, “Qing Xuan,” was also his senior sister, a disciple of his father.","Divine power of 43 million.","Only slightly weaker than Elder Zhuge.","“Young Master!” Qing Xuan was still holding a pulsating heart.","The sight made Wu Li’s heart beat faster.","Just now, Qing Xuan had unleashed ten thousand swords in an instant, easily killing the purple stone Qilin.","“It’s just a beast, no need to kill it!” Hong Long pretended to scold, “Keep it yourself. There are plenty of monsters around here, don’t provoke them again!”","But just as he finished speaking, another monster appeared.","Hong Long held his head, helplessly saying, “Forget it, don’t mind them, let’s go!”","With that, he led everyone into the spacetime canyon.","Upon entering, Wu Li quietly transmitted his voice, “Brother Wushuang, how does that little girl’s swordsmanship compare to yours?”","“No comparison!”","“Just say who’s stronger, you or her?”","“She was stronger than me back then, but not now!”","“How long ago?”","“About... a hundred million epochs ago!”","Wu Li then shut up.","He didn’t know much about Jian Wushuang’s strength.","But Hu Qing’s strength had shocked him quite a bit.","It seemed that Jian Wushuang was still stronger.","To be so strong a hundred million epochs ago.","Now he had reached the Eighth Tribulation realm, no problem with his demigod combat power.","After entering the spacetime canyon.","A sense of disorientation hit them.","There were also some small spacetime fissures, and one careless move could split the divine body in half.","Though not fatal, it would damage the divine body.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was condensed from Starry Sky divine power.","The previous life force and power of all things were useless now.","He needed to be cautious about any treasures containing the power of the Starry Sky; he couldn’t afford to get hurt.","Otherwise, even with his Origin Source Starry Sky, recovery would be slow.","While not as slow as ordinary cultivators, it would still take several hundred years.","This would be considered lightning speed for ordinary cultivators, but for Jian Wushuang, who could restore his divine power in an instant in the past, it was torturously slow.","Thus, once he entered the spacetime fissure, he became exceptionally careful.","He displayed his weakest strength and took the opportunity to walk in the middle, right next to that young master, Hong Long.","The deeper they went into the spacetime canyon, the more numerous the fissures became.","However, these fissures were invisible, like lines.","They couldn’t flow treasures but could cause injuries.","His mind had to be taut, as one careless move could result in severe injury.","Half of this strenuous task was assigned to Hong Long’s guards, and the other half to Wu Li and others.","However, Qing Xuan and Wu Li were positioned at the front and back, one protecting Jian Wushuang and the others, the other protecting Hong Long.","As for Ke Shangyang and Elder Zhuge, they didn’t seem very eager to contribute.","After spending half a day in the canyon, they had found nothing.","Young Master Hong Long was not in a hurry, holding a compass in his hand, searching for the treasure he sought.","“Turn around, the spacetime is in disarray, and we’ve gone the wrong way!” Hong Long continuously adjusted their route.","Entering the inner perimeter was quite troublesome.","Without Hong Long leading the way, even if they were given the place, it would be difficult to find any treasures.","Jian Wushuang had a different story. Due to the spacetime disorder, his Thought power was fully expanded, covering a much wider range than theirs.","He had already seen a few floating treasures.","Some were at the level of the Seventh Tribulation, and some at the Eighth Tribulation.","He didn’t pay them any mind, knowing that even the others wouldn’t be interested.","Otherwise, he could have used his mental power to guide them over.","“Hmm?”","A powerful aura was captured by his mental power; it was a semi-divine artifact.","A large seal.","He felt a surge of joy in his heart.","Entering the Realm God Continent with nothing, he needed money to buy treasures containing the power of the Starry Sky.","Although after reaching the Eighth Tribulation, an epoch within his Origin Source could produce tens of millions of mixed yuan stones, it still wasn’t enough.","After painstakingly saving up a hundred billion mixed primordial stone, he found out that even an ordinary treasure couldn’t be exchanged for that.","Because treasures containing the power of the Starry Sky had to be exchanged for Starry Sky Crystals at the very least.","Starry Sky Crystals were condensed by the Starry Sky itself.","They were the hard currency of the Starry Sky.","Only Universe Masters could condense them.","And it was quite troublesome.","Jian Wushuang didn’t have a single one.","So, upon seeing that semi-divine artifact, he felt immense joy.","That semi-divine artifact, if sold, could fetch hundreds of billions of mixed yuan stones.","Exchanging for Starry Sky Crystals, he could get hundreds of them.","Without Starry Sky treasures, absorbing Starry Sky Crystals would work just as well."]},{"number":6151,"title":"Chapter 6151: Unexpected Discoveries","paragraphs":["Chapter 6151: Unexpected Discoveries","Anyway, his basic divine power was very low.","The improvement was fast enough.","He decided to take action, and with a thought, he guided the great seal towards their position.","At the same time, he transmitted a message to Wu Li, instructing him to adjust his position and prepare to snatch the treasure.","After all, Young Master Hong Long had said that any treasures obtained would belong to them, with only his treasure being an exception.","Wu Li was delighted upon hearing this, not expecting Jian Wushuang to have such abilities. After switching positions with Hu Qing, he sat and waited for the treasure to come flying over. It wasn’t that Jian Wushuang didn’t trust Hu Qing, but Hu Qing was not suitable for the task of turning hostile to snatch the treasure.","Just as Wu Li and Hu Qing switched positions, the treasure suddenly disappeared.","In its place, a terrifying aura remained.","That aura was definitely not from some so-called demon or a remnant from a spacetime rift.","He had guided it around the spacetime rift.","“Not good, there’s another group here!” He immediately understood that someone had taken advantage of the commotion outside to sneak in.","Upon hearing this, Wu Li and the others were incredulous. “Brother Wushuang, don’t scare me. Who has such great ability to sneak in here?”","Earlier, Young Master Hong Long had said that even a Universe Master could withstand this formation.","Who could enter?","Entering would be courting death!","Under heavy rewards, brave men come forward.","Indeed, a brave man had arrived.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was calm as he transmitted a message, “Just be careful. The intruder’s strength should not exceed fifty million.”","“Fifty million!”","Wu Li suppressed his shock and said, “Fifty million is still quite a lot. Who can stop them? How about we leave?”","“I will!” Hu Qing, who had been silent, spoke up at this moment. “Leave the danger to me!”","These words made Jian Wushuang pause, but he quickly smiled.","He felt that Hu Qing was indeed reliable.","Upon hearing this, Wu Li said joyfully, “I knew Brother Hu Qing was the strongest. Come, come, you handle this!”","In just a few breaths, Wu Li and Hu Qing switched positions again.","This made many people feel strange.","But before they could think too much, demons quietly approached from all sides.","“Be careful of those demons!” Young Master Hong Long shouted angrily.","This time, Wu Li was not overly surprised. He took the initiative to strike, smashing several approaching demons with a single punch.","Those demons each had a divine power of over thirty million.","But now Wu Li’s divine power had exploded, reaching around 40 million.","The following demons had similar divine power, with few exceeding 40 million.","The crowd remained calm.","Each person had taken action, except for Jian Wushuang.","Wu Li was especially excited about the killing.","Most of the monsters were slain by him, as if he was competing with Qing Xuan on the side.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang sent a voice transmission reminding, “Brother Wu Li, hold back a bit. These monsters were lured here, and there are demigod-level monsters among the ones following.”","Although he hadn’t taken action, his Thought power had been observing these monsters.","He felt something was amiss. The monsters were all heading towards them.","Clearly, they were being targeted.","Moreover, the subsequent monsters had divine power exceeding 45 million.","They had to be careful.","Upon hearing this, Wu Li quickly withdrew his fist, retreated behind the crowd, and covered his mouth with his fist, pretending to cough, “I’ve used up most of my divine power. I’ll leave the remaining monsters to you all!”","“Brother Wu Li, you’ve worked hard. These monsters aren’t worth your effort!” Hong Long, the young master, didn’t expect Wu Li to be so generous. He had fought through an entire group of monsters, leaving only a few stragglers before retreating.","They were practically like brothers from different mothers!","Otherwise, why would he help him so much?","Although Wu Li’s words had issues, it was impossible for his divine power to be consumed so quickly.","But Hong Long felt Wu Li must have used up at least twenty to thirty percent of his divine","power.","Little did he know that Wu Li was merely warming up.","The life force he obtained from Dan Bao could fill an ocean. Even if he used up thirty to fifty percent, he could instantly recover.","“You’re too kind. Compared to Elder Zhuge, I’m still far behind!” Wu Li deliberately praised Elder Zhuge, standing beside him and flattering, “Elder Zhuge, do you find these monsters too weak to bother with?”","Elder Zhuge didn’t say a word, merely pointing his finger and effortlessly shattering a few","monsters.","Unwilling to give up, Wu Li continued to praise, “Elder Zhuge’s divine power is indeed extraordinary. Just a casual move can crush these monsters, unlike me who used up twenty to thirty percent of my divine power. These monsters are too weak. Can’t we get a demigod- level monster for Elder Zhuge to practice on?”","A so-called demigod-level monster had around 45 million divine power, but its combat ability was lacking.","With the same amount of divine power, one could exhaust and kill a demigod-level monster.","Just as Wu Li finished speaking, a demigod-level monster indeed appeared behind Elder","Zhuge.","In the southwestern corner, Jian Wushuang and an ordinary guard with divine power around 40 million were guarding.","Jian Wushuang immediately pretended to explode in strength, directly performing the","Ancient Change.","His divine power increased to around thirty million.","“Save me!”","Increasing his divine power was for escape.","Wu Li showed a look of surprise, quickly shouting, “Elder Zhuge, I’ll go save them. You block","that monster!”","At this moment, another demigod-level monster appeared in front, which Qing Xuan had","already intercepted.","Elder Zhuge had no choice but to grit his teeth and take action.","He couldn’t just pretend he didn’t see it!","Wu Li went to save Jian Wushuang.","No one would save Hong Long’s guard.","If he fell, Hong Long would only resent him.","After some hesitation, Elder Zhuge had to take action.","He flew out.","Passing by Jian Wushuang and the guard, he cursed, “Useless!”","These words were overheard by Hong Long, who frowned.","Wu Li conveniently rescued the guard.","This warmed Hong Long’s heart.","He instantly felt that the friends he made were more useful than the old retainers.","At least these people obeyed him, unlike Elder Zhuge who was so arrogant.","Even rescuing his own people, he hesitated.","And then spoke arrogantly.","Living for so long, he hadn’t even reached the threshold of a demigod, truly useless.","Boom!","Just as Jian Wushuang was fake-rescued by Wu Li, a powerful aura exploded behind them.","Elder Zhuge had engaged in battle with the demigod-level monster.","In front, Qing Xuan was also fighting evenly with the monster.","For a moment, everyone had to stop.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t secretly diverted many monsters, at least ten demigod-level","monsters would have attacked now.","On the other side of the spacetime canyon.","Lion King frowned and coldly said, “Strange, why did these monsters suddenly change","direction halfway?”","“Normal, these monsters have no will!” Xi Jiu explained beside him, only to be kicked hard by","Lion King.","“Do I need you to remind me?”"]},{"number":6152,"title":"Chapter 6152: Sneak Attack!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6152: Sneak Attack!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Lion King grew impatient and frowned, saying, “Enough. We’ve tested enough. It’s time for us to act. Kill the remaining people and capture that Young Master Hong Long!”","“Yes!” Xijiu, who had climbed up from the ground, did not dare to show resentment and only respectfully accepted the order.","They didn’t know that everything was guided by Jian Wushuang.","All to lure them out.","If they wanted to rely on the monsters to test them, Jian Wushuang would not give them the chance.","If dozens of demigod monsters really came, Hu Qing would definitely reveal his true divine power, and then the opponents would be scared away or come back with more precautions, which would be bad.","The enemy was also in the dark, so they had to be more careful.","Caution could be the key to eternal safety!","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang’s mind power detected several terrifying auras quietly approaching them. As soon as they entered his mind power range, he noticed their movements.","“Everyone, the fish have taken the bait!”","Everyone understood what this meant.","Only the people around Young Master Hong Long were still foolishly dealing with those monsters.","This time, saving the other party was enough for them to kneel and thank him.","If it weren’t for the Beast God Weapon, he wouldn’t have bothered to act as a bodyguard for the other party.","The key was that this time the situation had escalated.","They had encountered the ambushing Star Field bandits.","That terrifying aura was exactly like the Star Field bandits Young Master Hong Long had described.","However, the person Jian Wushuang expected to master the Starry Sky divine power did not seem to be present, or perhaps no one had mastered the Starry Sky divine power.","If they were here, it could have compensated for his losses this time.","Buzz!","Hu Qing was the first to start gathering energy.","At the moment the Star Field bandits approached, he took the lead and caught them off guard.","“Hmm?” Lion King, the leader of the bandits, frowned and discovered that Hu Qing’s divine power was not inferior to his own, even surpassing 50 million.","With just a clash of stances, he was pushed back.","A massive aura exploded.","Young Master Hong Long was also stunned.","Seeing Lion King, he realized they had been tricked.","“Forget about those monsters, retreat first!” His reaction was quick. The sudden appearance of the Star Field bandits, combined with the burst of powerful divine power from Hu Qing and the others, left him uneasy.","But retreating now?","It was already too late.","The Star Field bandits were not alone.","Lion King was held back by Hu Qing, while the other bandits charged at Elder Zhuge and Guest Official Shangyang.","For a time, a fierce battle erupted around them.","Guard Qingxuan shook off the monsters and came to Young Master Hong Long’s side.","At this moment, she had to ensure the young master’s safety and could not leave his side.","“Brother Wu Li is so strong!” Young Master Hong Long was also stunned.","Besides Hu Qing, Wu Li’s divine power also reached about a demigod level.","With a wooden sword, he had toppled several Star Field bandits.","Divine Wood King and Wu Zuo also possessed formidable divine power exceeding 40 million. They could barely hold off those Star Field bandits.","Their treasures and divine bodies were not inferior.","However, Elder Zhuge was in trouble. He not only had to deal with the demigod monster but was also besieged by two Star Field bandits.","Only Jian Wushuang was the most relaxed, standing behind Young Master Hong Long, without any intention of making a move.","Instead, he was observing these Star Field bandits.","The Lion King, with about 53 million divine power, was fighting evenly with Hu Qing’s future self.","The other party couldn’t afford to prolong the fight.","Otherwise, if Young Master Hong Long’s father arrived, they would all be doomed.","“Hong Long, have you notified your father?” Jian Wushuang asked sideways.","Seeing the embarrassed look on Young Master Hong Long’s face, he realized something was wrong.","The two only exchanged glances without saying much.","For fear of alarming others.","Young Master Hong Long immediately transmitted a distress signal to the outside world, only to find that his mind power could not pass through the token.","This place already had a chaotic spacetime, and with the barrier of the formation, the only way to communicate with the outside was through his special token.","Now that the token was also isolated, he could only hope that his father could sense the commotion here.","What he didn’t know was that the Lion King had long used a special secret method to envelop the spacetime canyon in his formation. Now, no one from the outside could come in, and they couldn’t think of leaving either.","The grand formation here had effectively added to the Lion King’s dowry.","Instead, it would block anyone from the outside trying to enter.","“Looks like they came prepared!” Jian Wushuang remained calm. The combat power displayed was something Hu Qing alone could handle.","There was nothing to fear.","Since they couldn’t leave, they might as well take down the opponent!","“Hu Qing, take him down!”","Hearing this, Hu Qing, who was entangled with the Lion King, retreated half a step, his brilliance intensifying.","His future self ascended once more, jumping from 50 million to 60 million.","This terrifying divine power made even Jian Wushuang gasp.","He hadn’t expected the second-tier Future Self that Hu Qing had created to be so powerful.","With 60 million divine power, just a single encounter left Lion King severely injured.","Feeling the intense loss of his divine body, Lion King was stunned, “Who are you to possess 60 million divine power?”","“Who I am is none of your concern!”","Hu Qing did not pause, raising his hand once more to strike Lion King.","The first strike had already severely injured the Lion King, and the second shattered his divine body entirely.","“It’s over, I will undoubtedly die with a third strike!” Lion King was terrified, his golden armor shattered.","With 60 million divine power, one could claim a territory in many star fields and become a lord.","As a star field bandit, he didn’t dare to provoke such an entity!","This time, he was doomed.","Their divine power was mediocre at best, sufficient to handle someone like the Ninth Tribulation Realm Hong Long, but against a powerful demigod, they were sure to fail.","A perfect plan, ultimately defeated by divine power.","Unwillingness filled his heart!","“It seems I still have to ask for help from His Majesty!” Lion King’s eyes flickered. He took out a token and crushed it instantly.","Hu Qing noticed Lion King’s action and tried to stop him, but it was too late. He could only continue attacking?Lion King.","But as his palm fell, Lion King’s figure vanished in an instant.","“It’s a spacetime token, he actually has a spacetime token!” Hong Long shouted in surprise.","Hu Qing’s second outburst alone was enough to amaze him. He hadn’t expected Lion King, with only 50 million divine power, to possess a spacetime token.","That was a treasure that could tear open spacetime. Once torn, one could escape at will.","Even in this spacetime gorge, he could quickly leave.","Such a life-saving super treasure, he didn’t have it. He had only heard his father mention it once.","Now, it was the first time he saw it.","Fortunately, it was used by the opponent to escape.","They were safe too.","Seeing the opponent escape, Hu Qing felt some regret.","Despite his usual politeness, he had no mercy for star field bandits who committed arson and looting.","Lion King had escaped.","But those black-clad bandits he left behind did not have spacetime tokens.","Hu Qing raised his hand, his fingers pointed directly at the star field bandits, killing them instantly.","With just a single point, he killed them in an instant."]},{"number":6153,"title":"Chapter 6153: Xi Jiu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6153: Xi Jiu","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","You should know that those bandits all possessed 40 million units of divine power.","“Hm?” Hu Qing looked in surprise at a skeletal, odd-looking Star Field bandit who had managed to withstand his strike.","Just as he was about to make a second move, he was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","“Leave a tongue!”","Only then did Hu Qing halt his attack.","The Star Field bandits came quickly and died just as quickly.","Now, only one remained.","Xi Jiu!","He showed no fear. Seeing them hold back, he hurriedly stepped forward respectfully, saying, “Spare my life, and there will definitely be benefits!”","“Benefits?” Jian Wushuang smiled upon hearing this. The other party seemed sensible, so he asked, “The treasures you bought in Zhalong City that contain the power of the Starry Sky, who are they for?”","This was what he was most curious about. As for why they targeted the Spacetime Gorge, he did not care in the slightest.","At this moment, Young Master Hong Long also stepped forward, grabbing the man’s neck and coldly asking, “And who sent you? How dare you spy on the treasures of Zhalong Mountain!”","“This...” Xi Jiu glanced at Jian Wushuang and Young Master Hong Long, then finally looked towards Hu Qing.","He wasn’t a fool and knew who was stronger.","Guest Qing Shanyang saw this and quickly soothed Young Master Hong Long, saying, “Don’t rush. Let him speak slowly!”","Only then did Young Master Hong Long realize his impoliteness and slowly released Xi Jiu, saying in a low voice, “Tell us everything you know. Otherwise, you know the consequences.”","“Cough, cough...” Xi Jiu coughed a few times before staggering as he said, “So, who should I answer first?”","Even at this point, the other party still dared to haggle. Jian Wushuang frowned.","Though he found the other party somewhat sensible, he saw no fear in his eyes; instead, there was a calmness. This gave Jian Wushuang a bad premonition, and he signaled Hu Qing with a glance.","If these Star Field bandits had a backup plan, they needed to act immediately.","“Enough nonsense!” Jian Wushuang frowned, and with a thought, he enveloped Xi Jiu in his divine power.","Xi Jiu was unfazed, but as he felt that divine power, a hint of doubt flashed in his eyes. He then grinned, “Power of the Starry Sky. You, a mere kid with only 20 million units of divine power, dare to inquire? I have to admire your courage. I can only tell you, some things are better left unknown!”","The moment his divine power enveloped Xi Jiu, Jian Wushuang’s attention was drawn away.","Because around them, a pink mist had risen.","“Poison!”","Jian Wushuang shouted, “Quickly, retract your aura and don’t let it touch you!”","But his warning came too late.","Except for Hu Qing, who had been alerted early and stepped back half a step, everyone else was affected.","Young Master Hong Long was also startled and tried to retreat but it was too late.","Pink bubbles appeared on his face, spreading along his body, causing even his divine form to start decaying.","This poison was extremely potent. Even weaker demigods would perish.","Seeing this, Hu Qing wanted to help but was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","Such a terrifying poison, they had no idea what it was.","Rushing to save them might get themselves killed too.","Just moments ago, Hu Qing had unleashed sixty million units of divine power, and yet the enemy dared to scheme against them, clearly confident in their poison.","“Young Master...” Qing Xuan, who was responsible for protecting Hong Long, was the first to fall, being the closest to Xi Jiu.","The poison came from Xi Jiu’s body.","Elder Zhuge’s eyes widened in disbelief, his eyes losing their light. Before he died, he shouted unwillingly, “It’s the Cha Luohua. You are from... Du Gu’s faction!”","With a thud!","Elder Zhuge’s body and divine form shattered, his Origin Source ceasing to function.","After being poisoned, the young master Hong Long relied on his treasures to forcibly hold on, but he could not persist for long.","When he heard about Cha Luohua and Du Gu, he fell into complete despair.","Cha Luohua was a top ten deadly poison on the Realm King Continent. Once a cultivator below the Universe Master was contaminated, they would undoubtedly die.","However, this poison had a special smell, making it difficult to get close to.","Unless someone could carry this deadly poison.","The person in front of him, Xi Jiu, was just such a person.","The only person who could carry Cha Luohua in the nearby star fields was that “Emperor Du Gu!”","It was not that Emperor Du Gu could carry it, but one of his subordinates could.","With this person, Emperor Du Gu plundered several star fields, and even Universe Masters had no way to deal with him.","This person appeared here.","So, the one targeting Zhalong Mountain this time was probably Emperor Du Gu.","“Brother Wu Li!” Before the young master Hong Long fell, he turned to look at Wu Li. From Hu Qing’s outbreak to Jian Wushuang’s calmness, he could see that what Wu Li had told him before might not be a lie. They might really be super prodigies from the Star Field of the Gods, or disciples of the Spacetime Divine Sect with vast backgrounds.","“Brother Hong Long, is there anything else you want to say?” Wu Li, seeing the unwillingness on his face, also felt a bit of pity.","“Brother Wu Li, help me deliver a message to my father...” As young master Hong Long spoke, he felt a tremor in his Origin Source, and he stood frozen, unable to move.","Behind him, a dagger coated with poison pierced his Origin Source, shattering his last bit of strength.","This scene startled Jian Wushuang.","The attack was too fast.","The guest of Zhalong Mountain, “Shang Yang,” turned out to be a traitor.","Not only was he not poisoned, but he took the opportunity to kill the young master Hong Long and snatched his formation compass.","Jian Wushuang was not the only one stunned; Wu Li was also dumbfounded.","And so was Xi Jiu.","“Haha, I didn’t expect the one the emperor mentioned was you. Fine, quickly take me away. The formation cannot stop the master of Zhalong Mountain!”","The person who came to meet him appeared, and the mission was declared over.","In fact, this was how it was supposed to be. It was all because Lion King was too arrogant, wanting to take down the Spacetime Gorge by himself.","How could that be possible?","With divine power just over 50?million, he wanted to take down the Spacetime Gorge. That was underestimating the master of Zhalong Mountain too much.","Shang Yang played with the compass in his hand, just about to put it away, but his expression paused. Ignoring Xi Jiu, he looked at Wu Li and shouted, “Catch!”","Then he threw the compass to Wu Li.","“Huh?”","Wu Li instinctively caught the compass.","Jian Wushuang wanted to warn him, but it was too late.","Shang Yang took out a jade copper mirror and said loudly, “Everyone, don’t thank me. I’ll be leaving now!”","“You?” Xi Jiu was confused for a moment, not understanding what Shang Yang was doing.","He quickly used a special method to communicate with Emperor Du Gu.","The order he received was the same as Shang Yang’s.","The two looked at each other and simultaneously took out their spacetimes tokens.","Then they directly crushed them.","Only Jian Wushuang and the others were left, standing dumbfounded in place.","The people brought by Young Master Hong Long were either dead or had betrayed him.","Only a few of them remained unscathed."]},{"number":6154,"title":"Chapter 6154: Tricked!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6154: Tricked!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now, he was at a loss, holding the compass.","“Brother Wushuang, you’re quick-witted. Can you tell us what’s going on here?” Wu Li was already dizzy from the confusion.","First, Jian Wushuang stopped Hu Qing and left Xi Jiu behind.","Then Xi Jiu and Cha Luohua used poison to kill everyone.","Just as Young Master Hong Long was about to say something, he was killed by his own guest.","When Jian Wushuang saw Shang Yang with the compass, his intention seemed clear.","It was simply to control the formation with the compass and loot the treasures in this place.","But when the other party threw the compass to Wu Li, he couldn’t understand it.","Now, both of them had crushed the spacetime tokens and fled.","No need to bother with them.","“Frame-up!”","Jian Wushuang growled, then laughed, “Childish tricks. I didn’t expect to encounter this kind of thing just after arriving at the Realm God Continent. It seems we won’t be able to leave today.”","Upon hearing the term “frame-up,” everyone reacted.","“Framing us? What does this group of people mean?” Divine Wood King was dumbfounded.","They were just a group of spacetime cultivators who had just entered the Realm God Continent.","How could they be framed?","Upon hearing this, Wu Zuo asked, “Could it be Zamasu?”","“No!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, denying, “Zamasu is stronger than you think. If he knew our location, he could send a Universe God to kill us all. There’s no need to use such tricks to scheme against us!”","The key point was that Zamasu wasn’t even on the Realm God Continent.","To Zamasu, these Northern Spacetime cultivators were like fish on a chopping board. Once he became a Realm King, he could easily wipe out all life in the Northern Spacetime.","There was no need to target them individually.","Every time they targeted the Northern Spacetime, it was to destroy all its cultivators.","“What are you doing?”","“What am I doing?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “I guess someone wants to sit back and watch the tigers fight, throwing this problem at us.”","Watching the tigers fight!","It must be that Lord Du Gu that Hong Long mentioned.","If their strength was ordinary, they might have been dead long ago.","There would be no value in using them.","But Hu Qing’s divine power had been exposed, and his second-tier future self already had top demigod strength.","He could be used as a test stone.","And Jian Wushuang.","His hidden strength was probably exposed too.","Now, if they took the compass out, they would probably face the wrath of Lord Zhalong immediately.","Getting caught with mud in the crotch, there was no way to explain it.","This place was the spacetime gorge, where time and space were chaotic. Not even a Universe God could reverse time here.","He could only prove his innocence himself.","But how?","Young Master Hong Long and all his men had fallen, not even ashes remained.","How could he explain this?","“Why don’t we run away too!” Wu Zuo was a bit scared.","The poison just now was truly terrifying.","Not only him, but even Jian Wushuang was afraid.","Perishing could happen in an instant.","They had stayed too long in the Northern Spacetime without a sense of crisis. After arriving at the Realm God Continent, they initially felt a bit nervous, but seeing Young Master Hong Long, they thought their divine power was not weaker than his, so there was nothing to worry about.","Now, they were in trouble.","For a moment, no one could think of a countermeasure.","Run!","If they could really run, it would be great. After all, coming from the Star Field of the Gods, even if Zhalong Mountain Lord recognized them as the culprits, he couldn’t trouble the Star Field of the Gods.","But they couldn’t run now.","With the compass, they could find the exit.","However, Zhalong Mountain Lord was probably already waiting at the exit.","Going out would lead to a fierce battle.","Although Jian Wushuang didn’t know the opponent’s divine power, it wouldn’t be less than 60 million divine power.","He and Hu Qing working together could deal with the opponent without a problem.","The problem was what if they dealt with the opponent and the star domain bandits took advantage of the situation?","This was a conspiracy against Zhalong Mountain Lord.","For them, it was an open scheme.","“Let’s not go!” Jian Wushuang made up his mind and explained, “Going out now would lead to a fierce battle. Since the compass is in our hands, we might as well stay. Even if Zhalong Mountain Lord makes a new token, he might not find us. Besides, there are many natural barriers in this place’s spacetime cracks. If we have enough patience, the star field bandits will lose patience, and we can clear ourselves of suspicion!”","This was the best plan he could come up with.","After all, there were many treasures here, and they could search for them conveniently.","Why not?","Once the star domain bandits lost patience and came out to fight with Zhalong Mountain Lord, they might even benefit from the situation.","“Good, this plan is great!”","Upon hearing that they didn’t need to go out and fight, Wu Zuo and Wu Li were the first to agree.","Their divine power was just over 40 million.","Without any major life-saving methods, going out would be tough.","They would be burdens.","Shenmu Wang was different. He at least had the Ninth Tribulation level Moyun Vine. Together, they could reach the demigod threshold.","However, since everyone agreed, he had no objections.","Hu Qing, as always, listened to Jian Wushuang.","“Then let’s trouble Brother Wu Li to control the compass. I’ll lead the way and search for the treasures here first!”","The treasure Hong Long was looking for was something that could quickly make one a demigod.","Initially, they didn’t care, but now that Hong Long was dead, all the treasures here belonged to them.","...","While Jian Wushuang and the others were searching for treasures.","Outside Zhalong Mountain, in a broken palace, a group of star domain bandits gathered.","Here were familiar faces like Lion King, Xi Jiu, and Shang Yang.","“Your Majesty, according to your instructions, we’ve given the compass to those from the Star Field of the Gods!” Shang Yang bowed and reported everything.","At the top of the broken palace, a solitary man in tattered battle armor, with eyes full of endless divine power, stood.","“Then let’s wait. When those guys come out, have Zongzheng and Wuya keep a close watch. In one era, regardless of whether they make a move, we will flatten Zhalong Mountain!”","The crowd below responded in unison, “Yes!”","Flatten Zhalong Mountain!","The star domain bandits sought treasures, not territories.","Emperor Du Gu also aimed at the treasures Zhalong Mountain Lord obtained initially.","As for the spacetime canyon, it was different.","The secrets within were not as simple as drifting treasures.","Previously, he had sent Lion King and others to the spacetime canyon to verify his suspicions.","And to set up a spacetime conversion array in the spacetime canyon, allowing entry at any time.","This way, they wouldn’t fear Zhalong Mountain Lord blocking them with the spacetime canyon array.","Zhalong Mountain.","The whole city was on alert. The news of the young lord’s death in the spacetime canyon had spread.","An enraged Zhalong Mountain Lord gathered all the strong ones and had already arrived at the spacetime gorge."]},{"number":6155,"title":"Chapter 6155: Yinglong Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6155: Yinglong Clan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The city’s defenses had to be solid to prevent anyone from sneaking in.","The grand formation of the spacetime gorge was not as complicated as Jian Wushuang and his companions had imagined.","Zhalong Mountain Lord wouldn’t be unable to enter just because he didn’t have a token.","When the grand formation was initially crafted, he had left a backdoor.","However, only he could enter through this backdoor.","Entering alone!","This posed a significant risk.","In the shadows, those who had wiped out the subordinates he had brought along with his son and seized the compass had clearly come prepared.","Moreover, the recent arrival of Star Field bandits added to the Lord of Zhalong Mountain’s concerns.","He wasn’t worried about powerful ambushers within the spacetime rift.","His fear was that the treasure he had meticulously hidden might have already been discovered.","This time, the intruders were here for the treasure he had found long ago.","If that was the case, he needed to be cautious.","Standing at the entrance of the spacetime rift, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain secretly sent a message to the outside world.","A demigod who could become a lord had some connections.","The fact that he could invite a Universe Master to craft this grand formation showed that the Lord of Zhalong Mountain had extraordinary connections.","“Brother, have you identified the culprit behind the attack on Spacetime Gorge?”","Through the spacetime token, this message was transmitted to a very distant Star Field.","An ancient being opened his eyes.","“It’s related to Star Field bandits, and there’s more than one Universe Master involved!”","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain’s expression trembled upon hearing this.","His heart grew colder.","More than one Universe Master was eyeing him.","His demigod-level combat power was at its limit. If it were several demigods, he wouldn’t worry, but hearing that several Universe Masters were targeting him made him feel helpless.","He couldn’t help but sigh.","The treasure he, a demigod, had found was ultimately something he couldn’t keep.","“Do not give up. Though they dare to eye it, they won’t dare to act. You are a member of the Yinglong clan. With me here, the Universe Masters won’t act easily. At most, they will send some demigods to trouble you. However, you must stay vigilant. If someone of the same level takes your treasure, I won’t be able to help you!”","The Yinglong clan!","A renowned clan on the Realm God Continent.","Rumor had it that true dragons existed within the clan.","A true dragon at the Universe Master level was far more powerful than a Universe Master who was a regular cultivator.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain hailed from the Yinglong clan.","Thus, he was able to guard this spacetime rift.","Back then, he even invited a Universe Master to craft the formation outside the Spacetime Gorge.","Without this background, the Star Field bandits would have stolen it long ago.","“If the Universe Masters don’t intervene, I am confident!” The Lord of Zhalong Mountain clenched his fists, feeling the boundless and fierce divine power within him.","This divine power was extremely ferocious.","A dark red aura surged from all around.","If Jian Wushuang sensed this power, he would be greatly surprised.","Because this power was very similar to the power of the beast gods.","“Be careful. If you can’t hold out, abandon the Spacetime Gorge and return to the Ancient Dragon Star Field. No one will dare to touch you there!”","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain gently shook his head and calmly sent a message, “No, I never thought of returning when I left.”","“Are you still angry about the bloodline issue? Hong Yuan, although you are of red dragon descent, the blood in your veins is of the true dragon lineage. Don’t hold a grudge!”","This time, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain did not respond.","Instead, he silently put away the communication token.","Since he had figured out everything behind the scenes, there was no need for him to stay here any longer.","The Spacetime Gorge was there; it wasn’t going anywhere.","What he needed to do now was to secure his position in Zha Long City and wait for those Star Field bandits to come.","Among the demigods, he didn’t dare to claim supremacy over the entire Realm King Continent, but in the nearby star fields, no one was his match.","As for Jian Wushuang and the others in the spacetime rift, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain didn’t take them seriously at all.","Since he could investigate Jian Wushuang’s background, there was naturally nothing to fear.","Moreover, he had lived for so long that he wouldn’t be deceived by the tricks of those Star Field bandits.","He wouldn’t take action against Jian Wushuang and the others, but they shouldn’t dream of leaving the spacetime rift alive.","Just as the Lord of Zhalong Mountain was about to leave the Spacetime Gorge, his brows furrowed suddenly.","“Beast God Power!”","He could easily sense the Beast God Power coming from the Spacetime Gorge.","And it was very pure.","That power was even purer than his brother’s.","“Impossible!”","He exclaimed in surprise.","His nearby subordinates turned to look, thinking something had happened.","Seeing the panicked expressions of his subordinates, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain regained his composure.","“You all stay here; I will personally go in and check!”","Originally, he had planned to return to Zhalong Mountain, as the situation here was not urgent.","He only needed to wait and catch them.","But after sensing the pure Beast God Power from the spacetime rift, he couldn’t contain his joy.","With a flash, he entered the spacetime rift.","Buzz!","A powerful force descended.","Guided by the Beast God Power, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain quickly approached Jian Wushuang and the others.","This powerful force was soon noticed by Jian Wushuang.","It wasn’t due to a mental probe but rather the attraction between similar powers.","“Hmm?”","Jian Wushuang had just collected a treasure containing Starry Sky power when he felt the threat.","They had been searching for treasures in the spacetime rift for several days.","Because his mental power was vast, he could explore a wide range, so they quickly gathered all the treasures drifting in the spacetime rift.","Among them were many treasures containing Starry Sky power, which naturally all went to him.","As for other treasures, they were divided between King Shenmu and Wu Li.","Huiqing and Wu Zuo didn’t care for these treasures.","Although every ten thousand eras brought a treasure hunt, and each time some special treasures appeared, their value was limited.","The most special treasure this time was the one the Young Master Hong Long had been looking for.","Jian Wushuang had just exposed himself using Beast God Power because of that treasure.","It was a blood pool containing Beast God Power.","If one soaked in it using Beast God Power, it could nurture the divine body.","If all the Beast God Power in the blood pool was absorbed, it could increase divine power by millions.","Of course, it also depended on who absorbed it.","For Jian Wushuang, whose divine body only had 15 million divine power, absorbing this blood pool could increase his divine power by millions.","Unfortunately, his divine body was not a Beast God body.","The augmented Beast God Power didn’t come from his divine body but from the supreme treasure.","So, it couldn’t increase his divine power.","The same applied to others.","However, such a special treasure, even if he couldn’t use it himself, could be sold for a good price.","This time, it hadn’t been a wasted trip.","But now, after sensing that intense Beast God Power, Jian Wushuang felt a bit regretful.","“What’s wrong?”","Wu Zuo noticed Jian Wushuang’s expression and quickly asked."]},{"number":6156,"title":"Chapter 6156: Act According to the Situation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6156: Act According to the Situation","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The intense Beast God power was rapidly approaching.","It would only take an hour to reach this place.","And here, it was already the core of the spacetime rift.","To approach so quickly, one had to either be incredibly powerful or be so familiar with this place that they could navigate it with pinpoint accuracy.","Within the entire Zhalong Mountain territory, the only one with such capability was the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Jian Wushuang felt his breathing become a bit tense and hurriedly reminded, “Someone is approaching us, and it is very likely the lord of Zhalong Mountain!”","“What?”","Hearing this response, not only Wu Zuo, but also King Shenmu and Wu Li were stunned.","“Didn’t you say he couldn’t get in?”","“That was just my guess!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and said, “Moreover, he didn’t come in right away. Either he encountered obstacles outside that he has now cleared, or it’s because of that blood pool!”","Both guesses had some persuasive power.","However, they hadn’t hit the mark.","The group, new to all this, had no idea about the background and details of the lord of Zhalong Mountain.","But it wasn’t their fault.","Even the lord of Zhalong Mountain’s own son didn’t know about this matter.","“So what do we do now?” Hu Qing didn’t say much but asked for a strategy.","“Soldiers come, we block; water rises, we cover with earth!”","This was Hu Qing’s style.","Panicking was useless.","But this time, Jian Wushuang also had no solution.","Since the lord of Zhalong Mountain could enter, what other method could he think of?","There was only one entrance here.","To be precise, there was another entrance.","It was the massive spacetime rift.","But none of them dared to enter.","Even if it meant fighting to the death with the lord of Zhalong Mountain, they wouldn’t dare to enter.","The spacetime of Realm God Continent was extremely difficult to break.","Even Universe Masters could do it only rarely.","It was conceivable how strong this spacetime was.","How much divine power did these people have?","Entering the spacetime rift recklessly would only lead to death.","After a brief silence, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Let’s approach the spacetime rift first. When they arrive, we’ll try to explain. If that fails, we’ll fight!”","“This is our only option!” King Shenmu sighed slightly.","Wu Li felt a bit embarrassed.","This time it was still because of his problem. He had wanted to help Young Master Hong Long with a small matter and then bring up the issue of the Beast God Weapon. But who could have expected to encounter star field bandits?","And at the critical moment, Young Master Hong Long had even fallen.","“Let’s go, head to the spacetime rift first!”","In the entire spacetime canyon, the largest rift was at the deepest part of the canyon.","The treasures they searched for also drifted out from there.","When they arrived, since they had the spacetime rift at their backs, Jian Wushuang didn’t believe the opponent would dare to strike too harshly.","As they hurried, Jian Wushuang was also enhancing his basic divine power.","The treasures he had obtained were enough to boost some divine power, preventing the waste of time during a fight.","Taking this opportunity, he frantically absorbed the Starry Sky power within them.","A small pale blue flag in his hand dimmed in just an instant.","“Only increased by one and a half million?”","This small flag was a top-tier universe treasure of the Eighth Tribulation level.","The Starry Sky power it contained only increased his divine power by about one and a half million.","The remaining items were even less effective.","Fortunately, there were several of them.","He kept absorbing.","His divine power barely reached about 20 million.","With the Tribulation Armor, it was 25 million.","But it was still far too little.","And the cost was enormous.","So many Universe Treasures at the Eighth Tribulation level, yet they only increased his divine power by such a small amount.","His basic divine power needed to reach 30 million, even 40 million.","How much Starry Sky power would he need?","Thinking of this gave Jian Wushuang a headache.","The Hunyuan Stone in his hand no longer seemed appealing.","He didn’t have any Starry Sky Crystals either.","He felt powerless.","When they reached the edge of the spacetime rift, everyone was stunned.","It was the first time they had seen such a rift.","The shock they felt was ten times stronger than when they had sensed it with their mental power.","There was no doubt that the power contained within this rift was far stronger than any spacetime power they had ever seen.","“A place even more terrifying than the Abyss. How do you think this was formed?”","Hearing this question, even Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Creating such a massive spacetime rift in the Northern Spacetime wasn’t difficult.","But making it so the spacetime couldn’t heal was a challenge.","The divine power needed to be over 30 million.","Back when they fought in the lower-tier spacetimes, they created quite a few of these rifts.","The Realm King himself had to repair them.","On the Realm God Continent, even if Jian Wushuang used all his strength, he couldn’t make the spacetime fracture.","Let alone create a rift that couldn’t heal.","“It must have been a Universe Master, and a very powerful one at that, like Zamasu!”","This was the periphery of the Star Field of the Gods, so it was possible that a great battle had occurred here in the past.","For instance, the Starry Sky Secret Realm that Wu Li and others had found, where even Universe Masters had fallen!","Speaking of that secret realm, Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed.","Perhaps there was a story they didn’t know about that happened near the Star Field of the Gods.","Creating treasures like the Spacetime Gorge and the Starry Sky secret realm.","But all this seemed distant to them.","For now, they needed to focus on dealing with the Lord of Zhalong Mountain!","Buzz!","A strong divine power shook the surrounding spacetime.","Soon, a figure bathed in waves of red divine power appeared before them.","There was no need to ask; this was the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","“Greetings, Lord!”","Without hesitation, everyone respectfully saluted upon seeing his arrival.","Etiquette first, then force.","They couldn’t lose their momentum.","Nor could they be unreasonable!","Hong Long’s fall had little to do with them.","They couldn’t take all the blame.","But the Lord of Zhalong Mountain didn’t see it that way.","He had ventured here to seek the power of the Beast God.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have come.","It was too important.","The practitioner containing the power of the Beast God had purer power than even his brother’s Beast God power, comparable to the Ancestral Dragon.","His brother was a Universe Master, and a very powerful one at that.","As for the Ancestral Dragon of the Yinglong Clan, he was even more unfathomable.","He had only seen him once.","His gaze swept over the crowd.","Soon, his eyes locked onto Jian Wushuang.","He could sense that the power came from within Jian Wushuang.","“Was Hong Long’s matter your doing?”","Though he could crush them, he didn’t directly kill them for their treasures.","The sudden intensity startled Jian Wushuang, who didn’t know the Lord of Zhalong Mountain had restrained himself from acting immediately.","This time, Wu Li had taken the lead, so naturally, he stepped forward to answer.","“Reporting to the elder, Hong Long’s matter wasn’t our doing. It was those starry sky bandits who previously entered Zhalong City, and they also had a spacetime token...”"]},{"number":6157,"title":"Chapter 6157: Exposed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6157: Exposed!","Before Wu Li could finish speaking, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain snorted coldly, “A spacetime token?”","Such a treasure, he barely had a few, and none were given to his descendants.","How could he believe this?","Wu Li also knew his explanation sounded far-fetched.","It sounded more like a perfunctory lie.","But that was the truth.","Two seemingly unremarkable demigod powerhouses had both taken out spacetime tokens, and after failing to defeat them, had fled.","“It’s absolutely true, with our level of power, how could we dare deceive the Lord!”","After finishing his words, Wu Li bowed deeply.","Jian Wushuang and the others held their breaths, waiting for the Lord of Zhalong Mountain to speak, whether it would be battle or peace depended on his next words.","However, judging by the other party’s demeanor, it seemed unlikely they would leave safely today.","Such a flimsy excuse, even a three-year-old wouldn’t believe it.","Let alone the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","The atmosphere gradually cooled, and a murderous intent began to show in the eyes of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","His gaze then shifted towards Jian Wushuang.","“Fine, I will temporarily believe your words!”","With these words, not only did Jian Wushuang not feel relieved, but his heart grew even heavier, because he could see the killing intent in the other party’s eyes.","He just didn’t know what tactics the person before him would use against them.","Or what his intentions were?","With such powerful divine power, if it were him, he would definitely not waste words and would directly slaughter them.","He wanted to see what tricks the other party had up their sleeve.","Upon hearing the other party’s seemingly agreeable words, Wu Li’s face brightened, and he stood up, suppressing his joy, then spoke sorrowfully, “The fall of Brother Hong Long saddens me as well. Until his death, he kept murmuring about finding that treasure; otherwise, we would have reported the news of his death long ago!”","This also explained why they hadn’t immediately reported the incident.","But the Lord of Zhalong Mountain showed no interest in this explanation.","The fall of Hong Long, to a powerhouse of his level, wasn’t even a significant blow.","His previous intention to pass on his position was because he had reached a bottleneck.","He had reached the perfection stage within the Tribulation.","The next step was to prepare for the divine tribulation.","Therefore, he had paid a little attention to his descendants.","Many of his descendants had already fallen.","He had only treated Hong Long differently this time because he hoped Hong Long could protect his Zhalong Mountain.","The fall had happened, and so be it.","As long as he could become a Universe Master, he could cultivate even stronger descendants.","Why would he ruin his grand plan over such a small matter?","Jian Wushuang saw this clearly, which is why he remained vigilant.","Not avenging his son, yet seeking them out, there must be another reason.","“I can let go of Hong Long’s matter, but among you, whoever used the Beast God Power must stay, the rest I can let live!”","Beast God Power!","Upon hearing this, Wu Li and the others were stunned.","Previously, only Jian Wushuang had used the Beast God Power once, to absorb the blood pool.","It turned out to be about that matter.","They were still not out of trouble.","Seeing this, Wu Li quickly put on a fawning smile, taking out the blood pool, and said, “Senior, you must be mistaken. We are all human, how could we have Beast God Power? The Beast God Power you saw came from this blood pool, which is the treasure Brother Hong Long was looking for. Now that you are here, I hand it over to you, to honor Brother Hong Long’s spirit in heaven!”","Smack!","As soon as Wu Li offered the treasure, it was slapped away by the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","A treasure containing Beast God Power meant nothing to him.","That bit of power wasn’t worth a glance.","If one could control Beast God Power, like Hong Long’s son, it could increase basic divine power by tens of millions.","But to the Lord of Zhalong Mountain, who had reached demigod perfection, even an increase of ten thousand was difficult.","How could he care about such a treasure?","Seeing this, Wu Li knew he couldn’t deceive him and stepped back half a step, saying nothing","more.","The others did the same.","Clearly, they were ready to fight desperately.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain was a bit surprised, not expecting these people to be so united, with no one seeking to save themselves.","Although he had not thought about letting anyone go, wouldn’t one typically cherish even a sliver of hope?","“It seems you aren’t planning to talk!” The divine power of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain surged, instantly surpassing 60 million.","And it was just his basic divine power.","There was no need to use any secret arts.","His basic divine power had already reached 65.5 million.","With a slight use of secret arts, it could break 70 million.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but swallow hard.","The pressure was immense.","However, Hu Qing and the others were not the least bit flustered.","Hu Qing aside, he might still have a trump card.","But Wu Li remained calm and composed.","This made Jian Wushuang suspect that Wu Li might also have a hidden card.","Wu Zuo was indifferent because he had absolute faith in himself and Hu Qing.","Divine Wood King was somewhat tense but not panicked.","He had seen such scenes many times.","Back when they faced Chi Jiuxiao, it was far more thrilling than this.","Just as everyone was preparing to face the threat head-on, Jian Wushuang spoke up.","“Wait!”","Upon hearing this, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","He already knew the problem lay with Jian Wushuang, and his earlier words were meant to","make Jian Wushuang speak voluntarily.","Possessing the power of the Beast God, and in such a pure form, he didn’t believe Jian Wushuang was a human. He was likely a super Beast God of the demon race.","If he captured him and extracted his complete Origin Source to transform himself, the value","would be infinite.","This was why the various demon clans treated those super Beast Gods like treasures.","Beast Gods were graded, and the most heaven-defying Beast Gods, once they became","Universe Masters, were nearly invincible.","They would inevitably be carefully protected and slowly nurtured.","He highly suspected Jian Wushuang was a super Beast God in disguise as a human.","So, he cautiously probed.","“Senior!” Jian Wushuang, unaware of his thoughts, proactively took out a Beast God Weapon","and said, “This treasure, I obtained by chance. Using it, I can wield the power of the Beast","God!”","The treasure he brought out was the Beast God Weapon “Eye of the Candle Dragon,” which he","had obtained earlier!","The Candle Dragon belonged to the dragon race.","Moreover, it was a top-tier Beast God among the dragon race.","When the Lord of Zhalong Mountain saw that eye, he couldn’t help but feel moved, and his","expression changed.","“You actually have such a treasure!” He could hardly believe it. Jian Wushuang had casually","taken out the super treasure he had dreamed of for so long.","He also had one such treasure, but he knew it was incomplete.","And that treasure was the Beast God Weapon Jian Wushuang had been searching for.","The last of the nine Beast God Weapons!","“The Demon Dragon’s Blade!”","He knew the last Beast God Weapon was in Zhalong Mountain.","But he hadn’t expected it to be in the hands of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain, who cherished it","like a precious gem."]},{"number":6158,"title":"Chapter 6158: Demon Dragon Blade","paragraphs":["Chapter 6158: Demon Dragon Blade","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This left him somewhat puzzled.","Although the Beast God Weapon was somewhat special, a single Beast God Weapon was only at the level of the Seventh Tribulation.","A demigod lord, taking a fire poker as a treasure?","“Senior, this treasure is just an ordinary item refined by a Beast God...”","This left him silent.","However, the eyes of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain widened like copper bells, then he suddenly awoke.","He remembered that when he first obtained the Demon Dragon Blade, he also thought that this treasure was very ordinary.","But when he used his True Dragon Power, he discovered that the Demon Dragon Blade could actually strengthen his True Dragon Power.","Moreover, it contained a complete Demon Dragon Origin Source.","Initially, the Origin Source was at the Seventh Tribulation level, but he later raised it to the Ninth Tribulation.","Originally, his divine power was only 50 million, but he could unleash an attack of 70 million divine power.","An increase of a full 20 million divine power.","In the end, through his elder brother within the clan, he upgraded the Demon Dragon Blade to the ultimate level.","That is, a divine weapon.","The Origin Source within the Demon Dragon Blade also reached the Universe God level.","Completely ultimate Origin Source, comprehending it was equivalent to comprehending the Origin Source of a Universe God.","Subsequent divine power increases were also rapid.","His basic divine power reached over 60 million.","With the enhancement of the Demon Dragon Blade, he feared no demigod.","This was his confidence.","The Demon Dragon Blade was one of the two most important treasures he had obtained in the Spacetime Gorge back then.","The other one wasn’t very helpful to him now, but it would be of great help when he became a Universe God in the future, although it was useless to him now.","Yet someone had their eyes on it.","Because even a Universe God would fight for that treasure.","However special it might be, it was of no help to him now.","What could currently enhance his divine power was still the Demon Dragon Blade.","“Kid, where did you get this treasure?” The Lord of Zhalong Mountain couldn’t help but reveal a look of greed in his eyes. However, he didn’t snatch it directly; instead, he wanted to ask for more information.","Even a child of three years old would understand from his previous behavior that he was clearly coveting Jian Wushuang’s Eye of the Candle Dragon.","Jian Wushuang paused for a moment before replying, “Senior, I obtained this treasure unintentionally in the Star Field of the Gods. Back then, when my strength was weak, it was helpful to me. But now, it is of no use to me. Just now, because I obtained that Blood Pool, I felt that their auras were the same, so I thought to test it out.”","His eyes were clear, and he actually hadn’t lied much.","A powerful being could see through lies at a glance.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain stared at Jian Wushuang for a long time, then with a flick of his finger, he directly grasped the Eye of the Candle Dragon in his hand.","After sensing the Origin Source within it, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain could tell that Jian Wushuang wasn’t lying.","Because the Origin Source inside was just a trace.","Although Jian Wushuang thought it was complete, it was still far from it.","With a slight movement, the Beast God Weapon Candle Dragon opened up.","There was the Heart of the Candle Dragon, the Wings of the Candle Dragon, the Armor of the Candle Dragon, and so on.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain wasn’t interested in these; he only cared about the Origin Source.","That Origin Source was very weak.","But it had endless potential for enhancement.","That was enough.","Jian Wushuang proactively offered up the Beast God Weapon, making Hui Qing and the others feel it was a bit too humble.","In fact, he could have fought.","At this moment, Wu Li sent a voice transmission, saying, “Brother Wushuang, this is your precious treasure. Are you just going to give it away like that?”","Evidently, even he found it a bit unbelievable.","Back when Jian Wushuang was still an Emperor, Wu Li knew about Jian Wushuang’s treasure, which could amplify the Beast God’s power. With this treasure, Jian Wushuang shone brightly during his Emperor period, making the entire Green Grass Sixteen Nations bow down.","The title of Invincible Emperor, or Invincible Dao Lord, was closely tied to this Beast God Weapon.","Just giving it away like that indeed seemed unreasonable.","Jian Wushuang smiled wryly and sent a calm voice transmission, “If I don’t hand it over, he will act immediately!”","“So what? I still have...” Wu Li was about to reveal his trump card when he saw Jian Wushuang shaking his head proactively.","This wasn’t the time to use their trump card.","Jian Wushuang had his own plans.","He knew that Star Field bandits were watching from the shadows.","If they fought with the Zhalong Mountain Lord now, it would only benefit others who would reap the rewards.","It was better to give the treasure to the opponent for now, preserving and concealing their strength.","Let both sides be unaware of their true divine power.","When the Star Field bandits fought with the Zhalong Mountain Lord, they could then strike from behind.","Wouldn’t that be perfect?","Now it depended on what the Zhalong Mountain Lord would say. If he really wanted to fight, there would be no choice. Not acting now was the best strategy.","The Zhalong Mountain Lord held the Eye of the Candle Dragon, and most of his doubts vanished, but he wouldn’t let go of such a treasure so easily.","Since Jian Wushuang and his companions were of no further use, there was only one path left for them.","Just as he was about to act.","The Spacetime Gorge began to tremble.","Auras rose continuously.","The surrounding formations started to break.","“What is this?” The Zhalong Mountain Lord was shaken.","He didn’t know that his Spacetime Gorge had been previously restricted by Lion King and the others with a spacetime grand formation.","It was a formation that could be placed within spacetime cracks.","Created by a Universe God.","“Haha, Brother Hong Yuan, long time no see!”","An arrogant voice sounded from behind.","Jian Wushuang and the others immediately saw the face of the newcomer.","Buzz!","In the turbid space, a burly figure stepped forward, each step causing spacetime to tremble, with thunderbolts appearing in the surrounding cracks.","“It’s you!”","The Zhalong Mountain Lord turned his head and saw the face clearly.","“Luo Lan!”","A member of the Luo family from the Silver Blue Star Field, a powerful demigod!","Moreover, he was an extremely strong demigod.","He could be considered the strongest demigod in the entire Silver Blue Star Field.","His status was only inferior to the four Universe Gods.","The Luo family was founded by a Universe God.","But the actual controller was Luo Lan standing before them.","Besides him, several other powerful demigods descended around them.","They did not seem to be Star Field bandits.","“So it’s you!” The Zhalong Mountain Lord was somewhat surprised but not too shocked!","The original information indicated a demigod.","Although the guise was that of Star Field bandits, they weren’t all Star Field bandits.","Because this fat piece of meat couldn’t be swallowed by the Star Field bandits alone.","And those great families needed to save face.","Using the identity of Star Field bandits was just a cover.","Wearing wolf skins to do wolf deeds.","Jian Wushuang also saw that these people were not in league with the previous Star Field bandits.","Seeing their appearance, he felt relieved.","He originally thought he would have to maneuver a bit more, but it turned out to be seamless.","“Wu Li, when they start fighting, stand on the side of the Zhalong Mountain Lord!”"]},{"number":6159,"title":"Chapter 6159: Lord Du Gu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6159: Lord Du Gu","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang first provided some explanations to prevent any misalignment later.","His treasures were still with the leader of Zhalong Mountain, so naturally, he sided with him.","Wu Li and the others nodded in agreement and gathered together, preparing to watch the upcoming battle.","The leader of Zhalong Mountain scanned the crowd, frowned, and shouted angrily, “You filthy ants, get off my territory!”","As soon as he finished speaking.","The Demon Dragon Blade in his hand erupted, divine power swept through the surrounding space-time rifts, directly repelling the encircling demigods to the periphery.","The powerful divine power made Jian Wushuang and the others break into a cold sweat.","Fortunately, the earlier attack bypassed them.","Wu Li frowned deeply as he watched, clearly indicating that his hidden cards were not enough to deal with such a situation.","“Young ones, hide behind me!” The leader of Zhalong Mountain glanced back at Jian Wushuang and the others, then leaped forward, a black shadow charging straight at Luo Lan.","Such formidable power had already reached 70 million divine power.","Luo Lan frowned and swallowed hard, having no choice but to face him head-on.","Now he felt a bit regretful.","Regretting not listening to the Star Field bandits.","According to the Star Field bandits’ plan, they wanted the leader of Zhalong Mountain to attack Jian Wushuang and the others first, to test the strength of both sides.","The earlier outburst from Hui Qing, with 60 million divine power, had made the Star Field bandits very wary, hoping to reap the benefits later.","But seeing Jian Wushuang willingly hand over his treasures, Luo Lan couldn’t sit still anymore.","This time, attacking Zhalong Mountain for the treasures was of great significance.","The four Universe Masters of the Silver Blue Star Field all placed great importance on this action.","There were also several Universe Masters supporting the Star Field bandits.","Therefore, this matter had to be quick, precise, and ruthless.","There was only one treasure.","But there were many Universe Masters.","So they had to act first to gain the upper hand.","Outside the territory of Zhalong Mountain.","The leading demigod of the Star Field bandits, “Lord Du Gu,” was watching the battle in the Space-Time Canyon through the barrier.","The leader of Zhalong Mountain’s strength was indeed as they had guessed, incomparably powerful.","He made ruthless moves right from the start.","Luo Lan and the others, leading the Silver Blue Star Field, had already lost many demigods.","You should know that the demigods Luo Lan brought all had divine power above 55 million.","Originally planning to form a formation to trap and kill the leader of Zhalong Mountain, they ended up being slaughtered by him one by one.","Even forming a formation with divine power exceeding 65 million, they still couldn’t stop the leader of Zhalong Mountain.","Luo Lan, leading the group, had a divine power of sixty-eight million, pushing to his limit, but still couldn’t block the leader of Zhalong Mountain.","At this moment, he anxiously sent a message to Lord Du Gu, hoping he would intervene.","“Tsk tsk!” Lord Du Gu shook his head and smiled bitterly upon hearing the message, mocking himself, “These fools, they really don’t see Hong Long as a threat!”","As a Star Field bandit, Lord Du Gu had been rampaging across several Star Fields for many years, living so freely.","One reason was his strong background, not inferior to the leader of Zhalong Mountain, “Hong Long.”","The second reason was his accurate intelligence.","He had reported that Hong Long’s divine power exceeded 70 million.","Others didn’t believe it, but he did.","Because he had dealt with the leader of Zhalong Mountain a long time ago, knowing his character and background.","As a Hong Long divine beast of the dragon race.","Hong Long was a mid-tier divine beast.","His basic divine power exceeded sixty million, and in peak state, his divine power was definitely above 70 million, so he was cautious.","Earlier, waiting for Jian Wushuang and the others to make a move to test, he didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to surrender.","Then it was Luo Lan and the others taking the lead, all part of his meticulous plan.","“Your Majesty, Luo Lan can’t hold on much longer. If we don’t take action now, Zhongzheng might activate the final barrier to destroy the entire Space-Time Canyon!”","Xi Jiu’s weak voice echoed in the hall.","Lord Du Gu’s brow twitched, he turned to look at Xi Jiu, and said coldly, “Are you threatening me?”","“You can think of it that way!”","Xi Jiu’s words made Lord Du Gu’s subordinates unhappy, and the Lion King immediately stood up, wanting to teach Xi Jiu a lesson, but was stopped by Lord Du Gu.","“Continue!”","With divine power under 50 million, Xi Jiu couldn’t stir up any trouble.","However, the person behind him was not simple.","Xi Jiu raised his head and looked directly at Lord Du Gu, calmly saying, “My master has said that to deal with Hong Yuan, we must have Luo Lan. If Luo Lan dies, this plan will fail!”","“It seems you’re quite close to Zongzheng!” Lord Du Gu stretched his neck, slowly descended from the throne, walked to Xi Jiu’s side, and suddenly extended his arm, grabbing Xi Jiu by the neck and lifting him to his eye level. With a cold tone, he said, “Next time, if you sabotage my plan, I can forgo the treasures, but your lives must be forfeited!”","He had survived for such a long time.","Lord Du Gu had one more crucial factor.","That was strength.","His combat power also surpassed 70 million.","In this plan to flatten Zhalong Mountain, there were three super demigods.","One was Luo Lan, who was now severely injured.","He was a powerful demigod brought by the Silver Blue Starfield, naturally belonging to their side.","The second was Lord Du Gu from the starfield pirates’ side.","The last one was Xi Jiu’s master.","Also, the master who crafted the restrictions.","The prodigy of the Zong family.","A famous demigod powerhouse in the Northern Starfield of the Realm King Continent.","From the Kunpeng family of the demon race.","Zong Qian!","Lord Du Gu slightly loosened his grip and threw Xi Jiu aside.","“Tell Zong Qian, if he’s going to join in, then do it properly. Stop with the tricks. If you push Hong Yuan back to the dragon race, no one will be able to handle it!”","Xi Jiu got up and showed a respectful demeanor, “Rest assured, Your Majesty, I will relay your message to my master!”","...","Because if they delayed any longer, Luo Lan would truly fall.","In the Canyon of Spacetime.","The humming sound of divine power was deafening.","Jian Wushuang and others stood obediently at the back, not daring to breathe.","Too powerful.","This was the strongest being they had seen since coming to the Realm God Continent.","The divine power unleashed by the Lord of Zhalong Mountain was a staggering 72 million.","Moreover, he could tell that the other party had not yet reached his limit, or even his peak.","A demigod strong to this extent.","Perhaps they didn’t understand, but Wu Li, who had also spent many years on the Realm God Continent, couldn’t help but take a deep breath and exclaimed, “The Lord’s divine power is likely among the top ten in the entire Northern Starfield of the Realm God Continent. With such powerful divine power, unless a Universe Master appears, he is unbeatable.”","“So exaggerated?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim.","If that was the case, then what about his Beast God Weapon?","He couldn’t afford to lose his own Beast God Weapon while failing to obtain the opponent’s.","Calculating his current divine power.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to act rashly.","He continued to wait, waiting for those starfield pirates.","He knew more than one group was eyeing this place.","His own divine power was now 25 million.","If he used the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it would be 50 million.","With the blessing of the Origin Source Dao Arena, breaking through 70 million would still be difficult."]},{"number":6160,"title":"Chapter 6160: The Terrifying Zong Qian","paragraphs":["Chapter 6160: The Terrifying Zong Qian","His Origin Source was only at the Eighth Tribulation level, so it was an exaggeration to amplify fifty million divine power.","If it were to amplify 40 million divine power, that would be increasing it by half.","Which was 20?million divine power.","But if it were 50 million divine power, it would be difficult to increase it by even 40 percent.","If he acted recklessly, he would not win.","Hu Qing blinked and firmly said, “If he hasn’t hidden any divine power, I should be able to withstand it!”","“Withstand it?” Wu Zuo quickly came over and asked, “Little brother Hu Qing, don’t act recklessly at this time. My 70 million divine power, it’s not that I don’t believe you, but how long have you been at the Ninth Tribulation level?”","“Enough!”","Jian Wushuang interrupted everyone’s concerns and said, “It’s not over yet, is it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the spacetime around them trembled again.","Two terrifying auras descended simultaneously.","Along with them came dozens of powerful demigods.","Among them were familiar auras, like the Lion King and Xi Jiu.","The divine power of these two was ordinary, but they had many means and couldn’t be underestimated.","As for the two terrifying auras, Jian Wushuang felt it was hard to breathe and exclaimed in surprise, “They’re here, they are our reinforcements, their divine power is no less than Zhalong Mountain Lord!”","“Huh?”","After carefully probing one of the auras, he frowned even more.","“The power of the Starry Sky!”","That aura was all too familiar to him.","This time, a truly significant figure had arrived.","Before they could react.","Zhalong Mountain Lord was already in front of them.","Roland was severely injured, lying prostrate in the void.","“Zong Qian!” Zhalong Mountain Lord looked at the blue figure in disbelief and exclaimed, “You are a super divine beast, and you also wield the power of the Starry Sky. Do you want to wade into these troubled waters?”","A super divine beast and the power of the Starry Sky!","Standing on either of those was already a reserved seat for super powerhouses.","Standing on both!","That made an absolute super genius.","Before becoming a demigod, they would be carefully protected by their family.","After becoming a demigod and gaining the ability to protect themselves, they generally ventured into the secret realms of the Starry Sky or went to some dangerous places to seek opportunities.","But now they were mingling with the Star Field bandits.","Zhalong Mountain Lord, being a dragon and naturally aware of the other’s highly esteemed status, was extremely surprised!","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t understand much but seeing Zhalong Mountain Lord’s surprised expression, he knew the other party was not to be trifled with.","Whether in strength or background, they were formidable.","“Just helping a friend,” Zong Qian said arrogantly, “If you’re sensible, you can give me the treasure directly. For your brother’s sake, I can compensate you with some other treasures!”","Zong Qian’s overbearing manner didn’t make Hong Yuan feel uncomfortable at all.","Because the other party had the ability to back it up.","“Zong Qian, I have no grievances against you. Do you really want to force me?” Hong Yuan was not frightened by the other party’s words.","He had his own confidence.","With the Demon Dragon’s Blade in hand, he feared no super beast.","Only the power of the starry sky made him somewhat apprehensive.","Moreover, this was the Spacetime Gorge. If a fight broke out, their divine power could destroy this place.","“I’m not bargaining with you. Answer my question!”","“Dream on!”","“Then there’s nothing more to talk about!” Zong Qian stopped wasting words and directly attacked.","Boom!","A huge explosion resounded as the massive form of the Kunpeng appeared.","Blue arcs of electricity burst forth, and divine power soared above 7,500.","Hong Yuan took a deep breath and charged forward, gritting his teeth.","His figure flashed, revealing his true form.","A gigantic red dragon rose into the sky.","Facing the Kunpeng head-on.","A middle-tier beast against a super beast, and a super beast that mastered the power of the starry sky at that.","This scene made Jian Wushuang and the others completely lose their desire to join the battle.","They were already considering their escape routes.","But there was another super strong individual nearby who had not yet taken action, merely watching them.","They couldn’t even run.","Jian Wushuang and the others could only avoid the opponent’s gaze.","But the more they avoided, the more brazen the opponent’s gaze became.","“Is it that little monk?”","Lord Du Gu’s eyebrows twitched as he stared at Hu Qing.","“It’s him. I don’t know what secret method he used, but his divine power surged to 60 million, and it didn’t even seem to be his peak!” the Lion King answered respectfully.","“Interesting. It looks like Zong Qian doesn’t need my help over there. Once he gets that treasure, I’ll go contend with him. In the meantime, I have time to meet him!”","With a shake of his throne, Lord Du Gu instantly appeared in front of Hu Qing.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but shout, “Be careful!”","But it was already too late.","Lord Du Gu didn’t give them a chance to breathe and attacked immediately upon arrival.","Hu Qing didn’t even have time to use his future self.","He was directly captured by the opponent.","With one hand, Lord Du Gu grabbed Hu Qing’s head.","“Not as exaggerated as they said?” Lord Du Gu said, applying more force.","Hu Qing’s face showed pain as he struggled in vain.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang couldn’t bear this situation and exploded in rage.","“Super Ancient Transformation!”","The thick power of the starry sky burst forth instantly.","The aura shook.","Even Zong Qian, who was fighting the Lord of Zhalong Mountain, paused to look at Jian Wushuang.","The power of the Starry Sky?","This was an extremely rare power, and few cultivators could master it, even fewer than the number of super beasts.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain couldn’t help but exclaim, “He actually mastered the power of the starry sky!”","He had previously dismissed Jian Wushuang as just a lucky kid.","Unexpectedly, he had mastered the power of the Starry Sky.","Moreover, for some reason, Jian Wushuang’s divine power had doubled.","From 25 million, it had directly reached 50 million.","Lord Du Gu, who was holding Hu Qing’s head, was also stunned. Although surprised that Jian Wushuang mastered the power of the Starry Sky, he still found Jian Wushuang’s 50 million divine power insufficient.","“Is this all the power you have?”","Divine Wood King heard and moved, shouting angrily, “And me!”","“Moyun Transformation!”","With a roar, the Devil Cloud appeared and fused completely with Divine Wood King.","“Devil Cloud Transformation!”","Buzz!","The fully fused Godwood King also reached a divine power of 50 million.","“Friend Wushuang, I will help you!”","“And me!”","Wu Zuo also exploded in full force, using the Tenfold Realm King Fist, his divine power also surged to 50 million.","Wu Li looked around and found that only he was left.","But his divine power did not reach 50 million.","“I... I also have a trump card!” Wu Li gritted his teeth, looked at Lord Du Gu, and said viciously, “In the end, we’ll all die!”","His madness startled even Jian Wushuang.","The others had 50 million divine power, only Wu Li was left.","Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment and persuaded, “Brother Wu Li...”","“Don’t say anything, today I’ll risk it all!”","Wu Li took out a wooden token and crushed it, shouting, “Come out!”","Crack!","Wood chips scattered.","After several breaths.","Nothing happened."]},{"number":6161,"title":"Chapter 6161: We Have Chi Jiuxiao!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6161: We Have Chi Jiuxiao!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Wu Li was stunned and felt a bit embarrassed. He coughed lightly and said, “Wait a moment, I really have a backup plan!”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly, not knowing what to say.","His divine power was far from exhausted, and he hadn’t even used the Starry Sky Dao Arena yet!","While he hesitated, the Spacetime Gorge started to shake.","An ancient aura descended from the sky.","A terrifying figure faintly appeared in the void!","That figure had once brought endless fear to Jian Wushuang and his companions.","Back in the Wanliu Divine Tree, they had been relentlessly pursued by this figure, leaving deep scars.","Even now, seeing it made their legs tremble.","The oppressive force was on par with Broly.","“Chi Jiuxiao!”","Hu Qing and Wu Zuo didn’t understand.","But Jian Wushuang and the Divine Tree King knew well.","“Wasn’t Chi Jiuxiao taken away by Danbao?” the Divine Tree King exclaimed in surprise. “How is he here with you?”","Seeing Chi Jiuxiao descend, Wu Li breathed a sigh of relief and then explained, “Danbao feared this time would be dangerous and lent Chi Jiuxiao to me for use, but there’s a drawback. He can’t distinguish between friend and foe, so be careful!”","Careful?","“How strong is he?”","If it were before, they might have been terrified and helpless, but now they had fifty million divine power. Could they still fear Chi Jiuxiao?","Back in the Northern Spacetime, Chi Jiuxiao had thirty million divine power.","That was already his peak.","How much stronger could he get?","Even the First Tribe...","“Below the Universe Master, he is invincible!”","As Wu Li’s words fell, Jian Wushuang immediately unleashed his Origin Source, with his divine power approaching 70 million.","With a flying kick, he knocked Lord Du Gu off the throne, grabbed Hu Qing, and started to retreat.","He even used the Three Shock Universe without hesitation.","He retreated to the farthest point with everyone else.","Only Chi Jiuxiao and Lord Du Gu were left.","Lord Du Gu, who had been kicked down, was extremely shocked. It wasn’t the summoning of Chi Jiuxiao that surprised him, but Jian Wushuang’s divine power. After doubling his power, he could still increase by another 20 million.","This kind of secret technique, he had never encountered before.","The only ones who could increase their divine power so drastically in one transformation were the Frost Demon Clan.","But that clan was almost extinct.","And Jian Wushuang hadn’t transformed.","“Eh?” After Jian Wushuang ran away, Lord Du Gu turned to look at Chi Jiuxiao.","What he saw shocked him.","This was a Giant God Clan member.","The Starry Sky’s First Tribe.","There might not be many on the Realm God Continent.","Back in the Northern Spacetime, Jian Wushuang had encountered fewer than ten Giant God Clan members.","The ratio was enormous.","Even larger than that of Super Beast Gods.","Some cultivators had never seen a Giant God Clan member in their lifetime.","Lord Du Gu, despite traveling through so many star fields, had only seen one.","The Giant God Clan member he encountered was an ordinary Ninth Tribulation, with divine power not exceeding 50 million.","It had just broken through not long ago.","And even then, it was under siege.","But the Giant God Clan member who had helped the Ninth Tribulation Universe Master was far too powerful.","It surpassed his understanding. Among the many Universe Masters he had seen, the strongest was definitely that Giant God Clan Universe Master.","Seeing the aura emanating from Chi Jiuxiao, he couldn’t help but feel a pang of fear.","“A Giant God Clan member, how could there be a Giant God Clan member here!”","Hong Yuan and Zong Qian, who were still fighting, also stopped.","Seeing the Giant God Clan expert appear, they were stunned too.","This was someone they couldn’t afford to provoke.","Zong Qian, who had extensive knowledge, knew that the Giant God Clan might not be very prominent on the Realm God Continent because there might not even be 100 Giant God Clan experts there.","Standing out was hard.","Moreover, among these many Giant God Clan members, 90 percent were Universe Masters.","There were no more than ten Universe Gods.","But even so, the combat power of these ten Universe Gods could almost sweep across the entire Realm King Continent.","Unless those innate gods descended.","For instance, the Realm King God, or figures like Zamasu and the Great Realm King.","The Universe Gods among practitioners were simply no match.","Even though his background was solid, he had to weigh his options when encountering the Giant God Clan.","“Are you a powerful figure from the Giant God Temple?” Zong Qian stopped his hand and asked tentatively.","The Giant God Temple was a great temple left by the Giant God Clan on the Realm King Continent, providing opportunities for the Giant God Clan.","As long as a member of the Giant God Clan reached the Ninth Tribulation, they could obtain a chance to go to the Starry Sky by reaching the Giant God Temple.","Or they could gain opportunities and continue to stay on the Realm King Continent.","But Chi Jiuxiao was different.","He was brought from the Starry Sky by Babidi, first arriving at Northern Spacetime, and then after being revived, he was taken to the Star Field of the Gods by Danbao.","And now he ended up like this.","Faced with Zong Qian’s question, Chi Jiuxiao’s eyes shifted, completely unable to understand.","He looked like a madman.","With fists clenched, his divine power suddenly surged.","Although he had a physique similar to Broly’s, he lacked Broly’s unlimited growth potential.","His divine power erupted, stopping only after breaking through 80 million.","This action made Zong Qian involuntarily gasp.","He ranked among the top ten in the Northern Star Field of the Realm King Continent.","But he didn’t have 80 million divine power!","After Chi Jiuxiao’s eruption, he didn’t give them any chance to continue talking and directly made a move.","It was as crazed as always.","Lord Du Gu was dumbfounded.","He didn’t even have time to increase his divine power before he was severely injured by a punch.","Zong Qian wasn’t in much better shape; his continuous defense made his divine body unstable.","Forcefully increasing his power was counterproductive.","He could only defend with difficulty, stabilizing his divine power.","The unluckiest was Roland of the Silver Blue Star Field, who was torn to pieces by Chi Jiuxiao.","He fell on the spot.","The Zhalong Mountain Lord, Hong Yuan, took the opportunity to retreat.","Holding his breath and containing his divine power, he prepared to flee.","Too many powerful figures had come this time.","If he didn’t leave, he would truly be stuck here.","His Zhalong Mountain couldn’t remain here anymore; he had to take his clan members and leave.","It was just a pity for this Spacetime Gorge, a place that continuously produced treasures!","“Hmph, even if I leave, I won’t leave it for you!”","The Zhalong Mountain Lord flew higher.","He also held a token to control the great array in his hand.","He wanted to destroy this place.","Or rather, repair the spacetime rift.","Before the destruction, he turned to look at Jian Wushuang and the others, but he had no more plans.","These people had surprised him too much.","First, Jian Wushuang brought out the Beast God Weapon, then Jian Wushuang revealed the power of the Starry Sky.","His divine power increased to 70 million, yet he willingly gave him the Beast God Weapon.","Either the other party was truly patient, considering the Beast God Weapon just an ordinary treasure.","Or they had plans for him.","They definitely had motives.","But he hadn’t paid attention to the other party before.","Now they had released a member of the Giant God Clan.","And judging by the looks of it, still a mad one.","An unconscious member of the Giant God Clan.","He couldn’t afford to provoke them.","“Go!”","With a crack, he crushed the token.","His figure flashed, wanting to leave the Spacetime Gorge immediately.","Buzz!"]},{"number":6162,"title":"Chapter 6162: Unexpected","paragraphs":["Chapter 6162: Unexpected","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The surrounding spacetime began to gradually collapse from that moment.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain was somewhat astonished. This was his first time activating this restriction, and he didn’t know what was going on.","He thought of leaving quickly.","But before he could move, a figure appeared in front of him, blocking his way.","Upon closer inspection, there were two figures.","One of them was a monk-like figure.","There was no need to guess; it was Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","“Lord, it seems you have taken something that you shouldn’t have!”","Jian Wushuang slowly walked forward, his divine power surging, reaching directly to 70 million.","He had not yet burned his divine body.","The Beast God Weapon was right in front of him. Today, no matter what, he had to make the other party leave it behind.","“Who exactly are you people?” The Lord of Zhalong Mountain would not surrender easily. Although his divine power had decreased significantly, he still had more than 70 million left and was not afraid of Jian Wushuang at all.","He was just apprehensive about the other party’s identity.","Jian Wushuang sneered, “Try, and you’ll know!”","He knew the other party wouldn’t let go easily.","There was only one way – a battle.","Clang!","He drew his sword directly.","His strongest technique was still the Starry Sky Chronicles.","As soon as he drew his sword, it was the fifth sword of the Starry Sky Chronicles.","“Spacetime Reincarnation!”","A gigantic sword shadow descended from the sky.","The terrifying Origin Source contained within it, if compared to divine power, surpassed 70-five million.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain could hardly believe it.","It was too late for regret now; he could only grit his teeth and take this sword head-on.","Spacetime and reincarnation intertwined, sweeping across the surroundings.","Buzz!","The impact force shone on the face of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain, twisting his divine body, clearly outmatched.","The sword shadow passed through, shattering the divine body of the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","Holding his chest with one hand, gasping, he said, “You’ve been eyeing the Devil Dragon Blade for a long time?”","Jian Wushuang nodded indifferently.","“Hand it over, and I can spare your life!”","His goal was the Beast God Weapon, nothing more.","As long as he was given the Beast God Weapon, everything could be settled.","There was no need to speak further; he immediately turned his head and left.","With his people, he headed to the Silver Blue Star Field to explore that starry sky secret realm.","Rather than wasting time here.","“Dream on!” The Lord of Zhalong Mountain snorted coldly. The Devil Dragon Blade was his most important treasure; it was impossible to hand it over, otherwise, it would cut off his path to becoming a Universe Master.","Swish!","He flipped his hand and took out a piece of Spacetime Order, coldly saying, “If you want the Beast God Weapon, come to the Dragon Clan and find me!”","This time, he decided to leave everything behind and return to the Dragon Clan.","To cultivate in seclusion, until the Universe Master emerged.","By then, with the treasure he obtained, he would also be a super existence among the Universe Masters.","Everything suddenly made sense.","Why let trivial matters hinder such a promising future?","This time, even Zong Qian was mobilized for that treasure.","He knew that no matter where he fled, it would be the same.","Better to return to the tribe.","When Jian Wushuang saw the Temporal Order, his heart sank.","He had forgotten about this.","The other party had the Temporal Order.","They could escape at any time.","This wasn’t the Northern Spacetime, where he could freely block spacetime.","In an instant, he panicked.","He hurriedly drew his sword again.","Trying to stop the opponent.","However, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain laughed indifferently, “Too late!”","Crack!","He crushed the token, and a rift appeared in spacetime.","Seeing the opponent about to escape, Jian Wushuang felt a mix of emotions. He urgently needed the Beast God Weapon to enhance his divine power. Otherwise, how could he face the threats of the Metal Lifeform and Xilu?","But he had seen the power of the Temporal Order before.","With a single activation,","Only a Universe Master could stop it, or a pre-arranged grand formation to block spacetime.","As he showed his unwillingness,","Hu Qing beside him reminded, “Brother Wushuang, it’s not over yet!”","Jian Wushuang looked again at the Lord of Zhalong Mountain and noticed something unusual.","He could no longer sense the opponent’s presence, yet he could see the opponent still within the spacetime rift, not far away.","And the crack kept expanding.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “Why is spacetime like this?”","The entire spacetime gorge was undergoing significant changes.","Lord Du Gu and Zong Qian, who were fighting against Chi Jiuxiao, also felt the change.","The surrounding cracks kept extending.","Soon, the area would collapse.","Forming an immense black hole.","By then, they would all be doomed.","Jian Wushuang, who had just arrived, didn’t know this.","He thought it was a unique feature of the place that trapped the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","So he attacked again, trying to strike the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","But he found that his Spacetime Reincarnation Sword couldn’t enter the spacetime rift.","Naturally, it couldn’t threaten the Lord of Zhalong Mountain.","“I’d like to see how long you can hide!” Jian Wushuang attacked again.","Unexpectedly, this time the Lord of Zhalong Mountain stepped out of the rift himself, taking the full brunt of the sword.","Already severely injured, the Lord of Zhalong Mountain was completely shattered by the sword.","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned, not expecting the opponent to come out and court death.","One sword ended the opponent’s life.","“That’s it?” Wu Li and others flew over, seeing the Lord of Zhalong Mountain turned to ashes, their eyes filled with surprise.","“Forget it, clean up and let’s go!” Jian Wushuang casually collected the treasures left on the ground and prepared to leave with the group.","But when they turned to look around, they found spacetime cracks all around.","There was no way out!","Zong Qian, Lord Du Gu, and those starfield bandits were all stunned.","Even the Temporal Order was useless.","They couldn’t escape.","They were sitting ducks, with Chi Jiuxiao as a threat.","No way to run.","Doomed!","“Damn!” Zong Qian roared in anger, bringing out his trump card.","His divine power approached 80 million, a life-saving measure given by the ancestor.","He used it all at once, surprisingly able to temporarily suppress Chi Jiuxiao.","But the surrounding cracks kept spreading.","The space kept shrinking.","They dared not enter the cracks, so they had to huddle together.","The area kept shrinking.","Soon it was within ten thousand miles.","Chi Jiuxiao’s massive figure didn’t even need to move to attack them.","“Wu Li, are you sure you can’t put him away?” Shenmu King looked at the towering Chi Jiuxiao, already in despair.","He didn’t want to face this monster again.","But now the space was so small they had to shrink themselves, they had no choice but to brace themselves and fight.","This wasn’t the only threat.","Facing Chi Jiuxiao, Jian Wushuang had life-saving measures.","But how to get out?","He also noticed that Zong Qian and others dared not step into the cracks.","Clearly fearing the spacetime rifts.","Even against Chi Jiuxiao, they dared not enter the spacetime rifts.","The Lord of Zhalong Mountain even voluntarily exited the rift.","“Let’s do it!”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, bringing out the pyramid.","Everyone filed in.","Awaiting the final judgment.","Entering the Realm God Continent hadn’t been many years.","Unexpectedly, they faced such an unfathomable situation this time.","Entering the spacetime rift?"]},{"number":6163,"title":"Chapter 6163: Illusory Realm in Turbulence","paragraphs":["Chapter 6163: Illusory Realm in Turbulence","Jian Wushuang held the token that Xuan Yi had given him.","If the Origin Source was threatened, he would immediately crush the token.","Buzz!","In the Spacetime Gorge, all space was completely lost.","A massive black hole formed.","Moreover, the black hole continued to contract.","Soon, the black hole became the size of a fist, floating in the depths of the canyon.","Everything around was calm, as if nothing had happened.","However, Jian Wushuang and the others were trapped within this black hole. Crash!","It was the sound of time.","In the blink of an eye, a hundred thousand epochs had passed.","Even the Zhalong Mountain had changed ownership.","Some Universe Masters had visited this place.","However, the material power leaking from the black hole was immense.","The Universe Masters were helpless.","They did not sense any life within the black hole.","They gradually dispersed.","Only the Kunpeng clan of the Demon Tribe was furious.","Because Zong Qian had fallen.","The Kunpeng clan, and even the entire Demon Tribe, lost their precious genius.","Several Universe Masters responsible for this were punished and sent to the clan’s purgatory.","Because of a treasure, they had lost a prodigy with boundless potential.","This was an immense loss.","Universe Masters were also divided into levels.","Zong Qian would have become one of the top Universe Masters in the future, potentially reaching the level of the Demon Tribe’s ancestor.","But he had fallen because of a treasure.","Lord Du Gu was merely a Star Field Bandit. Though his family was strong, no clan would make a big fuss over a Star Field Bandit.","Soon, his name would be erased.","Even Zhalong Mountain had changed its name.","100,000 epochs were short, yet many things could happen.","The Dragon Tribe did not mention this matter much.","Soon, it was forgotten.","Only the elder brother of the lord of Zhalong Mountain came to take a look and left disappointed.","“Did he fall?”","In the darkness, a voice muttered.","“No, everyone is still alive!”","The voice was familiar.","“Brother Wu Li!”","“Yes!”","“I am here too!”","“And me!”","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing, Wu Li, Divine Wood King, and Wu Zuo were all still alive.","But everything around them was pitch black.","There was no space, no time.","Even Thought power was gone.","They could only communicate by voice.","All five were alive.","They only felt a moment of darkness before speaking.","But in the outside world, a hundred thousand epochs had passed.","They had fallen into the chaotic flow of time and space.","“Huh?”","As they were asking each other, a wisp of colored breath appeared in front of them.","It rose from below.","Jian Wushuang didn’t recognize this breath, but Wu Zuo and the others did.","“No way!” Divine Wood King exclaimed, his mouth wide open. “This is the Starry Sky Secret Realm!”","A beam of light suddenly shone down.","They instantly arrived in a space.","Besides the five of them, Zong Qian, Lord Du Gu, Lion King, Xi Jiu, Zongzheng, and Wuya, all Star Field Bandits, were also there.","Buzz!","After appearing, a ripple emerged on the black mirror behind them, resembling foam.","A pair of jade-like feet slowly stepped towards them on the black foam.","From the bottom to the top.","Everyone followed the gaze.","On the beautiful jade legs was a thin, cool blue dress.","“Human race!”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","Looking further up, her willow-like waist and full, heaving chest made everyone’s blood rush.","“A woman!”","Only after seeing her face did everyone involuntarily take half a step back.","Stunning!","Absolutely beautiful!","Peerless!","One of a kind!","This was the only way they could express their thoughts.","They had never seen such a beautiful person before.","Even Zong Qian, who had extensive experience, was entranced.","That exquisitely delicate face, which they did not dare to touch, left them intoxicated.","“Virtuous!”","Hu Qing had already started reciting Buddhist scriptures.","Wu Zuo swallowed hard as he looked at her.","“Ahem!” Jian Wushuang coughed lightly to remind them, “Don’t stare. I can’t sense her aura;","she must be a supreme existence, not to be offended!”","Hearing “supreme existence,” everyone suppressed their inner turmoil and averted their","eyes.","The absolutely beautiful woman walked lightly to the front of the group and then slowly","stopped.","“Little ones, welcome to the Star Field of the Gods!”","These words made Zong Qian open his eyes.","He was the most knowledgeable among them.","Hearing “Star Field of the Gods,” his eyes flickered.","“Senior, what place did you say this is?” He could hardly believe his ears.","The absolutely beautiful woman smiled faintly and said calmly, “This is the Star Field of the","Gods. And you don’t need to call me senior, just call me Xing Yue.”","“Daoist Xing Yue, what is the Star Field of the Gods?” Wu Li, who was not very knowledgeable, swallowed hard. Finding her easy to talk to, he stared at her absolutely beautiful face and asked about the place.","This scene was loudly scolded by Zong Qian: “Junior, don’t be rude!”","“Well!” Seeing Zong Qian so intimidating, Jian Wushuang turned to look at him.","He wasn’t afraid of him now.","Lord Du Gu’s divine power had decreased a lot, and Zong Qian only had seventy million units of divine power left. At worst, they could fight again.","Hearing this, Zong Qian was about to rebuke but then realized that Jian Wushuang and the others were fearlessly ignorant, so he explained, “Juniors, if you go out, you can ask your elders if they have heard of the Star Field of the Gods. It is a pinnacle power in the Starry Sky. If I’m not mistaken, Senior Xing Yue should be an emissary of a Star Spirit.”","Star Spirit?","Hearing this title, Jian Wushuang understood.","Weiss was called that!","Star Spirit!","That indeed was a big deal. However, after hearing that the woman in front of him was just an emissary under a Star","Spirit, he thought it was not a big deal.","He had even met a Star Spirit and almost became a disciple. Unfortunately, because of Danbao’s appearance, he couldn’t succeed in the end.","He only accepted the first life of his universe, which was the hairless purple big cat as his","disciple.","To talk about seniority, he and Weiss were considered brothers. There was no way around it. The first life of his universe was his child.","Weiss accepted his child as a disciple, so they were on equal footing.","Moreover, Weiss had taught him the Autonomous Ultra Instinct technique.","Even though he hadn’t mastered it yet.","But he had been taught, hadn’t he?","“Heh heh!” Xing Yue covered her mouth and laughed, looking very much like Weiss. She","smiled faintly and said, “No need to be so nervous. Since you have arrived here, it means that someone among you has a connection with the Star Field of the Gods!”","Zong Qian was excited, “Senior, are you saying we can become disciples of the Star Field of","the Gods?”","“Is there any benefit?” Wu Li couldn’t help asking when he saw Zong Qian so excited, “Isn’t","this the Starry Sky Secret Realm? How is there also the Star Field of the Gods?”","This was the place all demigods dreamed of.","Yet he asked if there was any benefit. Zong Qian couldn’t help but cover his face, feeling very embarrassed, even though he had","nothing to do with Wu Li.","But having entered this place together meant they had a connection, so he started to explain the matters of the Star Field of the Gods."]},{"number":6164,"title":"Chapter 6164: Academy of the Gods","paragraphs":["Chapter 6164: Academy of the Gods","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It wasn’t really Wu Li’s fault for his limited knowledge.","Aside from him, no one here knew what the Academy of the Gods truly represented.","Entering the Academy of the Gods meant becoming a future Universe God.","A 100 percent chance of becoming a Universe God.","In the entire Starry Sky, only the Academy of the Gods could achieve this.","Because the one who founded this place was a true ruler of the Starry Sky.","But that person no longer cared about this place.","Everything was handed over to the Star Spirit Envoys.","Like Xing Yue in front of them.","But one should not underestimate the person in front of them.","Her strength might be even greater than that of the Realm King.","As for why she appeared here, the reason was simple.","Someone stronger than the Realm King appearing here was quite normal, wasn’t it?","Even if she appeared in a pit, people would still scramble to get in!","Upon realizing the significance of this place, Wu Li couldn’t help but gasp and immediately knelt down to bow.","Stronger than the Realm King—who would fear Zamasu if they entered the Academy of the Gods?","“Little ones, the Academy of the Gods is not easy to enter. You still need to pass the test!” Xing Yue was also curious herself, not knowing why she was guiding these strange little ones this time.","Among this group, she could only see the extraordinary in Zong Qian, Hu Qing, and Jian Wushuang.","The others were far too inferior.","These people entering was actually a waste of spots.","Not to mention the slots for entering the Academy of the Gods, even the spots for participating as candidates were extremely precious.","Because you couldn’t participate just because you wanted to.","It depended on whether you had the ability.","If you did, you would be summoned.","“I understand this. Since the Academy of the Gods has given me this opportunity, I, Zong Qian, will definitely seize it!” Zong Qian bowed in salute.","A resolute look appeared in his eyes.","As for the previous competition for the treasure, it had long been forgotten.","Even if he had the ability to snatch the treasure from Jian Wushuang, he wouldn’t do it.","Because compared to the Academy of the Gods, all of this was not worth it.","The opportunity to become a Universe God.","This opportunity could only attract ordinary people.","It couldn’t attract Zong Qian.","But the Academy of the Gods was different. Not only would it cultivate you to become a Universe God, but there was even hope of becoming a Realm King.","Or even becoming a Star Spirit Envoy.","The 12 Star Spirits of the Starry Sky.","Each Star Spirit had 3 Star Spirit Envoys.","There were only so many positions.","Whether it was becoming a Realm King or a Star Spirit Envoy, these were heights that ordinary cultivators couldn’t reach.","“Alright, since I’ve explained everything, let’s begin!” Xing Yue waved her hand, casually tearing apart the spacetime within the Starry Sky Secret Realm. Jian Wushuang and the others followed the opening and directly entered the depths of this Starry Sky Secret Realm.","Before entering, Jian Wushuang was still puzzled. What had been explained?","They hadn’t even mentioned the conditions for entering the Academy of the Gods!","But once he entered, he understood.","The scene before him was self-explanatory.","Towering towers lined up in a row.","The Land of Feathering!","The Feathering Towers!","This time, they were really playing big.","Actually, Jian Wushuang wasn’t particularly interested in the Academy of the Gods.","He preferred to follow a steady path.","But after Wu Zuo and the others learned about the Academy of the Gods, they had already started making efforts.","Each of them had a gleam in their eyes.","After entering the Land of Feathering, they discovered that they were not the only ones here.","There were thousands of candidates.","All of them were venturing into the Feathering Towers.","Zong Qian ignored everyone and was the first to head toward the Feathering Towers.","Seeing a powerful demon clan member, he smiled and asked, “Friend, we just arrived and are unaware of...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the other person ignored him and walked away.","Trying to extract information was impossible.","They were all competitors, after all.","Jian Wushuang also sneered and led his people directly to the nearest Feathering Tower.","Rules? We’ll figure them out once we’re in.","“You all wait here for a moment. I’ll sneak in first.”","Naturally, Wu Li and the others had no objections since he was the strongest among them.","The first to scout the way.","Just as he was about to step into the Feathering Towers, a withered old man blocked his path.","“To go up the tower, first hand over a skeleton!”","“A skeleton?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback. He then raised his head and asked, “Where do we find one?”","“The back mountain!”","After the old man coldly said this, he ignored him.","A skeleton!","The back mountain.","Jian Wushuang turned to look at everyone and waved, “Let’s go!”","They had all heard the conversation.","A mysterious force was gradually revealing itself before them.","No one knew they had entered this place.","The outside world still thought they had fallen.","Little did they know, they had entered the trial grounds of the Star Field of the Gods.","Zong Qian quickly figured out the rules.","To ascend the tower, they first had to obtain a skeleton.","The Feathering Towers were actually a treasure land within this Starry Sky secret realm.","It was just a place chosen by the Star Field of the Gods on the Realm King Continent to search for candidates.","Wu Li and the others were quite familiar with this place.","Upon hearing they had to find skeletons in the back mountain, they exclaimed, “They can’t possibly want us to kill that thing, right?”","“What thing?”","“You’ll know once we get there!”","When they arrived at the back mountain, Jian Wushuang was also startled by what he saw.","Skeletons wandered the back mountain.","Upon closer inspection, these skeletons were pieced together.","They weren’t from a single person.","The bones were also colored, indicating different levels.","White was the most common, with the weakest divine power.","Even a demigod could take them down.","This was to accommodate weaker candidates.","The Star Field of the Gods didn’t select based on who had the strongest divine power but on overall potential and talent.","That was how they made their final decision.","“Everyone, this time we’ve escaped death. Seize the opportunity we’ve gained!”","However, he knew in his heart that despite Zong Qian’s exaggerated claims, this place wouldn’t be easy to enter.","If he entered the Star Field of the Gods, he might not have to fear Zamasu anymore.","The key was being able to get in.","And he didn’t know the criteria for their judgment.","“I’m more familiar with this place. The Star Field of the Gods is likely temporarily selecting candidates here. Follow me!”","Wu Li led the way.","This place was a Starry Sky secret realm in the Silver Blue Star Field.","Zong Qian might not have been here before, but many others had.","Although entering this Starry Sky secret realm required a rare token, the candidates chosen by the Star Field of the Gods were all top experts from various major forces.","They were far from ordinary.","After entering, they quickly familiarized themselves with the place.","Jian Wushuang and the others followed Wu Li and Wu Zuo to the back mountain and began hunting those skeletons.","With their current combat strength, slaying blue skeletons was no challenge.","White skeletons corresponded to divine power below 50 million.","Blue skeletons ranged from 50 to 60 million.","Apart from Wu Li, their divine power was all above 50 million.","They quickly collected many blue skeletons.","Since they didn’t know what the skeleton levels represented, taking white skeletons to the Feathering Towers might make things easier.","This would require some testing to determine."]},{"number":6165,"title":"Chapter 6165: Collecting Bones","paragraphs":["Chapter 6165: Collecting Bones","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Brother Wu Li, you take the blue bones and leave first. I’ll try the purple bones alone!”","Since they were graded, the rewards obtained would be different as well.","Jian Wushuang wanted to obtain the strongest bones.","Or at least the bones that matched his abilities.","The purple bones had more than 60 million divine power.","And the golden bones had over 70 million divine power.","He wanted to give it a try.","Wu Li, being the weakest, only collected some white bones. He gave a brief reminder before leaving with the others.","Hu Qing also left.","It seemed that he wasn’t very interested in this place.","The so-called Academy of Gods was merely a force established by a Star Spirit.","They had just entered the Realm King Continent and hadn’t even seen many Universe Gods. How could they understand what the Academy of Gods represented?","This time, they had no choice but to enter this place.","Everything was left to fate.","If they could enter, they would; if not, they would leave it.","After the others left, Jian Wushuang ventured deeper.","He still very much wanted to enter the Academy of Gods.","After all, even Zamasu was a member of the Academy of Gods.","If he could enter the Academy of Gods, he might no longer fear the opponent’s threat.","Thinking of this, he did not slow down.","He ventured into the depths of the back mountain.","In front of a purple pond.","Jian Wushuang crouched down, touched the liquid in the pond, and sniffed it at his nose, muttering to himself, “Strange, it’s the scent of Origin Source!”","After going deeper, he discovered many purple ponds.","They contained not divine power but Origin Source power.","The purple bones were actually no different from the white bones; they were just stronger because they were imbued with the purple Origin Source power.","He had long understood the connection between Origin Source and divine power, so he wasn’t too surprised.","He just found the purple liquid somewhat peculiar.","“The corpse of a Universe God!” He looked up and saw a massive corpse from where he stood.","That was where Wu Li and the others crossed the Ninth Tribulation, with boundless divine power.","It looked close, but it was difficult to reach.","Wu Li and the others had been taken there by the Great Realm King’s people.","Relying on his own strength to get there was extremely challenging.","Boom!","A loud noise came from nearby, and Jian Wushuang immediately rose into the air.","Not far away, a golden skeleton was fighting a giant Beast God.","“Zong Qian?” Jian Wushuang recognized the Beast God at a glance.","It was Zong Qian, who had come with them.","A massive Kunpeng.","Possessing the power of the Starry Sky and a super Beast God itself.","There was probably no second person like him on the Realm King Continent.","There were many super Beast Gods.","There were also many cultivators who mastered the power of the Starry Sky.","But there were very few who mastered both.","“The perfect fusion of Beast God power and Starry Sky power!”","Jian Wushuang watched, blinking.","He had been puzzled from the beginning, but the urgent situation at that time didn’t allow him to think much.","Now, he had many questions and doubts.","The fusion of Beast God power and Starry Sky power.","It was just like the previous fusion of Origin Source and divine power.","Once he comprehended it, he might be able to create a second form of the ancient Super Evolution.","Unfortunately, since he wasn’t familiar with the other party, asking might not yield any answers.","He could only watch from the side.","The divine power of that golden skeleton was as high as 78 million.","Zong Qian, with his restored peak divine power, could still suppress the opponent.","His combat power was incredibly fierce.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang could tell that Zong Qian’s training time was even less than his own.","Possessing two kinds of power and using them simultaneously.","He originally thought he was extraordinary, but after seeing Zong Qian, he realized there was always someone stronger.","It was a pity that the other party only mastered the power of the Starry Sky and had not nurtured the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Otherwise, he could have created an ultimate secret technique like the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","It would definitely be much stronger than it was now.","Others only saw that he mastered the power of the Starry Sky, but they did not see that he controlled the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Watching Zong Qian’s battle, Jian Wushuang was also looking for the other party’s method of using power.","Unfortunately, in this kind of battle, he could at most see some of the opponent’s techniques, but studying the opponent’s power utilization was too difficult.","“Sigh!”","He sighed, and his figure flashed to the back of the golden skeleton.","At this moment, the golden skeleton’s divine power had already reached 80 million.","Golden liquid was still flowing on its body.","Zong Qian alone couldn’t take it down.","“Zong Qian, how about we cooperate this once?” He didn’t rush to make a move but instead asked for the other party’s opinion.","He wasn’t the type to take advantage of someone else’s peril.","Seeing him appear, Zong Qian was also stunned and asked in surprise, “What do you mean?”","He didn’t quite understand Jian Wushuang’s intention.","“How about we each take half of this golden skeleton?”","After all, the most important core of a golden skeleton was a few golden bones.","If they split it, they could go to Feathering Towers a few more times.","Hearing this, Zong Qian considered his own backup plan.","He alone would take a long time to defeat the golden skeleton.","And he was also being watched by Jian Wushuang. He couldn’t see through Jian Wushuang’s character.","What if the other party ambushed him from behind?","It would be better to cooperate and solve it quickly.","After thinking for a moment, Zong Qian nodded and said, “Split it in half!”","“No problem!”","Jian Wushuang agreed readily. Even if the other party said 70-30, he could accept it.","After all, they had been fighting for so long, and he had watched all the golden skeleton’s techniques from the side.","At this moment, joining the battle would also be to his great advantage.","After agreeing, he no longer hesitated and made a bold move.","Clang!","Drawing his sword, he unleashed his strongest strike.","Time and Space Reincarnation!","With one sword stroke, the mighty power of the Starry Sky surged towards the golden skeleton. The immense power directly drove the golden skeleton to the ground, and the bones in its arms struggled to resist this strike.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s fierce attack, Zong Qian was also somewhat surprised. However, after a slight pause, he resumed his assault.","Transforming into his true form, he spat out filthy substances from his mouth.","Don’t underestimate these things.","The things he spat out were venom.","As soon as the golden skeleton was contaminated, it could no longer move.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to strike several more times until he completely shattered the opponent’s bones.","At this moment, Zong Qian transformed again, taking on a divine demon form.","He clenched his fists.","One fist shadowed in blue was the power of the Starry Sky.","The other hand condensed into the shadow of a Beast God, and with a punch, it was like a Kunpeng spreading its wings, suddenly smashing towards the ground.","Jian Wushuang also boosted the Origin Source.","Gripping the Wanjie Sword, he suddenly unleashed the power of ten thousand swords.","A full ten thousand Spacetime Reincarnations.","All piercing into the ground simultaneously.","In the final moment, the ten thousand swords merged into one.","Seeing this, Zong Qian crossed his hands, and the two different powers began to intertwine.","Dark red and light blue.","After fusion, they turned into a pink airwave.","A huge pink beam burst from his hands.","The beam shot straight to the ground.","Boom!!!","After a huge sound, the dust settled.","A bottomless pit appeared on the ground.","The golden skeleton could no longer move."]},{"number":6166,"title":"Chapter 6166: Happy Cooperation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6166: Happy Cooperation","“Whew!”","Both of them panted heavily.","It was evident that their recent attacks had pushed them to their limits.","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Sword Dao had unleashed a power level of approximately 75 million.","Meanwhile, Zong Qian’s divine power had reached 80 million at the last moment.","The immense divine power left them both catching their breath for quite some time.","They were close to reaching the level of Universe Gods.","However, even at this level, Jian Wushuang still found it challenging to execute the sixth sword move of the Starry Sky Chronicles.","He still couldn’t comprehend how he had managed to perform that sword strike back then. After merging with Hu Qing, the power he had unleashed was beyond his understanding.","He didn’t know how much it was.","The Realm King had said it was even stronger than the Universe Gods.","If he could still merge, he wouldn’t fear anything like Xilu or Zamasu, but unfortunately, he no longer had that opportunity.","Gasping for breath, Zong Qian looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “I didn’t expect you to have hidden such power. Why didn’t you take the initiative to deal with Hong Yuan in the Spacetime Gorge and instead gave him the treasure?”","“If it weren’t for your intervention, I might have acted long ago!” Jian Wushuang didn’t hold back and explained his concerns at that time. If it weren’t for the Star Field Bandits and people like Luo Lan, he would have acted sooner.","Moreover, he hadn’t had a clear understanding of his own strength back then.","He was primarily worried about others taking advantage of the situation.","When he left the Northern Spacetime, the true spirit had told him that no one would look after them this time.","He needed his own strength.","Naturally, he had to be extremely cautious.","He couldn’t afford to be careless.","Even if his opponent’s divine power was only 50 million.","He had to consider the possibility that the opponent had a hidden divine power of 100 million. Better safe than sorry!","“Brave and wise, Jian Wushuang, you’re quite impressive. Perhaps this time you’ll be able to enter the Academy of the Gods!” Zong Qian couldn’t help but praise.","Jian Wushuang was surprised. To receive praise from the proud Zong Qian was unexpected.","It seemed that Zong Qian now regarded him as an equal.","There was a mutual appreciation among geniuses.","They entered the pit, divided the golden bones, each obtaining five bones.","That meant five opportunities.","“Pleasant cooperation!”","“See you at the Ascension Towers!”","They quickly parted ways without much further interaction.","Watching Zong Qian’s departing figure, Jian Wushuang stood still.","This cooperation wasn’t really for the golden bones; it was to probe Zong Qian’s strength.","But he didn’t get the chance.","Asking directly?","He understood better than anyone that such knowledge couldn’t be easily shared.","Why would others guide him?","He shouldn’t even think about it.","He only used this opportunity to establish some rapport with Zong Qian, which might prove beneficial in the future.","Just like his past relationship with Jinchen, when he arrived in the Daughter Kingdom, he received guidance from the ruler, Yun Zhi, which was an opportunity.","“Beast God Weapon!”","With a thought, several dark red divine weapons instantly wrapped around his body.","Among them, the Origin Source of the Demon Dragon Blade was the most powerful, already considered an artifact.","The remaining Beast God Weapons included the Eye of the Candle Dragon at the Ninth Tribulation level.","The rest were at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation level.","Currently, nurturing them was pointless.","He needed to hand them over to a divine blacksmith to reconstruct the current Beast God","Weapons.","However, the Origin Source would be preserved.","Until now, he hadn’t realized he had collected all the Beast God Weapons; the previous","experiences had been too fantastical.","With the Beast God Weapons gathered.","And the treasures obtained from the Lord of Zalong Mountain.","“Hmm?” As he scanned through those treasures, he discovered six artifacts.","Above the artifacts, there were stars.","The remaining treasures were either consumable elixirs and fruits or some semi-artifacts.","“Stars?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. Although he didn’t know much about artifacts, he had acquired quite","a few.","The Nine Tribulations Tower from before.","And the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","The Nine Tribulations Tower had nine stars, but he had thought they were just decorations","and didn’t pay much attention.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard had a crescent moon.","He hadn’t paid attention to that either.","Now, seeing these six artifacts, he suddenly thought that these decorations might indicate","the artifact’s level.","Of the six artifacts.","Five had one star each.","The last one had six stars.","A dilapidated ancient tower.","It contained a massive amount of Beast God’s power.","A true dragon coiled around the top of the ancient tower.","This treasure might be the one that Zong Qian and others wanted to snatch, and also the one","the Lord of Zhalong Mountain carefully guarded.","From the Beast God’s power above, Jian Wushuang saw the embodiment of a divine dragon.","His heart moved, and he exclaimed, “This Origin Source must be from a Universe God-level","true dragon!”","If that were the case, no wonder the Lord of Zhalong Mountain had guarded it so fiercely. Once the opponent became a Universe God, absorbing the Origin Source from this ancient tower could undoubtedly make them a super strong Universe God.","It was like a Dao Lord obtaining the Origin Source of a peak-level powerhouse.","After becoming an Emperor, absorbing the Origin Source wouldn’t necessarily make one a peak-level being, but a tier 5 Emperor was achievable, possibly even a tier 6.","“No wonder!”","Jian Wushuang carefully stored these treasures.","These were hard-won through life-and-death struggles; there was no rush to distribute them","now.","But the stars puzzled him.","The Demon Dragon Blade was also an artifact but only had half a star.","As for those treasures they called semi-artifacts, they didn’t even have half a star.","Perhaps it was wishful thinking on their part.","After collecting the golden bones, Jian Wushuang wandered around the area again, observed","some pools of golden liquid, and then left.","He even tried to absorb the golden liquid but was repelled.","He couldn’t absorb it at all.","White bones soaked in golden liquid had their divine power nearly doubled, yet the golden","liquid was Origin Source power, so how strong must it be?","Unfortunately, he couldn’t absorb it, so he had to leave.","When he returned to the Feathering Towers.","He saw Wu Li and others standing in the central square, looking despondent.","“You all went inside?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise, “How come you’re out so quickly!”","It had only been a few hours.","Wu Li and the others had collected quite a few bones!","“Sigh!” Wu Li sighed, “That Ascension Tower is impossible to climb!”","“What do you mean?”","Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised.","Impossible to climb?","Hu Qing was here too; even if he couldn’t reach the top, halfway should be achievable!","Why did everyone look so despondent?","Wu Zuo stepped forward to explain, “Brother Wushuang, you’ll understand once you go","inside, but it’s best to use white bones to climb the tower!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","There was definitely a difference between white bones and golden bones.","Using white bones to climb the tower might be relatively easier.","Golden bones were the hardest.","In a place like the Academy of the Gods, he would take the hardest path.","How could he take the easiest?","“What exactly is inside?”","“Tribulation!” Hu Qing didn’t beat around the bush, “The Ascension Tower has nine levels. I","used purple bones to climb and failed at the Fifth Tribulation!”","The Fifth Tribulation?"]},{"number":6167,"title":"Chapter 6167: There’s a Gap","paragraphs":["Chapter 6167: There’s a Gap","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but take a deep breath.","He dared not claim to surpass Hu Qing’s potential completely.","The purple skeleton ascended the building and only crossed five Tribulations?","From their expressions, it was evident they had tried many times.","All ended in failure.","“Speaking of which, I’ve crossed the most times, only falling at the Seventh Tribulation!” Wu Li said, smiling at the others’ distressed faces. “Although your divine power is strong, when it comes to crossing Tribulations, you have to look at me!”","“Shut up, you used the white skeleton!” Shen Mu Wang said irritably. “And this is just the first test. The Academy of the Gods expects us to cross the Ninth Tribulation!”","There was indeed no need to try again.","They had already tested the weakest white skeleton.","Trying again would be futile.","As they discussed this, Zong Qian emerged from the Ascension Tower.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, his expression showed pleasant surprise.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Zong Qian walked straight over.","Wu Zuo was startled, hastily shouting, “Zong Qian, don’t be too presumptuous; this is the Feathering Lands!”","“It’s fine!” Jian Wushuang patted Wu Zuo’s shoulder, looked at Zong Qian, and said, “Judging by your expression, you must be quite satisfied with your results this time!”","Zong Qian glanced at the others, then looked at Jian Wushuang with a slight smile. “Not bad. The golden skeleton ascended the tower and fell at the Ninth Tribulation. However, it’s likely because my starry sky power and beast god power weren’t perfectly fused. With some more training, I should be able to cross the Ninth Tribulation!”","Everyone was stunned.","The golden skeleton ascended the tower and failed at the Ninth Tribulation?","This was too extraordinary.","They found it hard to accept.","How could Zong Qian cross the Ninth Tribulation?","And with the golden skeleton.","Jian Wushuang was also surprised.","Zong Qian was indeed exceptional, mastering the power of the starry sky and being a super divine beast himself, but this was too much!","Hu Qing only reached the Fifth Tribulation.","“Congratulations!” Jian Wushuang didn’t know what to say. He hadn’t ascended the tower himself, but judging from Hu Qing and the others, Zong Qian might have the best results here.","But hearing the word “congratulations,” Zong Qian was taken aback and said in surprise, “Are you joking? I haven’t passed yet. If anyone deserves congratulations, it’s those people!”","He pointed to a group of humans in yellow robes.","“They all ascended the tower with golden skeletons and passed the first time. The demon tribe powerhouses in purple robes also ascended with purple skeletons and passed. I thought I could pass the first time too, but it seems I still need improvement!”","After Zong Qian finished speaking, the crowd fell silent again.","They scanned the square and saw many similarly dressed people walking around.","All had already passed the Ascension Tower.","Especially those in white robes, who were the most numerous.","Some of them had divine power around 40 million, seemingly no better than Wu Zuo and the others.","Not to mention Hu Qing, even Wu Li could defeat a group of them easily.","How were they inferior?","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang understood.","They had overlooked an important reason.","Their origin.","These people were native powerhouses from the Realm God Continent.","Almost none were from the spacetimes.","That was the difference.","They crossed Tribulations in the spacetime.","It’s different from those who crossed in the Realm God Continent or the starry sky.","This was why they almost all failed.","Seeing their grim faces, Zong Qian knew they hadn’t passed. To avoid further discouraging them, he discussed cooperating to kill golden skeletons with Jian Wushuang before leaving quickly.","After Zong Qian left, Jian Wushuang shared his suspicions.","“That must be it!” Wu Zuo said through gritted teeth. “I knew something felt off when crossing Tribulations here. The Origin Source is unsuitable, and the divine power is different.”","“No wonder, it’s not our fault, it’s their flawed requirements!”","“Yes, it’s their fault!”","Soon, everyone blamed the Academy of the Gods.","Since they couldn’t enter, exploring this starry sky secret realm was a good alternative.","Last time they entered was for Tribulations, this time they could focus on improving their basic divine power.","The treasures in this starry sky secret realm were plentiful.","Raising their divine power to the peak of demigods wasn’t impossible.","It wasn’t a wasted trip.","Jian Wushuang also thought it was a good idea.","But he still wanted to try ascending the tower.","And cooperating with Zong Qian, he could learn the secrets of his power usage.","With that thought, he brought out his gains from this time!","The Beast God Weapon was off the table.","He truly couldn’t divide that, but the rest of the treasures needed to be distributed properly.","But when he brought them out, Wu Zuo firmly shook his head and said, “Brother Wushuang, you’re underestimating us. This time...”","Before he could finish speaking, Jian Wushuang picked up a crown.","“Wu Zuo, I think this divine artifact suits you well. It only requires 60 million units of divine power to activate. It can create a Domain where your divine power increases, and your opponent’s decreases.”","Hearing this, Wu Zuo coughed dryly and no longer refused.","There were six divine artifacts.","He took out five and distributed them.","One of them contained the power of the Starry Sky, which he kept for himself.","As for the ancient tower that remained, he revealed its secret.","Because it held the power of the Beast God, it might be useful, and they could decide its fate later.","They had already benefited greatly and simply glared, saying, “Forget it, we didn’t contribute much this time!”","The battle in the Spacetime Gorge indeed highlighted their vast differences in strength.","When Wu Li arrived, he thought he was at least not the weakest.","However, even the God Wood King was much stronger than him.","There were also Wu Zuo and Hu Qing.","Jian Wushuang was in a league of his own, far surpassing them.","Recognizing the reality, they all realized their strength was insufficient. They had to improve or they wouldn’t be able to keep up with Jian Wushuang.","In the future, they would have to venture separately.","“Stop saying useless things. I only need the power of the Starry Sky or the power of the Beast God. I don’t need the other treasures. You all can take them. If you’re too weak, I won’t bring you along!” Jian Wushuang casually tossed the treasures to Wu Li for distribution, then turned and left the plaza, heading towards the Ascension Tower.","When it came to Wu Li and Hu Qing, he had never been stingy.","These people had shared countless life-and-death experiences with him.","Take Wu Li, for instance.","Back in the Infinite Great World, during the Tribulation of the Emperor, he risked his life to buy time.","Even though they were using each other back then, was the value of use higher than life?","Along the way, even a heart of stone would have been warmed.","As for Hu Qing, there was no need to mention.","He still remembered the scene from their first meeting.","Who could have imagined Hu Qing would achieve what he had today?","Wu Zuo, a disciple of Qishen.","At first, he had also clashed with him a few times, but later events saw him stand by his side without hesitation."]},{"number":6168,"title":"Chapter 6168: Ascending the Tower","paragraphs":["Chapter 6168: Ascending the Tower","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Divine Wood King didn’t have a particularly deep connection, but since the other party was willing to follow them and was a practitioner from the Northern Spacetime, he considered them one of his own.","Whoosh!","Arriving in front of the Ascension Tower, he didn’t hesitate and handed over the golden skeleton.","He took a step forward.","Entering the tower.","Buzz!","The space transformed.","He found himself on a golden planet.","The planet was small, with a diameter of only about 10,000 miles.","The surroundings were desolate, and the ground was smooth.","“The First Tribulation!”","A cold voice rang out, giving him no time to hesitate.","The divine body tribulation descended directly.","Along with it came the tribulation from the Origin Source.","Feeling that powerful force, Jian Wushuang understood why Wu Li and others had failed.","The method of undergoing Tribulation here was indeed different from that in the Northern Spacetime, confirming his suspicions.","The First Tribulation included the Supreme Tribulation of the Origin Source.","This did not exist in the Northern Spacetime.","Because in the Origin Universe, it only appeared in the Third Tribulation.","Here, it appeared in the First Tribulation.","And its power was not weak.","But for him, it was quite easy.","In the Origin Starry Sky, nine perfect universes floated.","With this foundation.","Trying to give him some difficulty was not an easy task.","Moreover, his method of undergoing tribulation was different from ordinary people.","Perhaps he could reach the Ninth Tribulation.","Swish!","After the First Tribulation.","He reached the second level.","The environment remained the same.","Only the tribulation was different.","But no matter what, the rules of undergoing tribulation did not change.","It still tested divine power and the Origin Source.","His divine power peaked at seventy million.","The Origin Source rivaled the Universe Masters.","This was his confidence.","Buzz!","After continuously undergoing the Seventh Tribulation, he finally felt some pressure.","That was the Eighth Tribulation.","Starting from the Seventh Tribulation, his tribulations became different.","Now facing such a tribulation was almost simple.","No pressure.","When he reached the Eighth Tribulation, it only felt somewhat peculiar.","He didn’t even use the power of the Origin Source.","He just used the Super Ancient Transformation and easily passed through it.","“The Ninth Tribulation!”","Just as he was preparing to undergo the Ninth Tribulation, he suddenly realized, he was only at the Eighth Tribulation realm!","Was he going to undergo the Ninth Tribulation already?","He had never undergone it before.","Buzz!","A buzzing sound echoed, but the sky couldn’t gather tribulation clouds.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment and speculated, “Could it be because I haven’t undergone the Ninth Tribulation yet?”","This time, he guessed correctly.","A pulling force threw him out.","Failed!","Although he failed, in a certain grand hall in the Feathering Lands, Xing Yue, who was responsible for selecting candidates on the Realm God Continent, was shocked!","It wasn’t the fact that Jian Wushuang was at the Eighth Tribulation realm that shocked her, but his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","This secret technique didn’t reveal any issues to others; they just felt the power didn’t belong to Jian Wushuang.","But Xing Yue could sense that the power came from within Jian Wushuang.","Swish!","As Jian Wushuang walked out of the Ascension Tower, Xing Yue’s figure appeared before him.","“Jian Wushuang, could we talk somewhere else?” Xing Yue’s voice was extremely beautiful, paired with her stunning appearance, giving Jian Wushuang no reason to refuse.","Xing Yue’s appearance also caught the attention of the other candidates in the square.","They all showed expressions of surprise.","“Why didn’t Lord Xing Yue descend when I passed? Who is this human kid to warrant such attention from Lord Xing Yue?”","“He has mastered the power of the Starry Sky. I’ve seen him in the back mountain!”","“That shouldn’t be the reason. Zong Qian also mastered the power of the Starry Sky!”","“You don’t understand, there must be something special!”","Many discussed Jian Wushuang’s background after witnessing the scene.","Only Wu Li and the others were stunned, finding it hard to believe.","“It’s over, Brother Wushuang is going to leave us this time!”","Everyone sighed.","“There’s nothing to be sad about. We were already far behind Wushuang. Following him would only be a burden!”","“Exactly, but we shouldn’t slack off. Let’s refine those treasures, especially you, with your weakest divine power!” Wu Zuo glanced at Wu Li and knocked on his head.","Wu Li pushed away Wu Zuo’s hand reluctantly, “Stop worrying about me. Your divine power isn’t that strong either.”","In front of the Feathering Towers.","Jian Wushuang followed Xing Yue into a grand hall on the mountain.","After entering the hall, Xing Yue turned to Jian Wushuang and asked coldly, “Jian Wushuang, I want to know why you possess such pure power of the Starry Sky. I’ve observed your background, and you’re not from the Starry Sky!”","“Umm...” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He found it difficult to answer her question.","The secret of his Origin Source was known only to him and Weiss.","He wouldn’t reveal his foundation easily.","Even if the other party was a Star Spirit Envoy.","Xing Yue noticed Jian Wushuang’s reluctance to speak and said enticingly, “There’s no need to hide it from me. If you tell me, I might be able to secure a special spot for you to enter the Academy of the Gods!”","From her words, it seemed he might still enter the Academy of the Gods even if he didn’t disclose his secret.","But he was unwilling to reveal his Origin Starry Sky even for entry into the Academy of the Gods.","“I appreciate your kindness, my lord!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, cupping his hands in thanks, showing no intention of revealing more.","Xing Yue’s eyes flashed with dissatisfaction and she asked, “Don’t you want to enter the Academy of the Gods?”","“I know you have some enmity with Zamasu. He is the future Realm King of the Realm God Continent. If you don’t enter the Academy of the Gods, your days might become difficult!”","Jian Wushuang did not expect Lian to know even this, but recalling the vast divine powers of Weiss, it seemed likely that his emissaries would not be much different.","He responded, “I’ll face whatever comes my way!”","There was nothing to fear.","At least the current Realm King was not Zamasu.","And Zamasu was still only at the Eighth Tribulation.","In the future, when he reached the Ninth Tribulation, he wouldn’t fear even the weaker Universe Masters.","And when he became a Universe God, would he still fear Zamasu?","Ridiculous.","After arriving at the Realm God Continent, although he remained cautious, he had gained confidence.","He feared no one.","Xing Yue, hearing this, felt that Jian Wushuang was overconfident.","“Zamasu is not as simple as you think. His current strength may not match mine, but with his potential, he will surpass me once he becomes a Realm King candidate. Do you understand how strong Zamasu will be then?” Xing Yue paused before continuing, “With your potential, without the support of the Academy of the Gods, how far do you think you can go?”","The words were harsh but true.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang was not as good as the other party.","But the more the other party said this, the more Jian Wushuang was determined not to go to the Academy of the Gods.","Originally, if he had been reassured, he might have considered it.","Now, no way would he go.","He didn’t believe that he couldn’t survive without them."]},{"number":6169,"title":"Chapter 6169: Graceful Decline","paragraphs":["Chapter 6169: Graceful Decline","Then he would have fallen long ago.","He wouldn’t be alive today.","Even Weiss couldn’t see through his future, so how could a Star Spirit Envoy determine his entire life!","“Thank you for the reminder, madam, but I have my own path to follow, so there’s no need for you to worry about me!” He became defiant.","If you think I overestimate myself, then I might as well be arrogant.","“You!” Xing Yue was taken aback by this statement, not expecting an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master to dare speak to her in such a manner.","After a moment’s pause, Xing Yue showed her displeasure and dismissed him, “Since you’re so determined, then leave this place!”","With that, she turned and walked into the depths of the hall.","Jian Wushuang slightly bowed and left the hall directly.","If he couldn’t go, he wouldn’t go. He wasn’t at the point of needing to beg for food yet.","Now, Zamasu was not on the Realm King Continent.","His threats were minimal.","Kude from the Divine Domain wouldn’t bother with a small fry like him.","The remaining threats were Cell and the metal lifeforms.","Back then, Xilu had only 20 million divine power. Even if everything went smoothly for him and with Zamasu’s help, having 50 million divine power now would be impressive.","He wouldn’t be afraid.","After leaving the hall, he arrived at Feathering Plaza.","Wu Zuo and others had been using the training grounds there, refining their divine artifacts, and also enhancing their divine power.","Seeing Jian Wushuang return, they stepped forward to congratulate him, “Brother Wushuang, I knew you could do it this time. What did Lord Xing Yue say to you? Did you get into the Academy of the Gods?”","“Lord Xing Yue personally appeared, so you must have gotten in!”","“Yeah, those cultivators who ascended the golden skeleton stairs didn’t even catch Lord Xing Yue’s attention. Wushuang, you definitely caught her attention, getting into the Academy of the Gods is a certainty.”","Seeing Jian Wushuang come out, Zong Qian also came over, curious about why Lord Xing Yue had called Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said calmly, “I didn’t pass!”","“Uh?”","Everyone was stunned.","Even Zong Qian was taken aback.","It wasn’t surprising if Jian Wushuang passed, but it was strange that he didn’t pass.","Otherwise, why would Lord Xing Yue appear?","“None of you passed, so how could I?”","But everyone knew Jian Wushuang was joking.","Wu Zuo spoke up to comfort him, “It’s okay, who says you can’t become a Universe God if you don’t get into the Academy of the Gods? We won’t be worse than them in the future!”","His words, however, caused some dissatisfaction among those who had passed the test.","But dissatisfaction was all it was.","After all, they hadn’t truly entered the Academy of the Gods yet.","It was just a small test.","They might fail the second one.","The quota for the Academy of the Gods on the Realm King Continent was definitely no more than ten.","And it took countless eras for ten to appear.","Out of the tens of thousands here, it would be lucky if one could get in.","So Wu Zuo’s words were to cheer them up.","Jian Wushuang only smiled and said nothing.","Zong Qian stood aside, unsure of how to bring up the matter of cooperation.","Jian Wushuang had given up and saw no need to collect the golden skeletons anymore.","He could only seek out other people now.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the back of the other person, abandoning his original plan as well.","Turning to Wu Li, he said, “You should know the way out of here, right?”","“Don’t worry, I’m very familiar with it!” Wu Li patted his chest and said, “Back then, guided by the Realm King, I remember it clearly. Although I couldn’t pass through with my strength at the time, now it’s no problem to traverse that ancient Starry Sky road.”","“Then let’s depart!” Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate any longer.","Immediately, he followed Wu Li and left the Feathering Lands.","Passing through the black membrane, they exited the area designated by the Academy of the Gods.","Getting out was simple, but without guidance, even a Universe God couldn’t get in.","Swish!","The scene changed.","A huge blue ancient road appeared before them.","With it came some of the failures.","Their divine power was generally around 50 million.","Being able to come here indicated they had considerable potential.","It wasn’t just about divine power.","But even if they failed, there were benefits to be gained.","Crossing the ancient Starry Sky road ahead, they would reach another dangerous place.","There were many benefits there.","Their goal was the place where a Universe God had fallen.","In the dojo of the sitting place, there was a vast power.","Additionally, there was the power of the starry sky. This time, Jian Wushuang could absorb it","all.","He aimed to elevate his divine power to the limit of the Eighth Tribulation; the rest was the","Origin Source.","Perhaps he could solve both problems at once.","Then he would be ready to face the Ninth Tribulation.","But to enter the dojo where the Universe God had fallen, they had to cross this ancient road.","Despite its emptiness, it hid great dangers.","“Be careful of the monsters here!” As they stepped onto the ancient road, Wu Li cautiously reminded them.","It was Jian Wushuang and Hui Qing’s first time here. Hearing about the monsters, they couldn’t help but pause and asked, “The monsters, are they like the ones in the Spacetime","Gorge?”","“You’re right, but their combat power is much stronger than those in the Spacetime Gorge!”","With that, everyone cautiously stepped onto the ancient road.","During the journey, they rode the pyramid.","This also helped avoid sneak attacks.","After entering the ancient road, they found that there were indeed many cultivators here.","The lucky ones were brought by the Academy of the Gods.","The others entered this starry sky with tokens.","Their original plan was to find the Beast God Weapon and then explore this starry sky.","Now, they saved travel time.","The pyramid moved forward at full speed.","Being careful didn’t slow them down.","It meant being cautious of encountering monsters.","With good luck, they might not meet a single monster while passing through.","With bad luck, they might encounter a monster of Universe God level.","Upon learning there were Universe God-level monsters here, Jian Wushuang’s expression","changed.","“Wu Li, you said there are Universe God-level monsters here?”","Universe God was a term for cultivators, yet such powerful beings could emerge among","monsters?","And their consciousness was weak...","How did this resemble the Infinite Land described by the Realm King?","If that was true, perhaps some secrets were right in front of them.","Through the large projection, he looked at the ancient starry sky road outside.","Jian Wushuang seemed to see countless strong people from ancient times passing through","this place, heading to the Infinite Land to battle.","The scene shattered in an instant.","Ahead on the ancient road, a group of monsters indeed appeared.","Their divine power varied.","The strongest among them had 60 million divine power.","And they were already fighting with the cultivators.","“Babata, go around them!” Wu Li immediately ordered Babata to bypass the road.","Although those monsters weren’t a threat to them, fighting here would soon attract more","monsters.","It would be troublesome then.","Jian Wushuang looked at the cultivators fighting the monsters.","He felt a touch of emotion in his heart."]},{"number":6170,"title":"Chapter 6170: Stepping on the Ancient Road","paragraphs":["Chapter 6170: Stepping on the Ancient Road","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You all go ahead, I’ll help them out!”","Hearing this, everyone except Hu Qing was taken aback.","They thought Jian Wushuang had become a bit indecisive.","Facing danger without avoiding it and even offering help?","This was not like him at all!","Jian Wushuang didn’t give them time to question. With a flicker of his figure, he left the pyramid.","If there had been creatures with 80 million divine power among those demons, he might have avoided them.","But since it was only 60 million divine power, he could easily wipe them out.","“Supreme Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Buzz!","With a surge of divine power, it instantly reached 70 million.","He didn’t draw his sword.","With both hands, he condensed two beams of light, directly piercing through the group of demons.","In an instant, he annihilated them.","The cultivators who had been blocked by the demons immediately showed expressions of joy and turned to bow, “Thank you, senior, for your help!”","However, Jian Wushuang’s figure had already disappeared into the ancient road of the Starry Sky.","When he reappeared, he was back at the pyramid.","Wu Li and the others were not surprised. Against such demons, Jian Wushuang could deal with them effortlessly.","They continued their journey at full speed.","Time flew by, and more than half a month had passed.","According to Wu Li, there were still a few days of travel left.","Along the way, they encountered a few demon attacks.","However, the divine power was weak.","Only around fifty to 60 million.","But for those cultivators who were exploring, fifty million was already very dangerous.","60 million meant they could lie down and wait for death.","Among demigods, those with divine power exceeding 60 million were still rare.","Not every demigod had the strength of Zamasu or Zong Qian.","Most had only over fifty million, and those with 60 million were very few.","Those exceeding seventy million were super strong among demigods.","As for those over eighty million.","There might not be more than a few in the entire northern star region of Realm King Continent.","Even Zong Qian, who could rank in the top ten, didn’t have divine power exceeding eighty million.","Perhaps only a few stronger than him had divine power over eighty million.","Combining all the demigods on Realm King Continent, there might not be more than twenty.","So, their journey was actually very dangerous, only Jian Wushuang’s divine power was strong.","In fact, Hu Qing also had divine power exceeding 60 million.","But for some reason, after the blow in the Spacetime Canyon, Hu Qing rarely took action.","He had been meditating on secret techniques with his eyes closed.","It might also be related to Jian Wushuang’s strength, not wanting to fall behind.","Over the years, his strength had been on par with Jian Wushuang.","For a long time, Hu Qing even suppressed Jian Wushuang.","Now, he couldn’t fall behind.","Jian Wushuang also noticed some changes in Hu Qing, but now was not the time to enlighten him.","A bit of pressure was also normal.","On top of the pyramid, Wu Li watched the surroundings.","The others were resting with their eyes closed.","Buzz!","Just when everything seemed normal, countless black mists suddenly appeared around them.","Jian Wushuang immediately opened his eyes.","Seeing the black mist, his heart sank.","This black mist had given him too many fears.","Because Mie Sheng could turn into black mist.","But at this moment, the black mist had nothing to do with Mie Sheng. After all, the other party had fallen a long time ago.","“Be careful, it’s a large group of demons!” Wu Li shouted angrily, ordering Babata to retract the pyramid.","Everyone appeared on the ancient road, ready to fight at any moment.","The black mist covered the ancient road ahead.","They could only charge forward.","“Follow me!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily.","He drew his sword directly.","In the black mist, there were monsters with over 70 million divine power.","They had to be treated with caution.","Boom!","Thunder rumbled within the mist.","Five figures resolutely entered it.","More followed.","Confronted with the vast black mist, they all hesitated, reminisced, and then withdrew sadly.","Yet, Jian Wushuang and his companions pressed on.","On the other side of the black mist was the place where a Universe God had fallen.","At this moment, several figures appeared, all in tattered clothes, their expressions dull, and all were severely injured, their divine bodies damaged considerably.","“Brother Wushuang, we owe this one to you!” These people were none other than Jian Wushuang and his companions.","They had fought for several days in the black mist before making it out.","There were several monsters with 70 million divine power among them.","Additionally, they had to take care of Wu Li and the others, which left Jian Wushuang quite injured.","Fortunately, they had obtained many treasures from Zhalong Mountain Lord earlier.","After leaving the black mist, they began to restore their divine bodies and divine power. This place was no longer the ancient Starry Sky road.","According to Wu Li, there was no more danger ahead.","However, to enter the place of practice, they still needed to pass some tests.","But considering they could enter when they were at the Eighth Tribulation realm, it should be no problem now that they were at the Ninth Tribulation realm.","After repairing their divine bodies, they finally breathed a sigh of relief.","“Phew! Let’s go in!”","Wu Li’s tone was somewhat tired.","While divine bodies were easy to repair, maintaining their energy was more challenging. “We need to rest for 100,000 years after going in!”","When they arrived outside the place of practice, two huge stone statues blocked their way.","“Practitioner, defeat me to...”","Before the stone statue could finish speaking, Wu Zuo kicked it away.","The other statue hadn’t reacted yet before Wu Li took care of it too.","They swaggered into the place of practice.","Many were already there.","Absorbing divine power had its limits.","It wasn’t about how much one absorbed, but how little.","The more one absorbed, the more treasures one could get.","When they reached their limit and couldn’t absorb any more, it was time to leave.","Some had been practicing here for millions of years, trying to comprehend the Universe God’s law phase.","After entering, they restrained their aura and did not act arrogantly.","There were diligent practitioners here, who deserved respect.","Such perseverance commanded respect from all practitioners.","“Let’s go, the place to absorb divine power is in the cave ahead!” Wu Li led the way, introducing the place to Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Although called caves, they were actually the pores of the Universe God’s flesh body.","The flesh body did not decay.","Even Emperors could achieve this, let alone a Universe God, who could naturally preserve it.","“Alright, after entering the caves, you can absorb divine power without holding back. Brother Wushuang, you can go to the blue cave above to absorb the power of the Starry Sky!” Wu Zuo casually found a cave and said, “My foundational divine power is still short of the limit. This time, I might need to absorb for 10,000 epochs!”","“Same here,” King Shenmu nodded calmly. Only Wu Li’s foundational divine power was the weakest. The strongest was Hu Qing.","However, among demigods, their divine bodies were still far behind.","Their foundational divine power hadn’t reached 60 million, which wasn’t considered the limit.","After saying goodbye to everyone, Jian Wushuang flew towards the blue cave above.","The power of the Starry Sky.","The long-desired power of the Starry Sky.","After removing the Tribulation Armor, his foundational divine power was only 20 million, the weakest among them.","Unfortunately, there were no suitable Origin Source treasures here for him.","Even if there were, they might not be enough.","Otherwise, he would have considered undergoing the Ninth Tribulation here."]},{"number":6171,"title":"Chapter 6171: Absorbing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6171: Absorbing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At present, an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master entering to absorb divine power, how much could they absorb?","Jian Wushuang himself did not know.","He only knew that his divine body had not yet reached a saturated state.","He stepped into the blue entrance.","After walking for a quarter of an hour, he finally saw what lay ahead.","On the other side of the entrance was a blue ocean.","The vast ocean stretched beyond sight.","“Heavens!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim.","Such a large Starry Sky ocean.","How strong must this Universe God have been before falling?","The accumulation of such a vast Starry Sky force, how many years would it take?","After observing for a moment, he no longer hesitated and sat down cross-legged to begin absorbing divine power.","After removing the Tribulation Armor.","His two million base divine power seemed extremely insignificant in this Starry Sky ocean.","“Whew!”","His breath was even.","The absorption began.","This absorption was much like cultivation.","Extremely slow.","At the start, he could absorb tens of thousands a day.","After a month, the daily absorption of divine power was less than a thousand.","The further he progressed, the harder it became.","In the blink of an eye, 100,000 eras passed.","His base divine power reached 3 million.","It still had not reached a saturated state.","Increasing 1 million divine power took 100,000 eras.","Yet it was still countless times faster than the outside world.","It was just different from the divine power he had increased when he was weaker.","At that time, doubling in a day was possible.","Day by day passed.","Wu Zuo and others had already come out.","Their divine power had significantly increased.","Since the last time, they had grown stronger by an unknown amount.","Now they could absorb even more.","Moreover, this time might be the last time they could enter this place.","After all, obtaining the token was not easy.","And there were restrictions.","So they decided to cultivate here for some time, and after finishing their cultivation, they would absorb divine power again.","Thus, they repeated this process over and over.","Unknown eras passed outside, and Jian Wushuang emerged from seclusion.","His base divine power had reached complete saturation.","35 million.","Including the undifferentiated increase from the Tribulation Armor, it totaled 40 million divine power.","This changed his view of the Tribulation Armor considerably.","He used to think that an increase of several million was nothing.","But such an undifferentiated increase still surprised him.","Buzz!","He lightly clenched his fist. At this moment, Jian Wushuang, though not claiming to be invincible among demigods, had few true opponents.","By using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power could easily reach 80 million.","His Starry Sky Dao Arena could still amplify it.","However, the amplified divine power was much weaker.","After all, his Origin Source was only at the Eighth Tribulation level, yet it had to amplify an 80 million divine body.","For ordinary cultivators, not to mention amplifying such vast divine power, even supporting it would be impossible.","“Hu Qing!”","Leaving the cave, he found Hu Qing cultivating in the dojo below.","The opponent’s base divine power was even higher, having reached 60 million.","Basic divine power reached 60 million, and Hu Qing had completely reached the peak of a demigod.","“Wushuang!”","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and learned from Hu Qing that Wu Li and others were also improving quickly.","Their basic divine power had reached about 50 million.","Even Wu Li had caught up.","“By the way, you probably haven’t claimed your reward yet!” Hu Qing reminded, and Jian Wushuang remembered that the more divine power absorbed, the richer the rewards.","“I almost forgot about this rule!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","He followed the direction Hu Qing pointed out.","Outside a large hall within the arena.","There were several cultivators collecting their rewards.","The rewards were distributed by those statues.","Absorbing the divine power of this Universe God could earn one treasures as rewards.","Jian Wushuang admired the magnanimity of the Universe God.","Even after their fall, they still took care of the younger generation.","He didn’t know who this fallen Universe God was; otherwise, he would have noted the cause and effect.","Inside the large hall.","The statue glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “You’ve increased your divine power by 15 million, the reward...”","Before finishing the sentence, the statue’s eyelid twitched, and it looked at Jian Wushuang again in surprise. “You absorbed the power of the Starry Sky?”","“Yes,” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Seeing the statue’s expression, he realized that things might not be so simple.","It seemed as if it had seen a monster.","Absorbing fifteen million divine power wasn’t something extraordinary.","But absorbing the power of the Starry Sky was different.","If he mentioned that he absorbed fifteen million of the Starry Sky power, everyone would be shocked.","Because the most Starry Sky power absorbed by any cultivator here was just 6 million.","Jian Wushuang had absorbed more than double that amount.","He had indeed surpassed the previous cultivator by far.","The one who mastered the Starry Sky power only absorbed 6 million divine power and received a legacy from the Universe God.","Jian Wushuang absorbed 15 million!","The statue was incredulous and communicated with other statues, beginning to discuss Jian Wushuang.","This left Jian Wushuang at a loss.","The statues were intensely discussing among themselves.","“15 million of Starry Sky power; according to our master’s arrangement, we can vote to decide if he becomes the heir!”","The statues did not avoid Jian Wushuang in their discussion.","So, Jian Wushuang heard everything clearly.","Heir?","He might become the heir here?","Jian Wushuang felt immense joy.","If that sea of Starry Sky power became his, it would suffice for him through the Ninth Tribulation and even as a Universe God.","But everything depended on the statues’ decision.","“Let’s vote!”","They quickly decided to vote.","Because the heir not only needed strength but also had to be judged on character and potential.","The six statues began voting.","“I oppose!”","“I oppose!”","“I oppose!”","...","“I approve!”","Six statues, three approved, three opposed.","The pressure was now on Jian Wushuang.","“Young one, to become the heir here, you need to undergo a test of will!”","The statue looked at Jian Wushuang with expectation.","It approved of Jian Wushuang becoming the heir.","Now with a 3-to-3 split, Jian Wushuang qualified to face the challenge.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang had no objection and said respectfully, “I am willing!”","Receiving a free inheritance was not to be missed.","After exchanging glances, the statues said, “Very well, place your hand on this crystal immediately!”","The statue threw a crystal towards Jian Wushuang.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang walked up to the crystal and placed his hand on it.","Buzz!","As soon as he touched the crystal ball, he saw an incredibly desolate world.","An endless world.","Black mist gathered in the sky.","Countless demons were born.","He was alone.","Behind him was an exit.","Staying felt like certain death.","Because the black mist in the sky pressed down as if covering the whole world.","Universe God-level demons appeared endlessly.","Jian Wushuang, however, firmly held his Dao Heart, knowing that it was all an illusion."]},{"number":6172,"title":"Chapter 6172: Fear","paragraphs":["Chapter 6172: Fear","Jian Wushuang charged forward, taking the initiative to engage in battle. He unleashed his full power.","“Ah!!!!” Clenching his hands tightly, he let out an angry roar, “Ha!”","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!","His divine power directly soared to eighty million.","The Starry Sky Dao Arena began to descend as well.","This amplified his divine power to nearly ninety million.","But the black mist merely twisted a bit, and a group of Universe Gods appeared.","Jian Wushuang was utterly dumbfounded.","“This isn’t real!”","But the feeling of fear surged spontaneously.","Boom!","A demonic creature of the Universe God level, with a powerful consciousness, raised its hand and controlled a perfect path.","Sword Dao!","With a single strike, an incredibly stunning Sword Dao was unleashed.","Jian Wushuang was completely stunned.","His body instinctively retreated.","He retreated to the exit.","Watching that sword approaching his forehead, he retreated once more. “Huff!!!!”","Heavy breathing echoed in the hall.","In just an instant, Jian Wushuang had failed.","“That wasn’t an illusion!” Jian Wushuang shouted hoarsely, “How can this place be connected to the Infinite Lands!”","The statue, hearing his roar, was also taken aback.","He didn’t expect Jian Wushuang, an Eighth Tribulation Realm cultivator, to know about the Infinite Lands.","This secret was unknown to many Universe Gods; only Spacetime Gods and the gods in the Starry Sky were aware of the threat of the Infinite Lands.","Jian Wushuang himself had learned about it from the Realm King.","Otherwise, it would take a long time to uncover such a secret.","“Little guy, you know about the Infinite Lands?”","Several statues displayed looks of disbelief.","If Jian Wushuang knew about the Infinite Lands, then the previous test of his Dao Heart would not count.","After taking several deep breaths, Jian Wushuang finally reacted and replied, “I don’t know much.”","Although he didn’t know much, he could instantly recognize it when the demonic creature condensed the Sword Dao.","If he hadn’t retreated, it might have been fine since it was a selection of an heir, and they wouldn’t have truly killed him.","But knowing that it was the Infinite Lands in his heart, he would definitely be afraid.","He instinctively retreated.","This was somewhat similar to the Free and Easy Skill he comprehended; encountering danger, he would automatically avoid it.","It had nothing to do with his Dao Heart.","“It seems you have many secrets!” The statue commented indifferently, then turned to look","at the other statues and said, “The first test doesn’t count; we can proceed to the second trial.”","“Agreed!”","Jian Wushuang hesitated, wanting to ask about the Infinite Lands, but the statue ignored him.","He had many speculations about the Infinite Lands.","An endless desolate place, yet capable of birthing such demonic creatures.","They could casually carve out a perfect path.","It was too mysterious.","When he entered the Ancient Path of the Starry Sky, he felt that this place had some","connection with the Infinite Lands.","Jian Wushuang was surprised to find that he could indeed pass through this place and enter the Infinite Lands.","Moreover, the Infinite Lands was even more terrifying than he had imagined.","Entering it casually, one could encounter a group of Universe Gods.","How could he possibly resist?","Wouldn’t going there be courting death?","He was utterly frightened.","As for the upcoming test, he didn’t give it much thought.","“A Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation level with 35 million divine power, let’s use that","as the combat strength standard to test him!”","“Throw him into the Seventh Demon Kiln, where the minimum divine power of the demons is","35 million!”","Hearing this test, Jian Wushuang laughed inwardly.","35 million? They underestimated him too much.","“Little fellow, the first test might not count, but for the second test, if you can’t survive in the Demon Kiln for a month, you’ll be deemed a failure!”","The three statues that voted in favor of him becoming the successor were optimistic about","him.","So they gave him a special reminder.","However, Jian Wushuang was more interested in the Infinite Lands, and he thought that","selecting a successor here might be for dealing with those demons.","After entering the Infinite Lands once, he didn’t dare to enter again.","It was too terrifying.","Even a Universe God would be instantly torn apart upon entering.","Perhaps only a strong person at Xing Yue’s level could withstand it.","Noticing his hesitation, the statue slowly said, “Everything you want to know, you must show your strength. Once you become the successor, you will understand!”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","But he was still hesitant about becoming the successor.","The demons were too terrifying.","He never wanted to enter the Infinite Lands unless he reached Zamasu’s level, able to alter the supreme rules at will, and then he might have the courage to enter the Infinite Lands.","That place was too frightening.","His ambition was instantly shattered.","Only survival remained.","But now, hearing that he would learn about the Infinite Lands after becoming the successor,","he was intrigued. Curiosity killed the cat.","Even at his level, he remained curious.","For instance, he was curious about the structure of this world and some ultimate secrets.","He looked up at the Starry Sky.","He was interested in the ultimate mysteries of the Starry Sky.","Just like mortals looking up at the universe, they would have many whimsical ideas.","“Go!”","Jian Wushuang steeled his heart.","He took a step forward.","Entered the Seventh Demon Kiln opened by the statue.","Swoosh!","His figure instantly disappeared, and when he reappeared, he was in an extremely murky","world.","Heaven and earth had not yet opened.","Demons rampaged.","“Just as they said!” As soon as Jian Wushuang descended, he saw the roiling demons.","Seeing a cultivator, the demons attacked without hesitation.","The weakest among them had 35 million divine power.","But there were very few this weak.","Most had over 40 million.","This test was indeed extraordinary.","The statue’s mind was too rigid, not realizing his divine power was only his base divine","power.","A base divine power of 35 million, plus Tribulation Armor, made it 40 million.","Facing the demons, he punched out.","The surrounding murky substance instantly shattered, and the world cleared a bit.","Jian Wushuang’s figure moved, his body constantly rising.","“Create Heaven!”","Back then, when he accidentally saw the giant in the Starry Sky creating heaven, he had the","same thought.","Clang!","The giant used an axe to open the heavens.","But he used a sword.","Buzz!","Sword energy filled the surroundings.","The Origin Source of the Starry Sky manifested.","The demons couldn’t even get close, being shredded by the sword energy as soon as they","appeared.","In this Demon Kiln, Jian Wushuang seemed like the true master.","He raised his sword and slashed horizontally.","Heaven and earth manifested!","The murkiness disappeared, and the demons retreated.","A gap appeared in heaven and earth, and from then on, the Demon Kiln had a distinction","between heaven and earth.","As for the demons, though they had no consciousness, they didn’t dare approach.","Because the sword energy around Jian Wushuang could tear them apart. “Perhaps this is how the Starry Sky came to be!” Jian Wushuang looked up. The world he had","created, with swordsmanship as its core, had formed a heavenly path.","He himself was the Dao Ancestor.","But once he left, this place might become a Demon Kiln again.","The heavenly path would be destroyed by the demons.","No wonder the Realm King called these demons realm beasts. Devouring a realm."]},{"number":6173,"title":"Chapter 6173: Trial","paragraphs":["Chapter 6173: Trial","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Isn’t it a beast?","The river of spacetime, created by the Starry Sky, was meant to cut off these realm beasts’ attacks.","Whew!","He took a deep breath, the scene before him was not that surprising.","If all those realm beasts from the Infinite Land attacked the Starry Sky.","Could it still be defended?","No one knew!","A month passed quickly.","The stone statues could see Jian Wushuang’s performance from the outside and were amazed by him.","An Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, this strong, was something they were seeing for the first time.","There were quite a few Eighth Tribulation Masters who had entered this place, but none qualified to accept the trial.","“Honored predecessors, are there any more trials to be announced?”","Jian Wushuang held the Wan Jie Sword upside down, standing in the grand hall.","He looked up at the back of the stone statue, which was a huge divine statue.","It appeared to be the fallen Universe God.","On the stone statue’s chest were engraved eight stars.","This surprised Jian Wushuang; he thought this statue might also be a treasure.","An eight-star divine artifact?","Though he had seen and even owned a Nine Tribulation Tower, it was now gone.","He didn’t even know its functions.","Let alone others.","If he could become the heir of this place, that statue might be the most precious treasure here.","The stone statue seemed to see his astonishment.","One of the stone statues said proudly, “This is the statue of the master, an Eight-Star Universe God!”","Universe God?","Eight stars?","The other party misunderstood Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, and Jian Wushuang also guessed wrong.","He thought only the level of artifacts was measured by stars.","Unexpectedly, the strength of Universe Gods was also measured by stars.","“What, you don’t know?”","The stone statue was very surprised!","Jian Wushuang, at the Eighth Tribulation level, could be considered invincible among his peers; they didn’t believe he was just a rogue cultivator, he must have a background.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang had quite a background.","The Northern Realm King was his backer, after all, the head of a Spacetime God.","Unfortunately, the other party had long fallen, leaving only consciousness.","He never really told Jian Wushuang about the Universe Gods.","“Please enlighten me, senior!” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands in respect.","The stone statue was stunned for a moment, surprised, but it was just a statue and didn’t know what the outside world had become, so it began to explain: “Accurately speaking, Universe Gods have no level distinction, but there are differences in strength. When you become a candidate for Universe God, the Academy of the Gods will give you a star, representing a one-star Universe God. Reaching a divine power of 100 million allows you to achieve this, the threshold of a Universe God! For every additional 100 million in divine power, you gain 1 more star!”","“1 star equals 100 million?” Jian Wushuang was stunned!","That was too exaggerated.","He thought the strongest among the Universe Gods would have 300 to 500 million divine power.","It seemed he underestimated these Universe Gods.","Universe Gods were not much different from Spacetime Gods and Starry Sky Gods.","But becoming a Spacetime God would grant three stars at once.","Even if your divine power was insufficient, the Academy of the Gods would help you boost it to 300 million divine power.","The gods of the Starry Sky were even more exaggerated, starting at five stars.","Getting a position in the Starry Sky could easily make one a five-star powerhouse.","That was for an ordinary Starry Sky God.","Someone like Miesheng, reaching seven stars in the later stages, was normal.","To merge with life and become a God of Reincarnation.","That was even more outrageous.","This was why Miesheng worked so hard.","Once you become a God of Reincarnation, you could even become a nine-star god.","That meant 900 million divine power.","“Senior, is there anything beyond nine stars?”","Jian Wushuang swallowed, wanting to get to the bottom of it.","He really wanted to know Xing Yue’s strength, how many stars it was.","“There is, but it’s just a different mark!”","“The Star Spirit Envoys of the Academy of the Gods, how strong are they?” Jian Wushuang’s heart moved; Xing Yue’s strength was stronger than the Realm King God.","Of course, the strength was still limited.","There were many Realm Kings, ancient Realm Kings, who might be stronger than the other party.","But the current Realm King was not as powerful as Xing Yue.","The stone statue was startled by these words and asked, “You know a Star Spirit Envoy?”","“By chance, I have seen one!”","He didn’t mention that he knew the Star Spirit himself!","That would be too exaggerated, and perhaps the other party didn’t know how strong the Star Spirit was.","“Tsk tsk, I didn’t expect you to know quite a lot. The strength of the Star Spirit Envoy has already reached the limit of practitioners, naturally surpassing the Ninth Tribulation. Their divine power has broken through a billion, and the mark on their chest would be a crescent. If you encounter one, you must show respect!”","Too late!","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang chuckled inwardly.","Not long ago, he had offended one.","Xing Yue wanted to inquire about his Origin Source power, but she had stubbornly refused to speak.","He had already offended them.","Although the other party probably wouldn’t trouble a small figure like him, it still counted as disrespect.","He hadn’t expected the other party to be more powerful than he had imagined.","Originally, he thought that once he became a Universe God, he would be able to surpass them.","Now it seemed he was far off.","When he became a Universe God, even raising his basic divine power to 100 million would be difficult.","He wasn’t a Spacetime God, with the help of the Academy of the Gods.","Everything needed to be improved by himself.","Even with a base divine power of 100 million, his Super Eternal Transformation would only yield 200 million divine power.","Even then, if his Origin Source could double that.","400 million divine power, four stars.","That was nothing.","“Inheritor!”","Greed appeared in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","He had to become the inheritor of this place.","He also had to seize the ocean of Starry Sky power.","With the accumulated Starry Sky power, he could recklessly enhance himself once he reached the level of Universe God.","Anyway, once he became a Universe God, he would have comprehended all the Law Rules.","The Origin Source would also improve itself, with no bottlenecks.","Everything would rely on himself for improvement, so he would train desperately.","If one retreat wasn’t enough, he would go for two.","Until he became the strongest.","The threat of the Infinite Lands might erupt, and being strong would provide a means of survival.","He couldn’t sit and wait for death.","Thinking of this, he spoke again, “Senior, please begin the next trial!”","“Alright!”","The stone statue nodded.","In the following days, he continuously faced various trials.","However, none of them were difficult for him.","Until the final trial.","He had to go to the Infinite Lands and kill a semi-divine creature.","A realm beast, to be precise.","Jian Wushuang was a bit flustered.","It wasn’t that he couldn’t defeat it, but he feared encountering a group of Universe God-level realm beasts.","The group of stone statues, seeing Jian Wushuang had reached the final stage, all believed he had a chance to become the next inheritor.","They were unwilling to give up and began to console him.","“Young one, don’t worry. This time, you will go to the outskirts of the Infinite Lands. Universe Gods are rare there. Your luck won’t be that bad; you might not even encounter one!”","“Yes, we wouldn’t lie to you!”","“Go ahead, the benefits of becoming an inheritor are beyond your imagination!”","Amidst this encouragement, Jian Wushuang lost himself.","“Go!”","After all, it was just the outskirts."]},{"number":6174,"title":"Chapter 6174: I Can’t See Your Fear","paragraphs":["Chapter 6174: I Can’t See Your Fear","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The chances of encountering a Universe God-level realm beast were extremely low; it would be quite unlucky if he did.","“Go now!”","The crystal ball displayed an image of a desolate land.","As soon as Jian Wushuang’s hand touched the crystal ball, his figure vanished from the spot.","In the next moment, he had already entered the desolate land.","Upon entry, he unleashed his full power.","The Super Ancient Transformation and the Origin Source Dao Arena simultaneously boosted his strength.","His divine power instantly doubled, reaching ninety million.","Clang!","This time, he dared not hide anything and immediately drew his Wanjie Sword.","He prepared to face the realm beasts.","Buzz!","The sky trembled.","The realm beasts, regarded as demons by outsiders, began to gather.","The statue had not deceived him; the realm beasts that emerged were indeed ugly but were only at the demigod level, with divine power around 60 million.","With a casual flick, his sword energy swept out.","In an instant, he killed the demigod-level realm beast.","With a reach of his hand, he grabbed the beast’s original core.","This was the power condensed by the demons.","The divine power within was chaotic, making it impossible for ordinary cultivators to absorb.","It required special experts to decompose it, extracting various types of power.","Among them were the powers of the Starry Sky, Spacetime, the Universe, the Beast God, and Reincarnation.","It could be said to encompass all things and worlds.","It was like a grand mix.","After obtaining the original core, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed and shouted loudly, “Senior, I got it! Quickly, teleport me out of here.”","...","About three breaths later, there was still no response.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang sensed a change behind him.","A mass of black fog separated from the clouds in the sky, slowly condensing.","The power surged rapidly, reaching over a billion in an instant.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed dramatically.","“Senior, please don’t joke with me. This is a Universe God!”","He panicked.","It felt like he had been tricked.","Standing there, calling out to the heavens and the earth with no response.","Despair loomed over him.","“No, I can’t stay here!” He turned his gaze behind him, towards the long river of spacetime.","That was the boundary.","He had to return on his own.","Boom!","“Three Quake Universe!”","Although he couldn’t tear through spacetime, he had hope of escaping with his speed traversing the universe.","But just as he moved, a gigantic demonic figure appeared before him.","“Ah!”","In his panic, Jian Wushuang swung his sword directly.","Boom!","The enormous sword shadow slashed out.","But it was casually crushed by the demonic figure.","It had no effect whatsoever.","This time, Jian Wushuang was utterly desperate.","With a flip of his palm, he took out the token left by his teacher, Xuan Yi.","It was said that in case of any danger, crushing the token would save his life.","He hadn’t expected to use it at this moment.","Using it during a trial?","It would be embarrassing to admit.","He hadn’t intended to use it.","But if he didn’t use it now, he would be torn to pieces in the next moment.","“Cultivator!”","“Hmm?” Just as he was about to crush the token, the opponent spoke.","For a moment, he was bewildered.","He had never spoken with a realm beast before.","As far as he knew, their consciousness was very weak.","Or rather, very poor.","A Universe God-level realm beast being able to speak was normal.","But what could it have to say to a Universe Master like him?","Seeing an opportunity for negotiation, Jian Wushuang steadied his mind.","But he didn’t know how to respond.","After pondering for a moment, he stood firm and said in a heavy tone, “realm beast!”","The opponent called him a cultivator.","He couldn’t possibly call it senior!","That would be betraying his kind.","He would rather die standing.","“Facing me, I can’t see your fear!”","This statement was true.","Despite Jian Wushuang’s panic, he always had a trump card in his mind.","It was the token in his hand.","He had unwavering faith in his teacher Xuan Yi’s words.","If it could save his life, it would save his life.","Even against a group of Universe Gods, he had complete confidence in escaping.","“Because I’m not afraid of you at all!” Jian Wushuang raised his head, growing defiant.","This time, he was truly going to use the token. Although it was embarrassing to use it during a trial, not using it would mean his demise.","At the same time, he cursed those statues in his heart.","They had deceived him.","They had promised to send him back after killing a demigod realm beast.","Yet, after killing the demigod realm beast, they ignored him.","And now, he had the misfortune of encountering a Universe God-level realm beast.","Who could he complain to?","If he successfully returned and inherited their legacy, he would definitely smash those statues and build a latrine over them.","“Is it because of the token in your hand?”","The ugly realm beast raised its hand slightly, and the surrounding space instantly froze.","Words became reality!","Jian Wushuang frowned, his eyes flashing with light, and his mind raced as he tried to crush the token, only to find his limbs immobilized.","Jian Wushuang was already immobilized.","It wasn’t a matter of time; it was a spatial technique.","Even though he had mastered space, he was still immobilized instantly.","His opponent’s level far surpassed his own.","The token slowly floated from his palm into his opponent’s hand.","Jian Wushuang was completely dumbfounded.","He shouldn’t have hesitated.","Now, it was all over.","With the token in his opponent’s hand, he was beyond saving.","The crisis of falling had never felt so intense.","Sweat beaded on Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","Although he had faced life and death situations many times, he had never felt such despair.","The last time he confronted death head-on, even walking towards it, was in the illusion within the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, where he faced the scene of battling Mie Sheng alone.","But that time was an illusion; this time, it was the real world.","“Is this your reliance?” The ugly realm beast, clutching the token, continued, “Show your fear!”","“Never!” Jian Wushuang roared angrily, forcibly boosting his divine power, trying to break free from the immobilized space, but no matter what, he couldn’t do it.","His heart sank completely.","Seeing Jian Wushuang still trying to resist, the ugly realm beast pointed a finger, piercing through his chest.","Even his Origin Source suffered damage.","The Dao Arena couldn’t augment him, his Origin Source shattered, and he could no longer maintain the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Basic divine power was continuously draining.","Jian Wushuang’s current divine power was less than 30 million.","He was truly doomed.","The life-and-death crisis struck in that instant.","“If you have the guts, return the token to me!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were red.","He wanted to rush over, snatch the token, and crush it, waiting for his opponent to be ravaged.","He also wanted to see what trump card Teacher Xuan Yi had left him.","But the realm beast wasn’t stupid!","The opponent’s consciousness was only somewhat weak, not low in intelligence.","There was no way it would return the token.","However, seeing Jian Wushuang’s despair, the realm beast taunted, “I can give it to you, and even let you live!”","Was it negotiating terms?","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, but then he shook his head frantically, not daring to think about it.","“Dream on, you’re a realm beast born to devour all realms, I’m a cultivator born in the myriad realms, we’re mortal enemies with no room for compromise. You will die, and killing me will also lead to your death!”"]},{"number":6175,"title":"Chapter 6175: Trickery, Trickery","paragraphs":["Chapter 6175: Trickery, Trickery","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang’s furious roar echoed without any respite.","“You will understand what true pain is!” The realm beast’s face contorted in a sinister manner as it attempted to crush the token.","It wanted to destroy Jian Wushuang’s reliance right in front of him.","Crack!","After a crisp sound, the realm beast froze.","The sound wasn’t the token shattering; it was the sound of its own bones being crushed.","The token remained intact.","As it tried to break the token again, the token flew towards Jian Wushuang, emitting a dazzling light.","Buzz!","The light illuminated the surroundings.","Space shattered, and time became chaotic.","Boundless power of the Law Rules broke through everything.","Jian Wushuang naturally escaped from his predicament.","Slap!","He caught the token again, wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth, and raised the token with one hand, intending to crush it completely.","But when he saw his surroundings clearly, he was dumbfounded.","This wasn’t the Infinite Lands!","It was clearly an illusory world.","Everything before him turned into an illusion.","The ugly realm beast disintegrated into ashes in an instant.","Everything was over.","Jian Wushuang put away the token.","He had been tricked.","Tricked by those statues.","The Dao Heart test when he first arrived at the Infinite Lands was probably just a facade.","It was to make him afraid, to make him believe that this place could truly connect to the Infinite Lands.","The final test, to enter the Infinite Lands to kill a demigod, was just to tie everything together.","A scheme within a scheme, a trap within a trap!","It nearly made him use his strongest trump card.","“Phew!” He breathed heavily, his wounds slowly healing. He looked up and said coldly, “That should be enough!”","He had wanted to vent, but realizing that the other party didn’t truly intend to take his life, he had to handle things lightly.","Fortunately, that realm beast couldn’t crush the token.","Otherwise, he would have suffered a huge loss.","Becoming the inheritor of this place, how many benefits could he gain?","Was it worth as much as a life?","This token was his second life.","He couldn’t use it recklessly.","“Congratulations, from now on, you are the seventh inheritor of this place!”","A voice came from the sky. Jian Wushuang looked up and saw several giant statues appear around him, only revealing their upper bodies.","He was still in that small world.","With a flash, he was back outside.","“Seventh?”","He realized that even though he had fought so hard, he wasn’t the first.","There were six other competitors.","“Yes, you are currently the seventh inheritor. There are six before you. Among the six, there are four demigods and two Universe Gods. The strongest among them is a six-star Universe God. Once he becomes an eight-star Universe God, he will be able to fully inherit all the treasures here!”","With a wave of its hand, the statue revealed a leaderboard.","Even divine power was noted.","First place: “Zong Peng,” a six-star Universe God with 670 million divine power.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","How could he compete?","The others were nearly seven stars.","He hadn’t even qualified to undergo the Ninth Tribulation.","He couldn’t compete.","Or rather, he was being played.","“Don’t be discouraged. An eight-star Universe God isn’t as simple as you think. Moreover, there’s a final test. You might not lose!”","“You don’t need your basic divine power to reach the eight-star Universe God. You only need your combat power to reach that level!” Seeing Jian Wushuang’s disbelief, the statue added, “Don’t rush. The old master left nine positions. You’re seventh, which isn’t too late!”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. It wasn’t late indeed.","But the gap was too wide.","The sixth-place demigod already had 80 million divine power.","Almost the same as him now.","One demigod even had over 100 million divine power.","He was stunned.","He had never heard of a demigod with over 100 million divine power in the outside world.","“This?” He pointed to the third position, showing a surprised expression.","The statue knew what he wanted to ask and explained, “This is a demigod from the Starry Sky World. It’s normal for a demigod to rival a Universe God. You now have 90 million divine power at the Eighth Tribulation level, with combat power equivalent to a demigod threshold. What’s there to be surprised about!”","Indeed!","Jian Wushuang shouldn’t have been surprised.","But his uniqueness was known only to himself!","When he reached the Ninth Tribulation, he might be on par with the third place.","Divine power exceeding 100 million.","He hadn’t expected such a powerful demigod.","Next, he inquired about the Infinite Lands, his most pressing concern.","He needed to clarify this.","In case he became an inheritor and had to venture to the Infinite Lands for battles, he needed to be prepared.","The statue’s explanation was simple.","To inherit the treasures, he must also inherit the wishes.","After becoming the true inheritor, he would gain all the treasures.","Of course, not all at once.","He had to exchange the realm beast’s original core for them.","A primal core of an eight-star realm beast could directly obtain all the treasures.","The primal core of a seven-star beast could only obtain one-tenth of the treasures.","But even this required becoming the final heir to redeem them.","At present, he was not qualified.","The current benefit was the ability to enter this place and absorb the power of the Starry Sky.","Once he entered at the Eighth Tribulation, he would have to wait until the Ninth Tribulation to enter again.","Upon entering, besides absorbing the power of the Starry Sky, he also had to slay realm beasts of the same level.","The statue would customarily assign him realm beasts with equal strength, or even those stronger than him.","As long as he completed the test, he would be able to obtain treasures again.","Then there was the Universe God.","The Universe God could enter this place three times.","After using up the three opportunities, the next entry would require reaching the stage of an eight-star Universe God.","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded silently.","He thought it seemed quite reasonable.","Moreover, he could now receive a reward for reaching the Eighth Tribulation.","“The reward for the Eighth Tribulation is ordinarily quite common, but given that your strength far exceeds others of the same level, giving you an ordinary treasure would be useless. So, I will break the rules and give you a one-star divine weapon instead!”","The statue finally showed some generosity.","However, upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned.","After all this effort, he would only receive a one-star divine weapon.","He really wasn’t interested.","From Lord of the Zhalong Mountain, he had obtained a six-star divine weapon.","Naturally, he wasn’t interested in these one-star divine weapons.","Seeing Jian Wushuang frown, the statue corrected him, “Do not underestimate this treasure. Although your current divine power is strong, you cannot break through spacetime. The divine weapon I am granting you can break through spacetime!”","“Break through spacetime?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath upon hearing this.","A demigod wanting to break through spacetime could only use a spacetime token.","But that was too expensive.","Moreover, it required purchasing with Starry Sky crystals.","Jian Wushuang didn’t have a single Starry Sky Crystal.","Though he possessed the power of the Starry Sky, it wasn’t enough for himself. It was impossible to cut his divine power to condense Starry Sky Crystals to buy a spacetime token."]},{"number":6176,"title":"Chapter 6176: Divine Artifact That Traverses Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 6176: Divine Artifact That Traverses Spacetime","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That would be putting the cart before the horse.","So, upon hearing about a divine weapon that could break through space, he was understandably shocked.","“Illusory Sky!”","The statue murmured softly, and a long weapon appeared in his hand.","With a wave of his hand.","Whoosh!","A vast expanse of spacetime was torn open.","Illusory Sky floated within the spatial rift.","The statue’s figure flickered and jumped onto the long weapon.","Swish!","The next moment, he was already behind Jian Wushuang.","It wasn’t a matter of speed.","He had truly broken through spacetime and circled behind Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up at the sight.","It was worth it!","This trip hadn’t been in vain.","He had solved the critical issue of escape.","“What do you think? Pretty good, right?” The statue weighed the Illusory Sky in his hand and casually tossed it to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang caught it, eager to refine it.","Naturally, he agreed wholeheartedly.","He was very satisfied!","Moreover, the statue promised that once Jian Wushuang reached the level of Universe God, he would upgrade the Illusory Sky to a six-star divine weapon.","As for the subsequent upgrades, Jian Wushuang would have to figure them out on his own.","But this was already enough.","After reaching the level of Universe God, his divine power would reach a certain level, allowing him to break through spacetime, but the range and extent would be limited.","It would be nothing compared to the Illusory Sky divine weapon.","“Profitable!”","After becoming the successor, there were still very few dangerous situations.","And he could obtain treasures.","He was given a supreme treasure and ten thousand square Starry Sky Crystals.","These could supplement his Starry Sky Origin Source.","It was an unexpected surprise.","The statue also promised that once he reached the Ninth Tribulation, he could obtain one million square Starry Sky Crystals.","As a Universe God, it would be ten million square.","Even a three-star Universe God’s entire fortune wouldn’t amount to ten million square!","Generous indeed.","The further he advanced, the richer the rewards.","Jian Wushuang, holding his treasure, learned a few secrets about the Infinite Land from the statue before leaving.","When he reached the plaza, he realized everyone had gathered.","Upon hearing of his exit from seclusion, the others felt they had reached their limits as well and were preparing to leave.","So, they waited for Jian Wushuang in the plaza.","They waited for another hundred thousand epochs.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang emerge, Wu Zuo quickly stood up and asked, “Brother Wushuang, how was the haul this time?”","Given the long time he spent, it was bound to be extraordinary.","“Not bad, you’ll see soon enough!” Jian Wushuang replied proudly.","With the Illusory Sky divine weapon, he had to show off once they got out.","Initially, he was worried that the journey from the Silver Blue Star Field to the Star Field of the Gods would take a long time and be somewhat troublesome.","Now, with Illusory Sky, they would soon return to the Immortal Temple.","Wu Li’s eyes sparkled as he heard this and approached.","“You didn’t empty out this place’s treasures, did you?”","“You’re overthinking it!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","He wasn’t capable of that, and besides, this wasn’t the Northern Spacetime where everything could be taken in one fell swoop.","This was a Starry Sky secret realm.","Moreover, in this Starry Sky secret realm, aside from the fallen Universe Gods, there were many dangerous areas.","Those places were even more perilous.","Even Universe Gods faced the risk of falling.","This was merely the periphery.","Perhaps when his strength improved in the future, he could delve deeper.","For now, it was better to leave.","After everyone adjusted, they left the Dao Arena.","Before taking that step, Jian Wushuang glanced back at the statue.","The Universe God with eight stars.","He had fallen.","And according to the statue, it wasn’t due to entering the Infinite Lands, but because the Realm Beast from the Infinite Lands charged into the Realm King Continent.","That’s when this Universe God fell.","At this moment, he also understood the purpose of the Realm King Continent.","A buffer zone.","A battlefield!","“Six-Fingered Heavenly Saint!”","This was the title of the fallen Universe God.","His real name was “Chu Liu!”","Very simple, very ordinary.","Yet he had fallen in the war to protect the Starry Sky.","Jian Wushuang felt deeply moved.","After taking a deep breath, he returned to the Ancient Path of the Starry Sky.","The way they came was impassable.","They needed to head towards the exit.","There was only one entrance to this Starry Sky secret realm.","But there were many exits.","Moreover, there wasn’t much danger on the route.","It took them thousands of years to leave this Starry Sky secret realm.","If not for keeping a low profile, he could have used the Illusionary Space Divine Juncture and left in just a few hours.","However, there were many powerful beings in the Starry Sky secret realm.","As an Eight Tribulation Universe Master without any background, using such a powerful divine weapon would attract unwanted attention.","Even if he wasn’t afraid of them, he didn’t want to trouble himself.","After leaving the Starry Sky secret realm.","Their tokens kept flashing.","There were messages from the Realm King and Danbao.","After being away for hundreds of thousands of eras, they were in such a hurry.","It was clear that something had happened.","“Jian Wushuang, return to the Immortal Temple immediately, the metallic lifeform has appeared!”","“Brother Wushuang, the prophet has replied, the Beast God Weapons have already gathered together, did you succeed?”","Jian Wushuang responded to each message.","“Metallic lifeform?”","He no longer cared.","It was just a defeated opponent.","Moreover, it was so weak back then, even if the prophet reached the Realm King Continent, it’s uncertain if it could achieve Ninth Tribulation.","He wasn’t afraid at all.","He even wanted to deal with these troublesome guys all at once.","Especially Xilu.","How strong could he be?","Apart from these, there was also the matter of Zhalong Mountain.","At this moment, Zhalong Mountain was a mix of good and bad.","The Star Field of the Gods didn’t bother to manage it.","But Danbao took on this task, still waiting for them to return and seize the Zhalong Mountain territory!","This was considered a small matter.","The only thing that caught his attention was the Beast God Weapons.","Now that the Beast God Weapons were completely gathered.","He could refine the perfect Beast God Weapon.","The prophet of the Star Field of the Gods had already promised Danbao that he could help with the refining.","And it was free of charge.","This made Jian Wushuang very happy.","He immediately took out the divine weapon Illusionary Space.","“Hold on tight!”","Wu Li and the others had a look of disbelief in their eyes.","They didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to obtain such a divine weapon.","Although it was a one-star divine weapon, its function was more impressive than a seven-star one.","Of course, they wouldn’t be able to use a seven-star divine weapon.","Some one-star divine weapons required over 100 million divine power to activate.","This was why the Magic Dragon Blade of the Zhalong Mountain Lord was only a half-star.","It required only 70 million divine power to activate.","That was a demi-divine weapon.","With half a star.","The other demi-divine weapons they obtained required 30 million divine power, not even considered demi-divine weapons, just garbage.","Even the one-star divine weapon they got from the Zhalong Mountain Lord was similar.","Not as useful as the Demon Dragon Blade.","The Illusionary Sky divine weapon was even more extraordinary.","It required 10 million divine power.","Only responsible for traversing spacetime.","An absolute divine weapon.","Especially suitable for those geniuses.","Much better than the Spacetime Order.","Everyone stood on the Illusionary Space Divine Juncture, traversing spacetime again and again.","In just a month, they left the Silver Blue Star Field.","After leaving, they entered the Star Field of the Gods.","Within the star field, there were still some undeveloped territories.","Occupied by some disciples or relatives of the Star Field of the Gods.","Only Zhalong Mountain had no connection with the Star Field of the Gods."]},{"number":6177,"title":"Chapter 6177: Attack of the Threats","paragraphs":["Chapter 6177: Attack of the Threats","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The reason it could dominate for such a long time was because of the dragon race.","Now the Lord of Zhalong Mountain had fallen.","Originally, countless people would have come to seize it.","However, the Spacetime Gorge was gone too.","So no one had their eyes on it anymore.","Without the Spacetime Rift, the Zhalong Mountain territory was just ordinary.","It was no better than a common territory.","Rustle!","Zhalong Mountain!","In just a month, everyone arrived at Zhalong Mountain.","If they returned to the Star Field of the Gods, it might only take an hour.","Very fast.","“I will stay with Brother Divine Wood King. The Immortal Temple is too boring, I don’t want to go back. Notify me immediately if there is news about the metallic life. From now on, this Zhalong Mountain will be our territory!”","Wu Li and Divine Wood King bid farewell to everyone.","Jian Wushuang took Wu Zuo and Hu Qing and left the Zhalong Mountain territory.","But this place would soon be renamed.","It would become their stronghold.","Going to the Immortal Temple all the time was troublesome, so it was more comfortable to have their own territory, at least the space was large enough.","However, Wu Zuo and Hu Qing had rarely been to the Immortal Temple.","Besides, they didn’t like disputes!","Hu Qing didn’t like it.","That didn’t mean Wu Zuo didn’t.","This time, Wu Zuo returned because he was specifically named by the Realm King.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have gone back.","Buzz!","Phantom shuttle through time and space.","Before long, they tore through time and space and arrived above the Ninth Heaven of the Star Field of the Gods.","Through the clouds, they saw the Immortal Temple in the sky.","Danbao and the Realm King were already waiting at the edge of the hall.","Rustle!","Jian Wushuang and his companions descended together and landed in the Immortal Temple.","“Finally back. After losing the causal connection with you, I consulted the Prophet and learned that you went to the Starry Sky Secret Realm!” The Realm King spoke with a hint of reproach.","Jian Wushuang was surprised.","He hadn’t expected the Prophet to be so powerful, not only able to predict where treasures were but also where people went, and with such precision. It was impressive.","“It was a coincidence for us too. We ended up in that Starry Sky Secret Realm from the Spacetime Gorge!”","This time was indeed a stroke of luck.","They encountered the trial of the Academy of the Gods.","He told this to the Realm King.","The Realm King was shocked upon hearing it.","There was no need to say it; he knew they had failed.","“It is too difficult for practitioners of time and space to enter the Academy of the Gods. This has nothing to do with your strength, don’t take it to heart!” Though he said this, there was still a bit of regret on his face.","He asked Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang about their progress.","After listening, he felt relieved.","It wasn’t too far off.","If a miracle had happened and they had entered the Academy of the Gods.","Then their Northern Spacetime would have been greatly honored.","In the history of the Realm King Continent, only one practitioner of time and space had entered the Academy of the Gods.","And that was their adversary, “Zamasu!”","From the Southern Spacetime.","Among the strong in the four spacetime, the Southern Spacetime was the strongest.","All because of Zamasu!","The Realm King’s disappointment was evident, and Jian Wushuang felt a bit sad.","If he had been more flexible back then, maybe Xing Yue could have made an exception and brought him into the Academy of the Gods.","Then there would have been no need to fear Zamasu.","But by that time, he no longer saw Zamasu as a threat.","Especially now!","With a peak divine power of ninety million.","Upon becoming a Universe God and receiving the Six-Fingered Heavenly Sage’s blessing, he would quickly catch up to Zamasu.","There was no need to rely on the Academy of the Gods.","In the future, whatever the Southern Spacetime had, the Northern Spacetime would have as well.","After recounting their experiences, the Realm King pondered for a moment before bringing up the reason he had called them back this time.","Through the Prophet, the Realm King learned that in a hundred thousand years, metallic life would descend upon the Zhalong Mountain territory.","The goal was to kill Jian Wushuang.","After telling him some characteristics of the target, he added a special reminder.","“Don’t underestimate those metal beings. As far as I know, a very special mechanical brain from the Southern Spacetime is also approaching. You must be careful!”","Jian Wushuang, however, didn’t care. He said indifferently, “Don’t worry!”","With his divine power now at ninety million, how could he fear a few metal beings?","After dealing with the Realm King, he turned to ask Danbao about the prophet.","Refining the perfect Beast God Weapon was the most critical task.","His Super Ancient Transformation had reached the perfect level.","It could no longer be improved; he could only create stronger secret techniques.","And it still had to combine the power of the Beast God.","The Beast God Weapon was the key.","“The Prophet has already said that you can seek him out at any time. He is located at...”","Danbao handed a map to Jian Wushuang.","After a glance, he found it was not far.","Jian Wushuang stayed at the Immortal Temple for only one day before setting off to find the Prophet.","Huiqing and Wu Zuo remained at the Immortal Temple.","The Prophet was in the Star Field of the Gods, not far away.","It would take only a few days to reach there.","Swish!","Along the way, he took in the sights of the Star Field of the Gods.","Numerous divine palaces floated.","Gods from the four spacetimes and the Realm God Continent were all gathered here.","But it seemed there was no lively atmosphere.","A sense of decay covered the place.","No wonder the Star Field of the Gods had declined; it was too low-key.","This place should have been bustling with activity.","But now, it had been replaced by a divine domain built by cultivators.","Jian Wushuang felt deeply moved.","A few days later.","He arrived at the Prophet’s residence. He originally thought it would be a grand hall.","Unexpectedly, it was a small planet.","Less than a mile in diameter.","Standing on it, one could see the curved world lines.","It was indeed very small.","“Junior Jian Wushuang, here to visit the Prophet!”","Jian Wushuang stood above the Starry Sky and respectfully called out towards a round house in front.","Creak!","The door of the house opened, and an old man wearing a mask walked out with his hands behind his back.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t sense a trace of aura from him.","If he hadn’t seen him with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have been able to perceive his presence.","It was very similar to the first time he saw Weiss.","Feeling a stir in his heart, he became even more respectful.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Hearing his name called, he quickly landed in front of the old man.","“Senior!”","“No need to be so polite. Take out your Beast God Weapon!”","The Prophet didn’t exchange any pleasantries and got straight to the point.","This was naturally the best. Jian Wushuang quickly took out the nine Beast God Weapons.","“Wow!” The Prophet took a deep breath, glanced at the Beast God Weapons, and said calmly, “Not bad. The one who crafted these Beast God Weapons must have been guided by someone; otherwise, they couldn’t have been refined in the spacetime.”","“Guided by someone?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback, then thought of someone and muttered to himself, “Could it be Mie Sheng?”","“You guessed it right, it was indeed Mie Sheng!”","The Prophet smiled and said, “When Qishen was crafting them, he must have consulted the God of Death!”","“You even know this?” Jian Wushuang was astonished. The Prophet was indeed impressive, knowing all about past events.","He wondered if the Prophet could also see through his future."]},{"number":6178,"title":"Chapter 6178: Forging a Super Beast God Weapon","paragraphs":["Chapter 6178: Forging a Super Beast God Weapon","If he could, he would very much like to ask about his teacher.","However, now was not the right time.","He was here to forge the Beast God Weapon.","Perhaps he could ask once they were more familiar with each other.","As he thought of this, he suddenly remembered something.","If the other party could indeed predict everything, they had likely already anticipated his thoughts.","“Whoo!” Adjusting himself, Jian Wushuang stopped overthinking.","the Prophet examined the Beast God Weapon carefully, then asked, “Jian Wushuang, what kind of Beast God Weapon do you wish to forge?”","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised. He secretly wondered, could it be that the weapon could be tailored to his specific requirements?","Thinking of this, he didn’t hesitate and directly said, “Senior, I want to forge a Beast God Weapon that aligns with the power of the Starry Sky and supports my peak secret technique!” “The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, indeed a good choice!” the Prophet nodded calmly and then added, “However, that is not enough. If it were just that, the Beast God Weapon would become useless quickly, unable to help you for long before being discarded due to your increasing power!”","“Ah?”","Jian Wushuang was first surprised that the Prophet knew about his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, then astonished that the Prophet could see his future path so clearly. It was incredible.","Pausing for a moment, he respectfully said, “I am at your disposal, Senior!”","He left everything to the Prophet’s discretion.","From the first time he met the Prophet, he had been astounded beyond measure.","Initially, he intended to use the Beast God Power as an auxiliary force.","But now, listening to the Prophet, it seemed there was a greater use.","“The Beast God Power comes from the Starry Sky Beast God. It is not weaker than the power of the Starry Sky. The Beast God’s Origin Source is also not weaker than the Starry Sky’s Origin Source. Do you know what a Beast God is?”","The sudden question made Jian Wushuang pause. After a moment of hesitation, he answered, “Could it be the Origin Source of the realm beast?”","“Correct!” the Prophet’s eyes sparkled, and he smiled faintly, “It is indeed the Origin Source of the realm beast. However, that Beast God has fallen for countless eras, but its power has scattered among the world, known to you as the Super Beast Gods!”","“I see!”","Jian Wushuang nodded silently.","Thinking about it, Zong Qian was indeed remarkable.","The Super Beast Gods possessed the Beast God’s Origin Source and controlled the power of the Starry Sky.","He was the opposite.","He possessed the Origin Source of the Starry Sky and was about to control the Beast God Power.","As he pondered this, the Prophet firmly said, “No, you also possess the Beast God’s Origin Source. The existence of the realm beast is a loophole in this world. Mastering the loophole allows one to go further, as the rules only apply within boundaries, not within the realms!”","These profound words left Jian Wushuang somewhat confused.","After some thought, he realized that the Realm Beast was indeed a loophole in this world. It could wield power without cultivation.","Even the Starry Sky had to guard against the Realm Beast.","With this in mind, he felt that cultivators like them were insignificant.","“Whoa!”","The Prophet casually absorbed the Beast God Weapon into his body and then said, “With the Beast God’s Origin Source and the Starry Sky’s Origin Source, do you know how to use these two powers?”","“Use them?”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment. He really didn’t know.","He initially wanted to get close to Zong Qian to understand how to combine the two powers.","But this was different from what the Prophet said.","Zong Qian only had one Origin Source and controlled two powers.","Jian Wushuang needed to use two Origin Sources to unleash two powers, which was exponentially more difficult.","If he relied on his own understanding to explore, it might take eons to comprehend.","And that required him to be exceptionally talented. Otherwise, he might never understand it","in his lifetime.","“Please enlighten me, Senior!”","At this moment, he could only seek the Prophet’s guidance.","the Prophet, knowing everything, might provide an answer.","“Then you must comprehend this well!” After the Prophet spoke, he pointed with his finger.","A stream of light entered Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Countless material forces converged in his mind.","Strings of words floated before his eyes.","This was the simplified version, the easiest to understand.","Yet, the volume of words was as vast as a world.","In an instant.","He didn’t know how much time had passed.","His gaze was blank.","Until he comprehended everything, only then did his eyes regain color.","Awakening from comprehension, Jian Wushuang bowed in excitement and admiration.","“Thank you so much for your great kindness, Senior. I have no way to repay you. If needed, I am willing to ascend the blade mountain and descend into the sea of fire!”","At this moment, he felt more excited and thrilled than when he had successfully integrated or even when he had broken through to the Tribulation realm.","It was as if he had suddenly pierced through the essence of the world.","He had never met the Prophet before, yet the first time they met, the Prophet helped him","refine a Beast God Weapon and taught him how to use two Origin Sources.","How could he not be grateful?","He was so moved that he almost cried.","He was just short of kneeling down and acknowledging him as kin.","Moreover, in his interactions with the Prophet, he could always feel a warmth.","A sense of familiarity.","A certain familial bond.","He just didn’t know how to describe it.","The Prophet laughed and said, “I told you, there’s no need to be so polite. But you woke up at","just the right time, the Beast God Weapon is also ready!”","“Ready?”","Jian Wushuang was so surprised his mouth couldn’t close.","“Senior Prophet, how long have I been comprehending?”","For a moment, he couldn’t grasp the concept of time.","“To me, it was a month. To you, it might have been an era, or perhaps billions of eras!”","In other words, the time Jian Wushuang had spent comprehending was infinitely long, but to the Prophet, only a month had passed.","The Beast God Weapon had been refined in just a month, what could Jian Wushuang say to","that?","Too powerful.","He didn’t know much about the gods within the Star Field of the Gods.","The strongest were the Realm King Gods and the Great Realm King.","Perhaps there were a few ancient Realm King Gods still alive.","But Jian Wushuang felt that none were as powerful as the Prophet before him.","This was a true god of the world!","“Refine it first, and then we’ll talk!”","The Prophet handed the refined Beast God Weapon to Jian Wushuang.","The Beast God Weapon, refined into a single entity, was a pair of wings.","Dark red wings.","Placing one hand on them, Jian Wushuang felt a force of suction.","It was absorbing his Starry Sky power.","The dark blue and dark red powers intertwined.","And a pink aura was born from it.","Buzz!","Following the Prophet’s previous teachings, Jian Wushuang merged the two powers together.","It was just like his fusion with Hu Qing.","The power instantly surged.","His divine body suddenly exceeded a 100 million divine power.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang found himself unable to control this power.","Too powerful.","He simply couldn’t grasp it.","His current divine body and Origin Source couldn’t support this overwhelming power.","“It seems your strength is still not enough,” the Prophet said calmly. “Don’t worry, once your fundamental divine power reaches 50 million, you should be able to control this power!”"]},{"number":6179,"title":"Chapter 6179: Help Me Kill Someone","paragraphs":["Chapter 6179: Help Me Kill Someone","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a new power.","It required a base divine power of 50 million.","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","His current base divine power was precisely 35 million.","It seemed to be 15 million short of 50 million.","That required him to reach the Ninth Tribulation.","That would take some time.","He could wait.","“Right, the Beast God Weapon has three forms. Now it is only in the first form, with a pair of wings. Your base divine power needs to reach 50 million for the second form, which requires your base divine power to reach one hundred million. Remember, it is the base divine power. At that time, it will have four pairs of wings. The third form, which is also the final form, will have eight pairs of wings. Your base divine power needs to reach 500 million!”","That meant the base divine power of a Universe God at the five star level!","Jian Wushuang was bewildered.","The first form was already this strong.","When it reached the final form, it would be unstoppable.","When his base divine power reached five hundred million, he would practically be able to crush all Universe Gods.","The Prophet knew what he was thinking, touched his mask, and reminded him, “Little one, don’t underestimate this world. Among the Universe Gods, there are formidable existences!”","“I will remember, senior!” Jian Wushuang responded respectfully.","“Good!” the Prophet nodded slowly, “When you can exhibit the first form, come to me again. I have something else to give you!”","“Something else?”","This time, the Prophet had helped him so much, and he hadn’t given anything in return.","Now the Prophet wanted to give him something else.","Jian Wushuang felt he owed too much and wanted to decline.","“Don’t be quick to refuse; there are conditions!” the Prophet saw through him and knew even without being told.","Jian Wushuang relaxed upon hearing there were conditions.","Without conditions, he would be embarrassed to accept.","“Please speak, Senior!” He was confident, or rather determined.","He wouldn’t disappoint the other party.","“Help me kill someone, or rather a monster that shouldn’t exist in this world!”","“A monster?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened, and he said, “It wouldn’t be Xilu, would it?”","That would be too easy for him.","No difficulty at all.","If the Prophet told him where Xilu was, he would immediately go and kill him.","“Yes, it’s him!” the Prophet nodded and said, “He was created by the metal lifeforms of the Southern Spacetime and shouldn’t exist in this world. He violates the Law Rules of this world!”","“Too easy for me, senior. Why not mention a few more such pests, and I’ll take care of them all!” Jian Wushuang was very confident.","A mere Xilu was a piece of cake.","He wouldn’t even frown.","“Your courage is commendable!” the Prophet said with a smile, “Solve Xilu first, then we’ll talk!”","“No problem, senior, please help me predict his location, and I’ll go right away!”","Jian Wushuang immediately took out the artifact Huan Kong.","“Although I don’t know the exact location, I can predict that they will find you within an era. No matter where you go, you won’t be able to hide!”","“Heh!” Jian Wushuang got excited, flexing his wrist as he spoke, “Alright then, within an era, I will take their head!”","After making this promise, Jian Wushuang took his leave.","An era was indeed a short time.","Coincidentally, the metal lifeforms were also looking for him.","He could take care of them all at once.","As he treaded through the void and returned to the Immortal Temple, Hu Qing and Wu Zuo were both in seclusion.","The Realm King had also left.","Only Dan Bao and Bru remained with him.","So, he took this opportunity to explore the Beast God Weapon.","“A sun emblem?”","Jian Wushuang took down the Beast God Weapon and saw a sun mark on it.","It was different from a star.","The prophet’s craftsmanship was indeed extraordinary.","In the following time, apart from comprehending the Beast God Weapon, he also cultivated the Origin Source.","Ten thousand units of starry sky crystals could fill quite a few universes.","To reach the Ninth Tribulation, he needed a miniature spacetime river to appear within his Origin Source.","But now, there were only nine universes.","Nine universes were just a line.","To create a river, it wasn’t simple.","First, he needed to create multiple lines.","That meant dozens or even hundreds of universes.","The amount of starry sky Origin Source required was immense, only he knew how vast it was.","The ten thousand units of starry sky crystals were quickly exhausted.","And he only managed to create the second line.","Again, nine perfect universes.","His starry sky gradually brightened.","Thousands of years passed in a flash.","On this day, there were only three hours left until the metal lifeforms arrived.","Jian Wushuang exited seclusion early.","He ran into Wu Zuo head-on.","But Wu Zuo’s expression was not good.","“Wushuang!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded in greeting, then asked curiously, “Brother Wu Zuo, what happened? Is your cultivation not going well?”","Wu Zuo smiled bitterly, “It’s not about cultivation, it’s my Origin Source that’s problematic. Now that I’ve reached the demigod stage, I asked the Realm King about the Origin Source, and it turns out mine is lacking in many ways. I’m troubled by this.”","“It’s normal, no need to worry. The Origin Source is different from the divine body, it can’t be rushed!” Jian Wushuang patted Wu Zuo’s shoulder.","To be honest, he was more anxious than anyone.","He couldn’t even manage his own Origin Source, yet he had to put on a calm facade to console others.","“It’s hard not to worry! I have no confidence against the incoming metal lifeforms.”","“You have me!” Jian Wushuang was very confident.","This time, the metal lifeforms’ attack was not a threat.","“Forget about that for now. After dealing with the metal lifeforms, the Realm King has found us a relic from an ancient sect. It has treasures for cultivating the Origin Source. We can check it out then!”","“Count me in!”","Hu Qing walked over from the side hall.","Apparently, he also encountered difficulties with his Origin Source.","It seemed everyone was the same.","While they were troubled by divine tribulations, Jian Wushuang was worried about his Ninth Tribulation.","The three gathered and chatted for a while.","Then they prepared to set off for Zhalong Mountain.","However, Zhalong Mountain had been renamed.","Wu Li and the Divine Wood King had transformed it into a massive estate.","Few outsiders came, and they had driven away many families.","“North Town!”","It signified guarding the Northern Spacetime.","The scope expanded immediately.","Initially, they thought Wu Li and the Divine Wood King were going to rebuild the Ancient Wood Sect or establish a family power.","But this was grander.","It could be a temporary rest spot for strong individuals from the Northern Spacetime in the future.","“Let’s go, Brother Wu Li has been waiting!”","“Yes!”","Just as the three were about to leave, Dan Bao stopped them.","“Wait!” Dan Bao approached with his staff, Bru by his side.","“What’s wrong?”","Jian Wushuang smiled lightly, “Don’t worry, we’ll be back soon!”","Seeing Dan Bao’s tense expression, he offered some comfort.","“Let Bru go too. Don’t underestimate the metal lifeforms!”","Wu Zuo nodded, “Another person, more assurance!”","This surprised Jian Wushuang, he didn’t expect Wu Zuo to be so cautious this time.","Hu Qing, who had just come out of seclusion, had a significant change in his aura.","Wu Zuo had also become much stronger.","And yet, they still needed to be cautious?","“Alright then!”"]},{"number":6180,"title":"Chapter 6180: “He” Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 6180: “He” Is Here","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He didn’t ask too many questions and summoned the artifact, Phantom Void.","Ripping through spacetime, he began to traverse.","Sensing Elder Blu’s aura, he realized the other had become much stronger.","After becoming a demigod early on, his divine power was actually no weaker than Wu Zuo’s.","No wonder Danbao had asked Elder Blu to come along.","Unfortunately, there was no need for that.","Jian Wushuang slightly bowed his head, and his speed increased once again.","In no time, he arrived at Northern Town.","After not seeing it for a hundred thousand years, the place had changed significantly.","Without the corrupt forces, there were far fewer cultivators.","Now, the town was entirely populated by rogue cultivators.","Any threats were promptly dealt with by Wu Li.","Swish!","Upon entering the town, Wu Li and Divine Wood King found them.","“I say, you guys really know how to keep time!” Wu Li said with a light smile. “There’s still a quarter of an hour until the time predicted by the Prophet. The metal lifeforms should be entering the town by now!”","“Did you clear out the town just to welcome the metal lifeforms?”","With so few cultivators in the town, any strange ones would be immediately noticeable.","“Something like that,” Wu Li replied, not elaborating. “Our targets are two metal lifeforms. Let’s split up and search. When you find them, unleash a burst of divine power immediately. The town isn’t that big, we can converge in an instant!”","“No problem!”","As soon as they gathered, they dispersed again.","Jian Wushuang headed towards the northern part of the town.","Four directions, five areas.","With six people, they had more than enough coverage.","Metal lifeforms emitted no aura.","They could only be spotted with the naked eye.","A bit troublesome.","In fact, waiting at home wasn’t a bad idea.","Jian Wushuang was quite relaxed, even taking the opportunity to observe Northern Town.","The town’s layout was meticulous.","It must have been the handiwork of Divine Wood King, who had also been an ancestor of a sect.","The entire Northern Town was divided into core, inner, and outer areas.","The outer area could be freely roamed.","The inner area required a token, issued by the City Lord’s Mansion; without it, entry was impossible.","The core area was even more solemn.","Jian Wushuang even sensed his own residence there.","It housed countless grand halls, a total of one hundred thousand.","Only those of the Ninth Tribulation were eligible to reside there.","Currently, there were only five positions filled.","Clearly, they were prepared for the Ninth Tribulation of the Northern Spacetime.","At the center of the hundred thousand grand halls was the Qian Kun Hall, a place for discussions.","Even the City Lord’s Mansion was in the outer area and not placed in the core.","Divine Wood King had truly put a lot of thought into this.","While his mind was observing Northern Town, he sensed a sudden drop in aura.","“Strange!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows, and with a surge of divine power, he rushed towards that direction.","A rapid drop in divine power could only mean one thing.","Someone was injured.","But there was no commotion in the town.","How could someone be injured without a fight?","And at such a critical moment.","He had to take a look.","Without notifying the others, he went alone to investigate.","Swish!","“Hmm?” His eyes flickered.","The scene before him startled him.","An emaciated elder, wearing a high hat, was holding Divine Wood King with one hand.","His hand was gripping Divine Wood King’s throat.","His other hand had pierced through Divine Wood King’s chest.","“Stop!” Jian Wushuang roared, flying forward and kicking the emaciated elder.","Beside the emaciated elder was a fat man.","Seeing Jian Wushuang charging forward, the fat man’s eyes lit up. He pulled out a long needle and stabbed it directly into Jian Wushuang.","The pain didn’t stop Jian Wushuang. He still managed to kick the emaciated elder far away, crashing into several buildings.","The commotion attracted the attention of the others, who quickly rushed over.","After kicking away the emaciated elder, Divine Wood King was finally freed.","His face showed fear.","He had just been searching the area when he encountered two cultivators with no aura and went to question them.","Unexpectedly, the opponent suddenly ambushed him. The fat man gave him an injection, and then his divine body began to feel weak and powerless.","The old man took the opportunity to grab his neck and continuously absorb his divine power.","Under the dual assault, his divine body was pierced through once again.","This directly inflicted serious injuries on him.","He had now lost the ability to fight.","“Jian Wushuang, be careful of that fat man!” The Divine Wood King had a wary look in his eyes, not realizing that Jian Wushuang had also been hit.","However, Jian Wushuang’s reaction was not as obvious.","“Don’t worry, leave it to me!”","Jian Wushuang gathered a large amount of life force and injected it into the Divine Wood King’s body.","At this stage, his life force had not increased.","But he himself had grown much stronger, and the Life force he just gave was almost all he had.","If he got injured later, he wouldn’t be able to recover.","But he was confident he wouldn’t get hurt.","Whoosh!","The withered old man turned over from the shattered rubble and appeared before the crowd once more.","At this time, Hui Qing and others also arrived. Seeing the strange-looking old man and the fat man in front of them, they asked, “Are you metallic life forms?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","The withered old man didn’t answer Hui Qing’s question. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang and coldly said, “Was it you who killed the Miluo Light Brain?”","“That’s right!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist. Just now, he hadn’t even used his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and had only used 40 million units of divine power to kick the opponent away.","He felt that metallic life forms weren’t that impressive.","At this moment, he felt very relaxed.","But that injection just now made him feel a bit uneasy.","“Old man, how about changing the location?” Wu Li’s eyes were filled with killing intent as he pointed outside the city and said, “Do you dare to fight me outside?”","“My target is Jian Wushuang; it has nothing to do with you!” The withered old man kept his eyes fixed on Jian Wushuang, ignoring everyone else.","Jian Wushuang stepped forward and said coldly, “Then let’s fight outside!”","After speaking, he soared into the sky.","He looked down and gestured to the metallic life form to follow.","Seeing his opponent rise, he flew towards the lake outside the city.","The lake had many small islands.","He randomly chose an uninhabited island and stopped there.","Seeing the crowd following behind, he slowly descended.","Boom!","His feet slammed into the ground, and he flexed his wrists.","Swish!","The metallic life form and Wu Zuo and the others also landed one by one.","“Enough talk, let’s get started!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t wait any longer. For some reason, his fighting spirit was somewhat diminished. Though he spoke with high fighting intent, he felt a bit flustered and anxious inside.","He wanted a quick fight.","The metallic life form smiled at this.","They didn’t want to waste time either.","“Lord Galo, please leave Jian Wushuang to me!” The fat man bowed respectfully to the withered Lord Galo.","“Alright, but the others are mine!”","The withered old man was a bit dissatisfied with the fat man taking Jian Wushuang, but he still agreed.","Watching them divide the opponents, Wu Zuo was very displeased and coldly shouted, “Old man, just you wait!”","“They are all mine!” Jian Wushuang pointed at the fat and thin duo and said, “Let’s start quickly!”"]},{"number":6181,"title":"Chapter 6181: Jian Wushuang Was Defeated?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6181: Jian Wushuang Was Defeated?","Buzz!","He clenched his fists and let out a furious roar.","“Ha!”","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation instantly converged.","In a flash, he charged forward.","Not giving his opponent any time to prepare, he landed a punch on the fat man’s face.","Then followed up with a knee strike.","Hand-to-hand combat.","Fists and feet combined.","Driven by his immense divine power, he was practically ravaging his opponent.","This scene also left Wu Zuo and the others deeply shaken.","After Jian Wushuang executed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power reached 80 million.","He relentlessly pummeled the fat metallic lifeform.","From the small island, they fought up into the sky.","Onlookers saw him gaining the upper hand, but he knew that his attacks just felt like hitting cotton.","They were ineffective.","The fat metallic lifeform, after taking another punch, didn’t even retreat, only tilting its neck slightly before turning back to coldly stare at Jian Wushuang with a sneer.","Seeing the taunting look in his opponent’s eyes, Jian Wushuang grew anxious.","He concentrated a blue beam of light in his hands and blasted it towards his opponent’s head. Boom!!!","The powerful explosion shook the lake, causing water vapor to fill the air.","But as soon as the mist cleared, the fat metallic lifeform remained completely unscathed.","“Now it’s my turn!”","The metallic lifeform charged headfirst at Jian Wushuang’s face.","Bang!","This impact directly cracked Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Moreover, he could feel the metallic lifeform getting even stronger.","For a moment, he was no longer in the advantageous position.","“Origin Source Dao Arena!”","He clenched his fists again, unleashing more divine power.","After fighting for so long, his divine power had dropped to 75 million. With the reactivation of","the Origin Source Dao Arena, his divine power surged to around 85 million.","Clang!","The longer he fought, the more he felt something was off.","He drew the Wanjie Sword, aiming for a swift victory.","No more holding back.","“Spacetime Reincarnation!”","Sword shadows filled the sky.","Buzz!","A massive sword shadow formed, slashing towards the metallic lifeform.","Facing the sword shadow, the fat metallic lifeform widened its eyes in delight.","“This is the sword strike I’ve been waiting for!”","He extended his hands, revealing a miniature black hole in his palms.","The powerful Origin Source energy from Temporal Reincarnation was completely absorbed by the black hole.","At this point, Jian Wushuang was starting to weaken.","But the metallic lifeform’s strength had significantly increased.","Its divine power had reached 80 million.","It flew and knocked Jian Wushuang off the small island, sending him plunging into the lake.","The onlookers below also noticed something was wrong.","“This isn’t right, did Brother Wushuang not use the Origin Source Dao Arena?” Wu Zuo was puzzled, sensing Jian Wushuang’s apparent weakness.","At this moment, Divine Wood King recalled the time when Jian Wushuang had saved him and exclaimed, “No, Wushuang was ambushed earlier, he was definitely hit by a poisoned","needle!”","“What poisoned needle?” Hu Qing and the others looked over simultaneously.","“I don’t know, but once the poisoned needle enters the divine body, it weakens divine power.","I was ambushed this way and couldn’t fight back for years!”","Upon hearing this, Elder Blu became solemn and shouted, “Stop watching and get ready to save Jian Wushuang!”","There was no doubt that Jian Wushuang had been struck by the poisoned needle.","However, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was strong, and he had been suppressing the poison.","Unfortunately, during the battle, the suppression weakened, allowing the poison to take","effect.","Splash!","As they were about to act, the metallic lifeform Galo blocked their way.","“Your opponent is me!”","But Blu ignored him, unleashing his divine power, which soared beyond 70 million, and roared, “Get out of my way!”","Buzz!","He fired a blast of energy, attempting to eliminate Galo.","But the attack was easily absorbed by the black hole in Galo’s hand.","“Don’t use divine power attacks, engage in hand-to-hand combat!”","Everyone restrained their divine power and advanced again.","But Hu Qing remained still.","“You guys hold him off, I’ll go save Brother Wushuang!”","Hearing this, Wu Zuo hesitated for a moment and anxiously said, “The metallic lifeform above is stronger, let’s deal with this old man first and then go save Wushuang together!”","That metal lifeform was so powerful, its divine power had reached 80 million.","They were not a match for it.","Upon hearing this, Hu Qing shook his head.","“Leave it to me!”","As soon as he finished speaking, his divine power suddenly surged.","He had seen everything that had just happened.","Jian Wushuang could have killed the metal lifeform.","Unfortunately, his divine power had been weakened and then absorbed by the metal lifeform.","That was why he couldn’t defeat it.","However, Hu Qing’s divine power was not weakened.","“Future Transformation!”","Hu Qing roared, and a golden light exploded.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Future Self?","Future Transformation!","“You... you broke through?” Wu Zuo was stunned.","Hu Qing’s divine power had now exceeded 90 million.","In a flash, he rushed into the sky.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was being ravaged by the metal lifeform.","His divine body had almost been completely absorbed by the opponent.","Even the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could no longer be maintained.","“Now, your opponent is me!”","Hu Qing charged forward, holding a black long staff that had appeared in his hand, and with","one strike, he sent the metal lifeform flying.","With his other hand, he grabbed the weakened Jian Wushuang.","This blow had been too great for Jian Wushuang.","He had originally thought it would be a piece of cake, but he hadn’t expected things to turn","out this way.","Weakly, he looked at Hu Qing and said, “Be careful, be careful of him absorbing divine","power!”","“Don’t worry!”","Hu Qing nodded and shouted to the Divine Wood King below, “Take him back to the Immortal","Temple first!”","Seeing this, Divine Wood King immediately stepped forward to catch Jian Wushuang.","Before losing consciousness, Jian Wushuang took out the artifact, Phantom Void.","Then he passed out.","On the ground.","Blu, seeing Hu Qing’s outburst, felt assured.","He no longer hid anything and clenched his fists with a furious roar.","His divine power directly surpassed 80 million.","“Whew!” Wu Zuo took a deep breath.","He hadn’t expected Elder Blu to be so powerful.","“He’s mine!” Elder Blu pointed at the metal lifeform, Galo.","In a flash, he disappeared from where he was.","When he reappeared, he was already behind Galo.","With one punch, he knocked off Galo’s tall hat.","“You!” Galo hadn’t even reacted, not knowing how to defend himself.","But Elder Blu chopped off one of his arms with a hand blade.","In the crack of the arm, numerous small metal parts appeared, intricately designed.","Galo, holding his severed arm, quickly retreated.","“Calculation error, how can a Porunjia clan member be so powerful!”","He had come from the Southern Spacetime, following a message from Miluo.","He had created that fat metal lifeform based on his opponent.","Then he adjusted his own divine power accordingly.","Even when they reached the Realm King Continent, they were considered the ultimate","demigod powerhouses.","According to calculations, no matter how strong Jian Wushuang was, he wouldn’t reach the","level of demigod.","But in the recent battle, he found Jian Wushuang’s strength had reached an unimaginable","level.","Fortunately, he had prepared in advance, with the poison that weakened divine power. But he hadn’t accounted for Jian Wushuang’s companions being so strong."]},{"number":6182,"title":"Chapter 6182: Invincible Hu Qing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6182: Invincible Hu Qing","At the time in the Wanliu Divine Tree, Miluo had not seen Wu Zuo and Hu Qing. These two were variables.","In fact, the greatest danger, besides Jian Wushuang, was Divine Wood King.","However, in this battle, Divine Wood King did not perform impressively.","On the contrary, as soon as he descended, he severely injured the opponent. What he did not anticipate was Hu Qing.","And now, Elder Blu had also become so powerful.","He could suppress him with just a wave of his hand.","Galo’s divine power was only seventy-five million. “Retreat!”","With a thought, he took out a compass.","“Number Twenty, don’t get entangled in the battle, retreat first!”","He had failed.","This time, his plan had failed.","But this did not mean that Miluo’s revenge plan would fail.","At this moment, three metallic lifeforms had also arrived in the Northern City territory.","Not far away, at Galo’s speed, he could reach the opponent within an hour.","“Go!”","Without any hesitation, he crushed the compass.","A spatial exchange occurred.","On the originally desolate island, a simple house appeared in an instant, while Galo disappeared from the original spot.","“What happened?” Wu Li was startled.","Elder Blu, however, understood immediately and shouted angrily, “It’s a spatial exchange. He hasn’t run far. Split up and chase him!”","“Why don’t we deal with that fat guy first?”","Wu Zuo pointed at the battle in the sky.","At this moment, Hu Qing was fighting against the abandoned metallic lifeform.","After creating a new peak secret technique, Hu Qing’s future transformation had almost doubled.","His divine power had reached 90 million.","He continuously suppressed the metallic lifeform.","“I’ll help you!” Elder Blu’s figure flashed as he intended to help Hu Qing deal with the opponent first.","Hu Qing kicked the metallic lifeform away and turned his head to say, “No need, you guys go chase that person. I will catch up with you shortly!”","“Alone?” Elder Blu hesitated for a moment but then agreed.","This time, the strength of the metallic lifeforms had exceeded their expectations. They had to eradicate them completely and couldn’t let the opponent escape.","“Galo is already injured. Let’s split up and chase him!”","“Alright!”","Elder Blu, Wu Zuo, and Wu Li split up and went in different directions.","Only Hu Qing was left to fight the strongest metallic lifeform.","Seeing that the others had left, Hu Qing’s aura shook again.","“Let’s see whether you absorb more or explode more!”","Buzz!","He abandoned the long staff and gathered divine power in both hands.","In an instant, his power broke through ninety million.","The vast divine power gathered in his hands, forming a golden light beam.","“Ha!”","Boom!","The metallic lifeform that had fallen to the ground looked up and saw the incoming divine power beam, immediately rejoicing.","It stretched out its hands and began to absorb it.","The powerful divine power continuously poured into the metallic lifeform.","Soon, the metallic lifeform’s power broke through ninety million, reaching the same level as","Hu Qing.","But Hu Qing did not intend to stop and continued to increase his divine power.","The future transformation had been pushed to its limit.","The divine power kept gathering.","93 million!","94 million!","95.5 million!","“Ah!”","This time, the metallic lifeform couldn’t hold on any longer. Its limit was 90 million.","The subsequent power completely pushed it to its limit.","It was overfed!","Seeing the opportunity, Hu Qing moved his mind, and the silver long staff flew out from behind.","Following the beam of light, it shot straight at the metallic lifeform.","Pfft!","The long staff pierced through the metallic lifeform’s divine body along with the beam of","light.","“Now’s the time!” Hu Qing increased his divine power again.","Boom!","The metallic lifeform that pierced through the divine body could no longer resist. Its body was shattered by the beam of light, and its limbs turned to ashes.","Only a round head remained, falling to the ground.","Hu Qing glanced at it, and a beam of energy shot out, obliterating the metallic head as well.","With a thought, he scanned the entire Northern Town territory.","He quickly discovered three powerful auras converging together.","In a flash, he sped towards that direction.","Within the territory, the battles raged on, wave after wave.","However, Jian Wushuang had only participated in the initial battle and then lay down","afterward.","At this moment, he was in the Immortal Temple, receiving treatment from Danbao.","Through the crystal ball, Divine Wood King watched the troubles encountered by Elder Blu","and the others.","Galo was already severely injured, with little combat strength left.","But their crisis had only just begun.","Two familiar faces appeared in Northern City.","There was also a burly figure, faceless, entirely pitch black, like a puppet, resembling a","rudimentary metallic lifeform.","Divine Wood King stared at the crystal ball, exclaiming, “It’s incredible that the owner of the","pyramid could create such powerful lifeforms!”","“The Realm King said that this crisis is no less threatening than the extinction!” Danbao","bowed his head and sighed, “I wonder if we can hold them off!”","“How much longer to restore Jian Wushuang?” Divine Wood King inquired.","With only Hu Qing alone, it might not be enough.","He had killed one metallic lifeform and severely injured another.","But now, three more metallic lifeforms had appeared.","They seemed stronger than the fat one that was killed.","It would be very difficult to hold them off.","Danbao gathered divine life force with both hands, continually restoring Jian Wushuang.","“It will take a day; his divine body is too severely damaged!”","Divine Wood King frowned, clenching his fists, and said, “Give me a ball of life force, I need to","save them!”","“But...” Danbao hesitated.","“We don’t have time; do you want to watch them die?” Divine Wood King took out the artifact Illuosry sky and said, “With Illuosry Sky, I can take them and escape!”","Only then did Danbao nod in agreement, gathering two massive balls of life force and handing","them to Divine Wood King.","“Be careful!”","“Mm!” Divine Wood King nodded.","...","Within Northern City.","In a narrow alley, Elder Blu and the others had cornered Galo, as well as the newly appeared","three metallic lifeforms.","This made Elder Blu pause for a moment.","He hadn’t expected three more to appear.","The metallic lifeforms had no aura, so he couldn’t gauge their strength.","But he was confident.","Because he had obtained the Dragon God Treasure from Divine Wood King when he ascended.","Buzz!","Clenching his fists, his divine power surged to 80 million.","“Today, you won’t escape!”","Wu Li and Wu Zuo also erupted together, their divine power breaking 70 million.","Three terrifying auras rose within the town.","At this moment, Hu Qing descended with a boom.","He landed in front of everyone.","Slowly turning, he looked at Galo.","“These are your helpers?”","Hu Qing’s eyes held battle intent.","Jian Wushuang had fallen, and he had to take on everything alone.","Hearing this, Galo looked tense.","He knew his subordinates must have been killed.","“Impressive!”","A clear voice rang out.","A short-haired girl among the metallic lifeforms stepped forward, clapping her hands, and","said, “Such a spectacular moment, why isn’t Jian Wushuang here?”","Her target was Jian Wushuang.","She had no interest in these people before her.","If a battle was necessary, she would oblige, but not now."]},{"number":6183,"title":"Chapter 6183: A New Metallic Lifeform?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6183: A New Metallic Lifeform?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Your opponent is me!” Hu Qing pointed at himself with his thumb and said, “But you no longer have a chance to see Jian Wushuang!”","Buzz!","His divine power surged, instantly reaching its peak.","Seeing this, Galo hurriedly urged, “Lan Yan, go kill them!”","Behind the short-haired girl stood a short-haired boy, his gaze cold.","He was very disdainful of Galo’s command.","With a frown, he said, “Lord Galo, it seems you are not needed here!”","“What do you mean by that?” Galo took half a step back, also feeling that the three metal lifeforms created by Miluo had problematic personalities.","Moreover, with Miluo already fallen, there was no way to control these three.","Swish!","The short-haired boy moved swiftly, appearing directly behind Galo. With a single hand chop, he instantly decapitated Galo.","The round head rolled to Hu Qing’s feet.","Even without a body, Galo did not truly perish. His eyes shifted, and he began to curse, “You traitors, I am Miluo’s elder brother, how dare you attack me!”","This scene stunned Hu Qing and his companions.","They did not expect the metal lifeforms to engage in infighting.","For a moment, they were all dumbfounded.","The short-haired boy, Lan Yan, struck again, crushing Galo’s head underfoot.","“Noisy!”","The short-haired girl frowned and complained, “Why did you have to step on him?”","The two exchanged words as if Galo’s death was of no consequence.","As for the burly figure behind them, he remained silent throughout, merely following behind Lan Yan and Lan Shui.","“Now it’s your turn!” The girl, Lan Shui, pointed at Hu Qing, then glanced at Wu Li and the others, saying, “All of you, attack together! We’re in a hurry!”","Wu Li observed the situation and felt they no longer had the advantage. He stepped forward and asked, “Aren’t you guys with Galo?”","“This old guy has nothing to do with us!” Lan Yan, standing behind, shook his head casually.","“If you’re not with Galo, why are you still hunting Jian Wushuang?”","This confused him even more.","According to Galo, he was avenging Miluo by creating Lan Yan and Lan Shui.","Lan Yan and Lan Shui were also avenging Miluo.","Now, the two groups were infighting.","It was indeed puzzling.","Lan Shui chuckled and explained, “Hunting Jian Wushuang is our mission from creation. If we kill him, we’ll be free. Of course, we must do it!”","With these words, there was no room for negotiation.","Wu Li’s face darkened as he retreated.","Hu Qing frowned, clenched his fists, and attacked.","He threw a punch, but Lan Shui easily dodged it.","In an instant, she sidestepped and countered with an elbow strike, knocking Hu Qing aside.","The combined attack from Wu Li and Wu Zuo was also easily thwarted by Lan Shui.","With a single kick each, they were sent to join Hu Qing.","Boom!","Half of the Northern City was destroyed.","Divine Wood King, controlling the Illusory Sky divine artifact, had just arrived and was dumbfounded.","He had only left for a moment and returned to find the opponents had changed.","Galo and that fat guy were gone.","Three new metal lifeforms had appeared.","Moreover, they were even stronger.","Hu Qing and the others attacked again, but the metal lifeforms didn’t even use their divine power absorption techniques, yet still left the three without the strength to fight back.","Seeing this, Divine Wood King in the air dared not move recklessly.","The newly appeared three special lifeforms first attacked their own, killing Galo. Then the cold girl began to fight Hu Qing and the others.","To call it a fight was an overstatement; it was a one-sided beating.","Hu Qing, with his ninety million divine power, stood no chance against them.","As for Blu and Wu Li, they fared even worse.","Boom!","The newly rebuilt Northern City was half-destroyed in an instant.","Hu Qing crawled out of the rubble, looking incredulously at the cold girl before him, feeling fear for the first time.","Such fear had never occurred before.","He never imagined that after his breakthrough, he would be so vulnerable.","Previously, he had taken on Jian Wushuang’s burden and slain metal lifeforms.","He thought this threat had ended.","Unexpectedly, this was just the beginning.","“Too weak. I wonder if that Jian Wushuang will give us some surprises!” The aloof boy stood aside, glancing at Hu Qing and the others with disinterest, and reminded the cold girl Lan Shui, “Hurry up and finish this!”","He couldn’t help but feel a bit itchy to join the fight as he watched. Unfortunately, Hu Qing and the others were not strong enough to put up a good fight.","He could only think of going to deal with Jian Wushuang.","“Let’s end this!” The cold young girl raised the corners of her mouth, and her hands suddenly converged, a burst of red light flashing out.","Buzz!","The powerful divine power made the entire Northern City tremble.","Hu Qing’s face changed, and he turned to shout at Wu Li, “Quick, get out of the way!”","After saying that, he flashed to Blu’s side. At this moment, Blu had already lost the ability to move. Hu Qing grabbed Blu with one hand and wanted to retreat.","But the red light had already swept over the ground and the void.","There was no escape.","In the red glow, Hu Qing showed a look of despair.","Boom! Boom!","After the huge noise, the entire Northern City was completely reduced to ruins.","The proud young man Lan Yan and the black metal life form both leaped and hovered in the sky.","Below, the cold young girl Lan Shui’s clothes were only slightly tattered, but her aura remained unchanged, not having decreased her divine power due to the previous attack.","“There’s still a faint aura!”","Upon hearing this, Lan Shui wanted to strike again.","But Lan Yan stopped her, “Forget it, these cultivators are too weak, no need to kill them. It’s better to leave them; maybe they will fight with Jian Wushuang against us, and that will be interesting!”","“Good idea!” Lan Shui raised her head and blinked, thinking it was very reliable.","Divine Wood King in the sky heard all this, his face turning dark, and he roared, “You won’t succeed! When Jian Wushuang arrives, you will all be doomed!”","“Hmph!” Lan Shui turned her head and looked at Divine Wood King, calmly saying, “When Jian Wushuang comes, whether we will be doomed is uncertain, but it’s very easy to doom you now!”","As soon as these words came out, Divine Wood King’s face changed dramatically. After hesitating for a moment, he still unleashed all his divine power. The green aura around him surged suddenly, arcs of electricity flickering.","“Then let’s try!”","He couldn’t escape and could only fight.","Lan Shui slowly walked towards him, extending a palm, and asked in surprise, “You’re not afraid of death?”","She was a bit curious why Divine Wood King would jump out to stop her.","“Afraid!”","Divine Wood King was very afraid of death.","But what could he do?","“Alright, I’ll spare your life!” Lan Shui withdrew her palm, her tone indifferent.","“Just this?” Divine Wood King was stunned for a moment, thinking the other party looked down on him, not even bothering to strike. He shouted, “What exactly do you want?”","They clearly could kill them all but didn’t go for the kill.","Lan Shui heard this, turned her head to glance at Divine Wood King, and said, “For revenge, it’s that simple. I hope when we meet Jian Wushuang, you will be present. Don’t let us down!”"]},{"number":6184,"title":"Chapter 6184: Depressed Fighting Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 6184: Depressed Fighting Spirit","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After speaking, he followed Lan Yan and left.","Their destination was the Star Field of the Gods.","Divine Wood King watched their figures recede into the distance, his heart a mixture of emotions.","This time, they truly faced a great crisis.","There was no room for resistance.","Even the powerful Hu Qing couldn’t last a quarter of an hour in the enemy’s hands.","No matter how strong Jian Wushuang was, how much stronger could he possibly be?","In the end, he was just an Eighth Tribulation.","Currently, three special beings already possessed the combat power of a Universe God.","They were far from being their opponents.","It wasn’t until the metal beings disappeared from sight that Divine Wood King snapped back to reality and hurriedly went to find Hu Qing and the others.","Among the rubble, he found Hu Qing and the others.","Using his Thought power, he enveloped everyone and activated the divine artifact, Illusory Sky, tearing through spacetime, and heading directly towards the Star Field of the Gods.","...","The Immortal Temple.","After bringing everyone back, Danbao quickly healed Hu Qing and the others.","At this moment, they were all sitting cross-legged atop the Immortal Temple, contemplating how to face the battle.","Hu Qing was extremely despondent.","His fighting spirit had waned significantly.","The Future Self.","It was his ultimate secret technique.","The Future Transformation was a super-secret technique he could rely on even when facing Universe Gods.","Yet it was useless against the metal beings.","He was brutally killed.","He didn’t even have a chance to fight back.","For a while, he hadn’t completely recovered from the shock.","This blow was not only huge for Hu Qing but for the others as well.","Divine Wood King was utterly convinced. He couldn’t keep up with Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang’s pace, and facing the metal beings was even more impossible.","In contrast, Wu Li, still in the mood to joke, said, “Don’t worry, with Brother Wushuang here, we won’t lose. I’m not exaggerating. Back then, when I teamed up with Brother Wushuang, this old Brother Divine Wood King can testify, it was extremely dangerous. Brother Wushuang was just an Emperor then and dared to fight Gula. Now, what’s a mere metal being?”","“Right!” At this moment, Wu Zuo also spoke, “I met Brother Wushuang early on too. When he was just a Dao Lord, he was already defeating the peak-level experts. Now, as an Eighth Tribulation, beating a Universe God shouldn’t be a problem!”","The optimistic words of the two lightened the atmosphere a bit.","But just then, a familiar voice was heard.","“I can’t win!”","Everyone turned towards the source of the voice. It was Jian Wushuang.","He had fully recovered, but the gap in divine power was insurmountable.","Hu Qing had been defeated miserably. If he went, it would also be a death sentence.","The key was that he had no confidence in winning now.","“Brother Wushuang!”","“Brother Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","Everyone spoke up.","“This time, I dragged you all down!” Jian Wushuang said helplessly, “I didn’t expect these metal beings to be so powerful, making us all look so pathetic!”","Hu Qing shook his head and said, “Don’t say that. We face this together. If we hadn’t killed the metal being back then, there would be no God of Life, and we wouldn’t be where we are now!”","Divine Wood King understood this best because he had just been a Scattered Tribulation, and now he was a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master.","So, he was most qualified to understand and share the burden.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up as he turned to Danbao and said, “I’ve already contacted the Prophet. You can go to the Prophet to hide. I will use the divine artifact, Illusory Sky, to lead them away to a distant star field!”","He had contacted the Prophet, and Hu Qing and the others could go there and even seek advice from the Prophet.","After all, the metal beings were not targeting them.","Danbao took a deep breath at his words but did not nod in agreement. After hesitating for a moment, he said, “I have a way to defeat the metal beings!”","“Hmm?”","Everyone was taken aback, and Bruce frowned as if he had thought of something.","“Fusion!”","Upon hearing this, Wu Zuo became excited.","“You’re saying, let Brother Wushuang and Hu Qing fuse. This is a good idea. As long as Jian Wushuang appears, even the gods can’t stop us!”","After witnessing Jian Wushuang’s power, Wu Zuo was greatly influenced.","At that time, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing had only a fraction of their divine power, but after fusing, they could rival a Universe God.","They were much stronger than they were now.","Now, both Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang had around 90 million divine power.","If they fused, wouldn’t they be unstoppable across the entire Realm King Continent?","Bruce shook his head and explained, “Not the fusion created by the Realm King God, but our Polunga fusion!”","“What?”","This time, Jian Wushuang was also surprised and asked, “Could it be that there are also your people on the Realm King Continent?”","Danbao shook his head.","“I will fuse with Elder Blu!”","He and Blu could still fuse once more.","And it was the last fusion of the Polunga race.","Of course, it wasn’t like the elder’s fusion.","It was a physical fusion.","Simply put, Danbao would abandon the body of the God of Life, leaving only a consciousness, similar to the Realm King.","Blu had absorbed the God of Life and already possessed 80 million units of divine power.","With the integration of Danbao, he could potentially become a Universe God directly, avoiding the hassle of undergoing a Tribulation.","“Absolutely not!”","This time, it wasn’t just Jian Wushuang who opposed the idea. Wu Li and Divine Wood King also voiced their objections.","Wu Li had always stayed in the Immortal Temple and had developed a bond with Danbao over time.","Divine Wood King had received the greatest benefits and couldn’t bear to see another sacrifice made for them.","“There’s no other way,” Danbao said with a wry smile. “Only by merging with Blu do we have a chance to defeat the metallic life forms. Don’t worry, I won’t truly perish. Like the Realm King, I’ll become a consciousness. But I won’t be able to restore your divine power anymore!”","Jian Wushuang slowly walked over.","He didn’t want to burden Danbao any longer.","Patting Danbao’s shoulder, he said, “I still have room to improve. It’s not certain that I’ll lose!”","“But!” Danbao looked up at him, determination in his eyes.","“No buts!” Jian Wushuang was even more resolute.","He couldn’t watch his companions sacrifice themselves anymore.","They had been lucky this time, or perhaps the metallic life forms had shown erratic behavior and didn’t strike lethally.","Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","Hu Qing and others had almost fallen. He couldn’t afford to take that risk again.","Just then, Realm King descended. Seeing everyone present, he sighed in relief.","“Jian Wushuang, come with me,” Realm King beckoned. “The Great Realm King wants to see you.”","Hearing that the Great Realm King summoned them, everyone was stunned.","The Great Realm King was a figure comparable to Zamasu, one of the top figures on the Realm God Continent.","He wanted to meet them?","It seemed the Realm King had pleaded on their behalf, finding a way to break the impasse.","Otherwise, continuing to train and chase the metallic life forms under the current circumstances would be meaningless.","“I’m not going,” Blu said, remaining in place and glancing at Danbao.","Danbao, as the God of Life, couldn’t easily leave the temple, which also had its dangers.","As a divine envoy, he couldn’t leave either."]},{"number":6185,"title":"Chapter 6185: Danbao Sacrifices","paragraphs":["Chapter 6185: Danbao Sacrifices","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To stay behind and protect the Dao.","The Realm King naturally had no objections. He looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Don’t be anxious. The metal life forms are not terrifying. The real terrifying opponent has yet to appear!”","“Who?” Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment and then asked, “Is it Zamasu?”","Now that the metal life forms had the combat power of Universe Gods, if they weren’t terrifying, he truly didn’t know who the opponent could be.","The Realm King shook his head and replied, “It’s Xilu!”","“Xilu!” Wu Zuo’s eyes widened as he said, “How strong can he be? How long has it been since he left the Northern Spacetime? He can’t be stronger than the metal life forms, can he?”","Hui Qing was also somewhat shocked. He hadn’t expected there to be an opponent stronger than the metal life forms. This put considerable pressure on them.","“Rest assured, this time the Great Realm King will personally guide you and transform your divine bodies. Once you emerge after some time, dealing with these metal life forms won’t be an issue. However, Xilu poses a greater threat. The outcome will depend on your training results with the Great Realm King!” The Realm King boosted everyone’s morale.","There was no need to be downcast.","Upon hearing this, Wu Li’s face was ecstatic. Transforming their divine bodies and guiding their cultivation was immensely important.","Without this threat, they might never see someone like the Great Realm King in their lifetime.","They had to seize this opportunity.","“Let’s go!”","With a wave of his hand, the Realm King casually tore through the space of the Star Field of the Gods.","Being the Realm King, he naturally had the ability to traverse spacetime. Even without combat power, his own realm was still intact.","“Lord Realm King, those metal life forms won’t find the Immortal Temple, right?” Jian Wushuang was somewhat worried about the safety of Danbao and others.","“Rest assured, this is the Star Field of the Gods. Those metal life forms won’t have the chance to cause trouble here. Just focus on your cultivation!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, then followed the Realm King and left.","After entering the rift, the Realm King left behind an avatar.","“Blu!”","He looked at Blu and Danbao below, his eyes revealing worry.","The reason for taking Jian Wushuang and the others away first was to avoid affecting their cultivation.","“Lord Realm King!”","Danbao’s face was calm as he said, “Tell me what needs to be done.”","He had already accepted it calmly. Although he was merely the God of Life, he was also a God of Time and Space, with a sense of foreboding.","“Danbao, I have a task for Blu. This task is very dangerous. With Blu’s current strength, he would be walking to his death!” The Realm King’s face was somewhat somber.","Danbao had already sensed it and said calmly, “Is it to stop the metal life forms?”","“Yes!” The Realm King nodded.","Blu stood silently on the side. At this moment, he didn’t know what to say.","He only hated his insufficient strength.","Even before the metal life forms appeared, he had a premonition. At that time, he trained desperately, raising his divine power to over 80 million.","But he still couldn’t solve the problem of the metal life forms.","Now he could only be forced to merge with Danbao.","Actually, it was more like he was unilaterally absorbing Danbao’s divine flesh.","This was the only way to quickly enhance his divine power.","Blu had achieved his current accomplishments by merging with the entire Boron Clan of strong practitioners, relying on the foundation he had laid at that time.","But his potential was ultimately limited. He wasn’t human, and his comprehension was average.","Achieving the status of a Universe God might be something he could never accomplish in his lifetime.","However, after absorbing Danbao’s divine avatar, his potential and comprehension could improve. He might even achieve the status of a Universe God in one leap.","The choice was now in Danbao’s hands.","“Stopping the metal life forms isn’t actually the goal!” The Realm King didn’t want Danbao to lose his body either, but he said helplessly, “It’s to stop Xilu. To stop Xilu from devouring the metal life forms. If Xilu absorbs the metal life forms, even the Immortal Temple won’t be able to stop him. The Great Realm King cannot intervene directly. By then, even the Northern Spacetime will be in danger!”","This was what he was worried about.","Unfortunately, he no longer had his physical body. Otherwise, there would be no need for these juniors to come forward.","The Realm King felt very guilty, but there was no other way.","“Leave this to me!” Danbao nodded and said, “Anyway, I don’t have much use for my body.”","After a bit of self-consolation, he turned to Blu.","“Let’s begin!”","By now, the metal life forms had already entered the Star Field of the Gods, and time was running out for them.","Buzz!","Danbao’s body turned into golden light and merged with Blu.","At this moment, his divine power began to change drastically.","...","On the other side, Jian Wushuang and the others were brought to the small island where the Realm King resided.","After descending, everyone waited patiently in place.","Through the perception of karma, they were actually not far from the Immortal Temple; it would only take a quarter of an hour to reach the Immortal Temple by tearing through the void.","However, for those metal lifeforms to come here was as difficult as ascending to heaven. Even Zamasu would find it challenging to forcibly attack this place.","“You all wait here, I’ll go in and greet them!”","After the Realm King finished speaking, he walked towards the wooden house on the island.","At that moment, the door of the wooden house opened on its own, and an elderly blue-skinned man walked out.","“Have you brought everyone?”","“Yes, they are all here!”","There was no need to ask; the only one who could make the Northern Realm King show such respect was the Great Realm King.","Jian Wushuang quickly cupped his hands and bowed, saying, “Greetings, Great Realm King!”","“Great Realm King!” The others also bowed in unison.","“En!” The Great Realm King only slightly nodded, glanced at everyone, and then said, “Each of you will have a chance to be guided, but only for one year. However, in the Time House, you can train rapidly for ten thousand epochs. This means that after five years in the outside world, all of you can leave!”","Only one person could be guided at a time.","Five people would mean five years.","Naturally, everyone had no objections and stood to the side, ready to follow instructions.","“Who will go first?” The Great Realm King glanced at everyone.","Hui Qing stepped forward at this moment and answered, “I’ll go first!”","“Alright, follow me!”","The Great Realm King led the way, and Hui Qing followed.","The others then sat cross-legged on the spot and began to wait.","The Realm King stood aside, contemplating matters concerning the Immortal Temple.","At this moment, Blu had completely absorbed Danbao’s divine avatar, and a strong golden light burst from his body.","“I can’t believe my power has reached this level!” Blu could hardly believe it; his divine power had already surpassed a billion.","And he had not yet used his full strength.","As he slightly clenched his fist, the surrounding spacetime began to tremble, with small cracks appearing.","Danbao watched all this and smiled.","However, his figure was somewhat illusory now, similar to the Realm King, having lost his physical divine body. At least his Origin Source remained, allowing him to continue comprehending the true essence of life and improve the Northern Spacetime.","This was what it looked like after losing the physical divine body.","“The metal lifeforms have just left Zalong Mountain and are at the edge of the Star Field of the Gods. Blu, you only need to kill one of Lanyan or Lanshui immediately. As for that big black guy, don’t worry about him. Kill one without mercy, and leave the rest alone!” The Realm King carefully instructed."]},{"number":6186,"title":"Chapter 6186: Blu’s Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 6186: Blu’s Battle","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was very important. As long as they killed a metal lifeform, Xilu’s plan would not come to fruition.","At this moment, Blu was extremely confident and said calmly, “Rest assured, my lord, I will kill them all!”","With that, he slowly levitated into the air, signaled to the two of them, and his figure flashed out.","The surrounding spacetime was instantly torn apart, and Blu disappeared into the void.","“Swish!”","A few breaths later, Blu appeared in a desolate pile of rubble, standing on a giant broken rock, waiting for the metal lifeforms to appear.","He had now reached the level of a Universe God, fully mastering the surrounding spacetime Law Rules, and naturally discovered the position of the metal lifeforms.","Unlike before, he no longer needed to rely on their aura or use mental power to investigate.","Now, he just needed to control spacetime and could immediately see everything around him.","Boom!","In just a moment, three figures appeared in front of Blu.","“It’s you?” The cold young girl frowned when she saw Blu, as she noticed that Blu’s aura had changed, as if he were a different person.","The aloof Lan Yan didn’t put Blu in his eyes at all, sneering, “Defeated so quickly and recovered even faster, are you in such a hurry to die?”","“Tsk tsk!” Blu moved his wrist, peeled off the heavy skin, and stared coldly at the three metal lifeforms, arrogantly saying, “Are you all coming at once, or one by one?”","Hearing this, Lan Yan was first stunned, then laughed heartily while holding his stomach, “Did Lan Shui just beat you silly? You still want to take on three of us at once!”","“Why not try and find out?” Blu assumed a stance, ready to attack at any moment.","“Fine, very good. This time, I’ll do it myself. Lan Shui, you and the big guy just watch. I will kill him personally!”","Lan Yan’s arms trembled, his body slightly lowered, and his eyes became sharp.","He seemed to be searching for Blu’s flaws.","Lan Shui saw the stances of the two and showed a curious expression, retreating to the distant mountains with the big guy Lan Tian, quietly waiting for the battle to erupt.","Crack!","The gravel fell with the gusts of wind.","Before the stones even hit the ground, a huge aura shook the sky.","Lan Yan and Blu struck simultaneously, fist to fist, leg to leg.","The two immediately engaged in close combat.","As soon as their divine powers clashed, Lan Yan was shaken back and exclaimed, “No wonder you are so confident. You’ve reached the level of a Universe God, but it’s still not enough!”","As he spoke, he gathered energy waves in his hands and continuously blasted them towards Blu.","Boom!","The violent roar shattered the entire stone mountain.","But Blu’s figure had long since reached the sky, and he shouted, “I’m here, you fool!”","As soon as the words fell, Lan Yan felt a strong impact from his chest before he could even look up.","He was sent flying.","Boom!","He crashed through several mountain peaks before coming to a stop.","Blu approached again, roaring, “Ah ah ah... ha!”","A golden light beam shot out from his hand, instantly striking the place where Lan Yan had fallen.","The entire majestic mountain disappeared in an instant.","Completely pulverized.","The majestic mountains in the Divine Realm were extremely hard. Though battles could damage them, to completely pulverize them like this required divine power exceeding one billion 300 million.","The battle between Blu and Lan Yan had only lasted as long as an incense stick, yet it had already caused such a commotion.","“Whoo!” Blu took a deep breath. He did not sense Lan Yan’s presence in the spacetime he controlled, so he turned to Lan Shui and said, “I told you, you can all come at me together!”","In the distance, Lan Shui was initially stunned, then regained his composure, his lips curling up, “Finish Lan Yan first.”","“Hmm?” Blu frowned and quickly turned around.","But it was too late. As soon as he turned, he was punched down from the sky.","His figure, like a stream of light, crashed into the mountains below.","Lan Yan, now in tattered clothes, appeared in the sky, sneering, “With so little divine power, you want to defeat me? You’re far from it!”","But before he could be happy for too long, he noticed countless clusters of energy waves floating around him, appearing out of nowhere.","Down in the mountains below, Blu turned and spat out a mouthful of blood, calmly saying, “This is just the beginning!”","As soon as he finished speaking, countless clusters of energy waves began to gather and continuously bombarded Lan Yan.","The loud noises rose and fell, persisting for the duration of a stick of incense before stopping.","Thud!","Lan Yan fell heavily from the sky, and Blu revealed a cold smile at the corner of his mouth, looking at Lan Shui, “Aren’t you going to make a move?”","He already had the upper hand, and if Lan Shui and that big dark-skinned man didn’t help, Lan Yan was really going to fall.","“Lan Yan...”","Lan Shui frowned upon hearing this. She hadn’t expected that Blu, whom she had easily defeated, had grown so powerful in such a short time.","However, with just this divine power, it wasn’t enough to defeat Lan Yan!","Just as Blu was looking towards Lan Shui and the others, his back suddenly trembled, sensing a gradually rising aura.","Lan Yan stood up completely unharmed, and his divine power erupted once more, surpassing 150 million.","In terms of Universe God, that was one and a half stars.","Blu also turned to look at him in disbelief, thinking to himself, “What kind of monsters are they...?”","They had been fighting for so long, yet still hadn’t used their full strength.","And this was just one Lan Yan.","Lan Shui hadn’t even made a move yet, and that big dark-skinned man’s strength wasn’t trivial either.","At this moment, he felt immense pressure but still furrowed his brow and fully unleashed his divine power.","He also reached 150 million.","One and a half stars.","He fiercely clashed with Lan Yan once more.","Heaven and earth trembled, and the surrounding mountains all collapsed.","In their intense battle, neither noticed a terrifying presence approaching, like a ferocious beast, watching them, ready to strike at any moment.","...","In the Star Field of the Gods, at the residence of the Great Realm King.","On the primordial island, Jian Wushuang and the others were waiting for Hu Qing’s cultivation.","The flow of time here was different from the outside world.","One year on the island equaled one day outside.","When Hu Qing entered the wooden house, the time flow could reach a staggering billion times faster.","Moreover, the time was extremely stable.","The spacetime of the Realm King Continent was extremely stable, and below the Universe God, no one could control the flow of time.","Therefore, after Jian Wushuang and the others arrived at the Realm King Continent, they couldn’t control the flow of time to cultivate and could only train in the Time House.","“What an intense battle!”","The group sat together, waiting for Hu Qing to finish cultivating, while also watching the battle between Blu and Lan Yan.","This was a time-space orb left by the Realm King, allowing them to see the battle between Blu and the metal lifeform through the crystal ball. This battle indeed astonished everyone.","They also saw the gap.","The gap between Universe Gods and ordinary Tribulation level.","Jian Wushuang, with his current strongest combat power, couldn’t even touch the edge of the Universe God.","Although he had crafted the perfect Beast God Weapon, he couldn’t use it. He needed to reach the Ninth Tribulation to wield it."]},{"number":6187,"title":"Chapter 6187: Xilu Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 6187: Xilu Appears","Now, relying solely on the Super Ancient Transformation, it was simply impossible to participate in battles of this level.","He had to break through and become a Ninth Tribulation.","“It seems that Blu is not an opponent!” Wu Li shook his head and said, “In battles of metal lifeforms, divine power is hardly consumed, but Blu’s consumption is too great!”","Wu Zuo, however, retorted at this moment:","“Don’t forget, after Blu fused with Danbao’s physical body, his divine body contained life force. He hasn’t used it yet, and the consumed divine power can be replenished all at once. He is hiding his strength, waiting for a chance to deliver a fatal blow!”","Jian Wushuang, who had been silently watching, also understood the life force. Although it wasn’t apparent, he could tell that Blu had already used all his strength. If he wasn’t mistaken, Blu had even used his life force.","Crash!","He suddenly stood up, his pupils dilated.","“Not good!”","Through the crystal ball, he sensed a terrifying threat growing.","This threat was directed at him.","However, it had already targeted Blu.","“Wushuang, are you trying to scare me? Is Zamasu here?” Wu Zuo also jumped up, looking around warily.","“It’s Xilu!”","Just as he finished speaking, a terrifying aura rose in the crystal ball.","At the edge of the Star Field of the Gods.","Blu and Lan Yan’s battle had reached a fever pitch.","Neither side could currently gain the upper hand. They stared at each other, waiting for the next opportunity to strike.","But at this moment, Blu’s eyes widened in horror as he stared behind Lan Yan, his voice trembling, “You are... Xilu?”","Crack.","Following Blu’s gaze, on a low mountain behind Lan Yan, stood a monster radiating golden light. Its feet, like human hands, gently grasped the ground and crushed the small mountain into powder.","“You actually recognize me. Was it Jian Wushuang who told you?” From Blu, he could sense the aura of the Northern Spacetime.","Lan Yan quickly turned his head upon hearing the commotion. When he saw Xilu, his pupils contracted.","A natural fear arose from his heart.","That fear seemed innate.","It wasn’t just Lan Yan; Lan Shui felt the same.","Standing next to Lan Shui, a big black guy saw the emerging monster, his pupils also contracted sharply, and he clenched his fists. This was the first time he took something seriously. He hadn’t cared about Blu and Lan Yan’s battle before.","Lan Yan and Lan Shui didn’t know much about his strength, only that he was a man of few words.","In fact, among the three metal lifeforms, his strength was the strongest.","“This visitor is not friendly. You take Lan Yan and leave later!”","“Huh?” Lan Shui said in surprise, “You actually speak?”","This was the first time she heard the big guy speak.","The big black guy, codenamed Lan Tian, also came from the Northern Spacetime.","“He is coming for you!” Lan Tian said in a deep voice.","Lan Shui remained calm and scoffed, “So what? His divine power is barely at one star, not much of a threat!”","“No, that’s just the surface!”","Indeed, as Lan Tian said, the aura Xilu had just released was only his regular combat strength.","Seeing Xilu appear, Blu remembered what the Realm King had told him.","Beware of Xilu!","Beware of Xilu absorbing Lan Yan and Lan Shui.","Once he absorbed these two metal lifeforms, it would be over.","Even if Jian Wushuang and his companions could surpass themselves at the Great Realm King’s place and even reach the level of Universe God, they would still not be a match for Xilu.","The best solution now was to kill Lan Yan and Lan Shui, preventing Xilu from becoming complete.","Or they could directly kill Xilu right now.","Unfortunately, Blu couldn’t do it.","Let alone killing Xilu, it was difficult for him even to kill Lan Yan.","At this moment, Lan Yan, recovering from his fear, frowned and said, “Is this guy also with","Jian Wushuang’s group?”","“You don’t recognize him?” This time, it was Blu who was surprised.","He didn’t expect Lan Yan not to know Xilu.","Suddenly, he understood.","Metallic life forms were created by absorbing the life force of Wanliu.","Xilu was created from the power of blood; they were two different types of beings. Though created by the same person, it was normal for them not to know each other.","With this realization, he had an idea.","“Should I know this ugly fellow?” Lan Yan retorted, finding Blu’s question strange. “Lan Yan, let’s cooperate!” Blu opened up and directly revealed Xilu’s identity.","He was here to absorb the powers of both Lan Yan and Lan Shui.","They might as well cooperate, kill Xilu first, and then continue their fight.","Upon hearing this, Lan Yan sneered, “Why don’t you two attack together? I’d like to see how strong he really is.”","Although he felt that Xilu was terrifying, the divine power aura he sensed wasn’t that strong. He might not necessarily be his opponent.","“Foolish!” Blu cursed inwardly, thinking Lan Yan was too arrogant and couldn’t see Xilu’s","true strength.","This wasn’t a fight that could be won one-on-one.","“Tsk tsk, interesting. Blu, why don’t you help me defeat these two metallic life forms? Then, I might spare your life!” Xilu turned to Blu.","He wasn’t joking; he genuinely considered it because Lan Tian was a threat to him, while Lan Yan and Lan Shui were insignificant.","Blu only sneered at this and clenched his fist. Suddenly, he turned and gathered an energy wave in one hand, releasing it in the direction of Lan Tian and Lan Shui.","The ground trembled with the force of the attack.","Caught off guard by the sudden attack, Lan Shui was stunned, but Lan Tian stepped forward,","catching the energy wave with one hand without budging an inch.","Then he started walking towards Xilu.","As he walked, he said, “Lan Yan, take Lan Shui and escape quickly!”","“Escape?” Lan Yan scoffed, “You’ve got it wrong. They should be the ones running. We have","the advantage, three against two.”","“Blu is helping you!” Lan Tian corrected, “Xilu is stronger than you. Even I would have a hard time taking him down. You’d better stay far away!”","Upon hearing this, Blu was the first to retreat.","His earlier attack was meant to force Lan Tian and Lan Shui to join forces and attack Xilu","together.","Xilu wasn’t foolish either. He raised his arm and pointed a finger, and a beam of light shot from his fingertip, piercing Blu’s chest in an instant.","“Pfft!”","With just one strike, Blu was severely injured.","At this moment, Lan Yan realized something was wrong but still braced himself to stay.","Seeing that he couldn’t persuade him, Lan Tian stopped talking and walked alone towards","Xilu.","“Big guy, you can’t handle it. Let me take care of it!” Just as Lan Yan was about to intervene, he was stunned by the next scene.","In a flash, Lan Tian reached Xilu and sent him flying with a single punch.","Lan Tian’s figure flickered as he struck again, grabbing Xilu’s two wings and tearing them","apart brutally.","A huge gash appeared instantly.","“Ahhhhh!”"]},{"number":6188,"title":"Chapter 6188: Terminator, Lan Tian","paragraphs":["Chapter 6188: Terminator, Lan Tian","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Lan Tian shouted angrily, his mouth bursting with multicolored light, and powerful divine power shot into the sky. At that moment, Lan Tian’s divine power surpassed two stars.","That was 200 million in divine power.","The powerful impact poured into Xilu’s body, causing Xilu to swell continuously. After swelling to a monstrous appearance, Xilu exploded completely.","Fragments scattered all over the ground.","Lan Tian panted heavily, turned to look at Lan Yan, and said, “Take Lan Shui and leave quickly. Killing Jian Wushuang is your task, don’t worry about me!”","“No rush, this monster is already heavily injured and poses no threat to me now!”","Although initially shocked, he remained somewhat arrogant, believing that the heavily injured Xilu posed no threat to him.","He then glanced at Blu and said, “Still charging up? Don’t rush. After I kill this monster, it’ll be your turn!”","“Ignorant!” Blu continued to gather divine power in his single arm, which had already accumulated 180 million divine power.","However, this was not for the metal life form, but to completely kill Xilu.","Compared to Xilu, these metal life forms were much more adorable.","He would rather die at the hands of a metal life form than let Xilu live.","He wanted to give Xilu everything he had.","Hopefully, a single blow would kill him completely.","“Crash!”","The shattered Xilu reformed again.","But his divine power had significantly decreased.","“You actually managed to hurt me!” Xilu looked incredulous. After arriving on Realm God Continent, he had absorbed countless cultivators and even a Universe God.","He then began searching for metal life forms everywhere.","He knew the metal life forms’ target was Jian Wushuang, so he waited in the Star Field of the Gods, looking for an opportunity.","He knew Lan Yan and Lan Shui’s strength well.","But he hadn’t expected this big guy to be so powerful.","“Xilu, I am your terminator, Lan Tian!”","“Ha!”","Lan Tian’s divine power erupted again. His fists shot out like galloping lions, piercing through the entire mountain range.","Lan Yan and Lan Shui were dumbfounded by the scene.","Even Blu was greatly surprised.","The condensed divine power also paused.","At this moment, it seemed like he wasn’t needed anymore.","Boom!","The divine body of Xilu, shattered again, crawled out of the rubble with difficulty.","Wiping the blood from the corner of his mouth, he moved his broken arm, shouted angrily, and instantly restored his peak physical form.","His divine power had not decreased much.","“Big black guy, I don’t have your information. It seems you’re a crude product!”","Lan Tian replied coldly, “My goal is different from yours. You are here to kill Jian Wushuang, while I am here to end monsters that shouldn’t belong in this world!”","“Oh?” Xilu sneered at this, “So, you were created to kill me?”","“You can think of it that way!”","Lan Tian clenched his fists, ready to strike again.","But this time, Xilu didn’t give him the chance. His figure flashed and rushed towards Lan Yan.","“Not good!!!”","Xilu’s speed was extremely fast, surpassing Lan Tian, who couldn’t stop him.","“This useless guy.” Blu gritted his teeth. He had thought he wouldn’t need to take action, but Xilu’s sudden burst of speed was hard to contain.","In the end, he had to act.","“Xilu!”","He shouted angrily, his single arm trembling, a beam of light shooting skyward.","It rushed straight at Xilu.","The divine power it contained reached the level of a two-star Universe God.","Even if it couldn’t kill Xilu, it would heavily injure him.","“You...”","Xilu looked shocked. Just as the beam was about to hit him, he grinned.","They had been tricked.","Both Blu and Lan Tian had been tricked.","The beam pierced through Xilu, but Lan Yan was still absorbed.","Because the Xilu they saw was just a clone.","Xilu had been plotting since the fight with Lan Tian.","Using the shattered divine body to reshape a clone.","It was to attract Blu’s attack.","Xilu wasn’t a fool. He had noticed Blu’s situation long ago.","Lan Tian was also a difficult opponent. Without using some strategy, success would be hard to achieve.","“Haha, you can’t stop me!”","He laughed maniacally as Lan Yan struggled, eventually being absorbed into his body.","Buzz!","A powerful aura began to spread.","The surrounding rubble vibrated.","“It’s over!” Blu’s face was ashen.","Initially, they thought they had this in the bag, not expecting the metal lifeform to be so strong. Then Zamasu appeared, but luckily, Lan Tian was able to hold him off.","Unfortunately, those two idiots, Lan Yan and Lan Shui, refused to flee and insisted on watching from the side.","And now look at what happened.","Lan Yan was absorbed.","Zamasu’s power surged.","Even if they all attacked together, there was probably no hope of survival.","“I’m sorry for disappointing you all!” Blu slumped to the ground, his divine power completely drained.","Lan Tian stood on the other side, his expression unreadable.","But it was clear he too was on the brink of despair.","He turned and shouted at Lan Shui, “Run, flee deeper into the Star Field of the Gods!”","“But what about you?” Lan Shui was still worried about Lan Tian.","This warmed Lan Tian’s heart, but he then spoke with a serious tone, “My fate is here. I won’t leave.”","“Take care!”","After saying that, Lan Shui disregarded everything and flew towards the depths of the Star Field of the Gods.","Meanwhile, the changes in Zamasu continued.","It wasn’t just his divine power that transformed dramatically; even his appearance changed.","Originally gaunt, he now became even more robust.","“Ha!”","With a roar, Zamasu’s evolution was complete.","His divine power reached 270 million.","An increase of nearly 100 million in divine power.","If he were a Universe God, he would have gained an additional star on his chest.","The current Zamasu was barely considered a three-star Universe God.","With such strength, he could easily sweep through ordinary star fields.","“Trying to escape?”","The evolved Zamasu took a light step forward, causing the space stewardess to shatter instantly.","Just as he was about to move to give chase, Lan Tian stepped out again.","“Zamasu, you cannot leave!”","“Oh?” Zamasu sneered, “Do you have such a big mouth?”","...","On the small island of the Great Realm King.","Jian Wushuang and the others watched this scene, unable to help but gasp.","“So strong!” Wu Zuo shook his head and said, “I feel like I can never reach that level in this lifetime. The enemy we encountered this time is beyond my ability to participate!”","After speaking, he couldn’t help but sigh.","Before returning to Qishen Temple, he thought he was the protagonist. Later, the power of Miesheng made him realize the reality.","He felt he wasn’t the protagonist; at best, he was a supporting character.","He had even become a Ninth Tribulation early on.","Unexpectedly, this time, he might not even have the ability to watch the battle.","A quasi-three-star Universe God.","It wasn’t just Wu Zuo; even Wu Li and Divine Wood King couldn’t surpass that level.","Only Jian Wushuang and Hui Qing could.","“Don’t be disheartened. Not being able to surpass them now doesn’t mean you can’t in the future!” Jian Wushuang comforted everyone."]},{"number":6189,"title":"Chapter 6189: Saving People","paragraphs":["Chapter 6189: Saving People","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In truth, he didn’t have much confidence in his heart.","He was currently only at the Eighth Tribulation.","The gap was too vast; trying to achieve the combat power of universe at the Eighth Tribulation was incredibly difficult, let alone reaching the level of a three-star Universe God.","Currently, the only thing he could improve upon at the Eighth Tribulation was his Origin Source, increasing it to the extent of enduring Tribulation, roughly tripling it.","That meant three miniature spacetime rivers.","With the increase in Origin Source power, his Starry Sky Chronicless and the fifth sword?move might be able to kill a weaker Universe God.","But this was far from sufficient.","He had to become the Ninth Tribulation!","Upon reaching the Ninth Tribulation, his fundamental divine power would first surge dramatically.","He could also venture into the Starry Sky Secret Realm to obtain some treasures.","At the Ninth Tribulation, the fundamental divine power increased the most dramatically, at least 80 million.","Perhaps even 90 million.","By then, with the cooperation of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Dao Arena’s amplification, he might be able to put up a fight.","The Beast God Weapon!","The Extreme Freedom Intent Technique!","He wasn’t sure how much these two would amplify.","He did not dwell on it.","In short, he only had hope of doing these things if he reached the Ninth Tribulation.","“I don’t even know if the Great Realm King’s method of improvement will work for me!” Jian Wushuang thought anxiously.","It would be best if he could directly endure the Tribulation and become the Ninth Tribulation.","Time passed minute by minute.","In the crystal ball, Zamasu was ravaging Lan Tian.","There was no way around it; the gap was too large.","“Huiqing, hurry up a bit more!”","If Lan Tian couldn’t hold on, Blu would be in danger.","“It seems I have to make a trip!”","He couldn’t just watch Blu stay there and wait for death.","Since the metal lifeforms were now preoccupied, there was no need to let Blu stay there as a shield.","“Brother Wushuang, you’re going now?”","Wu Li stepped in to stop him, saying, “Going now is no different from seeking death. Don’t forget, Zamasu’s target is you!”","Indeed, both Zamasu and the metal lifeforms were there for Jian Wushuang.","Going now was akin to seeking death, wasn’t it?","“I have the Illusory Sky; I can take Blu away!” Jian Wushuang reassured them. Seeing that they were still trying to stop him, he looked at Wu Li and said, “You know I promised something back then!”","Wu Li paused at his words and then stopped trying to dissuade him.","Back on the Dragon God Continent.","Jian Wushuang had promised the Grand Elder to protect Blu and Danbao.","Later, when Danbao became a god, he thought he was no longer needed.","But this time, due to the appearance of the metal lifeforms, not only had Danbao abandoned his divine body, but Blu was also in mortal danger.","He felt deeply guilty about it.","If he let it go this time, he wouldn’t be able to endure the Tribulation.","His mindset would be affected.","No matter what, he had to go.","Seeing this, everyone else stopped trying to persuade him.","“Don’t worry, I’ll be back soon!” After saying this, he took out the divine artifact Illusory Sky, tore open a spacetime rift, and disappeared from sight.","The distance to the edge of the Star Field of the Gods wasn’t too far.","A few breaths, and he would arrive.","Lan Tian still had some breath left and could hold on for a while longer.","But fighting was impossible now.","Lan Tian’s divine body had been crippled.","Exposing mechanical bones.","The divine power drive was damaged, leaving him without any combat power.","Yet, relying on his strong physical body, he still clung to Zamasu.","“Damned bastard, do you think this can stop me?”","Zamasu sneered disdainfully.","He punched Lan Tian’s head.","With a powerful divine force, he directly shattered half of Lan Tian’s head.","“Get lost!”","Despite this, he couldn’t shake off Lan Tian. Zamasu was also enraged.","By now, Lan Shui had already escaped far away.","Although Zamasu could always sense Lan Shui’s position, he was still worried about encountering any unforeseen circumstances.","He was about to thoroughly understand Lan Tian.","Just as he was about to take action.","A beam of light suddenly struck at the speed of light.","Xilu raised his hand and blocked it.","The power of this beam was very weak, not even reaching the level of a Universe God. For Xilu now, it posed no threat at all.","He just felt very annoyed at being ambushed.","“Tsk tsk, don’t be in a hurry, your turn will come soon!” Xilu sneered, preparing to deliver the final blow to Lan Tian.","Blu had already collapsed from exhaustion, devoid of hope.","No one could...","Buzz!","The surrounding spacetime instantly shattered.","A figure appeared in the sky above.","Xilu, who was about to strike, stopped.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, he was a little surprised, but upon probing, he found that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was even less than that of a Universe God. He chuckled, “Another one here to die!”","Jian Wushuang ignored Xilu and flashed to Blu’s side.","After grabbing the unconscious Blu with one hand, he turned to look at Xilu.","“Xilu, if you have the guts, wait for one hour, someone will come to deal with you!”","Hu Qing was almost out; perhaps then he could fight Xilu.","“Someone’s coming?” Xilu was surprised. “You have help? Not planning to die yourself?”","“Don’t be in a hurry. Do you dare to give me a few days’ time?”","Jian Wushuang stood in the wind, his hair dancing.","He wasn’t bragging. If given a few days, he had hope of fighting Xilu.","“Haha!”","Xilu laughed, “A few days? Do you think in a few days you can become a Universe God!”","It was like he was talking in his sleep, making Xilu laugh out loud.","“To deal with you, there’s no need for a Universe God!”","His deliberate provocation made Xilu frown.","It wasn’t because of the verbal provocation making him uncomfortable. At this level, he no longer cared about such things.","But he was curious how Jian Wushuang, who didn’t even have Universe God combat power, dared to speak to him so easily.","Was he not afraid that Xilu would strike now?","No one here could stop him!","Thinking of this, his eyebrows moved as he thought of something.","“Too late!”","Jian Wushuang sneered, tearing open the spacetime and disappearing with Blu.","Originally, he planned to leave right after finding Blu.","But upon arrival, he received a message from Lan Tian.","Lan Tian hoped he could stall Xilu for some time.","That’s why he spoke so much to Xilu.","With his personality, he wouldn’t boast or risk staying when he lacked strength.","It was all because of Lan Tian.","Inside Lan Tian was a strand of destructive material.","Once detonated, it could destroy a star field.","This was his trump card, but it needed some time to activate.","Just now, Jian Wushuang was merely stalling for time.","Now that Xilu noticed, he could naturally leave. What remained was up to fate!","Even if it couldn’t kill Xilu, it could seriously injure him.","Swish!","Back on the Great Realm King’s island, he finally breathed a sigh of relief, fearing Lan Tian couldn’t hold off Xilu.","Here, he felt somewhat safe.","Then he hurriedly looked at the crystal ball.","“How is it? Is Xilu dead?”","Wu Li blinked and hesitated, “It seems... not completely dead!”","Through the crystal ball, they could see a constant flicker of dark light, with Xilu’s figure within it."]},{"number":6190,"title":"Chapter 6190: I’ve Transcended the Divine Tribulation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6190: I’ve Transcended the Divine Tribulation!","It was indeed impossible to discern life or death.","The tremendous commotion soon reached this place.","Even with the restrictions in place, a muffled thunder could still be heard.","“Too terrifying!”","Everyone gasped in shock.","Even Jian Wushuang was sweating coldly, grateful for his quick escape.","Otherwise, if he had been even slightly contaminated, he would have perished.","As they watched the crystal ball, the door of the wooden house opened.","Hu Qing, with a resolute gaze, walked out calmly.","Seeing Hu Qing emerge, Jian Wushuang turned his head in surprise and exclaimed, “So soon!”","He had expected it to take more time and hadn’t anticipated Hu Qing’s swift exit.","It was just the right moment to go and finish off Xilu.","“Just a stroke of luck!” Hu Qing’s demeanor and aura had changed considerably.","Once gentle, he was now icy cold.","He had an air of being unapproachable.","“How is your strength?” Wu Zuo hurriedly approached, eager to gauge how much Hu Qing’s power had increased.","Hu Qing replied calmly, “I have transcended the Divine Tribulation!”","Buzz!","Everyone was stunned.","He had transcended the Divine Tribulation?","This was incredible.","Having transcended the Divine Tribulation meant he had become a Universe God.","Was Hu Qing now a Universe God?","Jian Wushuang was also taken aback but quickly understood. Hu Qing had already reached the peak of the Ninth Tribulation stage, with divine power comparable to a Universe God.","Now, with the guidance and enhancement from the Great Realm King, transcending the Divine Tribulation didn’t seem so difficult.","While it sounded easy, only Hu Qing knew how challenging it was.","His personality and temperament had changed, suggesting he had been through a lot.","“Tell me the location of the metallic life forms. It’s time to deal with them!”","“There’s no need for that!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Hu Qing, the situation has changed. Xilu has appeared!”","In just one day, they had faced three waves of enemies.","First, it was Galo and his metallic life forms.","Then, Lan Yan and Lan Shui.","Lastly, Xilu.","Each time, the opponents grew stronger.","Their own strength continuously surpassed previous limits.","First, Blu and Danbao’s physical fusion elevated them to the level of Universe Gods.","Then, Hu Qing transcended the Divine Tribulation, and his current aura seemed no weaker than Xilu’s.","It was another qualitative leap.","Without opponents, they had been confined to Northern Spacetime for millions of eras, with limited growth in strength.","Yet now, in just one day, their power had multiplied several times over.","Having opponents was truly beneficial!","Although the pressure was immense, the results were evident!","This increase in strength might even surpass the Academy of the Gods.","Moreover, the greatest promise of the Academy of the Gods was to become a deity.","In the blink of an eye, Hu Qing had achieved it.","And he became an exceptionally powerful Universe God. The only question remaining was how many stars he possessed.","“Xilu?” Hu Qing’s eyes flickered as he clenched his fist.","“Last time, he escaped from my grasp. This time, he won’t get another chance!”","Back in the Northern Spacetime, it was indeed Hu Qing’s hesitation that allowed the opponent","to escape.","This time, the encounter with his nemesis made his eyes blaze with intense anger.","“We still need to be cautious. Xilu now possesses the combat power of a quasi-three-star Universe God.”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat uneasy.","He had witnessed Xilu’s terrifying aura before.","“Come quickly, Xilu has appeared!”","“Hm?”","Hu Qing’s gaze followed the direction indicated.","In the crystal ball, Xilu’s figure appeared.","Lan Tian had already perished.","However, Xilu remained unharmed.","A green glow emanated from his body.","That was the power of life.","He was continuously restoring his divine body.","“He has mastered the power of life, and it’s so abundant that he recovers this quickly!”","“That’s normal. Don’t forget who created that thing. It was a metallic lifeform from the","Wanliu Divine Tree.”","Wu Li nodded slightly. “Indeed.”","“Hu Qing, act quickly. We can’t give him a chance to catch his breath. Lan Shui hasn’t been","absorbed yet. If Xilu becomes complete, it will be a true disaster!”","Now, Xilu was already so strong just by absorbing Lan Yan.","Once he became complete, how powerful would he be?","It was unimaginable.","He had to be eliminated as soon as possible.","“Complete?” Hu Qing sneered, a hint of disdain in his expression. “I want to see just how strong he will be in his complete form!”","With that, he casually tore through spacetime and instantly disappeared from the spot. After Hu Qing left, Wu Zuo remarked in surprise, “Hu Qing has changed so much!” “That’s normal. There’s a significant difference between a Universe God and a Universe Master. It’s inevitable that one’s personality changes after becoming a Universe God.” “But this change is too drastic!” Wu Li couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise. Although he hadn’t met Hu Qing many times, he could see how much Hu Qing had changed.","“Forget it, let’s not talk about that. Who’s next to go in?”","Jian Wushuang changed the topic. Improving their strength was the most important thing","right now.","Even if Hu Qing successfully killed Xilu, they still needed to cultivate.","They couldn’t waste this excellent opportunity.","“You go first. I don’t have much confidence. The gap to becoming a Universe God is too","great!” Wu Zuo sighed.","Wu Li and the King of the Divine Tree felt the same.","They had already reached their limits. Even with the Great Realm King’s help, they could only","increase their divine power by ten or twenty million at most, reaching a state comparable to a","Universe God.","Breaking through to become a Universe God was not something that could be achieved with","just a simple opportunity.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Then I’ll go in first!”","After all, only a day would pass in the outside world.","They could afford to wait.","“Go ahead. I hope you can also become a Universe God in one fell swoop!”","“Thanks for the good wishes!” Jian Wushuang smiled.","If he could become a Universe God, that would be ideal.","This time, he aimed to reach the Ninth Tribulation Realm.","He stepped into the wooden house.","Immediately, the surroundings spun wildly.","After a moment, a white world appeared before his eyes.","“Here I am.”","“Hm?” Jian Wushuang looked up and saw the Great Realm King’s figure, standing in mid-air.","“Great Realm King Senior!”","The Great Realm King, with his hands behind his back, said calmly, “No need for formalities. In this place, everything depends on you. I can only guide you in your realm and provide you with treasures. I’ve observed that your Origin Source is very special. I might not even be able to guide you. Just tell me what treasures you need!”","“The Origin Source of the Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang said enthusiastically. “As much as possible!”","His realm was indeed very high.","He had even reached the level of a Universe God, and a very powerful one at that.","With enough Origin Source of the Starry Sky, he could even reach the perfection of the Ninth","Tribulation Realm.","He had that confidence; he just feared that the opponent’s Origin Source of the Starry Sky","wouldn’t be enough.","“Can you handle it?” The Great Realm King was taken aback. He hadn’t expected Jian","Wushuang to have such a large appetite.","Jian Wushuang didn’t bother to hide anything.","He directly revealed his Origin Universe.","Nine ultimate universes appeared, connected in a line.","The ultimate power emanated from them.","Among them, the Origin Universe pulsed with blue light.","This was the Starry Sky Universe.","The most powerful universe. Once connected in a line, it formed the Starry Sky River.","Illuminating the entire starry sky, this world would gain a second starry sky. This was Jian Wushuang’s current scope."]},{"number":6191,"title":"Chapter 6191: Starry Sky Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 6191: Starry Sky Origin","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Embarking on this path, he knew what it entailed.","He remembered the words Weiss had spoken back then.","“Great Realm King, you should know that the so-called Universe God is merely a universe that has reached its end. The path I will take is the path of the Starry Sky!”","The ultimate great evolution of the Universe God could expand infinitely.","But such a universe was chaotic.","Jian Wushuang would not take that path.","He was going to walk the perfect path of the Starry Sky.","Saying that it was unprecedented might be an exaggeration.","After all, there was still a perfect Starry Sky existing today.","The Great Realm King gasped, exclaiming, “Of course I know that the Universe God takes the path of chaotic expansion. If I’m not mistaken, you are walking the extreme path of the Starry Sky!”","“That’s right, I believe that the ultimate universe is inferior to perfection, it’s better to develop the Starry Sky, which can carry more!”","Jian Wushuang had already experienced the end of the universe.","Since mastering the extreme path and entering the Starry Sky, he had found his own path.","Creating a magnificent Starry Sky.","That was the goal.","To let the land of the infinite, or the land of chaos, give birth to a second Starry Sky.","Currently, it was unknown whether there was a second Starry Sky in the land of chaos.","He couldn’t guarantee it would be the second, but he was certain that he would be the next creator of a Starry Sky.","“Jian Wushuang, have you considered how difficult this path is?” The Great Realm King couldn’t bear to say, “The chaotic universe may have its drawbacks, but the power increase is very rapid. You might become a new Realm King, or even a Realm King God. With your talent, no less than the previous Realm King God, you have the potential to create your own Realm King Continent in the Starry Sky!”","Jian Wushuang was moved. He hadn’t expected such secrets behind the Realm King Continent.","Seeing his surprise, the Great Realm King continued, “The periphery of the Starry Sky initially didn’t have the long river of spacetime. It wasn’t until the appearance of the four spacetime gods, the Realm King Gods, that the long river of spacetime began to surround the Starry Sky. Later, the Great Realm King appeared and created the Realm King Continent. They didn’t take the ultimate path of the universe!”","A brand-new path.","From the ultimate expansion of the universe to the appearance of the long river of spacetime.","It was a qualitative change.","Now, Jian Wushuang wanted to go from spacetime to the Starry Sky.","It was also a qualitative change.","The appearance of the Great Realm King led to the emergence of the Realm King Gods, the spacetime gods.","That’s why Zamasu was so arrogant.","“Jian Wushuang, if you want to take this path, I won’t stop you, because you are a pioneer. Even if you fail, you’ll have done justice to your talent!”","These words were an encouragement to Jian Wushuang.","Even if he failed in the future, he would have paved part of the way for those who followed.","This was the charm of pioneering a path.","Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","“I have no regrets!”","With these words, he solidified his path.","The Great Realm King said nothing more. He immediately made a gesture, and a blue space appeared.","“This is the path to the Origin Source of the Starry Sky. There, you will find the Starry Sky power you need, as much as you want. But you need enough strength to obtain it; this is something I cannot help with!”","“This is more than enough!” Jian Wushuang bowed slightly. Giving him a path to obtain the Starry Sky Origin Source was already very generous.","After speaking, he stepped into the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Whoosh!","His entire body seemed to enter another space.","The surrounding space was more stable, and the gravity was many times stronger than on the Realm King Continent.","“The Origin Source of the Starry Sky, could this really be the source of the Starry Sky?” Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised. If it was truly the Origin Source, then indeed, as much Starry Sky Origin Source as he needed, he could get.","Even reaching the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation realm or undergoing the divine tribulation wouldn’t be a problem.","“The Nine Tribulation Tower?”","Upon entering this Starry Sky Origin Source, he saw the Nine Tribulations Tower again.","It was exactly like the one he had obtained before.","But back then, Weiss had taken it away.","He hadn’t expected to see it again.","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred as he thought, “Could it be possible to see Weiss again?”","Seeing the Nine Tribulations Tower, he understood what needed to be done.","To obtain the Origin Source of the Starry Sky, he needed to pass through this Nine Tribulations Tower.","Back when he was still an Emperor, he had barely managed to pass the first level.","Entering again this time, he wasn’t sure if he could pass all nine levels.","“Swish!”","With one step, he directly entered the Nine Tribulations Tower.","This place was different from when he had first entered.","There were carvings all around.","It looked like the Starry Sky, as he had never seen such a colorful decoration.","It must have come from Starry Sky civilization.","Crash!","As soon as he entered, a masked person appeared on the first level.","But it was different from the masked Weiss he encountered back then.","After all, Weiss was a Star Spirit and wouldn’t permanently reside in the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Back then, Weiss appeared in the Northern Spacetime because of the matter of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate either. He clasped his hands and shouted, “Ha!”","Divine power erupted instantly.","In the blink of an eye, he passed the first level.","Then came the second level.","He didn’t feel any pressure until he reached the eighth level.","The opponent on the eighth level was the same, but the divine power was different.","The divine power used was from the Starry Sky, and it wasn’t overly exaggerated.","The eighth level only required thirty million divine power, which was the limit for someone at the Eighth Tribulation.","However, the masked person used the art of Free Intent, which made Jian Wushuang quite troubled. Even though his divine power was much higher, defeating the opponent was difficult.","Through continuous attempts, he slowly comprehended the wonders of Free Intent.","After such a long time of comprehension, he finally reached the entry-level stage.","Gradually, he began to enter his own Free Intent.","His body technique was extremely exquisite. For practice, he even suppressed his divine power.","He maintained his divine power at the same level as the masked person.","Just fighting on the eighth level took him ten years.","His Free Intent completely reached the entry-level stage.","Even at the entry level, Jian Wushuang could use thirty million divine power to fight against a strong opponent with fifty million divine power without being at a disadvantage.","If it were a peak duel,","his ninety million divine power could completely rival a Universe God.","Although there was no substantial increase in divine power, his combat power increased.","This was more terrifying than increasing divine power.","Because the opponent couldn’t grasp his depth.","Free Intent was divided into entry, minor completion, major completion, peak, perfect, and ultimate.","Just reaching entry could increase combat power so much.","The future was unimaginable.","“The ninth level!”","Swish!","Currently, he was only at the Eighth Tribulation. He didn’t know if he could enter the ninth level.","After the teleportation,","the surroundings didn’t change.","“Unexpectedly, I can!”","This was the same as the previous teleportation.","After passing the first eight levels, he hadn’t obtained any Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","It seemed that one had to pass the entire Nine Tribulations Tower to obtain the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","After reaching the ninth level,","his opponent was a masked person with the combat power of a Universe God.","Jian Wushuang just happened to lack a sparring partner.","With his eyesight, he could tell that the masked person on the ninth level had only 80 million divine power."]},{"number":6192,"title":"Chapter 6192: Guessing About the Great Yan Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6192: Guessing About the Great Yan Domain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, it could unleash divine power of 130 million.","This was no longer a simple entry-level achievement.","It had definitely reached the minor success stage.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t have increased so much.","Jian Wushuang’s current peak divine power was only 90 million.","With the addition of the increased battle power from his Extreme Freedom Intent Technique, it barely reached 120 million.","But he also had the Starry Sky Chronicles.","The swordsmanship blessed by the Origin Source.","It was no less powerful than the Selfless Intent Technique and could also be used to fight across levels.","The sword intent, surpassing his current strength, surged.","The Fifth Sword!","“Reincarnation of Time and Space!”","Clang!","...","Despite this, he still stayed in the ninth level for a full thousand years before coming out.","“Passed!”","The thousand years of battle had greatly enhanced his Selfless Intent Technique and had brought the Starry Sky Chronicles to its peak at the fifth level.","When he reached the perfection of the Ninth Tribulation, he might be able to perform the Sixth Sword.","Even immortals could be defeated!","Or rather, even gods could be slain.","That sword was the essence of the Starry Sky Chronicles.","There were four swords among them that he had not yet comprehended.","The Sixth Sword had only been slightly performed when he fused with Hu Qing.","He still didn’t know which path needed to be improved.","Reincarnation of Time and Space.","It contained four paths.","Life, Death, Time, Space.","Mastering them all was the Reincarnation of Time and Space.","With the four major Origin Sources blessing the swordsmanship, the Fifth Sword had such terrifying power.","Actually, it could be considered as five Origin Sources.","There was also Sword Dao.","But swordsmanship also belonged to time and space.","It could be considered a prominent minor Dao.","It couldn’t compare to the great Dao.","Jian Wushuang had forcibly elevated swordsmanship to a level it didn’t belong to.","The Origin Source of Life didn’t need much explanation; every life contained it, which was the great path.","Death was the same.","Spacetime carried all living things.","These four paths, whichever one was cultivated, could lead to becoming a Universe God.","Take space as an example; when one perfected the Origin Source of Space at the level of Emperor, one could undergo tribulation to condense the universe space.","Reaching the extreme was becoming a Universe God.","Space was chaotic and infinitely expansive.","“Perhaps the Great Yan Domain was left by a Universe God, its chaotic expansion penetrated the Northern Spacetime!”","Otherwise, he truly couldn’t create a universe comparable to the Great Yan Domain.","In that universe, it even nurtured countless worlds.","Unfortunately, it couldn’t be found.","He didn’t know if Miesheng had hidden it or voluntarily separated it.","He would still seek it out if he had the chance in the future.","Beyond time and space was the place of infinite chaos.","If the Great Yan Domain expanded there, it would be an independent universe.","It wouldn’t be within the Starry Sky.","“Whew!”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but take a deep breath.","He didn’t know how Teacher Xuan Yi had found that universe.","As far as he knew, only Xuan Yi could enter at will.","And the Old Master.","This mystery puzzled him for a long time, so much so that he later took a trip to the Northern Spacetime, looking through the worlds before and after time.","Only then did he feel relieved.","Perhaps it was just a time discrepancy.","That was why these unsolved mysteries were left.","After passing the Nine Tribulation Tower, he was transported back to the Origin of the Starry Sky.","But this time, a higher tower appeared before him.","The tower had five levels: Universe, Spacetime, Starry Sky, Chaos!","But the fifth level had no plaque.","There was no name labeled.","But the first four levels still stunned Jian Wushuang.","He had the universe!","Time and space were still far off.","The Starry Sky was even more exaggerated.","As for chaos, it represented the chaotic and infinite place beyond the world.","That was even more absurd.","Now, there was a fifth layer.","The doubts in his heart immediately surfaced.","Back then, when Weis brought out the Nine Tribulation Tower, he didn’t mention that there was another tower above it.","As he was confused, a boundary stone monument descended.","Boom!","It heavily smashed onto the ground.","Above it were rows of names inscribed.","Starry Sky Master!","Twelve Star Spirits!","Great Realm King!","There was no name after Starry Sky Master, or rather Jian Wushuang couldn’t see it.","After the Star Spirits, there were 12 names.","One of them was Weiss.","After the Great Realm King, there were 17 names.","These were the Great Realm Kings of past generations.","The first Realm King God “Ye.”","Famous with just a single character!","“This must be the person the Great Realm King mentioned, the ruthless figure who created spacetime in history!”","To be the first to create spacetime was already very impressive.","The current four great spacetimes and the Realm King Continent were all created by this powerful being.","There were many more Realm King Gods after him.","Since the creation of the Realm King Continent, dozens of Realm King Gods had been born.","There were even more Great Realm Kings compared to ordinary Realm Kings.","Only the Star Spirits above were eternal markers.","The first Star Spirit “Great Star Officer!”","This person was second to none and held immense power over countless people.","No one knew how much stronger he was compared to Weiss.","There were also Star Spirit Messengers who were not listed, but they surely possessed power, at least stronger than the Realm King Gods.","However, they were considered practitioners, not true gods.","After reading the names on the stone monument, Jian Wushuang realized why he was shown this stone monument.","Could it be that everyone listed had once ventured into this tower?","Jian Wushuang was somewhat puzzled; he came here for the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Having just passed the Nine Tribulation Tower, he had undergone nine Tribulations and obtained an ultimate cosmic Origin Source.","It contained the power of the Starry Sky.","In his Origin Starry Sky, an additional universe had appeared.","However, he was still far from crossing the tribulation.","He needed to continue challenging the Nine Tribulation Tower.","As for this tower, he couldn’t even find the door.","Calling out to the heavens was futile, and calling out to the earth was in vain.","He had no choice but to return to the Nine Tribulation Tower.","He needed to obtain enough Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Meanwhile, the battle outside had just begun.","After he entered the Time House, the Great Realm King couldn’t guide him and could only let the third person enter.","The third to enter was Blu.","Having just restored his divine body, he immediately began training.","He wanted to increase his strength.","Having just fused with Danbao’s divine avatar, he lasted less than a day, feeling guilty in his heart.","He had no heart to face Danbao.","He only wanted to enhance his divine power to resolve the issue with Xilu and the metal life forms.","Outside, only Hu Qing remained.","At this moment, he was rushing towards Xilu.","Lan Tian had died in battle, Lan Yan was absorbed.","Lan Shui was missing.","Xilu was rapidly heading towards the depths of the Star Field of the Gods, searching for Lan Shui.","Although the Star Field of the Gods had declined, its foundation remained.","Xilu didn’t dare to cause too much destruction while searching for Lan Shui.","Because ancient Realm King Gods of past generations still slumbered in this place.","In the Star Field of the Gods, the fallen land of the seventh generation Realm King.","Above a sea area.","Scattered small islands below could be clearly seen.","A cold figure now appeared above the sea surface.","It was Lan Shui, being chased by Xilu.","“Hmm?”","Lan Shui moved slightly, her brows furrowing.","“Why is there a restriction here?”","The path ahead was blocked by a restriction.","She couldn’t get through.","If she took a detour now, Xilu would surely catch up.","As she hesitated, a terrifying aura was rushing towards her."]},{"number":6193,"title":"Chapter 6193: Hu Qing vs Xilu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6193: Hu Qing vs Xilu","Lan Shui couldn’t manage much and had to first head to the small island below to hide.","Metallic lifeforms had no aura; only Xilu could sense them.","The aura just now came from the front, not from Xilu.","In the Star Field of the Gods, no matter whom one encounters, if they are stronger, it’s best to hide first.","As soon as Lan Shui landed in the bushes on the ground, she noticed a golden aura burst through the sky.","“Doesn’t that guy know there’s a prohibition here?” Lan Shui looked up, her heart shaking.","Within the golden aura, a black-clad figure directly broke through the barrier, causing the seawater below to surge.","“It’s him!”","Seeing the figure within the golden aura, Lan Shui was shocked.","It was Hu Qing, whom she had previously beaten up.","Now he had become so strong.","At least three billion divine power.","Even more terrifying than Xilu’s aura.","Fortunately, he couldn’t lock onto her; otherwise, it would be over.","Just as she was worrying, a terrifying green aura shot up from the sky behind. Xilu!","Seeing this, Lan Shui felt a burst of joy.","If Hu Qing encountered Xilu, a battle would ensue.","Then she could seize the opportunity to escape.","This day had brought too many surprises.","First, Blu’s divine power suddenly doubled, allowing him to fight Lan Yan to a draw.","Then Xilu appeared, absorbing Lan Yan and killing Lan Tian.","Now, seeing Hu Qing’s sudden increase in divine power by several times, she felt relieved.","She could now accept these monsters, for whom increasing power was as simple as drinking water.","Boom!","At this moment, in the sky, two super-strong figures met.","Xilu knew Hu Qing, and Hu Qing knew Xilu.","These two had a long-standing grudge.","Back in the Northern Spacetime, Hu Qing had almost killed Xilu.","This time, he wouldn’t let his opponent escape.","He wanted to avenge his past humiliation.","Xilu, on the other hand, sought revenge for being beaten back then.","“Long time no see!”","“It has been a while!”","Their conversation was like that of friends.","Both stood in the sky, staring at each other.","“It seems you’ve absorbed the metallic lifeforms and increased your power this much!” Hu Qing used his Thought power and sensed Xilu’s not insignificant strength.","Just as Blu said, he was already a quasi-three-star Universe God.","Xilu’s eyes flickered as he replied, “Still a bit short, but enough to deal with you now!”","“Then let’s get started!”","Hu Qing spread his hands, his aura surging, waiting for Xilu to make his move.","Swoosh!","Xilu didn’t have time to reminisce with Hu Qing; he needed to find Lan Shui quickly.","The aura he had locked onto was nearby.","He feared Hu Qing might kill Lan Shui, preventing him from becoming a complete entity.","He had to kill Hu Qing before finding Lan Shui.","Then, he would go and kill Jian Wushuang.","Then he would truly be free, and those guys in the Southern Spacetime wouldn’t be able to control him.","Boom!","He launched an all-out attack, using his full power of 275 million divine power.","He punched Hu Qing right in the face.","“Eh?”","After throwing that punch, he was stunned.","Hu Qing wasn’t affected at all.","He continued to stare at him with a cold smile.","“Is this all your strength?”","Hu Qing said disdainfully, “You disappoint me, Xilu!”","After speaking, he spun around and kicked Xilu into the sea below.","He followed up quickly, and the moment Xilu fell, he delivered a knee strike.","Xilu’s divine body instantly shattered.","Green liquid flowed from the corner of his mouth.","A series of attacks from Hu Qing almost crushed Xilu, leaving him no room to fight back.","“Show your strength!”","“Xilu!”","All the dissatisfaction from being tormented by the","life","was vented on Xilu.","Hu Qing grew stronger as the battle continued, now in the state of a three-star Universe God.","He clasped his hands together, and a massive light shadow appeared at the bottom of the sea.","Xilu’s face darkened; this strike could kill him.","“Impossible!”","Buzz!","A green protective shield appeared around Xilu.","“How are you this strong?”","“This is impossible. According to the previous information, you aren’t a Universe God!”","Half of Xilu’s body had been smashed.","Now he could only maintain the protective shield, hoping to withstand Hu Qing’s strike.","“Haha, this is my strength. Even if you don’t believe it, it can still do whatever it wants with","you!” Hu Qing raised one hand, and the entire light ball shot into the sky.","The seawater instantly evaporated, and everything around turned to ashes.","Lan Shui was also exposed.","She was still astonished by Hu Qing’s divine power, her eyes wide open.","The shock in her heart was indescribable.","In that moment of distraction,","Xilu looked over, his eyes filled with greed.","“Lan Shui!!!”","His eyes flashed, and he instantly rushed towards Lan Shui.","Hu Qing, however, sneered and attacked immediately.","He threw the huge energy ball in his hand.","The speed was so fast it surpassed time.","This was the battle power of a Universe God.","Before Xilu could get close to Lan Shui, he felt an unprecedented threat.","The protective shield only lasted for a moment before cracks appeared.","He couldn’t move at all.","Xilu was almost going crazy.","Lan Shui was right in front of him, yet he couldn’t reach her.","On the Great Realm King’s island, Wu Zuo and others watching the battle cheered excitedly.","“Good! Good! Good!”","“This time, we don’t need to take action. Hu Qing can handle it alone!”","Wu Li, however, said reluctantly, “Alas, it seems I won’t have the chance to show my face this","time!”","“What chance do you have, to go out and die?”","“Lan Shui can crush you with one hand. What’s the use of saying that!”","King Shenmu, who had at least once been a king, disdainfully concealed himself like Wu Zuo","and Wu Li.","He just felt that over the years, he had fallen behind too much.","Even without Xilu’s threat, he needed to go in and train.","To catch up with Hu Qing and Blu.","“Stop pretending. Xilu’s death benefits us all. Just watch Hu Qing’s performance honestly!”","...","It really couldn’t be called a performance.","Because at this moment, Xilu had already turned into dust.","Only a piece of metal in his brain was left.","It hadn’t shattered yet.","Proving he hadn’t truly fallen.","In a split second, Xilu recovered his form again.","However, his divine power had already dropped to the lowest point, just one billion divine","power.","The lowest point for a Universe God.","He clenched his fists unwillingly, wanting to erupt.","But there was no change in his breath.","He completely withered away.","“Hu Qing, you should die. Every time you come out and cause trouble at my last step!”","“I have no grudge against you. Why do you target me!”","Xilu roared helplessly and furiously.","He looked up and roared to the sky.","He turned to glance at Lan Shui, who couldn’t get up. His eyes were filled with greed.","He had completely gone mad, rushing towards Lan Shui regardless.","Hu Qing’s previous strike had severely injured Lan Shui.","She was lying there, this was his last chance.","But as soon as he took a step,","Hu Qing flashed behind him and kicked him directly in front of Lan Shui."]},{"number":6194,"title":"Chapter 6194: The Conceited Hu Qing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6194: The Conceited Hu Qing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I...” Xilu struggled to get up, a peak spike behind him, ready to stab Lan Shui.","He still didn’t want to give up.","Hu Qing shook his head and sneered, “She is mine!”","With that, he kicked Xilu to the side, stepping hard on Xilu’s forehead and said, “I gave you a chance before, but you couldn’t grasp it. When we got to the Realm King Continent, I could still kill you!”","“This is your fate, destined to never be my match in this life!”","Since coming out of seclusion, Hu Qing in black had undergone a tremendous change in personality.","Even Xilu was very shocked at why Hu Qing had become so arrogant now.","Although he was somewhat arrogant before, at least he wouldn’t say it out loud!","The current Hu Qing indeed seemed a bit unfamiliar.","This was all related to the Tribulation.","Xilu still wasn’t resigned, shouting, “Just a bit more, if I became complete, you would surely die, definitely not my match!”","“You just got lucky!”","“Kill me then, but I will never be convinced, even if I fall!”","Xilu still stubbornly resisted.","Hu Qing’s eyes shifted, staring at Xilu under his foot, “Do you think I would care for something at my feet?”","With that, he kicked Xilu away.","“Just a waste, given so many chances, still useless. You don’t have another chance to stay!”","Killing Xilu was to settle the mistake made in the Northern Spacetime.","As for the complete form, he was indeed somewhat interested.","Turning his head, he casually grabbed Lan Shui in his hand, sneering, “Just with this, you have the confidence to defeat me?”","“Yes!”","Xilu stood up, greedily staring at Lan Shui.","“As long as I absorb her, I can definitely win. If you’re afraid, just do it now!”","Trying to goad him?","“Too clever for your own good!” Hu Qing shook his head and said, “Do you think goading would work on me?”","He had passed the Tribulation, his mind long unified.","The goal was to kill Xilu, and that would not change.","But letting the opponent become complete was not part of the plan.","He really wanted to see what the complete Xilu would be like!","Looking at Lan Shui in his hand, Hu Qing said indifferently, “However, I really want to see your desperate expression!”","Whoosh!","With a slight force, he directly threw Lan Shui towards Xilu.","“Absorb her, then fight me!”","Xilu’s face lit up with joy, arrogantly saying, “Hu Qing, you are really my great benefactor. You spared me last time, and this time you gave me the chance to become complete. I really don’t know how to thank you!”","“Then show some strength to repay me well!”","“I won’t let you down!” Xilu opened his peak spike and directly swallowed Lan Shui.","On the Great Realm King’s island, Wu Zuo and others, seeing this scene, all widened their eyes.","“Hu Qing!!!”","They had just thought that Xilu dying so quickly was a bit too easy for the other side.","But now they became anxious.","“Foolish!”","“Couldn’t see through such a simple goading?”","Wu Zuo shook his head and said, “No, this is an open scheme!”","“The current Hu Qing is very arrogant, and Xilu just took advantage of that. In fact, Hu Qing’s weakness was exposed long ago!”","Back then, Hu Qing was mild-tempered, but his actions were still somewhat arrogant.","It could be seen when he fought Xilu back then.","“No need to worry too much. What if the complete Xilu is just like that?”","“Yes, yes, we still have a chance!”","The God King of Wood took the opportunity to mock, “Of course you have a chance, get ready to be hunted by Xilu then!”","They had all witnessed Xilu’s evolution.","Initially, he only had a bit over 100 million divine power, considered quasi-two-star.","After absorbing Lan Yan, he directly became quasi-three-star.","This complete form would likely be even stronger.","At least four-star, maybe even quasi-five-star.","And Hu Qing’s divine power was only three-star.","At most three and a half stars.","How could this solve Xilu?","It couldn’t be that the complete Xilu only had three-star Universe God power!","That would be a laughingstock.","Jian Wushuang’s previous confidence proved that he had the capability to back it up.","At this moment, in the sky above the sea.","The white light was dazzling.","Even Lan Shui had to shield her eyes and couldn’t look directly.","It took a whole incense stick of time before the white light finally stopped.","Looking down, she saw Jian Wushuang walk out from the white light.","His expression was calm, and his entire demeanor had changed significantly.","With one hand on his waist, he looked up at Lan Shui in the sky and spread his hands, saying, “How about it, are you satisfied?”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s figure had shrunk a bit, and his single-hand stance appeared more solid than before.","Perhaps his divine body was more complete, making his physical form appear different as well.","Lan Shui crossed her arms and slowly descended from the sky, landing on the seawater that had surged in.","“Cut the crap, let’s fight directly. This time, I will show you despair!”","“I am looking forward to it!” Jian Wushuang remained calm.","He wasn’t flustered or excited about becoming a complete form, and his temperament had greatly changed.","As soon as Lan Shui finished speaking, she struck immediately, delivering a fierce elbow blow to Jian Wushuang’s chest.","Bang!","With just a muffled sound, Lan Shui’s expression froze.","“Tsk tsk, not bad!” Jian Wushuang glanced down at Lan Shui and then raised his hand, slapping her away.","Lan Shui found it hard to believe; she had just used seventy percent of her strength.","The battle power of a three-star Universe God couldn’t shake Jian Wushuang in the slightest.","Immediately, she roared in anger, clenching her fists tightly.","Buzz!","With a loud explosion, the surrounding aura instantly reversed.","Lan Shui’s divine power erupted from three stars directly to the level of a quasi-four-star Universe God.","She coldly stared at Jian Wushuang, “The game ends now!”","“You’re right!”","But Jian Wushuang looked at her like she was a fool.","He didn’t regard Lan Shui at all, simply raising one hand to mimic her full power.","A massive divine power wave surged into the sky.","This time, Lan Shui’s expression turned awkward.","“How can he do that?”","Before Lan Shui could react, the light wave instantly attacked.","The speed was far above hers.","Fortunately, the range wasn’t large, and she barely dodged it in time.","But before she could breathe a sigh of relief, she realized it wasn’t just one light wave.","It was two...","No!","Now there were four.","Eight!","The light waves, like they were splitting, instantly filled the entire sky.","This scene not only made Lan Shui gasp.","Even the gods in the Star Field of the Gods couldn’t help but marvel.","In the Northern Spacetime, the monster they created...","It was truly invincible.","On the Great Realm King’s island, WWu Zuo and the others were dumbfounded.","At this moment, Blu happened to walk out of the Time Chamber.","“Your turn now!”","“Hmm?” After he came out, he noticed WWu Zuo and the others’ strange expressions and walked over.","Looking down, he saw the scene in the crystal ball, and his expression changed dramatically.","“He, he has become a complete form?”","Blu found it hard to believe. When Lan Shui came out, he could tell that Lan Shui’s divine power was much stronger than Jian Wushuang’s at that time.","How did Jian Wushuang become a complete form in just one day?","And to achieve complete form at Lan Shui’s hands."]},{"number":6195,"title":"Chapter 6195: The Prophet Makes His Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 6195: The Prophet Makes His Move","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just moments ago, Blu, who had been full of confidence, wilted completely.","He had become a true Dragon God under the guidance of the Great Realm King.","Moreover, he was a unique Special Life Form.","His divine power had already reached its peak.","He possessed the combat strength of a quasi three-star Universe God.","But now, even Hu Qing, who had the strength of a four-star Universe God, was no match.","Continuing to train would be futile.","He had already hit a bottleneck.","The guidance of the Great Realm King was no longer useful, and no amount of treasures could help.","To progress further, he would either have to venture out into the world or receive guidance from someone who surpassed the Great Realm King.","But the strongest person they could possibly associate with was the Great Realm King.","Any stronger, and that would be the Realm King God.","Such a transcendent and otherworldly figure would never concern themselves with these minor matters.","“Alas, arrogance truly leads to one’s downfall!”","Wu Zuo had already collapsed to the side.","At this moment, he had lost the desire to enter the Time Chamber.","He glanced at the crystal ball, and his eyes suddenly brightened as he spoke, “No, perhaps we still have a chance!”","“A chance?”","Everyone looked up at Wu Zuo.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Wu Zuo glanced at everyone and then looked towards the Time Chamber.","Perhaps this time, a miracle would happen.","At that moment, they would surely win.","Believe in him!","That figure carrying a sword.","It seemed to be right before their eyes.","He had become their last straw of hope.","“A whole day has passed, and there’s still no movement from the Time Chamber. Brother Wushuang might not be able to come out in a short time. Don’t forget, he was only at the Eighth Tribulation when he went in. Now, even if Blu has the combat strength to surpass a four-star Universe God, even if Wushuang reaches the Ninth Tribulation or becomes a Universe God, he still wouldn’t be a match for Xilu!”","Wu Li sighed and shook his head.","It wasn’t that he didn’t believe in Jian Wushuang.","It was just that Xilu’s strength was too formidable.","The glimmer of hope in everyone’s despair gradually dimmed.","They couldn’t bear to look at the crystal ball any longer.","This scene was seen by the Great Realm King, who was peeking through a wooden door at the crowd, reminded of his own past despair.","He could feel that Xilu’s aura was nearly on par with his own.","Comparable to Zamasu.","However, Zamasu was a future Realm King God and would continue to grow stronger.","Now, he was training in the Starry Sky.","He would become even more powerful in the future, and surpassing him was just a matter of time.","Xilu was someone Zamasu had brought from the Southern Spacetime.","The Great Realm King couldn’t intervene.","Because he was the Great Realm King, not a cultivator.","If he took action, Zamasu would also send someone.","Kuder in the Central Continent God Territory had all returned.","If he acted now, it would only plunge the Northern Spacetime into the clutches of evil.","After taking a look, he could only place his hopes on Jian Wushuang.","Meanwhile.","The battle above the sea was extremely fierce.","Countless light waves continuously bombarded Hu Qing.","The future body was already shattered.","This was the super future body, akin to Jian Wushuang’s super ancient transformation.","Once it couldn’t be maintained, his combat strength would be halved instantly.","He would be utterly unable to contend with Xilu.","In fact, ever since Xilu became complete, Hu Qing had no chance of contending, just passively taking hits.","Just like how he had previously beaten Xilu.","“Impossible!”","Hu Qing clenched his fists, blood oozing from his eyes.","This battle had completely broken him.","Xilu still had a calm demeanor, looking at Hu Qing with one hand on his hip. “It seems you are satisfied. I did not disappoint you!”","As soon as he finished speaking, his figure flashed and he was already in front of Hu Qing.","Hu Qing’s eyes widened, but before he could move.","He felt a chill in his chest.","Xilu’s hand turned into a blade, shattering Hu Qing’s divine body with a single strike.","Crack!","Even his Origin Source began to wither.","At this moment, Hu Qing, let alone making a move, couldn’t even maintain consciousness. He started falling from the sky, unable to even fly.","A newly ascended Universe God was about to fall?","Hu Qing’s hands reached out as he fell from the sky.","Witnessing this, Wu Zuo and the others gasped.","It was over!","Hu Qing was going to fall.","“Ah!”","Wu Li gasped.","Even though they were prepared and knew that Hu Qing would likely fall, seeing it with their own eyes still shook them to their core.","Divine Wood King and Wu Li handled it better.","Blu merely closed his eyes in silence.","But Wu Zuo was the most shaken. His relationship with Hu Qing wasn’t as deep as Jian Wushuang’s, but he had watched Hu Qing grow up.","From a young monk in white robes to a Universe God. Their friendship spanned millions of years.","The brilliance inside Qishen Temple. The severed bonds with his apprentice. Merging with Jian Wushuang at the height of his power, achieving an invincible form.","All these moments seemed like they had just happened yesterday.","“Hu Qing!”","Wu Zuo’s eyes turned red.","“Sigh!” Wu Li sighed. “If Hu Qing falls like this, how will we explain it to Wushuang when he returns?”","Hearing this, Divine Wood King’s eyes widened, and he roared angrily, “Explain? Who do we owe explanations to when we venture out? At worst, I’ll fall with him!”","“Even if I die, I will die at the peak of my power. I will become a Universe God!”","“I will succeed!”","With that, Divine Wood King walked towards time. The rest fell silent.","Above the sea.","Xilu watched everything.","Everything was in his hands.","That feeling was wonderful.","The falling Hu Qing had lost consciousness, only a sliver of life remaining. Even if Xilu didn’t strike, Hu Qing wouldn’t survive for three days.","Seeing his opponent unconscious, Xilu stopped wasting time and prepared to deliver the final blow to Hu Qing.","A finger pointed out.","The beam of light shot towards Hu Qing below.","But just then, an old man wearing a mask appeared out of nowhere. With a casual wave, he redirected the beam.","“Who are you!” Xilu’s brow twitched, and a hint of fear surfaced in his heart.","He was in his complete form now.","Few could make him feel fear.","Even in the Star Field of the Gods.","Only the Great Realm King, Realm King Gods, or some ancient time-space gods could threaten him.","But he had a background too.","The Realm King of the Southern Spacetime and Zamasu.","In the Star Field of the Gods, few dared to challenge him.","“Xilu, I know why you are here. Why not wait for three days? Jian Wushuang will come to face you then!”","“And if I refuse?” Xilu’s eyes were icy.","It wasn’t about time, but pride.","Why should he back down?","He was in his complete form.","“You can try!” The mysterious masked man extended a hand.","Xilu frowned, hesitant to make a move.","At that moment, a voice entered his mind.","“Agree to it!”","The voice was familiar to Xilu.","It was the Realm King of the Southern Spacetime.","“Fine!”","“Remember your words!”","Xilu decided to heed the Southern Realm King’s advice.","But it wasn’t out of respect for the Southern Realm King. He realized that if the Southern Realm King bowed his head, he would only offend both sides if he acted tough.","The mysterious masked man said nothing more. With a single hand, he grabbed Hu Qing."]},{"number":6196,"title":"Chapter 6196: Coming Out of Seclusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 6196: Coming Out of Seclusion","Just like when he arrived, he appeared out of nowhere.","Then, he vanished into thin air.","Simply put, Xilu couldn’t accomplish such a feat.","He took a deep breath and didn’t linger at the original spot.","Three days.","Jian Wushuang personally came to confront him.","No matter how much Jian Wushuang could grow in these three days.","Preparations had to be made.","“Three days, how interesting. I want to see how strong you all can become!”","With a move, Xilu flew toward the transformed Zhalong Mountain.","Outside Northern City.","Xilu landed in a relatively desolate area and constructed a massive arena.","It was ten thousand miles in size.","The surrounding spacetime was altered by him, imposing restrictions.","Only two people could enter at a time.","This was his preparation.","Then he closed his eyes and waited for the battle in three days.","Every second was precious.","Even for Jian Wushuang in the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had already challenged the Nine Tribulation Tower over 20 times.","His Origin Source was becoming increasingly powerful.","Now, within his Origin Source Starry Sky, there were already three miniature spacetime rivers.","Each spacetime river contained nine universes.","The three spacetime rivers were aligned in a row.","They seemed to be on the verge of merging.","“Whew!”","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged outside the Tribulation Tower, exhaling deeply.","Since entering this place, he hadn’t dared to stop.","Now, he had finally reached the peak of the Eighth Tribulation.","Preparing to face the Ninth Tribulation.","It was the most significant Tribulation in the Tribulation realm.","Because the Divine Tribulation was already considered a requirement for the Universe God.","However, Jian Wushuang’s Ninth Tribulation, for an ordinary practitioner, was even more terrifying than the Divine Tribulation.","One chaotic Law Rule after another descended.","Baptizing his divine body.","Not only did it baptize his divine body, but also his Origin Source.","Jian Wushuang had already fused his divine body with his Origin Source.","The divine body itself was thirty-six ultimate universes.","The 36 universes of his Origin Source were also his divine body.","As long as the universes remained unbroken, his divine body was indestructible.","“Come together!”","Jian Wushuang slightly raised his head.","Staring at the Ninth Tribulation above.","This was no longer the highest Law Rule of the Starry Sky.","But a calamity from chaos.","“Ha!”","His divine power suddenly erupted.","In an instant, it surpassed 100 million.","After the complete fusion of his Origin Source and divine body, the amplification became even","more perfect.","In the Eighth Tribulation Realm, his divine power surpassed 100 million.","Throughout history, he was the only one.","Entering the Academy of the Gods was within reach.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had confidence in becoming a god, so why would he want to go to","the Academy of the Gods?","Just for that background?","Ridiculous.","What Xingyue had said back then only seemed laughable to him now.","As the chaotic tribulation descended,","Jian Wushuang’s divine body and Origin Source changed once more.","The power beyond the Law Rules baptized him.","99 times, each time enough to kill a demigod.","But with each baptism, his divine power increased significantly.","After 99 baptisms, his divine power had surpassed 100 million.","The base divine power he had left was an astounding 60 million!","This wasn’t the amplified divine body.","“The Nine Tribulations are over!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t hide the excitement in his eyes.","Even the Starry Sky’s divine power didn’t need replenishing.","“Now is the beginning of my rise to the peak.”","He immediately took out the Beast God Weapon.","Reaching the Ninth Tribulation Realm, he could finally use the Beast God Weapon.","Moreover, the super ancient transformation needed to be enhanced.","The Beast God’s power contained the chaotic Origin Source of the Realm Beast.","His own power was Starry Sky divine power, and the two merged.","Just like the Starry Sky within chaos.","This was the ultimate!","The Ultimate Ancient Transformation!","“However, the first form of the Beast God Weapon must be activated before I can create the","second layer of the super ancient transformation!”","Within the Origin Source Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the void, surrounded","by the power of the Beast God.","Blue and pink gradually blended together.","A terrifying force was also brewing.","The blue and pink ultimately formed a dark red color.","He suddenly opened his eyes.","“It worked!”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were entirely dark red.","With a movement of divine power.","He clenched his fists tightly.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Swish!","Without any delay, the transformation was instantly deployed.","But initially, when he first mastered it, he needed to gather divine power to be able to","perform the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","“Next is the Ultimate Ancient Transformation!”","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang shouted angrily, “Ha!”","Divine power surged.","Dark red divine power rose up, arcs of electricity flickered, and he bathed in it.","The divine power reached an exaggerated level.","Coupled with the first layer of the Beast God Weapon.","And the previous augmentation of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Now, he was already considered a quasi five-star Universe God.","First, the basic divine power was 60 million.","The Tribulation Armor transformed into the Ninth Tribulation Armor, increasing it by ten","million.","The first layer of the Beast God Weapon required 50 million divine power, which also","amplified his divine power by 50 million.","This made it 120 million, which is the combat power of a one-star Universe God.","The key was still the augmentation of the Ancient Transformation.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation doubled it.","That made it 240 million divine power.","The Ultimate Ancient Transformation doubled it again.","Divine power directly skyrocketed to 480 million.","This was already the combat power of a quasi five-star Universe God.","He also had the Selfless State technique.","The white aura merely drifted a little, yet it allowed him to contend with a quasi six-star","Universe God.","There was also the Starry Sky Record, and his swordsmanship could now maintain the sixth","sword.","Even a six-star Universe God, he had the confidence to kill.","“It’s time to leave!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","The original path, he might not have taken.","So, there was no hurry for the divine tribulation, it still needed some time.","This time span was very long.","With his current strength, it was enough to go out and deal with Xilu.","With a light finger point, the spacetime was torn apart.","Swish!","Entering the crack, the next moment he appeared inside the Time Chamber.","“Great Realm King, senior!” At this time, Jian Wushuang had returned to his normal state, with only sixty million basic divine power.","In the Ninth Tribulation Realm, this was not considered remarkable, just a strong half-god.","“So fast?”","The Great Realm King was a bit surprised, he thought Jian Wushuang would stay for a long","time.","Mainly, Jian Wushuang was worried about changes in the outside world, so he didn’t enter the","fourth-level tower.","Nor did he do much research before coming out.","Jian Wushuang directly spoke the truth after hearing this.","“Fourth-level tower?” Hearing that there was another tower, the Great Realm King couldn’t stand still.","He widened his eyes and exclaimed, “How is it possible, in the Origin of the Starry Sky, there’s","only a Nine Tribulation Tower left by the Great Star Official, there’s no such thing as a fourth-","level tower.”","“To be precise, there are five levels!” Jian Wushuang was somewhat uncertain, “First level","Universe God, second level Spacetime God, third level Starry Sky, fourth level Chaos, the fifth level has no name!”","To verify, the Great Realm King directly tore space and took the initiative to go to the Origin","of the Starry Sky.","Jian Wushuang naturally followed.","But when he arrived, he found that the tower had disappeared.","It came out of nowhere, and vanished into thin air.","“This... it was just here.” Jian Wushuang was a bit bewildered.","He had no reason to lie.","Seeing it meant he saw it, the Great Realm King took a deep look at him, took a deep breath,","“Perhaps, that is your destiny!”"]},{"number":6197,"title":"Chapter 6197: Power of Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 6197: Power of Chaos","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Ah!”","This time, Jian Wushuang couldn’t stand it. His unique opportunity was missed?","Such a loss.","“Don’t lament; what’s yours is yours. This is the Starry Sky, a place of Law Rules, not Chaos!” The Great Realm King consoled him.","However, he was secretly amazed at Jian Wushuang’s opportunity, something even he had never heard of.","The Nine Tribulation Tower was meant for the prodigies of the Starry Sky’s power.","It was a treasure personally placed in the Starry Sky Origin by the Great Star Officer.","To receive this reward was already quite remarkable.","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang could even see the mysterious tower.","“Mm!” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He was actually fine.","His battle strength had increased tremendously this time.","He was ready to face anything.","“By the way, Xilu has already become complete. Now, you...” The Great Realm King glanced at Jian Wushuang, feeling a bit uneasy.","He could naturally see that Jian Wushuang’s aura had changed a lot, but his base divine power was only sixty million.","Even if it doubled, he would only be a one-star Universe God, which was far behind the current Xilu.","Jian Wushuang naturally understood the Great Realm King’s concern.","He slightly clenched his fists.","“Complete form, huh?”","“Then let senior witness whether I or Xilu is stronger!”","“Ha!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily.","He directly unleashed the Ultimate Ancient Transformation.","The chaotic power from the convergence of the Starry Sky Origin and the Beast God Origin surged instantly.","“Ultimate Ancient Transformation!!!”","His divine power instantly reached the level of a quasi-five-star Universe God.","Additionally, there was the support of the Perfect Self Intention Technique, although this boost was invisible and intangible, only manifesting in battle.","The powerful force spread around.","Even the Great Realm King’s pupils involuntarily reversed, marveling, “Your strength has improved rapidly, but compared to the current Xilu, you might still be a bit lacking!”","“Well, that makes it more interesting!” Jian Wushuang smiled indifferently.","If Xilu was too weak, it would be less fun.","He had promised the Prophet to take Xilu’s life.","Initially, he thought it was a simple matter, but it turned out to be so complicated.","Moreover, Xilu’s growth was astonishing.","The first time they met was in the Northern Spacetime, and back then, Xilu had Ninth Tribulation strength after gaining consciousness in the Northern Spacetime.","After reaching the Realm King Continent, Xilu’s growth surpassed them all.","He was stronger than a quasi-five-star Universe God.","At least he was a peak expert among five-star Universe Gods, or even a quasi-six-star or six-star Universe God.","“Senior, if there’s nothing else, I’ll head out first!”","He still had to visit the Prophet and then deal with Xilu.","The Great Realm King nodded and said, “Go ahead. You still have a day left for the agreed time with the Prophet. Xilu is waiting for you at Zalong Mountain!”","Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised by these words but didn’t ask further.","He then walked out of the Time Chamber.","On the island.","Seeing him emerge from the Time Chamber, everyone stood up.","The last one to enter the Time Chamber was Wuzuo.","The others had already enhanced their strength.","They were all waiting outside now.","“Wushuang, you finally came out!” Wu Li’s face was somewhat grim because Hu Qing’s fate was unknown.","Earlier, he had been taken away by the Prophet, and there had been no news since.","Jian Wushuang noticed Hu Qing’s absence and asked, “Where is Hu Qing?”","“Well... you should ask the Prophet. He was severely injured by Xilu and then taken away by the Prophet!”","“Let’s not talk about that now. How’s your strength? Can you defeat the current Xilu?”","They were more concerned about this.","The pressure Xilu exerted was too great.","Jian Wushuang shook his head at this question.","“I haven’t seen Xilu’s complete form yet, so I’m not sure!”","Even the Great Realm King said his chances of winning were slim, so he didn’t dare to exaggerate.","“If it doesn’t work out, we’ll all go together!” Wu Li gritted his teeth and said, “It’s a pity I couldn’t become a Universe God. I only created a mysterious method for Universe Gods under the guidance of the Great Realm King, and my divine power is that of a one-star Universe God!”","“That’s already very good!” Jian Wushuang consoled him.","He didn’t expect much from Wu Li and the others.","Xilu was targeting him, and he had to deal with it himself.","Wu Li and the others briefly explained some previous events.","Hearing that Hu Qing almost perished, Jian Wushuang frowned, not expecting it to be so serious.","As for Hu Qing’s arrogance, he didn’t mind.","Personality changes were normal.","Allowing Xilu to become complete wasn’t Hu Qing’s fault.","“I’ll go see Xilu’s complete form first!”","Jian Wushuang casually tore through space.","He didn’t even need the artifact Phantom Space to assist him.","Everyone couldn’t help but gasp at this sight.","This was the Great Realm King’s territory, where space-time was more stable.","Jian Wushuang casually tore it apart.","This was not done using divine power, but through his realm.","Now, Jian Wushuang was just one step away from reaching the complete spacetime river.","Spacetime had already reached its peak level. As long as it was spacetime, no matter how solid, he could tear it apart.","Just like the spacetime canyon back then, now he could create one as well.","But it was no longer significant.","Ordinary treasures no longer caught his eye.","Despite this, everyone still reminded him, “Be careful, Xilu is very formidable!”","“No worries!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and disappeared from everyone’s sight with a flicker of his figure.","When he reappeared, he was already outside the northern city of Zalong Mountain Town.","He landed on the platform set up by Xilu, and the two stood back to back.","“Xilu!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","They only called each other’s names softly and did not say anything more.","But a powerful mental force was entangling.","They wanted to compete to see who was superior.","Jian Wushuang slightly furrowed his brows and chuckled.","“Let’s go!”","After saying this, he disappeared again.","“Interesting!” Xilu’s lips curled up. He could roughly gauge Jian Wushuang’s strength from the recent confrontation.","Five-star Universe God.","Compared to Xilu, that was still not enough.","Swoosh!","Jian Wushuang returned to the Great Realm King’s island, and everyone looked over curiously.","They wanted to know the answer in his heart.","“It should be about the same!”","This was Jian Wushuang’s estimate.","Xilu’s strength had indeed given him a surprise.","It was actually that powerful.","Stronger than his Thoguht power.","In terms of divine power, he was definitely stronger.","The regular state Xilu just now already had the combat power of a five-star Universe God.","At his peak, he might be around seven-star.","It was indeed very pressuring.","“No worries, you still have one day; you can still improve!”","“Forget it!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. He didn’t plan to go into seclusion again because it was unnecessary.","He still needed to visit the Prophet.","Seclusion wouldn’t make it in time, and besides, he had improved all he could.","The remaining Divine Tribulations required a long time to accumulate, which could not be achieved in a short period.","“I’ll go visit the Prophet. You can return to the Immortal Temple. Xilu won’t bother you for the time being!”","There was no point in staying here anymore.","This time, the Great Realm King helped them because of the Northern Realm King."]},{"number":6198,"title":"Chapter 6198: Teacher Xuan Yi’s Whereabouts","paragraphs":["Chapter 6198: Teacher Xuan Yi’s Whereabouts","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without the threat of Xilu, they wouldn’t receive any help in improving their strength.","Everything still needed to proceed step by step.","After explaining everything, he rose and flew towards the residence of the Prophet.","In the time it took to burn an incense stick, he arrived at the grand hall where the Prophet resided.","As he landed, he saw the Prophet already waiting for him.","“Seer!” Jian Wushuang greeted respectfully.","He admired the Prophet immensely and had always received his help.","Especially in the forging of the Beast God Weapon, where he was guided on the fusion of Starry Sky power with Beast God power.","the Prophet had shown him immense kindness.","Now, he had saved Hu Qing and stabilized Xilu.","“It seems you have mastered the Beast God Weapon.”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I have always remembered your words, and I came to find you immediately after my breakthrough!”","“And about Xilu, thank you very much!”","the Prophet waved his hand and said, “These are small matters. The significant issue is that you have mastered the Beast God Weapon. Additionally, your proficiency with the power of disorder has increased significantly. In the future, you might be able to barely survive in the Land of Chaos!”","“The Land of Chaos?” Jian Wushuang was startled. He hadn’t expected the Prophet to mention the Land of Chaos, which was outside spacetime.","There were no rules there, and powerful demonic beasts ruled, each staking their territory.","It was extremely chaotic.","The Starry Sky had always coexisted peacefully with the Land of Chaos. Even if there was an invasion, they only defended and never took the initiative.","There was no need for it.","If you hit them, they wouldn’t be affected at all.","Instead, you might hurt yourself.","It was very passive.","Yet, the Prophet’s words seemed to suggest he should go to the Land of Chaos.","This confused Jian Wushuang.","“You will understand in the future. For now, I have something to give you after mastering the Beast God Weapon. This item is related to your Tribulation Armor!”","the Prophet took out a blue bead.","“Related to the Tribulation Armor?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","The Tribulation Armor was obtained from the Heavenly Chessboard.","The Heavenly Chessboard was given to him by Teacher Xuan Yi, meaning the Tribulation Armor was related to Teacher Xuan Yi.","the Prophet even knew about this!","“Senior, do you know Teacher Xuan Yi?” Jian Wushuang asked excitedly, “Could it be that Teacher Xuan Yi sent you to help me?”","The Prophet vaguely replied, “More or less.”","“Then, can you tell me how to find Teacher Xuan Yi?” Jian Wushuang had many doubts. He kept seeking the source of the world but never found Teacher Xuan Yi’s whereabouts.","Finally, he had some clues.","“Didn’t he tell you?” the Prophet smiled, “He should have mentioned you would meet in the future. It shouldn’t be far off!”","He knew even this?","Jian Wushuang was completely stunned.","He hadn’t expected the Prophet to know so much.","He began to suspect the Prophet’s identity.","To be able to predict so accurately.","Teacher Xuan Yi might indeed be a god in the Starry Sky.","And a very powerful one at that.","Yet, he hadn’t seen Teacher Xuan Yi’s name on the boundary stone monument.","Perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi wasn’t his real name.","The Temple Master, Xuan Yi, of Qishen Temple had said he had borrowed Teacher Xuan Yi’s name.","“Then who could he be?”","The 12 Star Spirits?","Given Teacher Xuan Yi’s mysteriousness, it was highly possible.","Or perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi was the Great Star Officer himself.","“Stop guessing. Some things you can only understand when your strength is sufficient. Otherwise, knowing now wouldn’t help. It’s like you and the Universe Masters of Northern Spacetime; the gap is too large. You wouldn’t be of help and would be a burden instead.”","Jian Wushuang nodded silently.","“The Tribulation Armor!”","He took out the Tribulation Armor and handed it to the Prophet.","“This was forged from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard left by Teacher Xuan Yi. The Chessboard is divided into two parts: one condensed into the Heavenly Bead, and the other is this Tribulation Armor!”","Only then did he notice the bead in the Prophet’s hand.","Recalling Hu Qing’s rescue, he realized, “Senior, did you extract Hu Qing’s Heavenly Bead?”","That was Hu Qing’s key treasure. Extracting it would cripple him.","“Yes, this Heavenly Bead was originally meant for you. But because your path changed, the bead ended up with Hu Qing. This Tribulation Armor and the bead are one. Since you’ve gifted it, you should go all the way.”","“Alright, in that case, I’ll give the Tribulation Armor to Hu Qing as well!” Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","After all, an extra 10 million divine power meant nothing to him now.","The Prophet chuckled, “You are generous, giving away such treasures. Do you know its purpose?”","“I don’t know!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Initially, he thought the Tribulation Armor had no connection to the Heavenly Bead and separated them, giving the bead to Hu Qing.","The Tribulation Armor simply amplified his basic divine power.","It was quite a magical treasure.","Now, it had transformed into Divine Armor, even more extraordinary.","But it was of little use to him.","Unless it could transform again when he reached Universe God.","“Since it’s already given to Hu Qing, I won’t explain it to you. I’ll accept this treasure, and of course, I won’t let you suffer any loss. There are even better treasures to give you!” the Prophet said, taking out a red-marked eye from his bosom.","Chaotic power emanated from it.","When Jian Wushuang saw the eye, his heart trembled.","This power was too terrifying.","It was very similar to the chaotic power he had fused with the Starry Sky’s power.","It had the potential to destroy the heavens and the earth.","Moreover, he sensed a force originating from the Origin Source.","It was the source of chaos.","“No, this is just the source of the Beast God’s power!”","“Good eye. This was left behind by a Realm Beast that entered the Starry Sky, just one of its eyes,” the Prophet said casually, throwing the red eye to Jian Wushuang.","Realm Beasts were chaotic beings stronger than demons.","They had a single eye, were hideous in appearance, but extremely powerful.","There were even fewer recorded Realm Beasts.","The Prophet said it was a Realm Beast that entered the Starry Sky, meaning it had the strength to traverse the long river of time and space and shatter the Realm King Continent.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be able to enter the Starry Sky.","If the Starry Sky were compared to a house, the four great spacetimes would be the four walls, and the Realm King Continent would be the roof.","Most of the recorded Realm Beasts were killed by the Realm King before they got close to the spacetimes.","The stronger ones entered the Realm King Continent and were killed by the Great Realm King or powerful Star Spirits.","It was the first time Jian Wushuang heard of one that could enter the Starry Sky.","The Prophet added, “That Realm Beast left this eye and then escaped. It was extremely powerful, capable of shattering the entire Realm King Continent with one punch!”","Jian Wushuang broke into a cold sweat upon hearing this. Capable of shattering the Realm King Continent with one punch?","How strong must it be?","Even Weiss’ power might not be this terrifying."]},{"number":6199,"title":"Chapter 6199: Eye of the Realm Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 6199: Eye of the Realm Beast","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He ventured into the Starry Sky and managed to return unscathed.","The 12 Star Spirits were mere decorations?","“He actually escaped?”","“The great star official of the Starry Sky had ventured into the Land of Chaos. It was an ambush. Weiss from the 12 Star Spirits intervened, took the beast’s eye, but the beast still managed to escape!”","Back then, Weiss had fought the beast and had only slightly bested it, driving it away.","In his own domain, he couldn’t capture the beast.","And these were the 12 Star Spirits!","The 12 strongest beings in the Starry Sky.","Cultivators could almost be certain they could never surpass them.","The strongest cultivators were like Xing Yue.","Becoming a Star Spirit envoy or a Realm King God was the peak.","The number of Great Realm Kings was few, comparable to the number of Star Spirits.","That beast managed to slip away from Weiss.","Leaving behind only one eye.","Jian Wushuang carefully observed, his heart shaken.","He dared not directly comprehend it.","“This is the beast’s eye. You can attach it to the Beast God Weapon. It will elevate the weapon’s Origin Source, making it a supreme treasure!”","To Jian Wushuang, the prophet’s words seemed too modest.","This blood-red eye was a supreme treasure for anyone.","Even a Ninth Tribulation Universe God would drool over it.","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard, then wrapped it with his mental power and threw it into the Beast God Origin Source, starting the integration.","“Wow!”","He felt a tremor throughout his body.","The dark red power burst forth again.","It even suppressed his Starry Sky power.","The dark red turned into a peach pink.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, feeling his divine power surge uncontrollably.","His divine power instantly broke through 100 million.","It only stopped at the peak.","Now, without using Super Ancient Eternal Transformation, he had 150 million divine power.","Using Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he reached three-stars.","Using Ultimate Ancient Transformation, he reached six-stars.","He also had the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique...","“Seven-star Universe God!”","He could fight!","A mark appeared on Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","Blood red.","“Now, compared to Sileu, the gap isn’t that big anymore!” The prophet nodded calmly.","But Jian Wushuang was full of confidence.","Even if the prophet still thought there was a gap between him and Sileu, he still believed he had a chance to win.","“I will definitely accomplish the task given by the senior!”","To slay Sileu.","“Wait for Hu Qing; he should be out soon!”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","A day passed quickly.","Before dawn, Hu Qing emerged.","His entire demeanor had changed, wearing a black robe, his gaze cold.","When he saw Jian Wushuang, he only smiled faintly.","“Let’s go!”","The prophet was eager to witness this battle.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing nodded simultaneously.","Then they looked at each other and flew towards Zalong Mountain.","Passing through the Star Field of the Gods, they reached outside Northern City.","This time, they didn’t tear through space, they simply flew there.","Upon arrival, they found Wu Zuo and his group had also come.","Everyone looked at each other without saying much.","Sileu, seeing so many people, was extremely excited.","He even set the rules.","An arena battle, one-on-one.","Falling off the stage or dying meant losing.","“How about it? Satisfied?” Sileu spread his hands, looking at everyone.","Jian Wushuang appeared casual, calmly saying, “Of course.”","“Why don’t you and Hu Qing go together?” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but suggest.","He saw that Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang’s strengths were similar, but neither was as terrifying as Sileu.","It would be best to fight together to ensure safety.","“No need, I can win!”","Jian Wushuang was extremely confident.","Seeing his confidence, Wu Zuo stopped persuading.","The sense of determination spread.","Clack!","Jian Wushuang stepped onto the stage, slowly raising his hand.","“Let’s begin!”","“I originally wanted to save the best for last, but you’re too eager, Jian Wushuang!”","Sileu’s expression changed, and he attacked like lightning.","But Jian Wushuang was not slow, lightly tapping the ground with his toes and leaping into the air.","He gathered a strong light with both hands, paralyzing Sileu below.","But it only lasted for a moment.","The strong light began to dissipate.","Their figures flashed continuously, engaging in combat in the air.","Thudding sounds made the surrounding restrictions tremble.","The world shook with them.","Their divine powers kept increasing.","Jian Wushuang indifferently said, “Once the sword is out of its sheath, there is no turning back. Don’t let my preparation go to waste!”","Sileu completely disregarded Jian Wushuang.","He glanced at the Ten Thousand Tribulations Sword, revealing a cold smile.","The sword contained the intent of only a quasi-eight star.","Even if he stood still, a strike wouldn’t harm him.","“Come on, I’ll stand here and see what your sword can do to me!”","Facing the arrogant Xilu, Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","A faint smile tugged at the corner of his mouth.","The Tribulation Sword hummed.","Swish!","With a slight raise of his hand, the Tribulation Sword slashed.","An ordinary streak of sword energy burst forth.","Everyone was stunned, thinking Jian Wushuang had lost his mind.","How could such a simple sword energy possibly harm Xilu?","But the sword light within the sword energy suddenly erupted.","“Starry Sky Chronicles, Sixth Sword Move!”","Jian Wushuang murmured softly, his gaze shifting, and his entire aura turned sharp.","“Eternal Combat!”","Boom!","The originally narrow sword energy instantly transformed into sword light.","It covered the entire Star Field of the Gods.","At this moment, even the Supreme Law Rules couldn’t help but tremble.","The powerful aura resonated with heaven and earth.","Blood trickled from Jian Wushuang’s seven orifices.","His divine power was instantly drained.","All the Origin Source power within him converged into the sword light.","He collapsed.","The force was controlled perfectly, neither killing him nor failing to let this sword be displayed in its perfect form.","Under the illumination of the sword light.","Xilu’s heart tightened, not expecting Jian Wushuang to have such a trump card.","A terrifying sword light.","It was enough to shake his mind, making it impossible to face directly.","“Today, I will make you despair!”","Facing the sword light, Xilu opened his hands and clamped down hard.","He wanted to break the sword light with his hands.","But the moment he touched the sword light, he found his divine power instantly diminished.","A terrifying aura was devouring his power.","“How is this possible?” Xilu’s face was shocked.","He dared not continue to confront it head-on.","Gathering powerful divine power in his hands, he tried to shatter the sword light.","But when the beams of light from his hands were split into two segments, he was dumbfounded.","The speed of the sword light suddenly increased.","No longer giving Xilu a chance to breathe, the light and shadow slashed instantly.","Xilu’s figure gradually split within the light.","His eyeballs burst.","His body shattered.","Even his divine body trembled.","“No... you can’t kill me!”","Xilu struggled within the sword light.","But Jian Wushuang had no strength left to add.","The attacking sword light also gradually dimmed.","Xilu’s face lit up with joy, thinking he could withstand it.","The sword light weakened, and his pressure lessened.","His body gradually recovered.","With a fierce push of his hands, he blocked the weakening sword light.","“It’s over, everyone!”","This battle was exhilarating.","And also very dangerous."]},{"number":6200,"title":"Chapter 6200: Winning","paragraphs":["Chapter 6200: Winning","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Anyway, the fight was exhilarating, and finally, everyone was killed.","It was perfect.","Just as he relaxed, the sword light suddenly surged again.","“How is this possible?” Xilu was shocked.","Turning his head, he saw that it was Hu Qing!","It wasn’t just Hu Qing; there was also Wu Zuo, Wu Li, Blu, and Divine Wood King.","They raised their hands, channeling all their power into this one strike.","They wielded the sword on behalf of Jian Wushuang.","The power of the sword light surged to its peak again.","Xilu couldn’t withstand it anymore.","His entire body was engulfed by the sword light, gradually disintegrating.","Eventually, nothing remained.","Even his aura disappeared into the air.","Most of the Zhalong Mountain territory was destroyed.","Everyone lay sprawled on the ground.","Only Hu Qing could barely stand, using his hand to suppress the chaotic storm within his Origin Source.","He revealed a faint smile.","“We won!”","As twilight faded, a ray of sunlight fell on the barren ground.","“I knew they could do it!” The Northern Realm King, watching the scene, couldn’t help but cheer.","The Great Realm King was equally excited.","Jian Wushuang, lying on the ground, squinted as he watched the sun slowly rise.","But before he could smile, his gaze froze.","Instead of cheering, he saw Jian Wushuang turning into stone.","And he was already shattered.","“Jian Wushuang!!!”","Wu Zuo rushed forward, gently touching the stones.","It took him a long time to accept this fact.","Jian Wushuang had fallen.","He had exhausted his divine power and fallen!","Outside Zhalong Mountain.","After a few days of calm, Wu Zuo and the others took Jian Wushuang’s stone body back to Northern Town.","They did not go to the Star Field of the Gods.","Everyone remained silent.","Hu Qing went alone to the Star Field of the Gods, seeking the Prophet.","But he discovered that among the gods, no one knew of the Prophet’s existence.","Only Dan Bao knew.","Moreover, the Great Realm King said that the position of the Prophet never existed in the Star Field of the Gods.","Ultimately, he returned to Northern Town in despair.","After a few days of dejection, Dan Bao brought a message that made everyone breathe a sigh of relief.","Jian Wushuang had fallen, but not completely.","Now, they needed to find seven Origin Sources to restore Jian Wushuang’s physical body.","Once his body was restored, Jian Wushuang could be resurrected.","Upon hearing this, Hu Qing immediately set out on the path to find the Origin Sources.","Wu Zuo and the others were not idle either.","Everyone split up.","They began their adventure on the Realm King Continent.","Along the way, many things would happen.","There would also be many opportunities.","It was a form of compensation.","Because Jian Wushuang had gained more benefits.","In the Realm King Divine Realm.","On a small green planet, only ten miles in diameter.","Jian Wushuang lay sleeping on the grass.","This was the Northern Realm King’s domain.","His consciousness first reached the Prophet, then he was enlightened and gained the ability to create a consciousness avatar.","Then he was sent to the Northern Realm King.","This was the greatest benefit.","With a consciousness avatar, it was as if he hadn’t died.","He even had his original divine power.","He just couldn’t leave the Realm King Divine Realm.","Here, he could still cultivate.","It didn’t delay anything.","“Jian Wushuang, wake up, I have good news for you!”","“I’ve fallen, can’t I have a good sleep?”","Jian Wushuang turned over.","He lay on the grass, not wanting to move at all.","He had completely lost the motivation to cultivate.","He just wanted to rest for a while.","Now, he felt no pressure.","He had let go of a lot.","Since time was infinite, why rush?","It was better to take it step by step.","“Ahem!” The Northern Realm King coughed and said, “Listen carefully, there is a way to revive you now. And I’ve already told Hu Qing and the others. It won’t be long before you can leave the Realm King Divine Realm.”","“So what?”","Jian Wushuang didn’t care at all.","He actually liked it here.","It was better to cultivate here without anyone disturbing him.","He was tired of fighting.","Especially the schemes.","This time, being manipulated by the Prophet made him very upset.","Although the Prophet had no ill intentions towards him, the journey had been exhausting.","Moreover, he didn’t like being controlled.","He wanted to control his own fate.","“Alright, since you don’t care, I’ll go see the Great Realm King alone!” The Realm King said, ready to leave.","When Jian Wushuang heard “Great Realm King,” his eyes lit up, and he stood up immediately.","“The Great Realm King?”","This was the being who had created the Realm King Continent.","Even this Realm King Divine Realm was created by that being.","The Realm King God Realm was a world where consciousnesses coexisted.","In simple terms, physical bodies could not enter this place.","Only the consciousness of a fallen Universe God or a Spacetime God would be guided into the Realm King God Realm.","Moreover, only the powerful Universe Gods or those with extraordinary backgrounds were guided here.","Their consciousnesses were brought here to queue for rebirth.","This rebirth could retain their memories.","However, to awaken those memories, they would have to cultivate back to the level of a Universe God.","This was quite difficult.","Because after rebirth, their fortune might change.","If they were unlucky and died prematurely, they wouldn’t be able to enter the Realm King God Realm in their next life.","The risk was enormous.","So, many Universe Gods chose not to undergo rebirth and remained in the Realm King God Realm.","Of course, there was always a sliver of hope in every situation.","The consciousnesses of the Universe Gods that stayed behind could take on tasks to accumulate fortune for their next life.","Those with extraordinary fortune might be reborn directly into the Giant God Clan.","Starting as a Universe Master.","With casual cultivation, they could return to their clan and become an Eighth Tribulation or even a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master.","Very close to becoming a Universe God.","The key was safety!","The Giant God Clan dominated the Starry Sky.","The Star Spirits didn’t interfere with cultivators’ interests.","What remained were the families of the Star Spirit Envoys.","They were the true overlords of the Starry Sky.","And the Giant God Clan had six Star Spirit Envoys.","One of the Star Spirit Envoys was even under the command of the Great Star Officer.","Such a powerful clan that no one dared to provoke.","Everyone dreamed of being reborn into the Giant God Clan.","Jian Wushuang, however, was indifferent to these things.","He was different from the other guided consciousnesses.","When those guided consciousnesses fell, their consciousness directly entered here.","Only in the Realm King God Realm could they maintain their divine power from when they were alive.","Moreover, their consciousness could not cultivate.","Jian Wushuang was different.","He could manipulate divine power with his consciousness even when he was in the outside world. After arriving here, he could continue to cultivate.","There was no need for him to reincarnate.","Hu Qing and the others would still rescue him.","Unlike the other guided consciousnesses, he didn’t have such tremendous pressure.","For the first time, he felt a sense of superiority over his peers.","In the past, he was always under immense pressure, but now, seeing others struggle desperately, he finally understood what it meant to live comfortably.","It felt great!","Originally, he planned to just muddle along here."]}]);
